    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道分泌物色白，淋漓不断或带有臭味。见于脾阳虚证、脾虚湿困证、胞宫虚寒证等。又称白带。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vaginal discharge white in women incessant dripping or with foul odor. Seen in uterus deficiency-cold pattern. [证候待译:脾阳虚证/脾虚湿困证] Also known as white vaginal discharge (leukorrhea).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>白带</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0034269</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>MF3A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vaginal discharge</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_带下色白</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Vaginal discharge white in women incessant dripping or with foul odor. Seen in uterus deficiency-cold pattern. [证候待译:脾阳虚证/脾虚湿困证] Also known as white vaginal discharge (leukorrhea).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>白带</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0034269</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0034269"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MF3A</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
