    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手足掣动迟缓，类似虫行。见于气血两虚证、虚风内动证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sluggish jerking movement of hands and feet resembling insect crawling. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; internal stirring of deficiency-wind pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0200113</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_手足蠕动</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sluggish jerking movement of hands and feet resembling insect crawling. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; internal stirring of deficiency-wind pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0200113</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
