    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">欲吐而无物有声，或仅呕出少量涎沫。见于胃实热证、胃阴虚证、肝郁证、食滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urge to vomit with sound but no content or vomiting only a small amount of drool. Seen in stomach excess-heat pattern; liver depression pattern; food stagnation pattern. [证候待译:胃阴虚证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002013</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当、感染</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>249497008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>emesis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>8579004</tcm:snomedCT>
