    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">无论对亲友还是不认识的人都怒骂呼叫，不能自制。见于狂证、火热扰心证、痰热扰心证、火热伤阴证，或癫狂病等。又称言语骂詈不避亲疏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Angrily cursing and shouting at people regardless of whether they are relatives or strangers, with loss of self-control. Seen in kuang (manic) pattern, fire-heat disturbing the heart pattern, phlegm-heat disturbing the heart pattern, fire-heat damaging yin pattern, or dian-kuang psychosis. Also known as cursing at others regardless of kinship.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>言语骂詈不避亲疏</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
