    <obo:IAO_0000115>Angrily cursing and shouting at people regardless of whether they are relatives or strangers, with loss of self-control. Seen in kuang (manic) pattern, fire-heat disturbing the heart pattern, phlegm-heat disturbing the heart pattern, fire-heat damaging yin pattern, or dian-kuang psychosis. Also known as cursing at others regardless of kinship.</obo:IAO_0000115>
