    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发发红。见于血热化燥证、脾气虚证、气血两虚证，或疳病、染发、先天遗传等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair turning red. Seen in blood heat with transforming into dryness pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan (infantile malnutrition); hair dyeing; congenital heredity. [证候待译:脾气虚证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.25</tcm:reference>
