    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">巅顶部头痛。为厥阴经头痛。见于阴虚阳亢证、肝阳挟痰证、中焦虚寒证等。又称巅顶头痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Headache at the vertex region which is the jueyin-channel headache. Seen in yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern; liver yang with phlegm pattern; middle jiao deficiency-cold pattern. Also known as vertex headache.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.54</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>巅顶头痛</tcm:synonym>
