    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Abdomen muscle pressure tense. Seen in deficiency pattern. [证候待译:下焦虚证] [未译片段:拘紧感]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
