    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脓夹污血，脓少血多，脓中夹有败絮状物，色泽污浊而不明润。见于热毒血分。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pus mixed with foul blood less pus and more blood pus containing rotten-cotton-like matter color turbid and not lustrous. Seen in heat-toxin and blood aspect disorder pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
