    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pus mixed with foul blood less pus and more blood pus containing rotten-cotton-like matter color turbid and not lustrous. Seen in heat-toxin and blood aspect disorder pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
