    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hard stuffiness lump appearing in the epigastrium. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; gallbladder cancer; stomach cancer.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
