    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目睛下陷入目眶之内。见于津气亏虚证、脱液证、中气下陷证、气血两虚证、肾精亏虚证，或霍乱等伤津疾病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyeball sinking into the orbit. Seen in fluid-qi deficiency pattern; fluid collapse pattern; middle qi sinking pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; kidney essence deficiency pattern. [证候待译:霍乱等伤津疾病]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.58</tcm:reference>
