    <obo:IAO_0000115>Eyeball sinking into the orbit. Seen in fluid-qi deficiency pattern; fluid collapse pattern; middle qi sinking pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; kidney essence deficiency pattern. [证候待译:霍乱等伤津疾病]</obo:IAO_0000115>
