    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳内作胀，堵塞感。见于风热犯肺证、肝胆湿热证，或耳胀闷、咽鼓管异常开放等。又称耳胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Inside the ear distension blocking sensation. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:耳胀闷/咽鼓管异常开放] Also known as ear distension (Eustachian dysfunction). [未译片段:作]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.50</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>耳胀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳内胀闷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Inside the ear distension blocking sensation. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:耳胀闷/咽鼓管异常开放] Also known as ear distension (Eustachian dysfunction). [未译片段:作]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>耳胀</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
