    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头形呈两头小中间宽。见于先天不足、风湿痰热毒邪侵袭、肝肾亏虚证，或尖颅等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head shape small at both ends and wide in the middle. Seen in wind-dampness with phlegm-heat with toxic pathogen with invasion pattern; liver and kidney deficiency pattern; oxycephaly (tower skull). [证候待译:先天不足]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头面呈两头小中间宽</oboInOwl:id>
