    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便时成形时不成形。见于肝郁脾虚证、肝脾不调证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool sometimes formed and sometimes unformed. Seen in liver and spleen disharmony pattern. [证候待译:肝郁脾虚证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.59</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>大便时干时稀，大便时溏时结</tcm:synonym>
