    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">饮食量较平常减少，或少于一般人。见于肝气郁结证、脾胃气虚证、脾胃虚寒证、脾肾阳虚证，或伤食等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food intake reduced compared with usual or less than ordinary people. Seen in liver qi depression and binding pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:伤食]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.54</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>少食，纳少</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>饮食减少</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0004396</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>64379006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>decreased appetite</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7M</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
