    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡肿而宣浮，散漫不聚。见于风肿、痄腮、抱头火丹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores and ulcers swelling puffy and superficial not. Seen in mumps. [证候待译:风肿/抱头火丹] [未译片段:散漫聚]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.96</tcm:reference>
