    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">泪液减少，甚至枯竭，致黑睛、白睛干燥失润。见于气阴两亏证、肝肾阴亏证、心脾气血两虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Decreased tear fluid even exhausted cornea white of the eye dryness. Seen in qi and yin dual deficiency pattern; heart and spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:肝肾阴亏证] [未译片段:致失润]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.100</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_神水将枯</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Decreased tear fluid even exhausted cornea white of the eye dryness. Seen in qi and yin dual deficiency pattern; heart and spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:肝肾阴亏证] [未译片段:致失润]</obo:IAO_0000115>
