    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">听力减退，听音不清，且声音重复，又嗡嗡回声。见于肾精亏虚证、痰浊上蒙证、风邪上袭证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Decreased hearing with unclear perception of sounds, sounds seeming duplicated, and a buzzing echo. Seen in kidney essence deficiency pattern, phlegm-turbidity clouding upward pattern, and wind pathogen invading upward pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_重听</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Decreased hearing with unclear perception of sounds, sounds seeming duplicated, and a buzzing echo. Seen in kidney essence deficiency pattern, phlegm-turbidity clouding upward pattern, and wind pathogen invading upward pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#PhlegmEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
