    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">甲板上出现沟痕，凹凸不平。见于气滞血瘀证、脾胃气虚证、肝血虚证、气血两虚证，或钩状甲、横沟甲、勺状甲等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Grooves and ridges appearing on the nail plate, making it uneven. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, and qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or hook-shaped nail, transverse-grooved nail, and spoon nail.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_甲板高低不平</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Grooves and ridges appearing on the nail plate, making it uneven. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, and qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or hook-shaped nail, transverse-grooved nail, and spoon nail.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
