    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咳吐浊痰，闻之腥臭刺鼻。见于脓毒蕴积证，或肺痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Coughing up turbid sputum that smells fishy and offensive. Seen in pus-toxin accumulation pattern, or lung abscess.</tcm:definition>
