    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛浅层有泡状结节。见于肺经燥热证、肺阴虚证、肺火亢盛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vesicular nodules in the superficial layer of the white of the eye. Seen in lung channel dryness-heat pattern, lung yin deficiency pattern, and lung fire hyperactivity pattern.</tcm:definition>
