    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A subjective sweet taste in the mouth. Mostly seen in externally-contracted dampness-heat pattern, spleen deficiency pattern, or excessive consumption of greasy and sweet food.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.13</tcm:reference>
