    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">张口呼吸，双肩随呼吸起落。见于哮喘、肺热喘咳、白喉等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Breathing with the mouth open, both shoulders rising and falling with respiration. Seen in asthma, lung-heat panting cough, and diphtheria.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.17</tcm:reference>
