    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头倾斜低垂，无力抬举。见于脾气虚证、肾虚髓亏证，或颈部外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The head tilted and drooping, without the strength to hold it up. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern, or neck trauma.</tcm:definition>
