        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经周期提前或延迟、无定期，或行经持续时间延长或缩短，且连续出现2个周期以上，不能按正常规律行经。见于胞宫气虚证、胞宫血虚证、胞宫虚寒证、胞宫虚热证、心脾两虚证、肝郁化火证、冲任不调证、阴虚血热证、胞宫积热证、寒凝胞宫证、痰凝胞宫证、瘀阻胞宫证，或月经先期、月经后期、月经先后无定期、经期延长等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual bleeding occurring irregularly—advanced or delayed, at indefinite intervals, or with prolonged or shortened duration—for more than two consecutive cycles. Seen in uterus qi deficiency pattern, uterus blood deficiency pattern, uterus deficiency-cold pattern, uterus deficiency-heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, Chong-Ren disharmony pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, uterus heat accumulation pattern, cold congelation in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, and stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, or advanced menstruation, delayed menstruation, irregular menstruation, and prolonged menstruation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经血非时而下</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstrual bleeding occurring irregularly—advanced or delayed, at indefinite intervals, or with prolonged or shortened duration—for more than two consecutive cycles. Seen in uterus qi deficiency pattern, uterus blood deficiency pattern, uterus deficiency-cold pattern, uterus deficiency-heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, Chong-Ren disharmony pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, uterus heat accumulation pattern, cold congelation in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, and stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, or advanced menstruation, delayed menstruation, irregular menstruation, and prolonged menstruation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#ColdEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
