    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指窦道外口周围皮肤疱疹累累，疱内有脓液，或溃破后脓液流滋。见于热毒炽盛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Finger sinus tract mouth surrounding skin herpetic lesion inside with pus or ulceration pus oozing of serous fluid. Seen in toxic heat blazing pattern. [未译片段:外累累疱后]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.97</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_窦道周围脓疱</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Finger sinus tract mouth surrounding skin herpetic lesion inside with pus or ulceration pus oozing of serous fluid. Seen in toxic heat blazing pattern. [未译片段:外累累疱后]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
