    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼眶上部，眉棱骨部疼痛。属阳明经头痛。见于风热上乘、阳明经热或肝火上炎证、肝血虚证、风痰阻络证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain at the supraorbital ridge above the orbit, belonging to yangming-channel headache. Seen in wind-heat invading upward, yangming channel heat, liver fire flaring upward pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, and wind-phlegm blocking the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_眉棱骨痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain at the supraorbital ridge above the orbit, belonging to yangming-channel headache. Seen in wind-heat invading upward, yangming channel heat, liver fire flaring upward pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, and wind-phlegm blocking the collaterals pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
