    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉络末端终于食指第二指节横纹和第三指节横纹之间。见于邪气入经，邪深而病重。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The (infantile finger) venules ending between the transverse creases of the second and third segments of the index finger. Seen when the pathogen has entered the channels, indicating a deep pathogen and severe disease.</tcm:definition>
