    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目大眦部常有涎水或脓汁自泪窍外漏。见于风热证、心脾湿热证等。又称漏睛、脓漏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eye inner canthus region with drool fluid or pus lacrimal punctum leakage. Seen in wind-heat pattern; heart and spleen dampness-heat pattern. Also known as dacryocystitis (leaking eye). [又称:脓漏] [未译片段:常汁自外]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.67</tcm:reference>
