    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼睑结膜潮红充血。见于肉轮风热证、肉轮湿热证、肉轮热毒证，或眼脸湿疹、风赤疮痍等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid membrane flushed red congestion/hyperemia. Seen in wind-red sore (eczematous blepharitis). [证候待译:肉轮风热证/肉轮湿热证/肉轮热毒证/眼脸湿疹] [未译片段:结]</tcm:definition>
