      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N64fb5102da2843fdb42b26ef505a6503">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢由手足冷至肘膝的症状。见于阳虚、阴盛阳微的少阴病证，或血脉不畅，阳气不达四肢，如阳脱、寒厥、热厥、蛔厥、痰厥等。又称肢厥、四肢厥冷。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Coldness of the limbs extending from the hands and feet up to the elbows and knees. Seen in yang deficiency, shaoyin disease patterns of yin exuberance with faint yang, or when blood vessels are obstructed so that yang qi fails to reach the limbs, as in yang collapse, cold reversal, heat reversal, ascaris reversal, and phlegm reversal. Also known as limb reversal and reversal cold of the limbs.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>四肢厥冷</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>肢厥</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_四肢厥逆</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Coldness of the limbs extending from the hands and feet up to the elbows and knees. Seen in yang deficiency, shaoyin disease patterns of yin exuberance with faint yang, or when blood vessels are obstructed so that yang qi fails to reach the limbs, as in yang collapse, cold reversal, heat reversal, ascaris reversal, and phlegm reversal. Also known as limb reversal and reversal cold of the limbs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>四肢厥冷</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>肢厥</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#ColdEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
