    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">想咬其他人和衣物。见于狂犬病、痉病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The urge to bite other people and clothing. Seen in rabies and convulsive disease.</tcm:definition>
