    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便呈泡沫样。见于水饮内停证、风寒表证、外感风寒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool presenting as foam -like. Seen in external contraction with wind-cold pattern. [证候待译:水饮内停证/风寒表证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.82</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
