    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳内有闭塞感，如有异物阻塞。见于风热犯耳证、痰湿泛耳证，或耳胀、耵耳、异物入耳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A blocking sensation inside the ear, as if obstructed by a foreign body. Seen in wind-heat invading the ear pattern and phlegm-dampness flooding the ear pattern, or ear distension, cerumen impaction, and foreign body entering the ear.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.37</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳内堵塞</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A blocking sensation inside the ear, as if obstructed by a foreign body. Seen in wind-heat invading the ear pattern and phlegm-dampness flooding the ear pattern, or ear distension, cerumen impaction, and foreign body entering the ear.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
