    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睾丸肿胀变大。见于肝经湿热证、下焦热毒证、湿热下注证、水湿内停证、气滞证、外感邪毒证，或水疝、睾丸肿瘤、血疝、子痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Testicle swelling large. Seen in liver channel dampness-heat pattern; lower jiao heat-toxin pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi stagnation pattern; external contraction with pathogenic toxin pattern; ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:水湿内停证/水疝/睾丸肿瘤/血疝] [未译片段:变]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000053</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睾丸肿大</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
