    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口干或渴，但不欲饮水。见于湿热熏蒸证、痰湿内停证、水饮停聚阻塞气机、肾阳亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dry mouth or thirst without the desire to drink. Seen in dampness-heat fumigating pattern, phlegm-dampness internal retention pattern, water-rheum collecting and blocking qi movement, and kidney yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>不欲饮</tcm:synonym>
