    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发干枯而黄，毫无光泽。见于脾胃不和证、精血亏虚证、先天不足、气血两虚证、脾气虚证，或秃疮、疳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair dry and withered yellow without glossy. Seen in spleen and stomach disharmony pattern; essence and blood deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan (infantile malnutrition). [证候待译:先天不足/脾气虚证/秃疮] [未译片段:毫]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.26</tcm:reference>
