    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">红斑中心凹陷萎缩。见于风热伤营证，或盘状红斑狼疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Erythema/red macule central depression/hollowing atrophy. [证候待译:风热伤营证/盘状红斑狼疮]</tcm:definition>
