    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">夜间忽然惊醒剧哭，先哭后抽搐，啼哭似见异物，多见于小儿。见于惊恐伤神证，或客忤、蛲虫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden waking at night with violent crying, crying followed by convulsions, as if seeing something strange; mostly seen in children. Seen in fright damaging the spirit pattern, or infantile fright (kewu) and pinworm disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_剧哭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sudden waking at night with violent crying, crying followed by convulsions, as if seeing something strange; mostly seen in children. Seen in fright damaging the spirit pattern, or infantile fright (kewu) and pinworm disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
