      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">婴儿出生后，至2岁，囟门仍不闭合，甚则头缝开解。见于肾虚髓亏证、脾虚失调证、脾虚水泛证、热毒蕴结证等。又称囟门不合、囟开不合、囟解、解颅。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The fontanelle remaining unclosed up to 2 years of age, or even separation of the cranial sutures. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern, spleen deficiency dysfunction pattern, spleen deficiency with water flooding pattern, and heat-toxin accumulation pattern. Also known as unclosed fontanelle and separated skull (jielu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>囟开不合</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>囟解</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>囟门不合</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>解颅</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001476</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000270</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>295091000119</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>delayed closure anterior fontanel</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>82779003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>broad late closing cranial sutures</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen deficiency with water flooding pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_囟门迟闭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The fontanelle remaining unclosed up to 2 years of age, or even separation of the cranial sutures. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern, spleen deficiency dysfunction pattern, spleen deficiency with water flooding pattern, and heat-toxin accumulation pattern. Also known as unclosed fontanelle and separated skull (jielu).</obo:IAO_0000115>
