    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>囟解</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>囟门不合</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>解颅</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
