    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳脓秽浊不清，味臭。见于肾虚邪滞证、阴虚火旺证、湿热证、风湿热毒证、痰凝耳窍证，或慢性脓耳、骨疡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear pus turbid and filthy not foul odor. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; dampness-heat pattern; wind-dampness with heat-toxin pattern. [证候待译:肾虚邪滞证/痰凝耳窍证/慢性脓耳/骨疡] [未译片段:清味]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳脓臭秽</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Ear pus turbid and filthy not foul odor. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; dampness-heat pattern; wind-dampness with heat-toxin pattern. [证候待译:肾虚邪滞证/痰凝耳窍证/慢性脓耳/骨疡] [未译片段:清味]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
