    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">较早觉醒，多天未亮就醒，或半夜醒来，不能再入睡。见于心脾两虚证、心虚神怯证、心肾不交证、瘀阻脑络证、阴虚火旺证、痰热内扰证、肝郁化火证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Waking early—often before dawn or in the middle of the night—and being unable to fall asleep again. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, phlegm-heat internal disturbance pattern, and liver depression transforming into fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>193462001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>difficulty staying or falling asleep</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_早醒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Waking early—often before dawn or in the middle of the night—and being unable to fall asleep again. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, phlegm-heat internal disturbance pattern, and liver depression transforming into fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:193462001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
