    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">经血排出量明显减少，甚至点滴即净，或行经时间过短，不足两天，经量也因而减少。见于寒凝胞宫证、胞宫气虚证、胞宫血虚证、胞宫虚寒证、胞宫虚热证、冲任不调证、肝郁化火证、阴虚血热证、痰凝胞宫证、瘀阻胞宫证，或血劳、干血痨、血风劳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Markedly reduced menstrual flow, even only spotting before cessation, or menstruation lasting less than two days with consequently reduced volume. Seen in cold congelation in the uterus pattern, uterus qi deficiency pattern, uterus blood deficiency pattern, uterus deficiency-cold pattern, uterus deficiency-heat pattern, Chong-Ren disharmony pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, and stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, or blood consumption, dry-blood consumption, and blood-wind consumption.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000876</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>27342003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Oligomenorrhea</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>GA20.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Oligomenorrhoea</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经量少</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Markedly reduced menstrual flow, even only spotting before cessation, or menstruation lasting less than two days with consequently reduced volume. Seen in cold congelation in the uterus pattern, uterus qi deficiency pattern, uterus blood deficiency pattern, uterus deficiency-cold pattern, uterus deficiency-heat pattern, Chong-Ren disharmony pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, and stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, or blood consumption, dry-blood consumption, and blood-wind consumption.</obo:IAO_0000115>
