    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">精神错乱，语无伦次，狂躁妄言。见于气郁化火证，痰火互结证，或狂病、伤寒蓄血证等。又称狂躁妄言、语言狂妄不避亲疏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mental derangement with incoherent, manic and raving speech. Seen in qi depression transforming into fire pattern and phlegm-fire mutual binding pattern, or kuang (manic) disease and cold-damage blood amassment pattern. Also known as manic raving.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.41</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>狂躁妄言</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>语言狂妄不避亲疏</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_言语狂妄</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mental derangement with incoherent, manic and raving speech. Seen in qi depression transforming into fire pattern and phlegm-fire mutual binding pattern, or kuang (manic) disease and cold-damage blood amassment pattern. Also known as manic raving.</obo:IAO_0000115>
