    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">看见现实中并不存在的各种现象。见于痰气郁结证、痰火扰心证、阴虚火旺证、气血两虚证、热入血室等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Seeing various phenomena that do not exist in reality (visual hallucination). Seen in phlegm-qi depression pattern, phlegm-fire disturbing the heart pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, and heat entering the blood chamber.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
