    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女每值经期或经前出现发热，经后则退。见于肝郁化热、气滞血瘀、痰湿阻滞、气虚发热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever occurring with each menstrual period or just before it, subsiding after the period ends. Seen in liver depression transforming into heat, qi stagnation with blood stasis, phlegm-dampness obstruction, and qi deficiency fever pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.70</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行发热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever occurring with each menstrual period or just before it, subsiding after the period ends. Seen in liver depression transforming into heat, qi stagnation with blood stasis, phlegm-dampness obstruction, and qi deficiency fever pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
