    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin flakes shedding from the scalp. Seen in wind-heat transforming into dryness, dampness-heat engendering wind, blood heat transforming into dryness, and toxic pathogen spreading.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.160</tcm:reference>
