    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈项部或颈前喉结两旁肿胀。见于毒邪流窜证、气滞痰凝证、痰瘀互结证、阴虚火旺证、肝郁痰热证、胃热脾虚证、肝气郁结证，或瘿气、侠瘿瘅、颈痈、瘰疬、气瘿、瘿痈、肉瘿、石瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Swelling of the neck and nape, or beside the laryngeal prominence in the front of the neck. Seen in toxic pathogen wandering pattern, qi stagnation with phlegm congealing pattern, phlegm-stasis mutual binding pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern, stomach heat with spleen deficiency pattern, and liver qi depression pattern, or ying-qi, xiayingdan, neck abscess, scrofula, qi goiter, goiter abscess (thyroiditis), fleshy goiter, and stony goiter.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈项肿胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Swelling of the neck and nape, or beside the laryngeal prominence in the front of the neck. Seen in toxic pathogen wandering pattern, qi stagnation with phlegm congealing pattern, phlegm-stasis mutual binding pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern, stomach heat with spleen deficiency pattern, and liver qi depression pattern, or ying-qi, xiayingdan, neck abscess, scrofula, qi goiter, goiter abscess (thyroiditis), fleshy goiter, and stony goiter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
