    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">说话时断时续，语声低弱。见于风痰阻络证，或口吃、中风先兆、中风后遗症、喘证、哮证、虚弱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Speech interrupted and intermittent, with a low weak voice. Seen in wind-phlegm blocking the collaterals pattern, or stuttering, wind-stroke prodrome, wind-stroke sequelae, dyspnea disease, wheezing disease, and debility.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.11</tcm:reference>
