    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后阴道流血，或伴小腹、会阴部下坠感。见于胎漏、胎动不安等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vagina bleeding or accompanied by lower abdomen perineum region bearing-down sensation. Seen in threatened miscarriage; restless fetus. [未译片段:怀孕后感]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.3</tcm:reference>
