    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神较正常细小，甚者细如针孔，失却展开功能。见于脾肾阳虚证、水轮风热证、水轮湿热证、水轮风湿夹热证、阴虚火旺证。或先天性、神水混浊等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pupil smaller than normal, even pinhole-sized, losing the ability to dilate. Seen in spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, water-wheel wind-heat pattern, water-wheel dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel wind-dampness with heat pattern, and yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, or congenital causes and turbid aqueous humor.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.93</tcm:reference>
