    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_瞳神缩小</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The pupil smaller than normal, even pinhole-sized, losing the ability to dilate. Seen in spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, water-wheel wind-heat pattern, water-wheel dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel wind-dampness with heat pattern, and yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, or congenital causes and turbid aqueous humor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
