    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">风轮上部与气轮交界处，渐生灰白色翳膜，状如新月。见于肝肾亏虚证、肝血虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A gray-white nebular membrane gradually growing at the junction of the upper wind-wheel (cornea) and the qi-wheel (white of the eye), shaped like a crescent moon. Seen in liver-kidney deficiency pattern and liver blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_偃月侵睛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A gray-white nebular membrane gradually growing at the junction of the upper wind-wheel (cornea) and the qi-wheel (white of the eye), shaped like a crescent moon. Seen in liver-kidney deficiency pattern and liver blood deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
