    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">因足部肌肉萎缩致使足下垂不能抬起。见于脾虚气陷证、气血两虚证、肝肾亏虚证、热毒蕴结肌肤证、湿热阻络证、瘀血阻络证，或痿躄、软脚瘟等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Due to foot region muscle atrophy foot sagging/ptosis inability rising. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; liver and kidney deficiency pattern. [证候待译:热毒蕴结肌肤证/湿热阻络证/瘀血阻络证/痿躄/软脚瘟] [未译片段:致使抬]</tcm:definition>
