    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pharynx and pharynx region swelling or red swelling throat diffuse swelling pale red. Seen in lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:咽喉色鲜红肿痛/外感瘟毒证] [未译片段:后壁峡其]</tcm:definition>
