    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">整个头部或头的前、后部位，或两侧或头顶部位的疼痛。见于外感病或痰浊、瘀血阻滞证或气血两虚证、肾虚髓亏证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the whole head, or of its front, back, sides, or vertex. Seen in externally-contracted diseases, phlegm-turbidity or blood stasis obstruction patterns, qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, and kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.53</tcm:reference>
