    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹小如刺。见于毒热浸淫、痰热阴虚、风湿犯表证、湿热痹阻证、血热证、肺胃热盛证，或粟疹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rash small like. Seen in phlegm-heat with yin deficiency pattern; blood heat pattern; lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:毒热浸淫/风湿犯表证/湿热痹阻证/粟疹] [未译片段:刺]</tcm:definition>
