    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛持续时间较长，无明显间歇或缓解。见于血瘀证、实证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain lasting for a prolonged time without marked intervals or relief. Seen in blood stasis pattern and excess pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.14</tcm:reference>
