    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体肿胀，色鲜红或青紫不能收回口中。见于心脾热盛证、外感湿热证等。又称肿胀舌。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue body swelling colored bright red or bluish-purple inability mouth. Seen in heart and spleen heat with exuberance pattern; external contraction with dampness-heat pattern. [又称:肿胀舌] [未译片段:收回]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.84</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>肿胀舌</tcm:synonym>
