    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">膝关节软弱无力，甚或行走困难。见于肝肾亏虚证、寒湿痹阻证、湿热下注证，或膝痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Knee joint soft weakness marked or difficulty. Seen in liver and kidney deficiency pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:寒湿痹阻证/膝痹] [未译片段:弱行走]</tcm:definition>
