    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">尿液中有沉淀物，浑浊不清。见于湿热内蕴证、肾阴虚证、肾阳虚证、脾肾阳虚证、下焦湿热证、脾虚气陷证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urine with sediment mass turbidity not. Seen in dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; lower jiao dampness-heat pattern; spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern. [证候待译:肾阴虚证/肾阳虚证] [未译片段:中清]</tcm:definition>
