    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">嗅觉过敏，自觉有异常气味，或味淡而自感气味刺鼻。见于心肝郁热证、心脾两虚证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Olfactory hypersensitivity—perceiving an abnormal odor, or perceiving a bland smell as pungent (olfactory hallucination). Seen in heart-liver depressed heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, and yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:5200200</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>MB27.24</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Olfactory hallucinations</tcm:icd11Term>
  
