    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">嗳气连续不断，经常发生。见于肝气犯胃证、寒邪客胃证、脾胃气虚证，或胃疡、胃络痛、胃郁等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Belching occurring continuously and frequently. Seen in liver qi invading the stomach pattern, cold pathogen lodging in the stomach pattern, and spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, or gastric ulcer (weiyang), stomach-collateral pain, and stomach depression.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.47</tcm:reference>
