    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脐以下正中部位疼痛。见于膀胱湿热证、结石／瘀血阻滞膀胱证、肾虚寒凝证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the midline region below the umbilicus. Seen in bladder dampness-heat pattern, stones or blood stasis obstructing the bladder pattern, and kidney deficiency with cold congelation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002027</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>21522001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abdominal discomfort</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SM33</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Abdominal pain disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>DD91.4</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Functional abdominal pain syndrome</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SC10</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Puerperal abdominal pain disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
