    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">进食后困倦嗜睡，或进餐中疲困难支而停食入睡。见于脾气虚证、痰湿中阻证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Drowsiness and desire to sleep after meals, or fatigue during a meal forcing one to stop eating and fall asleep. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern and phlegm-dampness obstructing the middle pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.18</tcm:reference>
