    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉动显现部位较深，轻按不应，重按始得，举之不足，按之有余。见于里证、寒证、阴证，或留饮水肿、亡血失精、寒疝腹痛、湿痹关节等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pulse palpable only at a deep level—not responding to light pressure but obtained on heavy pressure; insufficient on lifting and excessive on pressing. Seen in interior pattern, cold pattern, and yin pattern, or retained-rheum edema, blood and essence collapse, cold-shan abdominal pain, and damp-bi of the joints.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XK16</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Deep</tcm:icd11Term>
  
