    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部转动时有辘辘水声。见于脾阳虚证、痰饮中阻证，或胃饮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A gurgling water sound when the abdomen is turned from side to side. Seen in spleen yang deficiency pattern and phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, or stomach rheum.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腹部转侧有水声</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A gurgling water sound when the abdomen is turned from side to side. Seen in spleen yang deficiency pattern and phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, or stomach rheum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
