    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">唇部上长有粟米状肿物，质硬疼痛。见于风热夹湿证、脾胃积热证、肝郁化火证、瘀血留滞证、虚灼口证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lip growing -like mass hard pain. Seen in wind-heat with with with dampness pattern; spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; liver depression with transforming into fire pattern. [证候待译:瘀血留滞证/虚灼口证] [未译片段:上粟米质]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_唇上生疔</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
