    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指舌表面有一层黄色浊腻苔，其苔中心稍厚，边缘较薄，属腻苔。见于湿热蕴结证、食积热腐证、痰饮化热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A yellow greasy coating on the tongue surface, slightly thicker in the center and thinner at the edges, belonging to greasy coating. Seen in dampness-heat accumulation pattern, food accumulation with heat putrefaction pattern, and phlegm-rheum transforming into heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.68</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
