    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴茎插入阴道不足1分钟便发生射精，不能正常进行性交。见于肾气不固证、肝经湿热证、心脾两虚、阴虚阳亢证，或精浊、早泄等。又称射精过快。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ejaculation within one minute of vaginal penetration, making normal intercourse impossible. Seen in kidney qi insecurity pattern, liver channel dampness-heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency, and yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern, or prostatitis (jingzhuo). Also known as overly rapid ejaculation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>射精过快</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0012876</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>44001008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>premature ejaculation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>15405008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>delayed ejaculation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SB08</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Premature ejaculation disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_早泄</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Ejaculation within one minute of vaginal penetration, making normal intercourse impossible. Seen in kidney qi insecurity pattern, liver channel dampness-heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency, and yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern, or prostatitis (jingzhuo). Also known as overly rapid ejaculation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
