    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志短暂丧失或不清，淡漠呆滞，无意识反应。见于心脾两虚证，或癫病、癫痫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Brief loss or clouding of consciousness with indifference, dullness and absence of response. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and epilepsy.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
