    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_精神恍惚</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Brief loss or clouding of consciousness with indifference, dullness and absence of response. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and epilepsy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
