    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脊柱离开正中线向左或右偏曲。见于先天不足、肾精亏损证、肝肾亏虚证、瘀滞筋骨证，或一侧胸部有病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The spine deviating left or right from the midline. Seen in congenital insufficiency, kidney essence depletion pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, and stasis in the sinews and bones pattern, or disease of one side of the chest.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
