    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">排便间隔时间延长，粪便艰涩难下。见于大肠热结证、湿热蕴结证、肺气虚证、肝脾气滞证、脾肾阳虚证、血虚津亏证、阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Prolonged intervals between bowel movements with difficult, obstructed passage of stool. Seen in large-intestine heat binding pattern, dampness-heat accumulation pattern, lung qi deficiency pattern, liver-spleen qi stagnation pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, blood deficiency with fluid insufficiency pattern, and yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.40</tcm:reference>
