    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口开而不闭。见于肺气将绝、脾气将绝、心气将绝、心肾亏虚证、风痰阻络证、或落架风、痫症等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The mouth held open and unable to close. Seen in lung qi about to expire, spleen qi about to expire, heart qi about to expire, heart-kidney deficiency pattern, and wind-phlegm blocking the collaterals pattern, or lockjaw-wind (luojiafeng) and epilepsy.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
