    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块表面触之光滑。见于热蕴络瘀证、痰湿流注证、痰核留结证、痰瘀互结证，或良性肿瘤、血瘤、肉瘤、胶瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass surface smoothness. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; hemangioma; lipoma/sarcoma. [证候待译:热蕴络瘀证/痰湿流注证/痰核留结证/良性肿瘤/胶瘤] [未译片段:触]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肿块表面光滑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mass surface smoothness. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; hemangioma; lipoma/sarcoma. [证候待译:热蕴络瘀证/痰湿流注证/痰核留结证/良性肿瘤/胶瘤] [未译片段:触]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
