    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">下肢筋脉突起如蚯蚓状，膝以下小腿处尤显，或形成团块。见于寒滞肝脉证、热蕴络瘀证、血瘀风燥证，或筋瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Blue vessels of the lower limbs protruding like earthworms, most marked on the calf below the knee, or forming masses. Seen in cold stagnation in the liver vessels pattern, heat accumulating with collateral stasis pattern, and blood stasis with wind-dryness pattern, or varicose veins (jinliu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.86</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000179</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000303</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>109504005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>big lower jaw</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>22810007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>big lower jaw</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
