    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">听力下降，轻者听音不清，重者全无所闻。见于风寒袭肺证、肝血虚证、肾虚证，或老年聋、久聋等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Decreased hearing—in mild cases unclear perception of sounds, in severe cases total loss. Seen in wind-cold attacking the lung pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, and kidney deficiency pattern, or presbycusis and chronic deafness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
