    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼部分泌物增多，泪液无法控制，溢出眼外。见于肉轮血瘀证、风重于热证、血轮实热证，或凝脂翳、电光伤目等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Increased eye discharge with tears overflowing uncontrollably beyond the eye. Seen in flesh-wheel blood stasis pattern, wind predominating over heat pattern, and blood-wheel excess heat pattern, or congealed-fat nebula (purulent keratitis) and electric-light eye injury (photokeratitis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MC14</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Eye discharge</tcm:icd11Term>
  
