    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呵欠频频不止。见于体虚、气滞血瘀证、脾肾阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Yawning repeatedly without ceasing. Seen in bodily deficiency, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, and spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.66</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
