    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">翳膜上赤脉密集，状如丝缕。见于风轮风热证、风轮热毒证，或血翳包睛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nebula (corneal opacity) membrane red vessels -like like thread-like strands. [证候待译:风轮风热证/风轮热毒证/血翳包睛] [未译片段:上密集]</tcm:definition>
