    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小儿耳后根部皮温较低，或自觉发凉。多见于出疹先兆。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Low skin temperature behind the root of the ear in children, or a subjective feeling of coolness there. Mostly seen as a precursor of eruptive disease.</tcm:definition>
