    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便清稀如水样。见于寒湿犯表证、饮食生冷、寒湿困脾证、水饮内停证、虚寒证、脾胃气虚证，或热结旁流、霍乱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool thin and clear like fluid -like. Seen in cold-dampness with encumbrance and spleen disorder pattern; deficiency-cold pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; cholera. [证候待译:寒湿犯表证/饮食生冷/水饮内停证/热结旁流]</tcm:definition>
