    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">精液挟血呈红色。见于阴虚火旺证、下焦湿热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Semen presenting as red colored. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; lower jiao dampness-heat pattern. [未译片段:挟血]</tcm:definition>
