    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发于头皮部的多个毛囊炎及毛囊周炎串联成片。见于湿热证，或蝼蛄疖、小儿暑疖、暑热、胎毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Multiple folliculitis and perifolliculitis lesions of the scalp coalescing into patches. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, or mole-cricket furuncle (lougu jie), infantile summerheat furuncle, summerheat-heat, and fetal toxin.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疖肿串空头皮</oboInOwl:id>
