    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或两侧下肢肿胀，或伴瘀紫。见于湿热下注证、脾阳虚证、肾阳虚证，或流火、下肢外伤、骨折、脱臼、脉痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Swelling of one or both lower limbs, possibly accompanied by purple stasis. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, and kidney yang deficiency pattern, or flowing fire (erysipelas of the leg), lower-limb trauma, fracture, dislocation, and vessel bi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.88</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_下肢肿胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Swelling of one or both lower limbs, possibly accompanied by purple stasis. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, and kidney yang deficiency pattern, or flowing fire (erysipelas of the leg), lower-limb trauma, fracture, dislocation, and vessel bi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
