    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">骤然发生的高出皮肤的斑丘疹堆累成片，搔痒难耐，迅速消退，不留痕迹。见于风热蕴肤证、胃肠积热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Suddenly appearing raised papules and wheals coalescing into patches, intensely itchy, subsiding rapidly without leaving marks. Seen in wind-heat accumulating in the skin pattern and stomach-intestinal heat accumulation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF9F</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Bladder heat accumulation pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_风团瘙痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Suddenly appearing raised papules and wheals coalescing into patches, intensely itchy, subsiding rapidly without leaving marks. Seen in wind-heat accumulating in the skin pattern and stomach-intestinal heat accumulation pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF9F</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
