    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Noisy expulsion of air from the nose due to itching—a manifestation of the body's yang qi rising to resist the pathogen; frequent sneezing with other discomforts is pathological. Seen in wind-cold attacking the nose pattern, lung deficiency with the nasal orifices unwarmed pattern, spleen deficiency with the nasal orifices unilluminated pattern, yang deficiency with the nasal orifices unwarmed pattern, and depressed heat fumigating the nose pattern, or wind-damage nasal obstruction, common cold, early measles, and allergic rhinitis (biqiu).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025095</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
