      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">经常怀疑、不信任别人或自己，甚至产生幻视、幻听或意想。见于胆热痰扰证、心脾两虚证、心胆气虚证、肝郁气虚证、气滞血瘀证，或脏躁等。疑虑可并见，不但怀疑别人或自己所做的事、讲的话，或不信任，认为别人有恶意，甚至产生幻视、幻听或意想，并过度忧愁担心。又称多疑虑、多疑多虑。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent suspicion and distrust of others or oneself, even with visual or auditory hallucinations or delusional ideation. Seen in gallbladder heat with phlegm disturbance pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart-gallbladder qi deficiency pattern, liver depression with qi deficiency pattern, and qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao). Doubt and worry may co-occur—distrusting what others or oneself has done or said, believing others have malicious intent, with hallucinations and excessive anxiety. Also known as suspiciousness with worry.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MB26.9</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Suspiciousness</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_多疑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Frequent suspicion and distrust of others or oneself, even with visual or auditory hallucinations or delusional ideation. Seen in gallbladder heat with phlegm disturbance pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart-gallbladder qi deficiency pattern, liver depression with qi deficiency pattern, and qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao). Doubt and worry may co-occur—distrusting what others or oneself has done or said, believing others have malicious intent, with hallucinations and excessive anxiety. Also known as suspiciousness with worry.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MB26.9</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
