    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼睑内睑板颜色淡白。多见于血虚证、气血两虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid inside tarsal plate pale white profuse. Seen in blood deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [未译片段:颜]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.33</tcm:reference>
