    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SR1T</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood deficiency pattern (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
