    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肤色较正常人黄而无华。见于虚劳、失血、劳倦过度、饮食不节、久病失治等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin yellower than normal and lusterless. Seen in deficiency-consumption (xulao), blood loss, excessive fatigue, dietary intemperance, and chronic disease with failed treatment.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.66</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
