    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin yellower than normal and lusterless. Seen in deficiency-consumption (xulao), blood loss, excessive fatigue, dietary intemperance, and chronic disease with failed treatment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
