    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼珠骤然突出，轻者含于睑内，重者突于眶外。见于脉络瘀滞证，或眼底部肿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The eyeball suddenly protruding—in mild cases contained within the lids, in severe cases protruding beyond the orbit. Seen in vessel-collateral stasis pattern, or tumor of the fundus.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_珠突出眶</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The eyeball suddenly protruding—in mild cases contained within the lids, in severe cases protruding beyond the orbit. Seen in vessel-collateral stasis pattern, or tumor of the fundus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
