    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自己脱掉衣服，奔走，而不自知。见于火热伤阴证、痰火扰神证，或癫病、狂病等。常与登高而歌并见。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tearing off one's clothes and running about without self-awareness. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern and phlegm-fire disturbing the spirit pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and kuang (manic psychosis). Often co-occurs with climbing heights and singing.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_弃衣而走</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Tearing off one's clothes and running about without self-awareness. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern and phlegm-fire disturbing the spirit pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and kuang (manic psychosis). Often co-occurs with climbing heights and singing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
