    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">结节呈红色。见于气血瘀滞证、痰气浸淫、寒湿阻络证，或瓜藤缠等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nodule presenting as red colored. Seen in qi and blood stagnation pattern; gualouchan (erythema nodosum). [证候待译:痰气浸淫/寒湿阻络证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032217</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0034819</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>SK6T</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Phlyctenular nodule disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
