    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">关节肌肉疼痛，动则疼痛加剧，不愿运动。见于虚证，或血瘀证、热毒炽盛证、顽痹证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the joints and muscles aggravated by movement, with reluctance to move. Seen in deficiency patterns, or blood stasis pattern, toxic heat blazing pattern, and obstinate bi pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025286</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_活动疼痛加剧</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain of the joints and muscles aggravated by movement, with reluctance to move. Seen in deficiency patterns, or blood stasis pattern, toxic heat blazing pattern, and obstinate bi pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
