    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">病变白睛侵及黑睛，黑睛边际发生灰白舌形混浊，尖端朝向中央。见于肝肺实热证、气轮湿热证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The lesion spreading from the white of the eye onto the cornea, forming a gray-white tongue-shaped opacity at the corneal margin whose tip points toward the center. Seen in liver-lung excess heat pattern, qi-wheel dampness-heat pattern, and yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.76</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_白膜侵睛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The lesion spreading from the white of the eye onto the cornea, forming a gray-white tongue-shaped opacity at the corneal margin whose tip points toward the center. Seen in liver-lung excess heat pattern, qi-wheel dampness-heat pattern, and yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
