    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼珠突起，胞睑白睛红赤肿胀。见于肝郁化火证、阴虚阳亢证、风热毒蕴证、热毒内陷证、热毒炽盛证、痰瘀搏结证、气郁化火证，或鸪眼凝睛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eye protrusion eyelid white of the eye red swelling. Seen in liver depression with transforming into fire pattern; yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern; toxic heat blazing pattern; qi depression with transforming into fire pattern. [证候待译:风热毒蕴证/热毒内陷证/痰瘀搏结证/鸪眼凝睛] [未译片段:珠]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.69</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
