    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Eye protrusion eyelid white of the eye red swelling. Seen in liver depression with transforming into fire pattern; yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern; toxic heat blazing pattern; qi depression with transforming into fire pattern. [证候待译:风热毒蕴证/热毒内陷证/痰瘀搏结证/鸪眼凝睛] [未译片段:珠]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
