    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">尿次、尿量明显少于正常。见于热盛伤津、汗下伤津，或热病、水肿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urine urine amount obvious scanty at. Seen in heat with exuberance with damaging fluids pattern; heat pattern; edema. [证候待译:汗下伤津] [未译片段:次正常]</tcm:definition>
