    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛上突起翳障，色黑而圆形状如珠。见于风轮热毒证、风轮湿热证、风轮阴虚证。或凝脂翳、湿翳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A protruding nebula on the cornea, black, round and pearl-shaped. Seen in wind-wheel heat-toxin pattern, wind-wheel dampness-heat pattern, and wind-wheel yin deficiency pattern, or congealed-fat nebula (purulent keratitis) and damp nebula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_黑翳如珠</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A protruding nebula on the cornea, black, round and pearl-shaped. Seen in wind-wheel heat-toxin pattern, wind-wheel dampness-heat pattern, and wind-wheel yin deficiency pattern, or congealed-fat nebula (purulent keratitis) and damp nebula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
