    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉头脑中有音声鸣响。见于肾虚髓亏证、火郁证、痰湿阻遏证等。又称脑鸣、头响、头脑鸣响。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective perception of sounds ringing inside the head. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern, fire depression pattern, and phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern. Also known as brain ringing and head ringing.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>头响</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>头脑鸣响</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>脑鸣</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
