    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective perception of sounds ringing inside the head. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow insufficiency pattern, fire depression pattern, and phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern. Also known as brain ringing and head ringing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
