    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛生多个星翳，或联缀，或团聚。见于风轮风寒证、风轮风热证、风轮实火证、风轮热毒证、风轮湿热证、风轮血热瘀结证、风轮阴虚邪恋证、脾气虚证、脾虚肝旺证、阴虚津伤证，或天行赤眼暴翳、聚星障、混睛、凝脂翳、花翳白陷、血翳包睛、银星独见、黑翳如珠、旋螺尖起、冰瑕翳、云翳、蟹睛病、暴露赤眼生翳、厚翳、脂翳、白膜侵睛、偃月侵睛、赤膜下垂、电光伤目、疳眼等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Multiple star-like nebulae on the cornea, linked in strings or clustered in groups. Seen in wind-wheel wind-cold pattern, wind-wheel wind-heat pattern, wind-wheel excess fire pattern, wind-wheel heat-toxin pattern, wind-wheel dampness-heat pattern, wind-wheel blood heat with stasis binding pattern, wind-wheel yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with liver exuberance pattern, and yin deficiency with fluid damage pattern, or epidemic red eye with sudden nebula, gathering-star impediment (herpetic keratitis), mixed-eye, congealed-fat nebula, flower-nebula white sinking, blood nebula enveloping the eye, solitary silver star, black nebula like a pearl, spiral-cone protrusion, ice-flaw nebula, cloud nebula, crab-eye disease, exposure red eye with nebula, thick nebula, fat nebula, white membrane invading the eye, crescent-moon invading the eye, red membrane hanging down, electric-light eye injury, and gan eye.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_黑睛生翳</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Multiple star-like nebulae on the cornea, linked in strings or clustered in groups. Seen in wind-wheel wind-cold pattern, wind-wheel wind-heat pattern, wind-wheel excess fire pattern, wind-wheel heat-toxin pattern, wind-wheel dampness-heat pattern, wind-wheel blood heat with stasis binding pattern, wind-wheel yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with liver exuberance pattern, and yin deficiency with fluid damage pattern, or epidemic red eye with sudden nebula, gathering-star impediment (herpetic keratitis), mixed-eye, congealed-fat nebula, flower-nebula white sinking, blood nebula enveloping the eye, solitary silver star, black nebula like a pearl, spiral-cone protrusion, ice-flaw nebula, cloud nebula, crab-eye disease, exposure red eye with nebula, thick nebula, fat nebula, white membrane invading the eye, crescent-moon invading the eye, red membrane hanging down, electric-light eye injury, and gan eye.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
