    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两手心、足心发热，手、足心温度高于手、足背，或自觉手、足心热感。见于阴虚证或火热内郁证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Heat in the palms and soles—the centers warmer than the dorsa, or a subjective hot sensation there. Seen in yin deficiency pattern and fire-heat internal depression pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.14</tcm:reference>
