    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门皮肤潮湿感。见于湿热下注证、热毒蕴结证、肛门湿热证、血虚风燥证，或急性肛门湿疹、慢性肛门湿疹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Damp anal skin. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; heat-toxin with accumulation and binding pattern; blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern. [证候待译:肛门湿热证/急性肛门湿疹/慢性肛门湿疹] [未译片段:感]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
