    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肤色较正常人黄。见于脾胃气虚证、气血两虚证、湿毒侵蚀，或黄疸、饮食不节等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin yellower than normal. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, and dampness-toxin erosion, or jaundice and dietary intemperance.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.166</tcm:reference>
