    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇部疼痛。见于脾经积热证、心脾有热证、胃热证，或唇茧等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips region pain. Seen in spleen channel accumulation with heat pattern; stomach heat pattern; lip callus (chronic cheilitis). [证候待译:心脾有热证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
