    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">与同龄人相比，阴茎过大，甚至畸形。见于先天肾阴不足、阴阳失调证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The penis larger than that of peers, even malformed. Seen in congenital kidney yin insufficiency and yin-yang disharmony pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.52</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000040</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>88673001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>enlarged penis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
