    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽部扁桃体肿大，形状如蚕蛾或乳头。见于肺胃热盛证，或急乳蛾、慢乳蛾。又称乳蛾。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tonsils swollen, shaped like a moth's wings or nipples. Seen in lung-stomach heat exuberance pattern, or acute and chronic tonsillitis. Also known as tonsillar moth (ru'e).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>乳蛾</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030812</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>46689006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>enlarged tonsils</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_乳蛾肿大</oboInOwl:id>
