    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体颜色淡红润泽，白中透红。见于健康人，病情轻浅、气血未伤者。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue body light red and moist, red showing through white. Seen in healthy persons, mild disease, or conditions without qi-blood damage.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
