    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸急促难续，喉间哨鸣有声。见于寒痰阻肺证、热痰阻肺证、寒热错杂证、阳虚证、阴虚痰阻证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rapid, difficult breathing with a whistling sound in the throat. Seen in cold-phlegm obstructing the lung pattern, heat-phlegm obstructing the lung pattern, cold-heat intermingling pattern, yang deficiency pattern, and yin deficiency with phlegm obstruction pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.29</tcm:reference>
