    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈部连及背部筋脉肌肉强直，不能前俯后仰及左右活动。见于风寒束表证、风湿束表证、邪热伤津，或金疮风毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck extending to and back sinews and vessels muscle rigidity inability and movement. Seen in pathogenic heat with damaging fluids pattern. [证候待译:风寒束表证/风湿束表证/金疮风毒] [未译片段:前俯后仰左右]</tcm:definition>
