    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤瘙痒，如虫行于皮中。见于营卫不和证，或虫痒、疥疮、手足癣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Itching of the skin as if insects were crawling within it (formication). Seen in ying-wei disharmony pattern, or worm itch, scabies, and tinea of the hands and feet.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.73</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤蚁行感</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Itching of the skin as if insects were crawling within it (formication). Seen in ying-wei disharmony pattern, or worm itch, scabies, and tinea of the hands and feet.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
