    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢月经期出现周期性的情志异常改变，如烦躁易怒，悲伤啼哭，或情志抑郁，喃喃自语，或狂躁不安，而经后又复如常人。见于心脾两虚、肝气郁结、心肝火旺、痰火上扰证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cyclic emotional disturbances with each menstrual period—irritability and anger, sadness and weeping, depression with muttering, or manic restlessness—returning to normal after the period. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency, liver qi depression, heart-liver fire exuberance, and phlegm-fire upward disturbance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.62</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行情志异常</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cyclic emotional disturbances with each menstrual period—irritability and anger, sadness and weeping, depression with muttering, or manic restlessness—returning to normal after the period. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency, liver qi depression, heart-liver fire exuberance, and phlegm-fire upward disturbance pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
