    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门及其周围以疼痛为主的症状。见于热毒炽盛证、气滞血瘀证，或肛痈、锁肛痔、肛裂、肛漏等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anus and surrounding pain is -like. Seen in toxic heat blazing pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; perianal abscess; anorectal cancer; anal fissure; anal fistula. [未译片段:其以主症]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.26</tcm:reference>
