    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">子宫出血量多而势急如崩。见于血热证、瘀血阻滞证、脾不统血证、冲任不固证等。又称崩中。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Uterine bleeding profuse and abrupt like flooding. Seen in blood heat pattern, blood stasis obstruction pattern, spleen failing to contain blood pattern, and Chong-Ren insecurity pattern. Also known as sudden flooding (bengzhong).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.9</tcm:reference>
