    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发、眉毛、阴毛、腋毛等全身毛发都脱落。见于血虚证、肾虚证，或普秃等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of hair over the whole body—scalp hair, eyebrows, pubic hair and axillary hair. Seen in blood deficiency pattern and kidney deficiency pattern, or alopecia universalis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.161</tcm:reference>
