    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙龈流出脓液。见于风热上炎证、火热上炎证、风火犯齿证、胃火燔齿证，或牙痈、牙宣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pus draining from the gums. Seen in wind-heat flaring upward pattern, fire-heat flaring upward pattern, wind-fire invading the teeth pattern, and stomach-fire scorching the teeth pattern, or dental abscess and yaxuan (periodontitis with gum recession).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.61</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_牙龈溢脓</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pus draining from the gums. Seen in wind-heat flaring upward pattern, fire-heat flaring upward pattern, wind-fire invading the teeth pattern, and stomach-fire scorching the teeth pattern, or dental abscess and yaxuan (periodontitis with gum recession).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
