    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼前出现团块状暗影飘移不定。见于水轮湿热蕴结证、水轮气滞血瘀证、水轮阴亏证、水轮气血亏虚证，或云雾移睛、血灌瞳神等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cloud-like dark shadows drifting before the eyes. Seen in water-wheel dampness-heat accumulation pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel yin insufficiency pattern, and water-wheel qi-blood deficiency pattern, or clouds and fog drifting in the eye (vitreous floaters) and blood flooding the pupil (hyphema).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
