    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目睛无神，白睛色暗。见于慢性、久病病人，属病重。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The eyes spiritless, with the white of the eye dark in color. Seen in chronic and prolonged disease, indicating a severe condition.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.86</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
