    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The eyes spiritless, with the white of the eye dark in color. Seen in chronic and prolonged disease, indicating a severe condition.</obo:IAO_0000115>
