    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌面有紫暗的瘀血斑块。见于外感病热入营血证、气血瘀滞证，内伤病血瘀证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue surface with dark purple macule. Seen in qi and blood stagnation pattern. [证候待译:外感病热入营血证/内伤病血瘀证] [未译片段:瘀血块]</tcm:definition>
