    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹凹如舟，严重者深凹着背。见于津液亏虚证，或霍乱、泄泻、痢疾等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The abdomen hollowed like a boat; in severe cases so deeply sunken as to touch the back. Seen in fluid deficiency pattern, or cholera, diarrhea, and dysentery.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.12</tcm:reference>
