    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴茎部皮肤溃疡，糜烂，纵深发展甚至腐烂脱落。见于肝郁气滞证、肝经湿热证、阴虚火旺证，或肾岩翻花等。见于病情较重。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Penis region skin ulcer erosion hair even festering falling off seen at. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; liver channel dampness-heat pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肾岩翻花] [未译片段:纵深展病情较重]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.54</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎腐脱</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Penis region skin ulcer erosion hair even festering falling off seen at. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; liver channel dampness-heat pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肾岩翻花] [未译片段:纵深展病情较重]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
