      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">男性外生殖器疼痛，或伴尿短频急等。见于下焦湿热证、结石阻滞膀胱证、心移热小肠证等。又称阴器痛、茎中痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the male external genitalia, possibly accompanied by scanty, frequent and urgent urination. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, stones obstructing the bladder pattern, and heart heat shifting to the small intestine pattern. Also known as pain of the genital organ and pain within the penis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.37</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>茎中痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>阴器痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MF40.00</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Pain in penis</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎疼痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain of the male external genitalia, possibly accompanied by scanty, frequent and urgent urination. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, stones obstructing the bladder pattern, and heart heat shifting to the small intestine pattern. Also known as pain of the genital organ and pain within the penis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>茎中痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>阴器痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
