    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌色淡白，干枯少津，甚则舌面毫无津液。见于阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue pale white, withered and dry with scant fluid, or even completely devoid of moisture on its surface. Seen in yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
