    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳廓糜烂流出脓液。见于血虚生风证、风邪热盛犯耳证，或旋耳疮、断耳疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Auricle erosion pus. Seen in blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern; auricular eczema; auricular perichondritis. [证候待译:风邪热盛犯耳证] [未译片段:流出]</tcm:definition>
