    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽后壁及咽峡部充血，色红。咽部深红者，肿痛明显，见于肺胃热盛证。咽部色红娇嫩者，肿痛不显，见于肾阴虚火旺证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pharynx and pharynx region congestion/hyperemia red pharynx deep red swelling pain obvious pharynx red swelling pain not seen at yin deficiency. Seen in lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern. [未译片段:后壁峡娇嫩显肾火旺证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.70</tcm:reference>
