    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体被白苔覆盖而不被透出者。见于风寒邪盛、寒湿踞于中焦等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue body covered by a white coating through which the tongue cannot be seen. Seen in wind-cold pathogen exuberance and cold-dampness entrenched in the middle jiao.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.90</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
