    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">臀部生痈肿。见于湿热壅滞证、火毒炽盛证，或臀痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Buttock abscess swelling. Seen in dampness-heat with congestion and stagnation pattern; buttock abscess. [证候待译:火毒炽盛证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.20</tcm:reference>
