    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔剥脱成地图样，边缘突起且位置时时移动。多见于小儿虫积证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue coating peeling in a map-like pattern, with raised margins that migrate from place to place. Mostly seen in pediatric worm accumulation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
