    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸廓较正常人扁，前后径小于左右径一半的症状。见于阴虚体质、肺肾阴虚证、气阴两虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The thoracic cage flatter than normal, with the anteroposterior diameter less than half the transverse diameter. Seen in yin deficiency constitution, lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, and qi-yin dual deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_胸廓扁平</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The thoracic cage flatter than normal, with the anteroposterior diameter less than half the transverse diameter. Seen in yin deficiency constitution, lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, and qi-yin dual deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF93</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
