      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊皮肤裂开。见于湿热下注证，脱囊等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum skin splitting/cracking. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
