    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便便质清稀，完谷不化，甚则如清水样。见于寒湿困脾证，脾肾阳虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool stool thin and clear undigested food in stool marked like fluid -like. Seen in cold-dampness with encumbrance and spleen disorder pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [未译片段:质则清]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.57</tcm:reference>
