    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足趾间皮肤瘙痒难忍，越搔越甚。见于肝经风热证、肌肤失养证、寒凝血涩证、肌肤湿热证，或脚湿气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Intolerable itching of the skin between the toes, worsening with scratching. Seen in liver channel wind-heat pattern, skin malnourishment pattern, cold congelation with blood stagnation pattern, and skin dampness-heat pattern, or foot dampness-qi (tinea pedis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.52</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_足痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Intolerable itching of the skin between the toes, worsening with scratching. Seen in liver channel wind-heat pattern, skin malnourishment pattern, cold congelation with blood stagnation pattern, and skin dampness-heat pattern, or foot dampness-qi (tinea pedis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
