    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">久蹲突然站起，而致头昏眼前发黑，站立不稳。多见于体质虚弱、气血两虚等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Chronic sudden rising dizziness eye turning black unsteady standing profuse. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:体质虚弱] [未译片段:蹲站致前]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_起立时眼前发黑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Chronic sudden rising dizziness eye turning black unsteady standing profuse. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:体质虚弱] [未译片段:蹲站致前]</obo:IAO_0000115>
