    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">尿次、尿量明显超过正常。见于肾阳亏虚证、肾气不固证，或消渴、肾著、尿崩、石水、侠瘿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urinary frequency and volume markedly exceeding normal. Seen in kidney yang deficiency pattern and kidney qi insecurity pattern, or wasting-thirst (diabetes), kidney fixation (shenzhuo), diabetes insipidus, stone-water edema, and xiaying tumor.</tcm:definition>
