    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊水肿而胀，伴全身水肿。见于脾肾阳虚、肝胆湿热、脾虚水停、心阳虚、血虚生风、湿热夹虫、湿热下注、阳虚水停，或水疝等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum edema distension accompanied by whole body edema. Seen in spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:脾虚水停/心阳虚/湿热夹虫/阳虚水停/水疝等证]</tcm:definition>
