    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来位沉，体细，其势软弱无力，需重按始浮取则无脉搏跳动。见于气血两虚证、元气虚、阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse deep in position, thin in body and weak in force, obtained only on heavy pressure—no beat felt on light touch. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, yuan qi deficiency, and yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>脉虚弱</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
