    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">病眼外观无异常，而视物模糊，自觉眼前有一片带色阴影遮隔。见于肝经郁热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The eye appearing normal externally, yet vision blurred with a subjective colored shadow screening the sight. Seen in liver channel depressed heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000622</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_视瞻有色</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The eye appearing normal externally, yet vision blurred with a subjective colored shadow screening the sight. Seen in liver channel depressed heat pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
