    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神失去正圆，边缘参差不齐，形如锯齿或花瓣。见于先天性、水轮风湿夹热证、阴虚火旺证、风轮阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pupil losing its round shape, with scalloped margins like saw-teeth or petals. Seen in congenital conditions, water-wheel wind-dampness with heat pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, and wind-wheel yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.97</tcm:reference>
