    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手指肿胀，屈伸不利。见于寒湿痹阻证、湿热痹阻证、血瘀证，或水气、蛇头疔、蛇眼疔、手指外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand finger swelling impaired flexion and extension. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:寒湿痹阻证/湿热痹阻证/水气/蛇头疔/蛇眼疔/手指外伤]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.75</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025131</tcm:hpoID>
  
