    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻孔两翼因呼吸急促而煽动。见于肺气将绝。又称鼻张、鼻扇、鼻掀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The two nasal alae flaring due to rapid breathing. Seen when lung qi is about to expire. Also known as nasal flaring (bizhang).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻张</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻扇</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻掀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0009928</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻翼煽动</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The two nasal alae flaring due to rapid breathing. Seen when lung qi is about to expire. Also known as nasal flaring (bizhang).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>鼻张</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>鼻扇</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>鼻掀</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
