    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">巩膜呈均匀黄染。见于肝胆湿热证，或黄疸、肝病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sclera presenting as all yellow. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; jaundice; liver disorder pattern. [未译片段:匀染]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.71</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
