    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">心中烦乱，或烦热郁闷。见于心阴虚证、心火炽盛证、血热扰神证、暑湿热郁证、阳明病等。又称烦躁、躁烦。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vexation and restlessness of the heart, or vexing heat with depression. Seen in heart yin deficiency pattern, heart fire blazing pattern, blood heat disturbing the spirit pattern, summerheat-dampness-heat depression pattern, and yangming disease. Also known as irritability and restlessness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>心烦不安</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>烦躁</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>躁烦</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000737</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_心烦</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Vexation and restlessness of the heart, or vexing heat with depression. Seen in heart yin deficiency pattern, heart fire blazing pattern, blood heat disturbing the spirit pattern, summerheat-dampness-heat depression pattern, and yangming disease. Also known as irritability and restlessness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>心烦不安</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>烦躁</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>躁烦</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0000737</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000737"/>
  
