    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙眼或齿根疼痛，通常遇冷热酸等食物时加重。见于风热犯齿证、外感风寒证、胃火燔龈证、虚火灼齿证、气虚齿动，或龋齿等牙根（牙髓）或牙龈疾病。又称牙齿痛、齿痛、牙疼。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the gum margin or tooth root, usually aggravated by cold, hot or sour foods. Seen in wind-heat invading the teeth pattern, externally-contracted wind-cold pattern, stomach-fire scorching the gums pattern, deficiency-fire scorching the teeth pattern, and qi deficiency with loose teeth, or diseases of the tooth root (pulp) or gums such as dental caries. Also known as tooth pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.25</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>牙疼</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>牙齿痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>齿痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_牙痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain of the gum margin or tooth root, usually aggravated by cold, hot or sour foods. Seen in wind-heat invading the teeth pattern, externally-contracted wind-cold pattern, stomach-fire scorching the gums pattern, deficiency-fire scorching the teeth pattern, and qi deficiency with loose teeth, or diseases of the tooth root (pulp) or gums such as dental caries. Also known as tooth pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>牙疼</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>牙齿痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>齿痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
