    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">饮食多于平常量，且易饥饿。见于胃火炽盛证、胃阴虚证、阳明蓄血证，或消渴病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eating more than usual and becoming hungry easily. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, stomach yin deficiency pattern, and yangming blood amassment pattern, or wasting-thirst (diabetes).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7E</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Stomach yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_多食易饥</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Eating more than usual and becoming hungry easily. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, stomach yin deficiency pattern, and yangming blood amassment pattern, or wasting-thirst (diabetes).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF7E</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
