    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Or forearm swelling accompanied by purple. [证候待译:前臂骨折/筋伤/脱臼] [未译片段:左右瘀]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.7</tcm:reference>
