    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛局限性青蓝，呈隆起状，高低不平，见于肺肝热毒证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">White of the eye bluish blue presenting as bulging -like uneven unevenness. Seen in lung disorder and liver heat-toxin pattern. [未译片段:局限性]</tcm:definition>
