    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">便次增多，便质稀薄，甚至便稀如水样。见于内伤饮食、感受外邪、脾气虚、脾阳虚、肝郁乘脾等。又称腹泻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool increase stool thin (watery) even watery stool -like. Seen in liver depression with overwhelming the spleen pattern. [证候待译:内伤饮食/感受外邪/脾气虚/脾阳虚] [又称:腹泻] [未译片段:次质]</tcm:definition>
