    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胎儿娩出后，瘀血和浊液从阴道流出，颜色红。见于血热证、血瘀证、阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red-colored discharge of stagnant blood and turbid fluid from the vagina after childbirth. Seen in blood heat pattern, blood stasis pattern, and yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.12</tcm:reference>
