    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">张口舒气，哈哈有声。于疲倦欲睡或乍醒时发作属正常。病态多见于肝郁气滞证、气滞血瘀证、脾肾阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Opening the mouth to exhale with audible yawns. Normal when tired or just awakened; pathological yawning is mostly seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, and spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.65</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
