    <tcm:icd11Term>Yawning</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SE91</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Qi stagnation pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呵欠声声</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Opening the mouth to exhale with audible yawns. Normal when tired or just awakened; pathological yawning is mostly seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, and spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MD11.D</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
