    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">泪液无制，经常溢出眼外。见于心脾湿热证、正虚邪恋证、风重于热证、气血两虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tears uncontrolled, frequently overflowing beyond the eye. Seen in heart-spleen dampness-heat pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, wind predominating over heat pattern, and qi-blood dual deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.66</tcm:reference>
