    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇上出现坚硬结节。见于脾胃热盛证，或唇疽、茧唇等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips appearance of hardness nodule. Seen in spleen and stomach heat with exuberance pattern; lip ju (lip abscess); callused lip. [未译片段:上]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.82</tcm:reference>
