    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛浅层水肿，透明发亮，伴眼脸水肿。见于脾肾阳虚证、水湿上泛证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Edema of the superficial layer of the white of the eye, transparent and shiny, accompanied by eyelid edema. Seen in spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern and water-dampness flooding upward pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.83</tcm:reference>
