    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肉芽有瘙痒感。若痒不甚，为愈合佳兆，痒甚，愈合缓慢则为湿毒证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Itching of the granulation tissue. Mild itching is a favorable sign of healing; severe itching with slow healing indicates dampness-toxin pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.54</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
