    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志失常，疯狂怒骂，或打人毁物，喧扰不宁，或少卧不饥。见于火热伤阴证、痰火扰神证，或癫病、狂病等。又称狂燥妄动、武痴、发疯等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mental derangement with mad cursing, beating people or smashing objects, clamor and restlessness, or reduced sleep and lack of hunger. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern and phlegm-fire disturbing the spirit pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and kuang (manic psychosis). Also known as manic agitation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>发疯</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>武痴</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>狂燥妄动</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000713</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>24199005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>agitation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_狂躁</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mental derangement with mad cursing, beating people or smashing objects, clamor and restlessness, or reduced sleep and lack of hunger. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern and phlegm-fire disturbing the spirit pattern, or dian (depressive psychosis) and kuang (manic psychosis). Also known as manic agitation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>发疯</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>武痴</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>狂燥妄动</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0000713</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000713"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:24199005</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/24199005"/>
  
