    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">结核（肿大的淋巴结）累累如串珠。见于肺肾阴虚证、外感风火时毒，或瘰疬等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nodules (enlarged lymph nodes) numerous like a string of beads. Seen in lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern and externally-contracted wind-fire seasonal toxin, or scrofula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.14</tcm:reference>
