    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指每界经前面部起红色丘疹（痤疮），经后即隐退。见于肺肾阴虚、肺经风热、肝肾阴虚、肾阴亏虚、阳明热盛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red papules (acne) appearing on the face before each menstrual period and subsiding after it. Seen in lung-kidney yin deficiency, lung channel wind-heat, liver-kidney yin deficiency, kidney yin deficiency, and yangming heat exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF82</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Lung and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
