    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳部包括耳廓和外耳道作痒。多见于风热犯耳证、心肝火热证、风湿热毒证，或耳疮、耳疖、旋耳疮、耳冻伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear region auricle and external ear canal itching profuse. Seen in heart and liver fire with heat pattern; wind-dampness with heat-toxin pattern; ear sore (otitis externa); ear furuncle; auricular eczema. [证候待译:风热犯耳证/耳冻伤] [未译片段:包括作]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.29</tcm:reference>
