    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠中或突然惊醒，或全身、局部肌肉抽动，或睡眠表浅，易受惊扰。见于胆郁痰扰证、肝经郁热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sleep or sudden or whole body local muscle twitching or light sleep. Seen in liver channel depressed heat pattern. [证候待译:胆郁痰扰证] [未译片段:中惊醒易受惊扰]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.11</tcm:reference>
