    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌边凹凸不齐，甚则似锯齿状者。见于脾虚证、水湿内盛证等。又称齿印舌。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue margin indented unevenly, even saw-tooth-like. Seen in spleen deficiency pattern and water-dampness internal exuberance pattern. Also known as tooth-printed tongue.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.66</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>齿印舌</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌有齿痕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The tongue margin indented unevenly, even saw-tooth-like. Seen in spleen deficiency pattern and water-dampness internal exuberance pattern. Also known as tooth-printed tongue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>齿印舌</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
