    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现紫红色斑块。见于气滞血瘀证、脾经湿热证、外感寒邪证，或寒疮、瓜藤缠、冻疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of purplish-red colored macule. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; spleen channel dampness-heat pattern; gualouchan (erythema nodosum); frostbite. [证候待译:外感寒邪证/寒疮] [未译片段:块]</tcm:definition>
