    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum transillumination presenting as negative. Seen in cold-dampness with obstruction pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with stasis obstruction pattern. [证候待译:血疝/筋疝]</tcm:definition>
