    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块推之不发生移动。见于痰浊凝滞证、寒凝血瘀证，或恶性肿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass not occurrence of movement. Seen in phlegm-turbidity with congelation pattern; cold congelation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:恶性肿瘤] [未译片段:推移]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.43</tcm:reference>
