    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块按之柔软，或有弹性，或软如绵。见于痰湿凝滞证、热蕴络瘀证、痰核留结证、饮邪内聚证，或良性肿瘤、气聚、脂瘤、气瘤、血瘤、肉瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass soft on palpation or with or soft like. Seen in phlegm-dampness with congelation pattern; sebaceous cyst; hemangioma; lipoma/sarcoma. [证候待译:热蕴络瘀证/痰核留结证/饮邪内聚证/良性肿瘤/气聚/气瘤] [未译片段:弹性绵]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
