    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肤色较正常人白或出现大小形状不一的白斑。见于血虚证、厥证、血脱证、脾肾阳虚证、血虚风燥证，或白驳风、石水、皮水、肾水、正水、血癌等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin whiter than normal, or white patches of various sizes and shapes. Seen in blood deficiency pattern, reversal pattern, blood collapse pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, and blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, or vitiligo (baibofeng), stone-water edema, skin-water edema, kidney-water edema, regular-water edema, and blood cancer (leukemia).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.87</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤发白</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin whiter than normal, or white patches of various sizes and shapes. Seen in blood deficiency pattern, reversal pattern, blood collapse pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, and blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, or vitiligo (baibofeng), stone-water edema, skin-water edema, kidney-water edema, regular-water edema, and blood cancer (leukemia).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
