    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">伸舌时舌体颤动不定，不能控制。见于气血虚衰证、热极生风证、肝阳化风证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue trembling uncontrollably when protruded. Seen in qi-blood deficiency-exhaustion pattern, extreme heat engendering wind pattern, and liver yang transforming into wind pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.54</tcm:reference>
