    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或两侧阴囊肿大。见于气滞血瘀证、阳虚水停证、湿热下注，或丝虫病、子痈、血疝、筋疝、水疝、阴囊水肿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Enlargement of one or both sides of the scrotum. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, yang deficiency with water retention pattern, and dampness-heat pouring downward, or filariasis, ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis), blood shan, sinew shan, water shan, and scrotal edema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.37</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033794</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊肿大</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Enlargement of one or both sides of the scrotum. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, yang deficiency with water retention pattern, and dampness-heat pouring downward, or filariasis, ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis), blood shan, sinew shan, water shan, and scrotal edema.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0033794</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
