    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊皮肤呈紫黑色。见于气血瘀滞证、湿热下注证，或脱囊、血疝、跌打损伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum skin presenting as purplish-black colored. Seen in qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene). [证候待译:血疝/跌打损伤]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊皮肤紫黑</oboInOwl:id>
