    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹因搔抓或摩擦后，破溃而渗出脂液形成的皮肤湿烂。见于脾虚湿困证、阴虚湿阻证、湿毒浸淫证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin wet erosion formed when a rash breaks and oozes sebum after scratching or friction. Seen in spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, yin deficiency with dampness obstruction pattern, and dampness-toxin spreading pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.93</tcm:reference>
