    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Umbilical region erosion. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; umbilical sores. [证候待译:肌肤热毒证/火热炽盛证/正虚邪恋证/脐痈]</tcm:definition>
