    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经行出现头目眩晕，视物昏花。见于心脾两虚、肝肾阴虚、脾虚夹湿证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">During menstruation appearance of head dizziness with blurred vision dim and blurred vision. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:心脾两虚/脾虚夹湿证] [未译片段:每逢晕]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.55</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行眩晕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>During menstruation appearance of head dizziness with blurred vision dim and blurred vision. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:心脾两虚/脾虚夹湿证] [未译片段:每逢晕]</obo:IAO_0000115>
