    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">进食后（饭后）感腹部胀闷不适，或伴腹鸣、食后腹泻。见于脾虚证、肝郁气滞证、胃肠气滞证、肝郁脾虚证，或伤食、食瘕、胃反、胃缓等。又称食后腹胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Taking food abdomen distension and stuffiness not or accompanied by abdominal rumbling food diarrhea. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; stomach and intestines qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:脾虚证/肝郁脾虚证/伤食/食瘕/胃反/胃缓] [又称:食后腹胀] [未译片段:后饭后感适后]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.52</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>食后腹胀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
