    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痛不很剧烈，尚可忍耐，但绵绵不休。见于虚证，如阳虚证、气虚证、血虚证。或阴寒内盛，气机不伸证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain not severe and still tolerable, but lingering and unceasing. Seen in deficiency patterns such as yang deficiency, qi deficiency and blood deficiency patterns, or yin-cold internal exuberance with qi movement failing to extend.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0012531</tcm:hpoID>
