    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上胞或下脸不能自控地怵惕瞤动。见于血虚生风证、心脾两虚证、肝阳化风证等。又称目瞤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The upper or lower eyelid twitching uncontrollably. Seen in blood deficiency engendering wind pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, and liver yang transforming into wind pattern. Also known as eye twitching (mushun).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.101</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>目响</tcm:synonym>
