    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脐下偏左或偏右处疼痛。见于寒滞肝脉证、肝气郁结证、肠道湿热证、太阳蓄血证、下焦湿热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the region below the umbilicus deviating to the left or right. Seen in cold stagnation in the liver vessels pattern, liver qi depression pattern, intestinal dampness-heat pattern, taiyang blood amassment pattern, and lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.45</tcm:reference>
