    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头面部发红、肿胀、疼痛难耐，伴憎寒壮热。多见于大头瘟。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head and face region turning red swelling pain accompanied by high fever profuse. Seen in big-head pestilence. [未译片段:难耐憎寒]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
  
