    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸部满闷，气不足以续息。见于痰饮中阻证、气滞血瘀证、心脾两虚证等。又称短气、少气。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Chest fullness and oppression with insufficient qi to continue breathing. Seen in phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, and heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern. Also known as shortness of breath.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>少气</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>短气</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033710</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002094</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>230145002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal breathing</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>267036007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal breathing</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
