    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Chest fullness and oppression with insufficient qi to continue breathing. Seen in phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, and heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern. Also known as shortness of breath.</obo:IAO_0000115>
