    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便中经常含有较多未消化食物。见于脾胃虚寒证、命门火衰证、食滞胃肠证、肝郁脾虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The stool frequently containing considerable undigested food. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency-cold pattern, mingmen fire decline pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, and liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.81</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
