    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻柱崩塌下陷。见于梅毒、麻风恶候等。又称鼻梁塌陷。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The nasal columella collapsed and sunken. Seen in syphilis and severe leprosy. Also known as collapsed nasal bridge.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.20</tcm:reference>
