    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">斑痕表面较高的隆起斑块。见于烧烫伤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Macule marks surface bulging macule. [证候待译:烧烫伤] [未译片段:较高块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.69</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>EE60.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Hypertrophic scar</tcm:icd11Term>
  
