    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">伸舌即回缩如蛇舐，或反复舐口唇周围，掉动不宁。见于热盛风动、脾肾虚热，或痫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue protruding and retracting like a snake's tongue, or repeatedly licking around the lips with restless movement. Seen in heat exuberance with wind stirring and spleen-kidney deficiency-heat, or epilepsy.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000157</tcm:hpoID>
