    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒的同时伴有振动、战栗。即表现为怕冷，且全身不自主地颤动的症状。见于邪正交争激烈，或外感风寒重证、疫疠表证、阳虚寒凝证、热毒内陷证、疟疾、疔疮走黄、疽毒内陷等病证。又称为恶寒战栗、寒栗、战寒、振寒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold accompanied by vibration and shivering—feeling cold with involuntary trembling of the whole body. Seen in intense struggle between pathogen and righteous qi, or externally-contracted severe wind-cold pattern, pestilential exterior pattern, yang deficiency with cold congelation pattern, heat-toxin sinking inward pattern, malaria, ding sores running yellow (septicemia), and ju-toxin sinking inward. Also known as shivering with aversion to cold and rigor.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>寒栗</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>恶寒战栗</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>战寒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>振寒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025143</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:icd11>MG21</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Chills</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_寒战</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to cold accompanied by vibration and shivering—feeling cold with involuntary trembling of the whole body. Seen in intense struggle between pathogen and righteous qi, or externally-contracted severe wind-cold pattern, pestilential exterior pattern, yang deficiency with cold congelation pattern, heat-toxin sinking inward pattern, malaria, ding sores running yellow (septicemia), and ju-toxin sinking inward. Also known as shivering with aversion to cold and rigor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>寒栗</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>恶寒战栗</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>战寒</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>振寒</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025143</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025143"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MG21</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
