    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脓液不能够顺利排出。见于正气不足，气血亏虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pus unable to discharge smoothly. Seen in insufficient righteous qi and qi-blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.17</tcm:reference>
