    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体瘦小枯薄。见于气血两虚证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue body small and thin thin. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [未译片段:枯]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
