    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便稀薄，如糊状。见于水饮内停证、脾胃气虚证、中气下陷证、肾阳虚证等。又称便溏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loose stool thin like -like. Seen in spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; middle qi sinking pattern. [证候待译:水饮内停证/肾阳虚证] [又称:便溏] [未译片段:糊]</tcm:definition>
