    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发生于膝下踝上部皮肤溃烂或破溃渗出。见于湿热下注证，或腿疽、鱼肚疽、疫疔走黄、肉瘤、消渴等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Occurrence of at knee below region skin ulceration and festering or broken. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; lipoma/sarcoma; wasting-thirst (diabetes mellitus). [证候待译:腿疽/鱼肚疽/疫疔走黄] [未译片段:踝上溃渗出]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.89</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_小腿溃疡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Occurrence of at knee below region skin ulceration and festering or broken. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; lipoma/sarcoma; wasting-thirst (diabetes mellitus). [证候待译:腿疽/鱼肚疽/疫疔走黄] [未译片段:踝上溃渗出]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
