    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤产生痒感而欲搔抓，但无原发皮肤损害。见于湿热证、风湿化热证、血虚风燥证、风寒化热证、风邪犯表证，或皮瘙痒症等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin itching with the desire to scratch, without primary skin lesions. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, wind-dampness transforming into heat pattern, blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, wind-cold transforming into heat pattern, and wind pathogen invading the exterior pattern, or pruritus cutaneous.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.89</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000988</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮疹瘙痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin itching with the desire to scratch, without primary skin lesions. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, wind-dampness transforming into heat pattern, blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, wind-cold transforming into heat pattern, and wind pathogen invading the exterior pattern, or pruritus cutaneous.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0000988</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
