    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">老年妇女月经已断绝1年以上，忽然又再行经。见于阴虚血热、瘀血阻滞证。又称经断复来、老年经断复行。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstruation recurring suddenly in an elderly woman after cessation for more than one year. Seen in yin deficiency with blood heat and blood stasis obstruction pattern. Also known as postmenopausal bleeding.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.61</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经断复来</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>老年经断复行</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033840</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>GA30.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Postmenopausal uterine bleeding</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经断复行</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstruation recurring suddenly in an elderly woman after cessation for more than one year. Seen in yin deficiency with blood heat and blood stasis obstruction pattern. Also known as postmenopausal bleeding.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>经断复来</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>老年经断复行</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
