    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">哭声高亢、洪亮，多见于小儿。见于新病、实证、热证，如心经积热证、风寒束表证、热扰心神证，或肠结等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loud and resonant crying, mostly in children. Seen in new disease, excess pattern and heat pattern, such as heart channel heat accumulation pattern, wind-cold fettering the exterior pattern, and heat disturbing the heart-spirit pattern, or intestinal binding.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_哭声响亮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loud and resonant crying, mostly in children. Seen in new disease, excess pattern and heat pattern, such as heart channel heat accumulation pattern, wind-cold fettering the exterior pattern, and heat disturbing the heart-spirit pattern, or intestinal binding.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
