    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">溃疡周围肌肤呈绷急紧张状。见于热疱、破伤风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ulcer surrounding skin and flesh presenting as tense -like. Seen in tetanus. [证候待译:热疱] [未译片段:绷急]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.103</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
