    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在冠状沟出现珍珠状，白色，黄色或红的半透明丘疹。见于肝郁血瘀证，或肾岩翻花、外阴臊疣、硬下疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pearly, white, yellow or red translucent papules appearing at the coronal sulcus. Seen in liver depression with blood stasis pattern, or kidney-rock flowering (penile cancer), genital warts (condyloma), and hard chancre.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_龟头丘疹</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pearly, white, yellow or red translucent papules appearing at the coronal sulcus. Seen in liver depression with blood stasis pattern, or kidney-rock flowering (penile cancer), genital warts (condyloma), and hard chancre.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
