    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睑缘睫毛生长稀疏。见于肉轮风热证、肉轮湿热证、肉轮热毒证、血虚风燥证，或睑弦赤烂等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelashes growing sparsely along the lid margin. Seen in flesh-wheel wind-heat pattern, flesh-wheel dampness-heat pattern, flesh-wheel heat-toxin pattern, and blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, or marginal blepharitis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.45</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA1RK2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Eyelashes</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睫毛稀疏</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
