    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡梦中说话，或词句完整，或吐字不清，意思不明。见于心火炽盛证、胆热证、胃气不和证。又称呓语。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Talking during sleep—with complete sentences or indistinct, meaningless words. Seen in heart fire blazing pattern, gallbladder heat pattern, and stomach-qi disharmony pattern. Also known as sleep talking (somniloquy).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.4</tcm:reference>
