    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉在筋肉之间，如屋漏残滴，良久一滴，脉搏极迟缓，溅起无力。见于气血营卫源绝。为无神脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pulse felt between the sinews and flesh like the residual drips of a leaking roof—one drop after a long interval, extremely slow and weak. Seen when the sources of qi, blood, ying and wei are exhausted; a spiritless pulse.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_屋漏脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The pulse felt between the sinews and flesh like the residual drips of a leaking roof—one drop after a long interval, extremely slow and weak. Seen when the sources of qi, blood, ying and wei are exhausted; a spiritless pulse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
