    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鳞屑容易脱落等。见于血虚风燥证、热盛风燥证，或干性鳞屑、剥脱性皮炎等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scales easily detached. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern and heat exuberance with wind-dryness pattern, or dry scaling and exfoliative dermatitis.</tcm:definition>
