    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口渴不欲饮，或欲饮，但饮入水即感不适，欲呕吐或呕逆吐出。见于水饮内停证、水停中焦证等。又称饮入欲呕、饮入即吐。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thirst without desire to drink, or desiring to drink but feeling discomfort once water is taken, with the urge to vomit or actual vomiting. Seen in water-rheum internal retention pattern and water retained in the middle jiao pattern. Also known as vomiting on drinking.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>饮入即吐</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>饮入欲呕</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_饮入呕逆</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Thirst without desire to drink, or desiring to drink but feeling discomfort once water is taken, with the urge to vomit or actual vomiting. Seen in water-rheum internal retention pattern and water retained in the middle jiao pattern. Also known as vomiting on drinking.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>饮入即吐</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>饮入欲呕</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#PhlegmEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
  </owl:Class>
