    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核脱出肛门外，不能自行回肛门内。见于气血两虚证，或息肉痔、内痔、翻花痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hemorrhoidal nodule prolapsing from anus inability anus inside. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; polyp hemorrhoid (rectal polyp); internal hemorrhoids. [证候待译:翻花痔] [未译片段:外自行回]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.35</tcm:reference>
