    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hemorrhoidal nodule prolapsing from anus inability anus inside. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; polyp hemorrhoid (rectal polyp); internal hemorrhoids. [证候待译:翻花痔] [未译片段:外自行回]</obo:IAO_0000115>
