    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">便血血色鲜红。见于肠风络伤证、血热动血证，或痔疮、肛裂、锁肛痔、肠癌。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bloody stool blood color bright red. Seen in blood heat with stirring blood pattern; hemorrhoids; anal fissure; anorectal cancer. [证候待译:肠风络伤证/肠癌]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.45</tcm:reference>
