    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉腰部寒冷，溶溶如坐水中，或如束冰袋，欲得温按。见于肾阳虚衰、寒湿阻络等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective coldness of the lower back, chilly as if sitting in water or wearing an ice bag, desiring warmth and pressure. Seen in kidney yang decline and cold-dampness obstructing the collaterals patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.2</tcm:reference>
