    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颊内、舌、唇、牙龈、腭等部出现白色、灰白色损害，呈现花纹斑块、斑点、丘疹样。见于风热夹湿证、脾胃积热证、肝郁化火证、瘀血留滞证、虚火灼口证、气血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cheek inside tongue lip gums region appearance of white colored grayish-white colored presenting as appearing macule spots papule -like. Seen in wind-heat with with with dampness pattern; spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; liver depression with transforming into fire pattern; qi and blood deficiency pattern. [证候待译:瘀血留滞证/虚火灼口证] [未译片段:腭等损害花纹块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.66</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032154</tcm:hpoID>
