    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中出气带有烂苹果气味。见于阴虚证、肺燥津亏证、胃热津伤证、肾阴虚证、阴阳两虚证，或消渴病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The breath carrying a rotten-apple odor. Seen in yin deficiency pattern, lung dryness with fluid insufficiency pattern, stomach heat with fluid damage pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, and yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, or wasting-thirst (diabetes, ketoacidosis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.2.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
