    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The breath carrying a rotten-apple odor. Seen in yin deficiency pattern, lung dryness with fluid insufficiency pattern, stomach heat with fluid damage pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, and yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, or wasting-thirst (diabetes, ketoacidosis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF93</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
