    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自感害怕而神志不宁，忐忑不安。见于心虚神怯证，或风厥、气厥、缩阴病、中恶、小儿客忤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Self-perceived fear with an unsettled spirit and apprehension. Seen in heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, or wind reversal, qi reversal, retracted-genitals disease, zhong'e, and infantile fright (kewu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:5200232</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恐惧</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Self-perceived fear with an unsettled spirit and apprehension. Seen in heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, or wind reversal, qi reversal, retracted-genitals disease, zhong'e, and infantile fright (kewu).</obo:IAO_0000115>
