    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">体表出现臖核（淋巴结）异常增大或成肿块。见于风热痰毒证、肝郁痰火证、湿热壅结证、气滞痰凝证、阴虚火旺证、痰毒凝结证、气血两虚证，或鼠疫等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Xinghe nodules (lymph nodes) abnormally enlarged or forming masses on the body surface. Seen in wind-heat with phlegm-toxin pattern, liver depression with phlegm-fire pattern, dampness-heat congestion pattern, qi stagnation with phlegm congealing pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern, phlegm-toxin congealing pattern, and qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or plague.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
