    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口干或渴，但喜热饮。见于脾胃虚寒证、痰湿内停证、肾阳亏虚证等。又称渴喜热饮。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dry mouth or fond of hot drinks. Seen in spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:痰湿内停证] [又称:渴喜热饮] [未译片段:渴但]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>渴喜热饮</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>自身免疫反应</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF97</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7M</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_渴喜饮热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
