    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉，或咽，或喉部位疼痛。见于外感风热证、风温证、阴虚证、气阴两虚证，或咽喉疾病，如咽瘅等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Throat or pharynx or throat (larynx) region pain. Seen in external contraction with wind-heat pattern; wind-warmth; yin deficiency pattern; qi-yin dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:咽喉疾病/如咽瘅] [未译片段:位]</tcm:definition>
