    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">饥饿时感觉疼痛明显或加重，或进食后可缓解。多见于胃脘疼痛，脾胃虚弱证、气虚证等虚证疼痛。又称饥饿痛甚、饥饿时疼痛明显。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hunger sensation pain obvious or aggravated or relieved after eating profuse. Seen in spleen and stomach weakness pattern. [证候待译:胃脘疼痛/气虚证等虚证疼痛] Also known as severe hunger pain. [又称:饥饿时疼痛明显] [未译片段:时]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>饥饿时疼痛明显</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>饥饿痛甚</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
  
