    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hunger sensation pain obvious or aggravated or relieved after eating profuse. Seen in spleen and stomach weakness pattern. [证候待译:胃脘疼痛/气虚证等虚证疼痛] Also known as severe hunger pain. [又称:饥饿时疼痛明显] [未译片段:时]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>饥饿时疼痛明显</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>饥饿痛甚</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
