    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小儿因多食甜食等原因而致牙齿组织被龋蚀，逐渐毁坏崩解，形成龋洞。见于龋齿病。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In children, tooth tissue eroded by caries due to excessive sweet intake, gradually decaying and disintegrating to form cavities. Seen in dental caries disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.89</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>DA08.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Dental caries</tcm:icd11Term>
  
