    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>In children, tooth tissue eroded by caries due to excessive sweet intake, gradually decaying and disintegrating to form cavities. Seen in dental caries disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
