    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">吞咽食物不下。见于肝郁气滞证、痰气阻膈证、热扰胸膈证、痰瘀阻膈证、津液亏虚证、脾胃虚寒证、急喉风、风热侵喉证、痰热搏结证、痰热动风证，或食癌、梅核气、食管瘅、食管瘅、膈疝、心痹、心衰、软脚瘟、脑瘤、肉痉、肌痿、痿痹、风痱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pharynx food mass failure to descend. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; fluids deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; acute throat wind (laryngeal obstruction); phlegm-heat with stirring wind pattern; plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis). [证候待译:痰气阻膈证/热扰胸膈证/痰瘀阻膈证/风热侵喉证/痰热搏结证/食癌] [未译片段:吞]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0004796</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>126765001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>gastrointestinal obstruction</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_吞食梗塞</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pharynx food mass failure to descend. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; fluids deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; acute throat wind (laryngeal obstruction); phlegm-heat with stirring wind pattern; plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis). [证候待译:痰气阻膈证/热扰胸膈证/痰瘀阻膈证/风热侵喉证/痰热搏结证/食癌] [未译片段:吞]</obo:IAO_0000115>
