    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈部瘤体青筋怒张明显。见于寒凝血瘀证，或骨瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck tumor body blue vessels (varicose veins) engorgement obvious. Seen in cold congelation with blood stasis pattern; osteoma.</tcm:definition>
