    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">人中短缩，唇外翻。见于脾阳已绝，主病危。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The philtrum shortened and the lips everted. Seen when spleen yang is exhausted, indicating critical disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
