    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经时断时续，或经期延长，量少，色淡或暗，或夹有血块。见于肝气郁结、气滞血瘀、气血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstruation or prolonged menstruation scanty amount pale or or with blood clots. Seen in liver qi depression and binding pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; qi and blood deficiency pattern. [未译片段:时断时续暗夹]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.25</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经血不畅</oboInOwl:id>
