    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstruation or prolonged menstruation scanty amount pale or or with blood clots. Seen in liver qi depression and binding pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; qi and blood deficiency pattern. [未译片段:时断时续暗夹]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
