    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口腔内肌膜破损，出现糜烂。见于风热夹湿证、毒火攻心证、脾胃积热证、肝郁化火证、瘀血留滞证、虚火灼口证、气血亏虚证，或口疮、狐蜮、口疳、经行口糜、口藓、创伤性溃疡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Oral cavity inside mucosa broken appearance of erosion. Seen in wind-heat with with with dampness pattern; spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; liver depression with transforming into fire pattern; qi and blood deficiency pattern; oral aphthae (mouth ulcers); mouth gan. [证候待译:毒火攻心证/瘀血留滞证/虚火灼口证/狐蜮/经行口糜/口藓] [未译片段:损]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.8</tcm:reference>
