    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">窦道时久，其外口周围颜色变深，发暗。见于邪陷正虚，或正虚邪恋。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The skin around the external opening of a long-standing sinus tract becoming darkened. Seen in pathogen sinking with righteous deficiency, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.110</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_窦道周围色素沉着</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The skin around the external opening of a long-standing sinus tract becoming darkened. Seen in pathogen sinking with righteous deficiency, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
