    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来急疾，快于数脉，一息脉来七、八次，相当于每分钟140次以上。见于阳亢证、亡阳证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pulse racing, faster than a rapid pulse—seven to eight beats per breath, equivalent to more than 140 beats per minute. Seen in yang hyperactivity pattern and yang collapse pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉疾</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The pulse racing, faster than a rapid pulse—seven to eight beats per breath, equivalent to more than 140 beats per minute. Seen in yang hyperactivity pattern and yang collapse pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
