    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔腻而厚，且其上有一层粘厚液如疮脓。多见于内痈。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A greasy thick coating covered by a layer of sticky thick fluid like sore pus. Mostly seen in internal abscess (neiyong).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.55</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
