    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便时干结便秘，时便稀腹泻，无规律。见于肝郁脾虚证、肝脾不调证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The stool irregularly alternating between dry constipation and loose diarrhea. Seen in liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern and liver-spleen disharmony pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.62</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
