    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤上出现色深红或青紫的点或大片，抚之不碍手，压之不褪色的斑点。或由损伤导致，或见于血瘀证、血分热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of colored deep red or bluish-purple dots or large not hand not blanching on pressure spots or leading to or. Seen in blood stasis pattern; blood aspect heat pattern. [未译片段:上片抚碍由损伤]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.65</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮下瘀斑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin appearance of colored deep red or bluish-purple dots or large not hand not blanching on pressure spots or leading to or. Seen in blood stasis pattern; blood aspect heat pattern. [未译片段:上片抚碍由损伤]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
