    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">髋部屈伸不利。见于湿热蕴结证、热毒炽盛证，或胯腰痛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Impaired flexion and extension of hip. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; toxic heat blazing pattern. [证候待译:胯腰痛]</tcm:definition>
