    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮痈肿势高突。见于热毒蕴结证、风热痰毒证，或软疖、发际疮、颈痈、臂痈、丫痈、膝痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sore abscess swelling raised protrusion. Seen in heat-toxin with accumulation and binding pattern. [证候待译:风热痰毒证/软疖/发际疮/颈痈/臂痈/丫痈] [未译片段:势]</tcm:definition>
