    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉喉咙部位作痒，或伴咳嗽、咽干、声音嘶哑、鼻干。见于燥邪犯咽证、风热表证、风寒表证，或感冒、喉核、急慢性喉痹、暴喑、久喑、肿瘤、咽角化证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Throat (larynx) region itching or accompanied by cough dry throat hoarseness nose. Seen in common cold. [证候待译:燥邪犯咽证/风热表证/风寒表证/喉核/急慢性喉痹/暴喑] [未译片段:自觉咙位作干]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>NA20.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Contusion of throat</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_喉痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Throat (larynx) region itching or accompanied by cough dry throat hoarseness nose. Seen in common cold. [证候待译:燥邪犯咽证/风热表证/风寒表证/喉核/急慢性喉痹/暴喑] [未译片段:自觉咙位作干]</obo:IAO_0000115>
