    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉络较平常明显变粗，分枝显现者，多见于热证、实证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The (infantile index-finger) venules are markedly thicker than usual with visible branching; mostly seen in heat patterns and excess patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.3.3</tcm:reference>
