    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志清楚，但说话语言艰涩，难以清楚表达。见于风痰阻络，或中风先兆、中风后遗症等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Clear consciousness with labored, hesitant speech and difficulty expressing oneself clearly. Seen in wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals, pre-stroke signs, or post-stroke sequelae.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_言语不利</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
