    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌敛束而无津，形如干荔肉，见于津枯热炽，主病危。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue is shriveled and devoid of moisture, resembling dried litchi flesh. Seen in fluid exhaustion with blazing heat; indicates a critical, life-threatening condition.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.9</tcm:reference>
