    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脓液似粉浆污水。见于气血两虚证，或伤筋蚀骨等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pus resembling starchy, turbid slop water. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or in sinew injury with bone erosion.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF62</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Dual deficiency of heart qi and blood pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
