    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现成片白斑，或大或小，境界清楚，平滑无屑。见于气血失和、气滞证、血虚证，或白癜风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Well-demarcated, smooth, scale-free white patches of varying size on the skin. Seen in disharmony of qi and blood, qi stagnation pattern, blood deficiency pattern, or vitiligo (baidianfeng).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.147</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤白斑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Well-demarcated, smooth, scale-free white patches of varying size on the skin. Seen in disharmony of qi and blood, qi stagnation pattern, blood deficiency pattern, or vitiligo (baidianfeng).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
