    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉头部发胀，或连及眼眶胀、耳胀，或觉头胀欲裂、如裂。见于肝火上炎证、湿阻气滞证、风热外袭证，或颅内肿瘤、春温、暑湿、厥头痛、出血中风、脑痨、脑瘤、颅脑痈、头部内伤、囊虫病、包虫病。又称脑胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective sensation of distension in the head, sometimes extending to the orbits and ears, or a feeling that the head is about to burst. Seen in liver fire flaming upward pattern, dampness obstruction with qi stagnation pattern, wind-heat exterior invasion pattern, or intracranial tumor, spring warmth (chunwen), summerheat-dampness, jue-headache, hemorrhagic stroke, brain consumption (naolao/tuberculous meningitis), brain tumor, cranial abscess, internal head injury, cysticercosis, or echinococcosis. Also known as brain distension.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>脑胀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002181</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>2032001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>brain edema</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective sensation of distension in the head, sometimes extending to the orbits and ears, or a feeling that the head is about to burst. Seen in liver fire flaming upward pattern, dampness obstruction with qi stagnation pattern, wind-heat exterior invasion pattern, or intracranial tumor, spring warmth (chunwen), summerheat-dampness, jue-headache, hemorrhagic stroke, brain consumption (naolao/tuberculous meningitis), brain tumor, cranial abscess, internal head injury, cysticercosis, or echinococcosis. Also known as brain distension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>脑胀</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0002181</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
