    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊红肿明显，皮肤呈鲜红色，表面光滑紧张。见于火毒炽盛证、湿热下注证，或阴囊丹毒、子痈、肾囊痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum red swelling obvious skin presenting as bright red colored smooth surface tense. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:火毒炽盛证/阴囊丹毒/肾囊痈]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊皮肤发红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Scrotum red swelling obvious skin presenting as bright red colored smooth surface tense. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:火毒炽盛证/阴囊丹毒/肾囊痈]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
