      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胎儿娩出后，胞宫内的瘀血和浊液虽下甚少，或下而忽然终止。见于肝郁气滞证、血瘀证、气血两虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid lochia in the uterus are discharged only scantily, or discharge stops abruptly. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, blood stasis pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶露不畅</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid lochia in the uterus are discharged only scantily, or discharge stops abruptly. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, blood stasis pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
