    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔剥脱处并不光滑，似有新生颗粒，伴舌淡，见于血虚证、气血两虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue tongue coating and rough surface with new-onset growing granules accompanied by tongue pale. Seen in blood deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [未译片段:剥脱处似]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.57</tcm:reference>
