    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳窍流脓清稀如水。见于脾肾阳虚证、湿热内蕴证、水湿侵耳证，或慢性脓耳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear pus discharge thin and clear like fluid. Seen in spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern. [证候待译:水湿侵耳证/慢性脓耳] [未译片段:窍]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7M</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳脓清稀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Ear pus discharge thin and clear like fluid. Seen in spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern. [证候待译:水湿侵耳证/慢性脓耳] [未译片段:窍]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF7M</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
