    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">内睑翻转于外睑之上，皮急吊于外，眼睑向外瞠开，甚者不能复位。见于风痰阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The inner eyelid turns outward over the outer lid; the lid skin is tense and everted, with the eye held wide open, in severe cases irreducible. Seen in wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.111</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮翻粘睑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
