    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">伴随月经周期出现的身体或肢节疼痛，经后消失。见于外感风湿、营血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the body or limb joints occurring with the menstrual cycle and resolving after menses. Seen in externally contracted wind-dampness, or nutrient-blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.60</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行身痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain in the body or limb joints occurring with the menstrual cycle and resolving after menses. Seen in externally contracted wind-dampness, or nutrient-blood deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
