    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛伴有冷感（全身或局部），喜温暖，得温则痛可减轻。见于阳虚证、实寒证、寒邪阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain accompanied by coldness whole body or local fond of warmth warmth pain alleviated. Seen in yang deficiency pattern; excess-cold pattern. [证候待译:寒邪阻络证] [未译片段:感暖得则可]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疼痛喜温</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain accompanied by coldness whole body or local fond of warmth warmth pain alleviated. Seen in yang deficiency pattern; excess-cold pattern. [证候待译:寒邪阻络证] [未译片段:感暖得则可]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
