    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃气上逆，咽喉间频频呃呃作声。见于痰气阻膈证、瘀血阻膈证、肝胃不和证，或胃郁、呃逆病。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stomach qi ascending counterflow, producing frequent hiccup sounds in the throat. Seen in phlegm-qi obstructing the diaphragm pattern, static blood obstructing the diaphragm pattern, liver-stomach disharmony pattern, or stomach depression (weiyu) and hiccup disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.41</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100247</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呃逆频作</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
