    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或两侧上臂、前臂部生痈肿，初起结块，迅速增大，大小形状不一。见于臂痈。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">An abscess developing on the upper arm or forearm of one or both sides, starting as a lump that rapidly enlarges, varying in size and shape. Seen in arm abscess (biyong).</tcm:definition>
