    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疹出皮色不变，搔之无明显感觉，表皮麻木。见于血虚证，或牛皮癣。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The eruption shows no change in skin color, scratching produces no obvious pain or itch, and the epidermis is numb. Seen in blood deficiency pattern, or psoriasis (niupixuan).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.90</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮疹搔之不知痛痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The eruption shows no change in skin color, scratching produces no obvious pain or itch, and the epidermis is numb. Seen in blood deficiency pattern, or psoriasis (niupixuan).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
