    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">时时悲伤欲哭，喜悲伤欲哭，无故悲伤、悲泣，不能自制。见于心肺气虚证、脏躁等。又称善悲。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent grieving with an urge to weep, or groundless sadness and weeping that the patient cannot control. Seen in heart-lung qi deficiency pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao). Also known as proneness to grief.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>善悲</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_善忧好哭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Frequent grieving with an urge to weep, or groundless sadness and weeping that the patient cannot control. Seen in heart-lung qi deficiency pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao). Also known as proneness to grief.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>善悲</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
