    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上颚有肿物如紫葡萄。见于上颚痈。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A purplish, grape-like swelling on the upper palate. Seen in upper-palate abscess.</tcm:definition>
