    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发生于颈项部位的体表皮肉之间的急性化脓性疾患。见于风热痰结证、气郁化火证、胃热壅盛证、气虚邪恋证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Occurrence of at neck and nape region body surface flesh acute suppuration. Seen in qi depression with transforming into fire pattern; stomach heat with congestion and exuberance pattern. [证候待译:风热痰结证/气虚邪恋证] [未译片段:位皮间性疾患]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
