    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">语调音低而沉闷。见于失音、风痱、经行失音、产后喑等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The voice is low-pitched and muffled. Seen in aphonia (shiyin), wind feebleness (fengfei), menstrual aphonia, or postpartum aphonia.</tcm:definition>
