    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志不清时出现胡言乱语，语无伦次，声高气粗。见于热炽阳明证、阳明腑实证、热毒攻心证、痢毒上攻证、热入营分证、热入血分证、湿热蒙蔽证、痰火上扰证、瘀血攻心证，或温热病、发热性疾病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Delirious, incoherent, rambling speech with a loud, forceful voice during impaired consciousness. Seen in blazing heat in yangming pattern, yangming bowel excess pattern, heat toxin attacking the heart pattern, dysentery toxin attacking upward pattern, heat entering the nutrient level pattern, heat entering the blood level pattern, dampness-heat clouding pattern, phlegm-fire harassing upward pattern, or static blood attacking the heart pattern; also seen in warm-heat diseases and febrile diseases.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0031258</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SQ00</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Delirium disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_谵语</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Delirious, incoherent, rambling speech with a loud, forceful voice during impaired consciousness. Seen in blazing heat in yangming pattern, yangming bowel excess pattern, heat toxin attacking the heart pattern, dysentery toxin attacking upward pattern, heat entering the nutrient level pattern, heat entering the blood level pattern, dampness-heat clouding pattern, phlegm-fire harassing upward pattern, or static blood attacking the heart pattern; also seen in warm-heat diseases and febrile diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0031258</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
