    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小儿发结如穗，枯萎不泽。见于脾胃气虚证、脾胃食积证、气血两虚证，或疳积等。又称发结如穗。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In children hair like withering not. Seen in spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach food accumulation pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan accumulation. [又称:发结如穗] [未译片段:结穗泽]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>发结如穗</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0031283</tcm:hpoID>
