    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">吞咽食物难下。见于肝郁气滞证、痰气阻膈证、热扰胸膈证、痰瘀阻膈证、津液亏虚证、脾胃虚寒证，或食道癌、梅核气、食管瘅、食管瘅、膈疝、心痹、心衰、软脚瘟、脑瘤、肉痉、肌痿、痿痹、风痱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Difficulty swallowing food. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi obstructing the diaphragm pattern, heat harassing the chest-diaphragm pattern, phlegm-stasis obstructing the diaphragm pattern, fluid depletion pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, or esophageal cancer, plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis), esophageal inflammation (shiguandan), diaphragmatic hernia, heart impediment, heart failure, soft-leg pestilence (poliomyelitis), brain tumor, flesh spasm, muscle atrophy, atrophy-impediment, or wind feebleness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
