    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">臖核结块如石头般坚硬。见于气郁痰凝证、痰湿瘀滞证、瘀血阻滞证，或石瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Xinghe nodule lumping like head hardness. Seen in phlegm-dampness with stagnation pattern; stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:气郁痰凝证/瘀血阻滞证] [未译片段:石般]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.44</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_臖核结块石硬</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Xinghe nodule lumping like head hardness. Seen in phlegm-dampness with stagnation pattern; stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:气郁痰凝证/瘀血阻滞证] [未译片段:石般]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
