    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中味觉减退，自觉口中淡，或饮食无滋味。见于脾胃气虚证、寒证等。又称口淡乏味、口淡无味。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mouth decreased taste mouth pale or food and drink without. Seen in spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; cold pattern. [又称:口淡乏味/口淡无味] [未译片段:自觉滋味]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口淡乏味</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>口淡无味</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000224</tcm:hpoID>
