    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>697990000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>decreased taste</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7C</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Stomach qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口淡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mouth decreased taste mouth pale or food and drink without. Seen in spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; cold pattern. [又称:口淡乏味/口淡无味] [未译片段:自觉滋味]</obo:IAO_0000115>
