    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">甲床缺损不全。见于外伤、先天不足、肝肾不足、肝血亏虚证，或手足癣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The nail bed is defective or incomplete. Seen in trauma, congenital insufficiency, liver-kidney insufficiency, liver blood deficiency pattern, or tinea manuum/pedis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_甲床残缺</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The nail bed is defective or incomplete. Seen in trauma, congenital insufficiency, liver-kidney insufficiency, liver blood deficiency pattern, or tinea manuum/pedis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
