    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anus prolapse mass presenting as bright red colored. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern. [证候待译:直肠黏膜脱垂性脱肛]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.3</tcm:reference>
