    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉下肢沉重，步行无力。见于脾虚湿困证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective heaviness of the lower limbs with weak, effortful walking. Seen in spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.66</tcm:reference>
