    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上、下眼睑粘闭，必得润而后可开。见于痰浊凝聚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The upper and lower eyelids are stuck shut and can only be opened after moistening. Seen in phlegm-turbidity congealing pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.73</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
