    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳部生疮，红肿作痛，溃烂流脓。见于风热侵袭证、肝胆湿热证、正虚邪恋证。又称耳疮、耳内生疮。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear region growing sore red swelling pain ulceration and festering pus discharge. Seen in wind-heat with invasion pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:正虚邪恋证] Also known as ear sore (otitis externa). [又称:耳内生疮] [未译片段:作]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>耳内生疮</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>耳疮</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Ear region growing sore red swelling pain ulceration and festering pus discharge. Seen in wind-heat with invasion pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:正虚邪恋证] Also known as ear sore (otitis externa). [又称:耳内生疮] [未译片段:作]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>耳内生疮</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>耳疮</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
