      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不能获得正常睡眠，或入睡难，或易醒，醒后不能再睡，甚则彻夜不眠。见于营血亏虚证、阴虚火旺证、心肾不交证、心脾两虚证、胆郁痰扰证、肝经郁热证、痰热扰心证、心火亢盛证、余热扰膈证，或癫病、狂病、神郁、神劳、百合病、绝经前后诸症、经行情志异常等。又称不寐，少寐、不眠。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Inability to obtain normal sleep: difficulty falling asleep, easy awakening with inability to return to sleep, or even sleeplessness all night. Seen in nutrient-blood deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, phlegm-heat harassing the heart pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, or residual heat harassing the diaphragm pattern; also seen in depressive psychosis (dian), manic psychosis (kuang), spirit depression, spirit taxation, lily disease (baihebing), perimenopausal syndrome, or menstrual emotional disorders. Also known as insomnia (bumei), scant sleep, or sleeplessness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>不寐，少寐</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>不眠</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
