    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_失眠</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Inability to obtain normal sleep: difficulty falling asleep, easy awakening with inability to return to sleep, or even sleeplessness all night. Seen in nutrient-blood deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, phlegm-heat harassing the heart pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, or residual heat harassing the diaphragm pattern; also seen in depressive psychosis (dian), manic psychosis (kuang), spirit depression, spirit taxation, lily disease (baihebing), perimenopausal syndrome, or menstrual emotional disorders. Also known as insomnia (bumei), scant sleep, or sleeplessness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
