    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">先恶寒，寒战振栗，既而发热，寒战随热度增加而减轻，常发作无定时。见于肺痈、肝痈、痈疡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold with shivering rigor followed by fever; the chills lessen as the fever rises, with episodes occurring at irregular times. Seen in lung abscess, liver abscess, or other abscess/ulcer diseases.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>寒战高热</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_振寒发热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to cold with shivering rigor followed by fever; the chills lessen as the fever rises, with episodes occurring at irregular times. Seen in lung abscess, liver abscess, or other abscess/ulcer diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>寒战高热</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
