    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腰脊正中或两侧肌肉筋骨疼痛。见于寒湿困滞证、风湿阻络证、风寒湿痹证、瘀血阻络证、肾虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the muscles, sinews and bones along or beside the lumbar spine. Seen in cold-dampness encumbering pattern, wind-dampness obstructing the collaterals pattern, wind-cold-dampness impediment pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, or kidney deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.40</tcm:reference>
