    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上腹部剑突下胀闷痞塞。见于脾虚气陷证、痰湿内阻证、水热互结证、寒饮停胃证、食滞胃肠证、胃气虚血瘀证，或胃饮、胃郁、胃缓、胃反、食瘕、伤食、肠郁、脾痿、臌胀、脾水等。又称心下痞、脘痞。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Distension, stuffiness and blockage in the epigastrium below the xiphoid. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern, phlegm-dampness internal obstruction pattern, water-heat binding pattern, cold rheum collecting in the stomach pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, stomach qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or stomach fluid-retention (weiyin), stomach depression, stomach slack (weihuan/gastroptosis), stomach reflux (weifan), food aggregation (shijia), food damage, intestinal depression (irritable bowel), spleen atrophy, drum distension, or spleen water edema. Also known as subcardiac stuffiness (xinxiapi) or epigastric stuffiness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.72</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>心下痞</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>痞满</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>脘痞，胃脘痞满不适</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>脘腹痞满</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_胃脘痞闷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Distension, stuffiness and blockage in the epigastrium below the xiphoid. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern, phlegm-dampness internal obstruction pattern, water-heat binding pattern, cold rheum collecting in the stomach pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, stomach qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or stomach fluid-retention (weiyin), stomach depression, stomach slack (weihuan/gastroptosis), stomach reflux (weifan), food aggregation (shijia), food damage, intestinal depression (irritable bowel), spleen atrophy, drum distension, or spleen water edema. Also known as subcardiac stuffiness (xinxiapi) or epigastric stuffiness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>心下痞</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>痞满</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>脘痞，胃脘痞满不适</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>脘腹痞满</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
