    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Below abdomen or or lower lateral abdomen hardness distension and fullness. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:癥瘕/腹部肿瘤] [未译片段:两侧左右]</tcm:definition>
