    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经中混有凝结血块。见于胞宫气虚证，或血热证、石瘕、胞宫癌等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood mixed with clots. Seen in uterine qi deficiency pattern, blood heat pattern, stone aggregation (shijia), or uterine cancer.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.3</tcm:reference>
