    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Spermatic cord presenting as -like swelling hard. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:急性子痈] [未译片段:触条索]</tcm:definition>
