    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现一时性局限性团块隆起，呈淡红或鲜红色，常突然发生，迅速消退。见于风热袭表证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Transient, localized raised wheals on the skin, pale red to bright red, appearing suddenly and subsiding rapidly. Seen in wind-heat attacking the exterior pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002297</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_风团色红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
