    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">中心视力（远视力，近视力）下降。见于肝风痰火证、表寒里热证、风热挟湿证、肝郁气滞证、水轮实火证、水轮湿热证、水轮气血瘀滞证、风痰上扰证、风阳上扰证、水轮虚火证、水轮阳虚络痹证、水轮气虚络痹证、肝肾亏虚证、血瘀夹风证，或厥头痛、内障、青盲、暴盲、视瞻昏渺、黑夜睛明、云雾移睛、高风内障、远视、近视、聚星、凝脂翳、疳积上目、圆翳内障、胎患内障、黄心内障、五风内障、混睛障、风牵偏视、小儿通睛、撞击伤目、物损真睛、眯目飞扬、惊振内障、缺血中风、囊虫病、雷头风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Decreased central visual acuity (distance and/or near vision). Seen in liver wind with phlegm-fire pattern, exterior cold with interior heat pattern, wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, water-wheel (pupil) excess fire pattern, water-wheel dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel qi-blood stasis pattern, wind-phlegm harassing upward pattern, wind-yang harassing upward pattern, water-wheel deficiency fire pattern, water-wheel yang deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, blood stasis complicated by wind pattern, or jue-headache, internal oculopathy (neizhang), blue blindness (qingmang/optic atrophy), sudden blindness, dim and hazy vision, night-blind clarity, cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity), high-wind internal oculopathy (retinitis pigmentosa), hyperopia, myopia, clustered-star (keratitis), congealed-fat nebula (suppurative keratitis), gan-malnutrition affecting the eye, round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract), congenital fetal oculopathy, yellow-heart internal oculopathy, five-wind internal oculopathy (glaucoma), mixed-eye opacity (corneal stromal opacity), wind-tugging deviation (paralytic strabismus), infantile crossed eye, contusion injury of the eye, foreign-body damage to the true pupil, dust in the eye, fright-vibration internal oculopathy (traumatic cataract), ischemic stroke, cysticercosis, or thunder-head wind.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0007663</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>13164000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>decreased central vision</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_视力下降</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Decreased central visual acuity (distance and/or near vision). Seen in liver wind with phlegm-fire pattern, exterior cold with interior heat pattern, wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, water-wheel (pupil) excess fire pattern, water-wheel dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel qi-blood stasis pattern, wind-phlegm harassing upward pattern, wind-yang harassing upward pattern, water-wheel deficiency fire pattern, water-wheel yang deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, blood stasis complicated by wind pattern, or jue-headache, internal oculopathy (neizhang), blue blindness (qingmang/optic atrophy), sudden blindness, dim and hazy vision, night-blind clarity, cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity), high-wind internal oculopathy (retinitis pigmentosa), hyperopia, myopia, clustered-star (keratitis), congealed-fat nebula (suppurative keratitis), gan-malnutrition affecting the eye, round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract), congenital fetal oculopathy, yellow-heart internal oculopathy, five-wind internal oculopathy (glaucoma), mixed-eye opacity (corneal stromal opacity), wind-tugging deviation (paralytic strabismus), infantile crossed eye, contusion injury of the eye, foreign-body damage to the true pupil, dust in the eye, fright-vibration internal oculopathy (traumatic cataract), ischemic stroke, cysticercosis, or thunder-head wind.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0007663</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0007663"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:13164000</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/13164000"/>
  
