    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">频频矢气，声响而无臭。多见于气滞肠胃。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent passage of flatus that is loud but odorless; mostly seen in qi stagnation in the stomach and intestines.</tcm:definition>
