    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">坏死的皮肉逐渐脱落。见于烂疔、有头疽等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gradual sloughing of necrotic skin and flesh. Seen in festering nail-like boil (landign) or headed carbuncle (youtouju).</tcm:definition>
