    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两眼不能正常辨认物体颜色。见于水轮阴亏证、肝气郁滞证、水轮亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Both eyes cannot correctly distinguish the colors of objects (dyschromatopsia). Seen in water-wheel (pupil) yin depletion pattern, liver qi stagnation pattern, or water-wheel deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
