    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便水分减少，燥结难解。见于肠热腑实证、阴虚肠燥证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The stools have reduced water content and are dry, hard and difficult to pass. Seen in intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, or yin deficiency with intestinal dryness pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.66</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>大便干结</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
