    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌上生紫疱，形似豆而坚硬，伴寒热疼痛。见于心脾火毒上攻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A purple, bean-shaped, hard blister-like boil on the tongue, accompanied by chills, fever and pain. Seen in heart-spleen fire toxin attacking upward.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
