      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽部干燥或干涩，甚或吞咽不适。见于风热袭肺证、脾胃热盛证、肝胆郁热证、阴虚咽喉失濡证、气虚咽喉失充证、热盛伤津证，或干燥病、急性咽喉病、急性外感病、高热病、慢喉痹、慢乳蛾、久喑等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dryness or parched sensation in the throat, sometimes with discomfort on swallowing. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern, spleen-stomach exuberant heat pattern, liver-gallbladder depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened throat pattern, qi deficiency with underfilled throat pattern, exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or dryness disease, acute throat disease, acute exogenous disease, high-fever disease, chronic throat impediment (houbi), chronic nippled moth (tonsillitis), or chronic aphonia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000600</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>162084009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Dry throat</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD36.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Pharyngitis</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽干</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dryness or parched sensation in the throat, sometimes with discomfort on swallowing. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern, spleen-stomach exuberant heat pattern, liver-gallbladder depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened throat pattern, qi deficiency with underfilled throat pattern, exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or dryness disease, acute throat disease, acute exogenous disease, high-fever disease, chronic throat impediment (houbi), chronic nippled moth (tonsillitis), or chronic aphonia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
