    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤表面出现大小不一，深浅不一的裂隙。见于血虚风燥证、血热风燥证、湿毒浸淫等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin surface appearance of of varying sizes not. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; blood heat with wind-dryness pattern. [证候待译:湿毒浸淫] [未译片段:深浅一裂隙]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.111</tcm:reference>
