    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡表面色泽淡红或红赤。见于火毒炽盛证、血分热证、湿热蕴结证、热毒侵袭肌肤证、热毒蕴结肌肤证，或委中毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores and ulcers surface colored light red or red. Seen in blood aspect heat pattern; dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; weizhong toxin (popliteal abscess). [证候待译:火毒炽盛证/热毒侵袭肌肤证/热毒蕴结肌肤证] [未译片段:泽]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.118</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
