    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发生于颈项部位的面积较大的急性化脓性感染。见于风热痰结证、气郁化火证、胃热壅盛证、气虚邪恋证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Occurrence of at neck and nape region face large acute suppuration infection. Seen in qi depression with transforming into fire pattern; stomach heat with congestion and exuberance pattern. [证候待译:风热痰结证/气虚邪恋证] [未译片段:位积较性]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Occurrence of at neck and nape region face large acute suppuration infection. Seen in qi depression with transforming into fire pattern; stomach heat with congestion and exuberance pattern. [证候待译:风热痰结证/气虚邪恋证] [未译片段:位积较性]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
