    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胞脸内睑板生黄、白色细小颗粒，质地坚硬如石，状如碎米。多见于上睑。见于痰浊凝聚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Small hard yellow-white granules like broken rice on the palpebral conjunctiva of the eyelid (conjunctival concretions), mostly in the upper lid. Seen in phlegm-turbidity congealing pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0009903</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>428477002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>conjunctival nodule</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睑内结石</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Small hard yellow-white granules like broken rice on the palpebral conjunctiva of the eyelid (conjunctival concretions), mostly in the upper lid. Seen in phlegm-turbidity congealing pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
