    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身及四肢胀满，或伴沉重，或伴水肿。见于水饮内停证、湿阻证等，或感冒、痹证、心衰、水气病、硬皮病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body and limbs distension and fullness or accompanied by heaviness or accompanied by edema. Seen in dampness with obstruction pattern; common cold; scleroderma. [证候待译:水饮内停证/痹证/心衰/水气病] [未译片段:自觉]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
