    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">遇风则目珠作痒，避风则缓，多伴流泪。见于外感风热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Itching of the eyes on exposure to wind, relieved when sheltered, often accompanied by tearing. Seen in externally contracted wind-heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
