    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃内容物经食管反流达口咽部，口腔感觉到酸性物质；如果十二指肠内容物经胃、食管反流达口咽部，口腔感觉到出现苦味物质，称为十二指肠胃食管反流。多由于贲门功能不全和胃功能障碍逆蠕动致酸性胃液反流至口腔。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gastric contents reflux through the esophagus to the pharynx, producing a sour taste in the mouth; when duodenal contents reflux through the stomach and esophagus producing a bitter taste, it is called duodenogastroesophageal reflux. Mostly caused by cardia insufficiency and disordered gastric motility with reverse peristalsis driving acidic gastric fluid into the mouth.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:synonym>泛酸</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>烧心</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0031453</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>16331000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Heartburn</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>DA22</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Gastro-oesophageal reflux disease</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_反酸</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Gastric contents reflux through the esophagus to the pharynx, producing a sour taste in the mouth; when duodenal contents reflux through the stomach and esophagus producing a bitter taste, it is called duodenogastroesophageal reflux. Mostly caused by cardia insufficiency and disordered gastric motility with reverse peristalsis driving acidic gastric fluid into the mouth.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>泛酸</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>烧心</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0031453</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0031453"/>
