    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后面部出现色斑，多无其他伴随症。见于胃热证、阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Facial pigmented patches appearing during pregnancy, usually without other accompanying symptoms. Seen in stomach heat pattern or yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_妊娠面部色斑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
