    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">结核小如豆状等。见于风火热毒证，或内脏肿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tuberculosis small like -like. Seen in wind with fire with heat-toxin pattern. [证候待译:内脏肿瘤] [未译片段:豆等]</tcm:definition>
