    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怕冷，取暖不得解。即病人时时觉冷，虽加衣履被，或近火取暖犹不能解其寒的症状。见于外感风寒表实证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold not relieved by warming: the patient constantly feels cold even with added clothing and bedding or sitting near a fire. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold exterior excess pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025143</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>274640006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Chills</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MG26</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Fever of other or unknown origin</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶寒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to cold not relieved by warming: the patient constantly feels cold even with added clothing and bedding or sitting near a fire. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold exterior excess pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025143</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025143"/>
