    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">风团发作来势凶猛，层叠堆积聚集成片状。见于瘾疹、药毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Wheals erupting violently, piling and aggregating layer upon layer into sheets. Seen in hidden rash (yinzhen/urticaria) or drug toxin (drug eruption).</tcm:definition>
