    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡表面色泽晦暗。见于阳虚证、气滞血瘀证、正虚邪恋证、气血两虚证等等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores and ulcers surface colored dull and dark. Seen in yang deficiency pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:正虚邪恋证] [未译片段:泽]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.116</tcm:reference>
