    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thickened toenails. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern. [证候待译:灰趾甲/厚甲症]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.63</tcm:reference>
