    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咳嗽时声音沉重，多伴痰液咳出。见于风寒束肺证、痰湿蕴肺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A heavy, turbid-sounding cough, often accompanied by expectoration of phlegm. Seen in wind-cold binding the lung pattern, or phlegm-dampness accumulating in the lung pattern.</tcm:definition>
