    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口角向一侧歪斜。见于肝风挟痰证、痰瘀阻滞经络等。又称口涡。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Deviation of the mouth corner to one side. Seen in liver wind complicated by phlegm pattern, or phlegm-stasis obstructing the channels and collaterals. Also known as wry mouth (kouwo).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.12</tcm:reference>
