    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹疱腔内液体干枯而致皮疹表面塌陷，干瘪。见于脾虚湿泛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rash inside dry and withered rash surface collapse/hollowing shriveling. [证候待译:脾虚湿泛证] [未译片段:疱腔液体致]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.76</tcm:reference>
