    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉耳内或耳廓疼痛，其病变部位可在耳廓，外耳道和鼓膜。见于火热结聚证、风湿热毒证、风热炽盛证、肝胆湿热证、肝胆火盛证，或耳疮、耳疖、耳后疽、急耳痹、慢耳痹、脓耳、耳根毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective pain inside the ear or in the auricle; the lesion may be located in the auricle, external auditory canal or tympanic membrane. Seen in fire-heat gathering pattern, wind-dampness heat toxin pattern, wind-heat blazing pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, liver-gallbladder fire exuberance pattern, or ear sore, ear furuncle, retroauricular carbuncle, acute ear impediment, chronic ear impediment, suppurative ear (nong'er), or ear-root toxin.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030766</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>10608006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Ear pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MC92.Y</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Otalgia</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective pain inside the ear or in the auricle; the lesion may be located in the auricle, external auditory canal or tympanic membrane. Seen in fire-heat gathering pattern, wind-dampness heat toxin pattern, wind-heat blazing pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, liver-gallbladder fire exuberance pattern, or ear sore, ear furuncle, retroauricular carbuncle, acute ear impediment, chronic ear impediment, suppurative ear (nong'er), or ear-root toxin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
