    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">心悸因惊恐、恼怒而发，或伴易惊、惊惕。见于心气虚证、心阳虚证、心阴虚证、心血虚证、痰热扰心证、水气凌心证、心脾气血两虚证、阴虚火旺证、心虚神怯证、瘀阻心脉证，或心痹、心瘅、胸痹、肺心病、心衰、风眩、厥心痛、高原胸痹、心郁、支饮、梅毒攻心、脚气冲心、神劳、神郁、中恶、风厥、瘿劳、黑疸、虚劳类疾病、饥厥、血脱、液脱、蚕豆黄等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Palpitation triggered by fright or anger, sometimes accompanied by easy startling and apprehension. Seen in heart qi deficiency pattern, heart yang deficiency pattern, heart yin deficiency pattern, heart blood deficiency pattern, phlegm-heat harassing the heart pattern, water qi intimidating the heart pattern, heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, stasis obstructing the heart vessels pattern, or heart impediment, heart heat (xindan), chest impediment, pulmonary heart disease, heart failure, wind dizziness, jue heart pain, high-altitude chest impediment, heart depression, propping rheum, syphilis attacking the heart, beriberi rushing to the heart, spirit taxation, spirit depression, malignity attack, wind syncope, goiter taxation, black jaundice, deficiency-taxation diseases, hunger syncope, blood collapse, fluid collapse, or favism.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.57</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001962</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>80313002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>heart palpitations</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MC81.2</tcm:icd11>
