    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经量较正常增多，而周期基本正常。见于肝肾阴虚证、肝火偏亢证、冲任虚寒证、湿热下注证、瘀血阻滞证、瘀阻胞宫证、胞宫气虚证、胞宫积热证，或石瘕、胎漏、紫癜病、血溢病等。又称经血过多。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual flow heavier than normal with an essentially normal cycle. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, liver fire excess pattern, chong-ren deficiency cold pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine accumulated heat pattern, or stone aggregation, threatened miscarriage (tailou), purpura disease, or blood flooding disease. Also known as profuse menstrual bleeding.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经血过多</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000132</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>237053008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Menorrhagia</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>GA20.50</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Heavy menstrual bleeding</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经量多</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstrual flow heavier than normal with an essentially normal cycle. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, liver fire excess pattern, chong-ren deficiency cold pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, stasis obstructing the uterus pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine accumulated heat pattern, or stone aggregation, threatened miscarriage (tailou), purpura disease, or blood flooding disease. Also known as profuse menstrual bleeding.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>经血过多</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0000132</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
