    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛部分突起，呈螺旋尾状。见于肝经积热证、气滞血瘀证、风轮湿热证、风轮热毒证等。又称翳如旋螺。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Part of the black of the eye (cornea) bulges forward in a spiral-tail shape. Seen in liver channel accumulated heat pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) dampness-heat pattern, or wind-wheel heat toxin pattern. Also known as spiral nebula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.90</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>翳如旋螺</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_旋螺尖起</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Part of the black of the eye (cornea) bulges forward in a spiral-tail shape. Seen in liver channel accumulated heat pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) dampness-heat pattern, or wind-wheel heat toxin pattern. Also known as spiral nebula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>翳如旋螺</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
