    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咳嗽时久而致声音嘶哑，咳出不爽。见于风寒犯肺证，或久咳、喉喑、喉痨、喉癌等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cough chronic hoarseness cough not. Seen in wind-cold invading the lung pattern; throat yin (laryngitis/hoarseness); laryngeal cancer. [证候待译:久咳/喉痨] [未译片段:时致出爽]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.58</tcm:reference>
