      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门皮肤出现溃疡。见于血热肠燥证、阴虚肠燥证、气血瘀滞证、湿热下注证、血虚风燥证，或肛门湿疹、肛裂等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anus skin appearance of ulcer. Seen in blood heat and intestines dryness pattern; yin deficiency and intestines dryness pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; anal fissure. [证候待译:肛门湿疹]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0200042</tcm:hpoID>
