    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Skin ulcer</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>ME63</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Skin ulcer</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肛门皮肤溃疡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Anus skin appearance of ulcer. Seen in blood heat and intestines dryness pattern; yin deficiency and intestines dryness pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; anal fissure. [证候待译:肛门湿疹]</obo:IAO_0000115>
