    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者频频欲大便。见于肠道寒湿证、肝郁脾虚证、痰瘀互结证、脾虚湿热证、肝郁气滞证、肠道瘀滞证、肠道湿热证，或奇恒痢、大瘕泄、肠郁、肠瘤、肠癌、痢疾等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent urge to defecate. Seen in intestinal cold-dampness pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-stasis intermingling pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, intestinal dampness-heat pattern, or persistent strange dysentery (qihengli), great aggregation diarrhea (dajiashui), intestinal depression, intestinal tumor, intestinal cancer, or dysentery.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032765</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032781</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032774</tcm:hpoID>
  
