    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Frequent urge to defecate. Seen in intestinal cold-dampness pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-stasis intermingling pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, intestinal dampness-heat pattern, or persistent strange dysentery (qihengli), great aggregation diarrhea (dajiashui), intestinal depression, intestinal tumor, intestinal cancer, or dysentery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
