      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N2e511564bf584f7a8de9291cf06f5ff4">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">进食后（饭后）感胸脘部满闷不适，或伴嗳气。见于脾胃气滞证、脾胃湿热证、脾气虚证、痰湿中阻证等，或胃缓等。又称食后脘胀，食后胃胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fullness and stuffiness of the chest and epigastrium after eating, sometimes with belching. Seen in spleen-stomach qi stagnation pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-dampness obstructing the middle pattern, or stomach slack (gastroptosis). Also known as postprandial epigastric distension.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>食后院胀，食后胃胀，食后胃脘胀满</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_食入胸脘满闷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fullness and stuffiness of the chest and epigastrium after eating, sometimes with belching. Seen in spleen-stomach qi stagnation pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-dampness obstructing the middle pattern, or stomach slack (gastroptosis). Also known as postprandial epigastric distension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>食后院胀，食后胃胀，食后胃脘胀满</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#DampnessEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
