    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胎儿娩出后，瘀血和浊液从阴道流出，质地清稀。见于气虚证、阴虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid fluid discharged from the vagina is thin and watery. Seen in qi deficiency pattern or yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.14</tcm:reference>
