    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">身体发热，热势壮盛，扪之灼手，或伴恶热烦渴，属高热，热势高，稽留热，体温持续于39℃以上。见于时疫瘟病、阳明病里实热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vigorous high fever with a burning body surface, sometimes accompanied by heat aversion, vexation and thirst; classified as high fever of the continued type, with body temperature persistently above 39°C. Seen in seasonal epidemic pestilence, or yangming interior excess heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002047</tcm:hpoID>
