    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻孔前附近皮肤红肿、糜烂、结痂、灼痒，经久不愈、反复发作。见于肺热上蒸证、阴虚血燥证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Redness, erosion, crusting and burning-itch of the skin in front of the nostrils, chronic and recurrent. Seen in lung heat steaming upward pattern, or yin deficiency with blood dryness pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Redness, erosion, crusting and burning-itch of the skin in front of the nostrils, chronic and recurrent. Seen in lung heat steaming upward pattern, or yin deficiency with blood dryness pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
