    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志混乱，亢奋妄动，躁扰不宁，或打骂呼叫。见于火热伤阴证、痰火扰神证，或癫狂病、狂病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mental confusion with agitation, reckless hyperactivity and restlessness, or shouting, cursing and calling out. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the spirit pattern, or dian-kuang psychosis and manic psychosis (kuang).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.17</tcm:reference>
