    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便排出困难，严重者点滴难出。见于下焦湿热证、肺热气壅证、脾气虚证、肾气虚证、肝气郁结证等。又称小便不通、小便点滴而出、癃闭。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Difficulty passing urine, in severe cases not even a drop can be voided. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, lung heat with qi congestion pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, or liver qi depression pattern. Also known as failure to pass urine, dribbling urination, or retention and blockage (longbi).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>小便不通</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>小便点滴而出</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>瘾闭</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000016</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>130951007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>increased post void residual urine volume</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>267064002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>increased post void residual urine volume</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>449491000124</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>increased post void residual urine volume</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
