    <obo:IAO_0000115>Difficulty passing urine, in severe cases not even a drop can be voided. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, lung heat with qi congestion pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, or liver qi depression pattern. Also known as failure to pass urine, dribbling urination, or retention and blockage (longbi).</obo:IAO_0000115>
