      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">困倦，不分昼夜，时时欲睡，或呼之能醒，醒后又睡。见于痰湿内盛证、阳虚阴盛证、心肾阳虚证、心脾两虚证、肾阳虚衰证、肾精亏虚证、瘀血阻窍证，或肥胖病、痴呆、中毒、头部内伤、虚劳病、脏厥等。又称多寐、多眠、多睡眠、嗜卧、欲寐。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Drowsiness irrespective of day or night, with a constant desire to sleep; the patient can be roused but falls asleep again. Seen in phlegm-dampness exuberance pattern, yang deficiency with yin exuberance pattern, heart-kidney yang deficiency pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, kidney yang debilitation pattern, kidney essence deficiency pattern, static blood obstructing the orifices pattern, or obesity, dementia, poisoning, internal head injury, deficiency-taxation disease, or visceral syncope (zangjue). Also known as excessive sleep, somnolence, or desire to sleep.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>嗜卧</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>多寐</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>多眠</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>多睡眠</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>欲寐</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>214264003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>dullness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271782001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal drowsiness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>79519003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal drowsiness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SF97</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
