    <obo:IAO_0000115>Drowsiness irrespective of day or night, with a constant desire to sleep; the patient can be roused but falls asleep again. Seen in phlegm-dampness exuberance pattern, yang deficiency with yin exuberance pattern, heart-kidney yang deficiency pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, kidney yang debilitation pattern, kidney essence deficiency pattern, static blood obstructing the orifices pattern, or obesity, dementia, poisoning, internal head injury, deficiency-taxation disease, or visceral syncope (zangjue). Also known as excessive sleep, somnolence, or desire to sleep.</obo:IAO_0000115>
