    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中出气臭秽，自觉或为他人所闻。见于胃热熏口证、肝热熏口证、肺热熏口证、脾胃湿热证、虚火灼口证，或口腔不洁、口腔病变（口糜、牙咬痈、牙疳、走马牙疳等），或鼻渊、鼻鼽、肺痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Foul-smelling breath noticed by the patient or by others. Seen in stomach heat fuming the mouth pattern, liver heat fuming the mouth pattern, lung heat fuming the mouth pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern, or poor oral hygiene, oral lesions (mouth erosion, dental abscess, gum ulceration, fulminant gum ulceration), or deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), allergic rhinitis (biqiu), or lung abscess.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100812</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>33893004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Halitosis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD95</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Halitosis</tcm:icd11Term>
  
