    <obo:IAO_0000115>Foul-smelling breath noticed by the patient or by others. Seen in stomach heat fuming the mouth pattern, liver heat fuming the mouth pattern, lung heat fuming the mouth pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern, or poor oral hygiene, oral lesions (mouth erosion, dental abscess, gum ulceration, fulminant gum ulceration), or deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), allergic rhinitis (biqiu), or lung abscess.</obo:IAO_0000115>
