    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上、下肢浮肿发胀，有时表现四肢同时肿胀，有的仅见上肢或下肢，或偏于一侧。见于湿热蕴结、气滞肌表证、寒湿凝滞证、气虚血瘀证，或水肿、外伤、痹病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Puffy lower limbs distending with appearing limbs swelling with seen upper limb or lower limb or at. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; cold-dampness with congelation pattern; qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern; edema; external injury pattern; bi (impediment) disease. [证候待译:气滞肌表证] [未译片段:上时表同时仅偏一侧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.80</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_四肢肿胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Puffy lower limbs distending with appearing limbs swelling with seen upper limb or lower limb or at. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; cold-dampness with congelation pattern; qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern; edema; external injury pattern; bi (impediment) disease. [证候待译:气滞肌表证] [未译片段:上时表同时仅偏一侧]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
