    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呕吐，吐出物为酸水，或吐出物中兼有酸水。见于胃热证、脾胃虚寒证、肝郁化火证，或胃疡、伤食脾痿、胃反等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting of sour fluid, or vomitus mixed with sour fluid. Seen in stomach heat pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, or stomach ulcer (weiyang), food damage, spleen atrophy, or stomach reflux.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.37</tcm:reference>
