    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">卧床后无睡意，或辗转反侧，或思虑无穷，或心烦抑郁，久久不能入睡，或入睡时间较长。见证同失眠。又称不易入睡、无睡意、不能眠。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">No sleepiness after going to bed, tossing and turning, endless ruminating thoughts, or vexation and depression, taking a long time to fall asleep. The associated patterns are the same as for insomnia (see that entry). Also known as difficulty falling asleep or absence of sleepiness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>不易入睡</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>不能眠</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>入睡困难</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>无睡意</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>难入睡</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>193462001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>difficulty staying or falling asleep</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>53888004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>difficulty sleeping</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_入睡难</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>No sleepiness after going to bed, tossing and turning, endless ruminating thoughts, or vexation and depression, taking a long time to fall asleep. The associated patterns are the same as for insomnia (see that entry). Also known as difficulty falling asleep or absence of sleepiness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>不易入睡</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>不能眠</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>入睡困难</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>无睡意</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>难入睡</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
