    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼外观正常，自觉眼前有白光闪烁，时发时止。见于肝肾亏虚证，或高度近视、年老体弱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Normal external appearance of the eye, with subjective flashes of white light before the eyes that come and go. Seen in liver-kidney deficiency pattern, high myopia, or old-age frailty.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
