    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">甲板倒生入肉内，刺痛如锥。见于外伤、先天性心脏病、手足癣、甲癣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nail plate growing entering flesh inside stabbing pain like. Seen in external injury pattern; congenital heart disease; onychomycosis. [证候待译:手足癣] [未译片段:倒锥]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.37</tcm:reference>
