    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉涩</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A thin, rough pulse that comes and goes sluggishly, unsmooth, feeling like scraping bamboo with a light knife. Seen in essence damage, blood deficiency, blood stasis pattern, or blood impediment, fluid collapse, blood loss, deficiency-taxation, or accumulation-gathering (jiju).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
