    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛部位出现灰白色颗粒样突起，赤脉自气轮追随牵袢呈束状，直达风轮表面，色红如赤小豆。见于肝经积热证、阴虚火旺证、脾虚夹湿证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gray-white granular elevations on the black of the eye (cornea), with red vessels trailing in bundles from the white of the eye onto the corneal surface, red like adzuki beans. Seen in liver channel accumulated heat pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or spleen deficiency with dampness pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_风轮赤豆</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Gray-white granular elevations on the black of the eye (cornea), with red vessels trailing in bundles from the white of the eye onto the corneal surface, red like adzuki beans. Seen in liver channel accumulated heat pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or spleen deficiency with dampness pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
