    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肌肉关节疼痛伴酸楚感。见于气虚证、气血两虚、阴虚证、血虚证、湿热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Muscle joint pain accompanied by aching discomfort. Seen in qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; yin deficiency pattern; blood deficiency pattern; dampness-heat pattern. [未译片段:感]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SE90</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SR1T</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood deficiency pattern (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
