    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤表面局限性变厚干燥。见于脾虚血燥证、血虚风燥证、风湿犯表证、气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Localized thickening and dryness of the skin. Seen in spleen deficiency with blood dryness pattern, blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, wind-dampness invading the exterior pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.78</tcm:reference>
