    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉形圆体短如豆兼滑数，应指明显有力，关部犹为明显，且动摇不定。见于阴阳相搏证、惊恐、疼痛、气结等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse that is round, short and bean-shaped, both slippery and rapid, palpable and forceful—most marked at the guan position—and fidgety/unstable. Seen in yin-yang contending pattern, fright, pain, or qi binding.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉动</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse that is round, short and bean-shaped, both slippery and rapid, palpable and forceful—most marked at the guan position—and fidgety/unstable. Seen in yin-yang contending pattern, fright, pain, or qi binding.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
