    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈项痛或头无力而倾斜低垂。见于脾气虚证、肾虚髓亏证，或颈部外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The neck is tilted or the head droops due to neck pain or weakness. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, or neck trauma.</tcm:definition>
