    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或双侧足跟部疼痛。见于气血亏虚、肝肾阴虚证、风寒湿痹证、血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Or bilateral heel region pain. Seen in qi and blood deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:风寒湿痹证] [未译片段:一侧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025238</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_足跟痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Or bilateral heel region pain. Seen in qi and blood deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:风寒湿痹证] [未译片段:一侧]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025238</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025238"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF5H</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
