      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N0fff1418a47a4b06980d29097e51ad0e">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热，体温高于39℃，伴烦躁；或仅自觉发热，体温不甚高，甚至正常，而伴心胸烦闷，烦躁不安（此情况多称为心胸烦热，见该条）。见于热证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever above 39°C accompanied by vexation; or merely a subjective feeling of heat with normal or slightly raised temperature plus heart-chest vexation and irritability (the latter is mostly called heart-chest vexing heat—see that entry). Seen in heat patterns, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_烦热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever above 39°C accompanied by vexation; or merely a subjective feeling of heat with normal or slightly raised temperature plus heart-chest vexation and irritability (the latter is mostly called heart-chest vexing heat—see that entry). Seen in heat patterns, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#FireEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
  </owl:Class>
