    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔色黄。多见于脾胃病、里证、热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue tongue coating yellow profuse. Seen in spleen and stomach disorder pattern; interior pattern; heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.104</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
