    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现限局性疮肿。见于热毒蕴结证、暑湿热郁证，或疖、臂痈、股痈、伏兔疽等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A localized sore or swelling of the skin. Seen in heat toxin accumulating pattern, summerheat-damp-heat stagnation pattern, or furuncle (jie), arm abscess, thigh abscess, or rabbit-crouch carbuncle (futuju).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.94</tcm:reference>
