    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便烂，或夹不消化食物，闻之味腐秽臭。多见于饮食积滞、大肠湿热。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mushy stools, possibly containing undigested food, with a putrid, foul smell; mostly seen in food accumulation stagnation or large-intestine dampness-heat.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.51</tcm:reference>
