    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腰脊正中连及腰骶部疼痛。见于风湿痹证、血虚证、肾虚证、血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lumbosacral spine extending to and lumbosacral region region pain. Seen in blood deficiency pattern; blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:风湿痹证/肾虚证] [未译片段:正中]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.41</tcm:reference>
