    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of tongue coating -like nodule or macule. [证候待译:白癞/乌癞] [未译片段:藓块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.137</tcm:reference>
