    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">子宫出血量少而势缓，淋漓不尽。见于肾虚证、血瘀证、冲任不固证等。又称漏下。与经血如崩并见，称为崩漏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bleeding scanty amount dripping not and flooding menstrual bleeding co-occurring is flooding and leaking (abnormal uterine bleeding). Seen in blood stasis pattern; Chong and Ren vessels insecurity pattern. [证候待译:肾虚证] [又称:漏下] [未译片段:子宫势缓尽称]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>漏下与经血如崩并见</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经淋漓不断</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Bleeding scanty amount dripping not and flooding menstrual bleeding co-occurring is flooding and leaking (abnormal uterine bleeding). Seen in blood stasis pattern; Chong and Ren vessels insecurity pattern. [证候待译:肾虚证] [又称:漏下] [未译片段:子宫势缓尽称]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>漏下与经血如崩并见</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
