    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块推之可发生移动。见于痰湿流注证、痰核留结证，或良性肿瘤、肉瘤、脂瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The mass moves when pushed. Seen in phlegm-dampness flowing and pouring pattern, phlegm nodule retention pattern, or benign tumor, sarcoma, or lipoma (zhiliu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.34</tcm:reference>
