    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉鼻窍胀满堵塞疼痛。见于风热壅肺证、痰火阻肺证，或鼻窦痰包染毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nasal cavity distension and fullness blocked pain. Seen in phlegm-fire with obstruction and lung disorder pattern. [证候待译:风热壅肺证/鼻窦痰包染毒] [未译片段:自觉]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.2</tcm:reference>
