    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">常因大便时搽破出血，或点滴不已，或一线如箭，无疼痛。见于内痔、外痔、混合痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bleeding from hemorrhoids, usually abraded during defecation, dripping incessantly or spurting in a stream like an arrow, without pain. Seen in internal, external or mixed hemorrhoids.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0040184</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痔核出血</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Bleeding from hemorrhoids, usually abraded during defecation, dripping incessantly or spurting in a stream like an arrow, without pain. Seen in internal, external or mixed hemorrhoids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
