    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">泪液变浑浊。见于气阴两亏证、肝肾阴虚证、心脾气血两虚证，或聚星障、凝脂翳、混睛障等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tear fluid turbidity. Seen in qi and yin dual deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; heart and spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gathering-star impediment (herpetic keratitis); congealed-fat nebula (purulent keratitis); mixed-eye impediment (interstitial keratitis). [未译片段:变]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.88</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0430031</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_神水浑浊</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Tear fluid turbidity. Seen in qi and yin dual deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; heart and spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gathering-star impediment (herpetic keratitis); congealed-fat nebula (purulent keratitis); mixed-eye impediment (interstitial keratitis). [未译片段:变]</obo:IAO_0000115>
