    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼前黑影飘浮不定，有如蚊状飞舞。见于气血两虚证，或高度近视等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dark shadows floating erratically before the eyes, like flying mosquitoes. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or high myopia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.14</tcm:reference>
