    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dark shadows floating erratically before the eyes, like flying mosquitoes. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or high myopia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
