    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, a large amount of stasis blood and turbid fluid flows from the vagina. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, yin deficiency pattern, or blood heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.18</tcm:reference>
