    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后呕吐等反应强烈，且小腹下坠，或伴阴道流血。见于胎动不安。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">During pregnancy, severe reactions such as vomiting, with bearing-down of the lower abdomen, sometimes accompanied by vaginal bleeding. Seen in restless fetus syndrome (threatened miscarriage with abdominal disturbance).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001557</tcm:hpoID>
