    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后自觉小腹及会阴部有明显下坠感，或伴阴道流血、胎动不安。见于胎动不安、胎漏。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lower abdomen and perineum region with obvious bearing-down sensation or accompanied by vagina bleeding restless fetus. Seen in restless fetus; threatened miscarriage. [未译片段:怀孕后自觉感]</tcm:definition>
