    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸廓形状改变，包括扁平、桶状、鸡胸等。见于阴虚体质、肺肾阴虚证、气阴两虚证、肺失宣降等、肾不纳气证，或扁平胸、桶状胸、久病咳喘等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Alteration of the thoracic cage shape, including flat chest, barrel chest and pigeon chest. Seen in yin deficiency constitution, lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, qi-yin dual deficiency pattern, failure of the lung to diffuse and descend, kidney failing to receive qi pattern, or flat chest, barrel chest and chronic cough-wheeze.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>29857009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>chest discomfort</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_胸廓变形</oboInOwl:id>
