    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole region or hand finger or toe skin and flesh disappearance not pain itching. Seen in blood deficiency pattern; tuoju (thromboangiitis obliterans). [证候待译:风眩] [未译片段:单个脚知觉知]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.50</tcm:reference>
