    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Whole region or hand finger or toe skin and flesh disappearance not pain itching. Seen in blood deficiency pattern; tuoju (thromboangiitis obliterans). [证候待译:风眩] [未译片段:单个脚知觉知]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
