    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">局部疼痛并伴有跳动感或血管搏动感。见于热毒酿脓证、有形实邪阻滞气机等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Local pain accompanied by a throbbing or pulsating (vascular) sensation. Seen in heat toxin brewing pus pattern, or patterns of tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
