    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门部结节隆起，触之柔软。见于皮外痔。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anal region nodule bulging softness. [证候待译:皮外痔] [未译片段:触]</tcm:definition>
