    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛上出现灰白色颗粒样突起，且有成束赤脉追随牵绊，色红如赤小豆。见于风轮赤豆、阴虚火旺证、风轮热毒证、风轮阴虚证、脾虚痰湿证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cornea appearance of grayish-white colored granules -like protrusion with bundled red vessels red like red small. Seen in wind-wheel red bean (corneal phlyctenule); yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:风轮热毒证/风轮阴虚证/脾虚痰湿证] [未译片段:上且成追随牵绊豆]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.50</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
