    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒与发热交替发作，先有恶寒，甚或寒战，随即发热，汗出热退，反复发作。见于少阳病、疟疾、邪伏膜原证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold and fever hair with aversion to cold marked or rigor (shivering) fever sweating heat recurrent attacks. Seen in shaoyang disorder pattern; malaria. [证候待译:邪伏膜原证] [未译片段:交替作先随即出退]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0005968</tcm:hpoID>
