    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to cold and fever hair with aversion to cold marked or rigor (shivering) fever sweating heat recurrent attacks. Seen in shaoyang disorder pattern; malaria. [证候待译:邪伏膜原证] [未译片段:交替作先随即出退]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0005968</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0005968"/>
  </owl:Class>
