      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N787c22b4a35b48d398e5d8c99470f8b1">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉隐伏于筋下，附于骨上，浮取、中取、重取均不见，诊察时需用力按于骨上，然后推动筋肉才能触到脉搏，甚则伏而不见。见于实邪内伏、气滞血瘀证、气闭、热闭、寒闭、痛闭、水饮阻滞证、久病正虚证、心阳虚证，寒厥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A deep-lying pulse hidden beneath the sinews and attached to the bone, imperceptible at superficial, middle and deep levels; it can only be felt by pressing forcefully onto the bone and pushing aside the sinews, or it may remain entirely hidden. Seen in excess pathogen lurking internally, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, qi blockage, heat blockage, cold blockage, pain blockage, water-rheum obstruction pattern, chronic disease with righteous qi deficiency pattern, heart yang deficiency pattern, or cold syncope.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.44</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉伏</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A deep-lying pulse hidden beneath the sinews and attached to the bone, imperceptible at superficial, middle and deep levels; it can only be felt by pressing forcefully onto the bone and pushing aside the sinews, or it may remain entirely hidden. Seen in excess pathogen lurking internally, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, qi blockage, heat blockage, cold blockage, pain blockage, water-rheum obstruction pattern, chronic disease with righteous qi deficiency pattern, heart yang deficiency pattern, or cold syncope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
