    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经气味恶臭，色暗，或秽浊。见于湿热阻滞、湿毒内聚、瘀热互结证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstruation offensive odor colored or turbid and filthy. Seen in dampness-heat with obstruction pattern. [证候待译:湿毒内聚/瘀热互结证] [未译片段:气味暗]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
