    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸部正中或偏侧疼痛。见于风湿阻络证、寒凝气滞证、瘀血阻络证、痰浊阻滞证、肝气郁结证、心气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the center or on one side of the chest. Seen in wind-dampness obstructing the collaterals pattern, cold congealing with qi stagnation pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, phlegm-turbidity obstruction pattern, liver qi depression pattern, or heart qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.49</tcm:reference>
