    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">说话时语声低弱、微小，极近距离方可闻及。见于中气虚证、阳脱证，或病情危重等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The voice is faint and weak, audible only at very close range. Seen in middle qi deficiency pattern, yang collapse pattern, or critical illness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
