    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The voice is faint and weak, audible only at very close range. Seen in middle qi deficiency pattern, yang collapse pattern, or critical illness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
