    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脓液质地稀薄。见于气血两虚证，或流痰、腋疽等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thin, watery pus. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or flowing phlegm (bone/joint tuberculosis) and axillary carbuncle (yeju).</tcm:definition>
