    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热盛衰起伏有定时，犹如潮汐一般。见于湿热证、阴虚证、阳明腑实证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever that waxes and wanes at regular times, like the tides. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, yin deficiency pattern, or yangming bowel excess pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.4</tcm:reference>
