    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后腹痛，或伴小腹下坠、阴道流血。见于气血两虚证，或胎漏、小产等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdominal pain or accompanied by lower abdomen bearing-down sensation vagina bleeding. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; threatened miscarriage. [证候待译:小产] [未译片段:怀孕后]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002027</tcm:hpoID>
