    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指目中之血，不循经注流，溢于黑睛与黄仁之间，轻者仅沉积下方呈水平液面，甚则一片鲜红，全掩瞳神，视力障碍。见于外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Blood in the eye escaping from its normal channels and collecting between the cornea and the iris; in mild cases it settles inferiorly as a horizontal level (hyphema), in severe cases the whole pupil is masked by bright red blood with visual impairment. Seen in trauma.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.89</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_血灌瞳神</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Blood in the eye escaping from its normal channels and collecting between the cornea and the iris; in mild cases it settles inferiorly as a horizontal level (hyphema), in severe cases the whole pupil is masked by bright red blood with visual impairment. Seen in trauma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
