    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡溃后如蝼蛄窜穴之状。见于蝼蛄疖，流痰等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mole-cricket-burrow-like sore after ulceration -like. Seen in flowing phlegm (bone/joint tuberculosis). [证候待译:蝼蛄疖]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.129</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疮疡溃后如蝼蛄窜穴</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mole-cricket-burrow-like sore after ulceration -like. Seen in flowing phlegm (bone/joint tuberculosis). [证候待译:蝼蛄疖]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
