    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌下肿胀，长有质软光滑的包囊，囊内积有无色或黄色的蛋青样液体。见于痰火蕴结、脾虚湿阻、气滞血瘀等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sublingual region swelling growing soft smoothness inside with without colored or yellow colored bluish -like. Seen in phlegm-fire with accumulation and binding pattern. [证候待译:脾虚湿阻/气滞血瘀等证] [未译片段:质包囊囊积蛋液体]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA7K99</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Sublingual vein</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌下痰包</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
