      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经前3～7天或正值经期出现乳房胀满疼痛，或乳头痒痛，而经后消失。见于肝郁气滞、肝脾不调、肝肾阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Distending pain of the breasts, or itching-pain of the nipples, occurring 3–7 days before each period or during menstruation and resolving after the period. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, liver-spleen disharmony, or liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经前乳胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Distending pain of the breasts, or itching-pain of the nipples, occurring 3–7 days before each period or during menstruation and resolving after the period. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, liver-spleen disharmony, or liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#EmotionE"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
  </owl:Class>
