    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛呈间歇性发作，或突然发作，阵阵加剧。见于肝郁气滞证、蛔虫证、石阻气机证或虚证等。又称阵发性疼痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain presenting as intermittent hair or sudden onset. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; deficiency pattern. [证候待译:蛔虫证/石阻气机证] [又称:阵发性疼痛] [未译片段:作阵阵加剧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>阵发性疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XT7X</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Episodic</tcm:icd11Term>
  
