    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛与黄仁之间出现黄色脓液，量多遮掩瞳神。见于脾胃积热证、风轮湿热证、风轮阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cornea and yellow appearance of yellow colored pus profuse amount pupil. Seen in spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern. [证候待译:风轮湿热证/风轮阴虚证] [未译片段:仁间遮掩]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_玉翳遮睛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
