    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃脘部辘辘作响，如水声激荡。见于痰饮中阻证、脾阳虚证，或胃饮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Splashing sounds in the epigastrium, like agitated water. Seen in phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, or stomach fluid-retention (weiyin).</tcm:definition>
