    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">男性睾丸单侧或双侧疼痛，或伴睾丸肿、硬、灼热等。见于寒滞肝脉证、肝郁气滞证、肝寒证、热毒蕴积证，或颓疝等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Testicle unilateral or bilateral pain or accompanied by testicle swelling hard burning heat. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; liver cold pattern. [证候待译:寒滞肝脉证/热毒蕴积证/颓疝] [未译片段:男性等]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MF40.21</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Testicular pain</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睾丸疼痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Testicle unilateral or bilateral pain or accompanied by testicle swelling hard burning heat. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; liver cold pattern. [证候待译:寒滞肝脉证/热毒蕴积证/颓疝] [未译片段:男性等]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MF40.21</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
