    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经先后不定且无规律，但无器质性病变。见于肝郁证、肾虚证、脾虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Irregular menstrual timing without fixed pattern and without organic lesions. Seen in liver depression pattern, kidney deficiency pattern, or spleen deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.47</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
