    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">正黄色中夹有灰褐色苔。见于热极之证。称老黄苔。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A burnt-yellow tongue coating, i.e., proper yellow mixed with gray-brown. Seen in extreme heat patterns. Called old-yellow coating.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.56</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>老黄苔</tcm:synonym>
