    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女在月经期间双目眼胞色晦睛。见于肝肾阴虚、痰湿阻滞证、肾气虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In women during menstruation, the eyelids and eyes take on a dark, dull hue. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, or kidney qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.64</tcm:reference>
