    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Slumped shoulders with a forward-stooped, rounded back. Mostly seen in liver-kidney deficiency pattern or stasis stagnating in the sinews and bones pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.27</tcm:reference>
