    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙龈局部或多处红肿。见于实火上炎证、虚热证、热毒壅盛证、风热犯表证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯齿证，或牙宣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gums local or profuse red swelling. Seen in deficiency-heat pattern; heat-toxin with congestion and exuberance pattern; yaxuan (periodontitis). [证候待译:实火上炎证/风热犯表证/胃火燔齿证/风火犯齿证] [未译片段:处]</tcm:definition>
