    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔干结粗糙，津液全无。见于热盛伤津之重症。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue coating is dry, compacted and rough, with no moisture at all. Seen in severe cases of exuberant heat damaging fluids.</tcm:definition>
