    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块按之坚硬充实。见于寒凝血瘀证、痰瘀互结证，或恶性肿瘤、胶瘤、骨瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass hard on palpation excess. Seen in cold congelation with blood stasis pattern; phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; osteoma. [证候待译:恶性肿瘤/胶瘤] [未译片段:充]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF01</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood stasis pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
