    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mass hard on palpation excess. Seen in cold congelation with blood stasis pattern; phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; osteoma. [证候待译:恶性肿瘤/胶瘤] [未译片段:充]</obo:IAO_0000115>
