    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身困乏疲倦，欲坐欲卧。见于气血两虚证、湿困脾胃证、痰湿内壅证、暑伤气阴证、暑湿内蕴证、肝胆湿热证、脾肾阳虚证、脾虚湿困证、心脾气虚证、肝肾阴虚证，或神劳、血劳、瘿劳、肌痿、肝热病、肝著、心衰、伤暑、㾏夏、肥胖病等。又称身困。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective heaviness, tiredness and fatigue of the whole body, with desire to sit or lie down. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach pattern, phlegm-dampness internal congestion pattern, summerheat damaging qi and yin pattern, summerheat-dampness internal accumulation pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, heart-spleen qi deficiency pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, or spirit taxation, blood taxation, goiter taxation, muscle atrophy, liver heat disease, liver fixity (ganzhuo), heart failure, summerheat injury, summer fever of children, or obesity. Also known as bodily tiredness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>身困</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_身体困乏</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective heaviness, tiredness and fatigue of the whole body, with desire to sit or lie down. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach pattern, phlegm-dampness internal congestion pattern, summerheat damaging qi and yin pattern, summerheat-dampness internal accumulation pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, heart-spleen qi deficiency pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, or spirit taxation, blood taxation, goiter taxation, muscle atrophy, liver heat disease, liver fixity (ganzhuo), heart failure, summerheat injury, summer fever of children, or obesity. Also known as bodily tiredness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>身困</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
