    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呕吐，吐出食物，但无呕声。见于脾胃气虚证、脾胃虚寒证、湿浊停滞证、痰饮证、脾肾阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting of food without retching sounds. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, damp-turbidity stagnation pattern, phlegm-rheum pattern, or spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.45</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MD90.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vomiting</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF77</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen yang deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呕而无声</oboInOwl:id>
