    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不自主地经常抠鼻，多见于小儿多动症。又称挖鼻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntary frequent nose-picking, mostly seen in childhood hyperactivity disorder (ADHD). Also known as nose-digging.</tcm:definition>
