    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡梦中上下牙齿相互磨切，格格有声。见于食滞胃肠证、心脾积热证，或蛔虫病等。又称梦中、齿。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Grinding of the upper and lower teeth during sleep with a clicking sound (bruxism). Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, heart-spleen accumulated heat pattern, or ascariasis. Also known as sleep tooth-gnashing.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>梦中</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>齘齿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0003763</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>191983006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bruxism</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>90207007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bruxism</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
