    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Grinding of the upper and lower teeth during sleep with a clicking sound (bruxism). Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, heart-spleen accumulated heat pattern, or ascariasis. Also known as sleep tooth-gnashing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>梦中</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>齘齿</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
