        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">傍晚进食之食物早晨吐出，或伴进食后胃脘不适。见于脾胃虚寒证、痰瘀内阻证、命门火衰证、寒饮内停证、痰气互结证、酒积湿热证、瘀血阻滞证，或胃反、虫积等。与朝食暮吐多同时并见。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food eaten in the evening is vomited the next morning, sometimes with epigastric discomfort after meals. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, phlegm-stasis internal obstruction pattern, life-gate fire debilitation pattern, cold rheum internal stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, alcohol accumulation with dampness-heat pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, or stomach reflux and worm accumulation. Often co-occurs with morning-food-evening-vomiting.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.41</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当、感染</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_暮食朝吐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Food eaten in the evening is vomited the next morning, sometimes with epigastric discomfort after meals. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, phlegm-stasis internal obstruction pattern, life-gate fire debilitation pattern, cold rheum internal stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, alcohol accumulation with dampness-heat pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, or stomach reflux and worm accumulation. Often co-occurs with morning-food-evening-vomiting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
