    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠表浅，或多梦、躁扰，或易惊、易醒。见于胆郁痰扰证、余热扰膈证、心肾不交证、心脾两虚证、阴虚火旺证等。又称睡眠不安。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Light sleep or frequent dreaming or easily startled. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:胆郁痰扰证/余热扰膈证/心肾不交证/心脾两虚证] [又称:睡眠不安] [未译片段:躁扰易醒]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>睡眠不安</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025199</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_夜寐不安</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
