    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颌下颈前结喉两侧部位粗肿。见于痰气郁结证、气滞血瘀证、心肝阳虚证，或瘿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thickening and swelling on both sides of the laryngeal prominence in the anterior neck below the jaw. Seen in phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, heart-liver yang deficiency pattern, or goiter tumor (yingliu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000475</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈粗</oboInOwl:id>
