    <obo:IAO_0000115>Thickening and swelling on both sides of the laryngeal prominence in the anterior neck below the jaw. Seen in phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, heart-liver yang deficiency pattern, or goiter tumor (yingliu).</obo:IAO_0000115>
