    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">晶珠出现浑浊，伴视力下降。见于年老体衰、肝肾亏虚证、脾肾阳虚证、脾虚湿热证，或圆翳内障、胎患内障、惊振内障等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Crystalline lens appearance of turbidity accompanied by decreased vision. Seen in liver and kidney deficiency pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; round-nebula internal obstruction (cataract). [证候待译:年老体衰/脾虚湿热证/胎患内障/惊振内障]</tcm:definition>
