    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">女子不到45岁即已停止行经。见于肾气亏虚证、胞宫虚寒证、肾阴阳两虚证、瘀滞胞宫证、寒凝胞宫证、痰凝胞宫证、胞宫虚热证、气血两虚证，或黑疸、肾亢、血风劳、肠覃等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cessation of menstruation before the age of 45. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency cold pattern, kidney yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, stasis stagnating in the uterus pattern, cold congealing in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, uterine deficiency heat pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or black jaundice, kidney hyperactivity, blood-wind taxation, or intestinal mushroom mass (changtan/ovarian tumor).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0008209</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>373717006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>climacterium praecox</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_过早绝经</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cessation of menstruation before the age of 45. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency cold pattern, kidney yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, stasis stagnating in the uterus pattern, cold congealing in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, uterine deficiency heat pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or black jaundice, kidney hyperactivity, blood-wind taxation, or intestinal mushroom mass (changtan/ovarian tumor).</obo:IAO_0000115>
