    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">星翳的后遗症，遗留大小不等，形状不一的瘢痕。见于阴虚邪恋证、风轮阴虚证、气血瘀滞证，或云翳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sequelae of star nebula (keratitis), leaving scars of varying size and shape. Seen in yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or cloud nebula (corneal macula).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_翳如浮云</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sequelae of star nebula (keratitis), leaving scars of varying size and shape. Seen in yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or cloud nebula (corneal macula).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
