    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">前囟较同龄幼儿宽大。见于肾气亏虚证、脾虚水泛证、热毒蕴结证，或解颅、佝偻病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The anterior fontanelle is wider than in children of the same age. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with water flooding pattern, heat toxin accumulating pattern, or cranial fissure non-closure (hydrocephalus) and rickets.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.37</tcm:reference>
