    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">矢气频多，味恶臭难闻。多见于饮食积滞久停化热、胃肠气滞证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent flatus with a foul, offensive odor; mostly seen in long-stagnating food accumulation transforming into heat, or gastrointestinal qi stagnation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.78</tcm:reference>
