    <obo:IAO_0000115>Head region skin not pain itching numbness (loss of sensation) scalp numbness numbness is pain itching profuse. Seen in blood deficiency pattern. [证候待译:头皮麻木以木为主/按之搔之皆无感觉/痰湿阻络证] [未译片段:知以主非非]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
