    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目珠奇痒难耐如有小虫爬行。见于风邪外袭证，或眼内风痒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Intolerable itching of the eyes as if small insects were crawling. Seen in wind pathogen exterior invasion pattern, or wind-itch inside the eye.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.25</tcm:reference>
