    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿因脱落或缺蚀而稀疏，缺豁。见于肾虚髓亏证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯肺证、气血亏虚证，或牙宣、牙痈、齿槽风、牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth are sparse with gaps due to loss or erosion. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, stomach fire flaring the teeth pattern, wind-fire invading the lung pattern, qi-blood deficiency pattern, or tooth disclosure (periodontal atrophy, yaxuan), dental abscess, alveolar wind (jaw osteomyelitis), or gum ulceration (yagan).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.100</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_牙齿疏豁</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Teeth are sparse with gaps due to loss or erosion. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, stomach fire flaring the teeth pattern, wind-fire invading the lung pattern, qi-blood deficiency pattern, or tooth disclosure (periodontal atrophy, yaxuan), dental abscess, alveolar wind (jaw osteomyelitis), or gum ulceration (yagan).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
