    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神呈淡绿色。见于肝胆火盛证、风痰上扰证、肝气郁结证、肝胃虚寒证，或绿风内障等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pupil presenting as light green colored. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder fire exuberance pattern; liver qi depression and binding pattern; liver and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; green-wind internal obstruction (acute glaucoma). [证候待译:风痰上扰证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.96</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_瞳神淡绿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pupil presenting as light green colored. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder fire exuberance pattern; liver qi depression and binding pattern; liver and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; green-wind internal obstruction (acute glaucoma). [证候待译:风痰上扰证]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
