    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不欲饮食，甚则闻食物之气味即觉恶心不适，或呕吐。见于食滞胃肠证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of appetite, even to the point of nausea or vomiting on merely smelling food. Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶闻食臭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loss of appetite, even to the point of nausea or vomiting on merely smelling food. Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
