    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头部昏沉不适，头脑不清楚，或走路不稳，甚至有失平衡之感。见于肝肾阴虚证、肾精亏虚证、气虚血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A heavy, muddled head with unclear thinking, unsteady walking, or even a sense of losing balance. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney essence deficiency pattern, or qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002321</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271789005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>dizziness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>399090003</tcm:snomedCT>
