    <tcm:snomedCT>399153001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>dizziness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MB48.2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Exertional dizziness</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头昏</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A heavy, muddled head with unclear thinking, unsteady walking, or even a sense of losing balance. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney essence deficiency pattern, or qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
