    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">早晨进食之食物傍晚或下午吐出，或伴食后胃脘不适。见于脾胃虚寒证、痰瘀内阻证、命门火衰证、寒饮内停证、痰气互结证、酒积湿热证、瘀血阻滞证，或胃反、虫积等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food eaten in the morning is vomited in the late afternoon or evening, sometimes with epigastric discomfort after meals. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, phlegm-stasis internal obstruction pattern, life-gate fire debilitation pattern, cold rheum internal stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, alcohol accumulation with dampness-heat pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, or stomach reflux and worm accumulation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_朝食暮吐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Food eaten in the morning is vomited in the late afternoon or evening, sometimes with epigastric discomfort after meals. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, phlegm-stasis internal obstruction pattern, life-gate fire debilitation pattern, cold rheum internal stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, alcohol accumulation with dampness-heat pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, or stomach reflux and worm accumulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
