    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌质纹理粗糙，形色坚敛。见于实证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue proper has a coarse texture and a firm, shriveled appearance. Seen in excess patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
