      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛血络破裂，血溢白睛外膜之下，呈一片鲜红，界限分明。见于肺经郁热证、阴虚火炎证、肝经郁热证、气轮血瘀证、肝肾阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rupture of the blood vessels of the white of the eye, with blood extravasating beneath the conjunctiva as a sharply demarcated bright-red patch (subconjunctival hemorrhage). Seen in lung channel depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaming pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, qi-wheel (white of the eye) blood stasis pattern, or liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.77</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0011885</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>815008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>episcleritis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_白睛溢血</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Rupture of the blood vessels of the white of the eye, with blood extravasating beneath the conjunctiva as a sharply demarcated bright-red patch (subconjunctival hemorrhage). Seen in lung channel depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with fire flaming pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, qi-wheel (white of the eye) blood stasis pattern, or liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0011885</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011885"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:815008</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
