    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体局部表面红肿疼痛，或有小溃疡。见于心经火热亢盛。生于舌下者，见于脾肾积热。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue body local surface red swelling pain or with small ulcer growing at sublingual region seen at heat. Seen in heart channel fire with heat with hyperactivity pattern. [未译片段:脾肾积]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.24</tcm:reference>
