    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身及四肢皮肤瘙痒，或伴起疹、抓痕，或红肿、流滋等。见于风证、血热证、湿热侵淫证，或风疹、隐疹、疮疡等皮肤病。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body and limbs skin itching or accompanied by rising marks or red swelling oozing of serous fluid. Seen in wind pattern; blood heat pattern. [证候待译:湿热侵淫证/风疹/隐疹/疮疡等皮肤病] [未译片段:自觉疹抓等]</tcm:definition>
