    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔黄赤兼黑。多见于胃肠先有宿食湿浊，积久化热，熏蒸秽浊上泛舌面，血瘀气滞或湿热夹痰。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue coating yellow red with black profuse. Seen in blood stasis with qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:胃肠先有宿食湿浊/积久化热/熏蒸秽浊上泛舌面/湿热夹痰]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
