    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">多出现于龟头包皮处或冠状沟处红色丘疹，或糜烂成片，或渗出较多。见于湿热下注、外感湿毒、湿毒内聚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red papules mostly on the glans, prepuce or coronal sulcus, eroding into patches or with profuse exudation. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward, externally contracted damp toxin, or damp toxin internal aggregation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.56</tcm:reference>
