    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">表现为增生的，隆起的条索状或形状不规则的暗红色略硬斑块。见于气血凝滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Manifesting as hyperplasia bulging -like or -like not dark red colored hard macule. Seen in qi and blood congelation pattern. [未译片段:条索形规则略块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.72</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疤痕结节</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Manifesting as hyperplasia bulging -like or -like not dark red colored hard macule. Seen in qi and blood congelation pattern. [未译片段:条索形规则略块]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
