    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">直立时两踝并拢而两膝分离向外弓出成“O”形。见于先天不足、肾气不充，或佝偻病等。又称”O”型腿、箩圈腿。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">When standing upright with both ankles together, the knees separate and bow outward (bowlegs). Seen in congenital insufficiency, kidney qi insufficiency, or rickets. Also known as O-legs or bowed legs.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.84</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>“O”型腿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>箩圈腿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>299331007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bow leggedness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>299330008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>genu valga</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_膝外翻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>When standing upright with both ankles together, the knees separate and bow outward (bowlegs). Seen in congenital insufficiency, kidney qi insufficiency, or rickets. Also known as O-legs or bowed legs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>“O”型腿</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>箩圈腿</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:299331007</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/299331007"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:299330008</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/299330008"/>
  </owl:Class>
