    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部色紫暗，或兼肿胀，或兼溃烂。见于风热上扰证、肺胃积热证、脾经湿浊证、肾阴亏虚证，或喉疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Throat purple or with swelling or with ulceration and festering. Seen in wind-heat with upward disturbance pattern; lung disorder and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:脾经湿浊证/喉疳] [未译片段:暗]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.77</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉色紫暗</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Throat purple or with swelling or with ulceration and festering. Seen in wind-heat with upward disturbance pattern; lung disorder and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:脾经湿浊证/喉疳] [未译片段:暗]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
