      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊疮口凹陷，有内外两口，脓出稀薄，夹有败絮样物，经久不愈。见于肾囊痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A scrotal sore with a depressed opening, having both inner and outer mouths, discharging thin pus mixed with rotten-cotton-like debris, failing to heal for a long time. Seen in scrotal abscess (shennang yong).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.61</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊瘘管</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A scrotal sore with a depressed opening, having both inner and outer mouths, discharging thin pus mixed with rotten-cotton-like debris, failing to heal for a long time. Seen in scrotal abscess (shennang yong).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
