    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">生于肛门部的小赘生物，呈淡红色或暗红色，小如粟米，大如栗。又称鼠屎痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Growing at anal region small growing mass presenting as light red colored or dark red colored small like large like. [又称:鼠屎痔] [未译片段:赘粟米栗]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼠屎痔</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
