    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠表浅，易受惊扰，时时觉醒或惊醒。见于胆郁痰扰证、肝经郁热证等。又称易醒、睡后易醒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Light sleep easily disturbed, with frequent awakening or startled awakening. Seen in gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, or liver channel depressed heat pattern. Also known as easy awakening.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>易醒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>睡后易醒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睡中易醒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Light sleep easily disturbed, with frequent awakening or startled awakening. Seen in gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, or liver channel depressed heat pattern. Also known as easy awakening.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>易醒</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>睡后易醒</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
