    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">病人自觉怕风，或遇风则怕冷战栗，避风则缓。是风邪袭表卫气失和的表现。见于太阳中风、外感风寒表虚证及肺卫气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective aversion to wind, or feeling cold and shivering on wind exposure, relieved when sheltered—a manifestation of wind pathogen attacking the exterior with disharmony of defensive qi. Seen in taiyang wind strike (zhongfeng), externally contracted wind-cold exterior deficiency pattern, or lung-defensive qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025143</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MG21</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Chills</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶风</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective aversion to wind, or feeling cold and shivering on wind exposure, relieved when sheltered—a manifestation of wind pathogen attacking the exterior with disharmony of defensive qi. Seen in taiyang wind strike (zhongfeng), externally contracted wind-cold exterior deficiency pattern, or lung-defensive qi deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025143</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025143"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MG21</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
