    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来应指圆滑如珠，搏动流利，有回旋转动，圆滑自如的感觉。见于实热证，或痰饮、食滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse that rolls smoothly under the finger like pearls, flowing freely with a gliding, rounded sensation. Seen in excess heat pattern, or phlegm-rheum and food stagnation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
