    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现对称分布的红色斑块。见于风邪犯表证、阴虚火旺证，或黄褐斑、盘状红斑狼疮、湿毒发斑、暑热疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of symmetrically distributed red colored macule. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; chloasma (melasma). [证候待译:风邪犯表证/盘状红斑狼疮/湿毒发斑/暑热疮] [未译片段:块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.12</tcm:reference>
