    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛周皮下可触及条索状物。见于肛门湿热证、正虚邪恋证、阴虚肠燥证，或肛门瘘、穿肠瘘等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A cord-like structure palpable in the perianal subcutaneous tissue. Seen in perianal dampness-heat pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, yin deficiency with intestinal dryness pattern, or anal fistula and trans-intestinal fistula.</tcm:definition>
