    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核脱出肛门外，可自行回到肛内。见于中气下陷证、湿热下注证、气血两虚证、气血瘀滞证，或翻花痔、脱肛、内外痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The hemorrhoid prolapses outside the anus but can return into the anal canal by itself. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or flower-turning hemorrhoid, rectal prolapse, or internal-external hemorrhoids.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痔核可自行还纳</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The hemorrhoid prolapses outside the anus but can return into the anal canal by itself. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or flower-turning hemorrhoid, rectal prolapse, or internal-external hemorrhoids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
