      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">由于阴囊皮肤溃烂、坏死、剥脱，睾丸暴露在外，并有黄色稀薄分泌物渗出。见于湿热下注证，或脱囊等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Due to scrotum skin ulceration and festering necrosis testicle exposure present and with yellow colored thin (watery) discharge. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene). [未译片段:剥脱外渗出]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睾丸外露</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Due to scrotum skin ulceration and festering necrosis testicle exposure present and with yellow colored thin (watery) discharge. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene). [未译片段:剥脱外渗出]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
