      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来累累，短小坚搏如循薏苡仁之状，见于心之危候，脏腑空虚。为无胃气之脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse arriving in successive short, small, hard, forceful beats like rolling job's-tears (coix seeds); seen in critical heart conditions with emptiness of the viscera—a pulse devoid of stomach qi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_转豆脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse arriving in successive short, small, hard, forceful beats like rolling job's-tears (coix seeds); seen in critical heart conditions with emptiness of the viscera—a pulse devoid of stomach qi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
