    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中出气带有氨味。见于浊毒闭神证、肾阳虚证、痰火闭窍证、气阴亏虚证、气随血脱证，或阴水晚期、肾厥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">An ammonia (urine-like) smell in the breath from the mouth. Seen in turbid toxin blocking the spirit pattern, kidney yang deficiency pattern, phlegm-fire blocking the orifices pattern, qi-yin deficiency pattern, qi deserting with blood loss pattern, or late-stage yin edema and kidney syncope.</tcm:definition>
