      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠后易觉醒，醒后入睡困难，或不能再入睡。见于心脾气血两虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Easy awakening during sleep with difficulty falling asleep again, or inability to return to sleep. Seen in heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_醒后难入睡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Easy awakening during sleep with difficulty falling asleep again, or inability to return to sleep. Seen in heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
