    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌头卷曲回缩，转动不灵，或伴言语不清者。见于热入心包证、热壅动风证，或痉病、中风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue curls and retracts, moving stiffly, sometimes with slurred speech. Seen in heat entering the pericardium pattern, heat congestion stirring wind pattern, or convulsive disease and stroke.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌卷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The tongue curls and retracts, moving stiffly, sometimes with slurred speech. Seen in heat entering the pericardium pattern, heat congestion stirring wind pattern, or convulsive disease and stroke.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
