    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉络末端终于掌指关节横纹和食指第二指节横纹之间。见于邪浅而病轻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The (infantile index-finger) venule extends only as far as the segment between the metacarpophalangeal crease and the second phalangeal crease of the index finger (the wind gate). Seen in mild disease with a superficial pathogen.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.3.5</tcm:reference>
