    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abscesses connecting with each other to form lumps. Seen in heat toxin accumulating pattern, summerheat-damp-heat stagnation pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, or furuncle (jie).</tcm:definition>
