    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sluggishness and weakness of the limbs. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach pattern, phlegm-dampness internal congestion pattern, summerheat damaging qi and yin pattern, summerheat-dampness internal accumulation pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, heart-spleen qi deficiency pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, or spirit taxation, blood taxation, goiter taxation, muscle atrophy, liver heat disease, liver fixity, heart failure, summerheat injury, summer fever of children, or obesity. Also known as tiredness or fatigue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
