    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳轮瘦小而薄。多见于先天亏损肾气不足，又称耳轮瘦削。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Helix of auricle small and thin thin profuse seen at congenital not foot. [证候待译:先天亏损肾气不足/又称耳轮瘦削] [又称:耳轮瘦削] [未译片段:亏损肾气]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.41</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>耳轮瘦削</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳廓瘦小</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Helix of auricle small and thin thin profuse seen at congenital not foot. [证候待译:先天亏损肾气不足/又称耳轮瘦削] [又称:耳轮瘦削] [未译片段:亏损肾气]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>耳轮瘦削</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
