    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">晶珠混浊，瞳神内呈圆形银白色翳障，中心呈棕黄色。见于绿风内障失明期。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cloudy lens (cataract) pupil inside presenting as white colored nebula (corneal opacity) central presenting as yellow colored. [证候待译:绿风内障失明期] [未译片段:圆形银障棕]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_白翳黄心</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cloudy lens (cataract) pupil inside presenting as white colored nebula (corneal opacity) central presenting as yellow colored. [证候待译:绿风内障失明期] [未译片段:圆形银障棕]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
