    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">啼哭持久，或频繁，多见于新生儿或婴儿、小儿。见于脾经虚寒证、心经积热证、心虚禀弱证，或受惊恐惧、伤食、积滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Persistent or frequent crying, mostly in newborns, infants or small children. Seen in spleen channel deficiency cold pattern, heart channel accumulated heat pattern, heart deficiency with weak endowment pattern, or fright and fear, food damage, or accumulation-stagnation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_终日啼哭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Persistent or frequent crying, mostly in newborns, infants or small children. Seen in spleen channel deficiency cold pattern, heart channel accumulated heat pattern, heart deficiency with weak endowment pattern, or fright and fear, food damage, or accumulation-stagnation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
