    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌面光洁无苔，平滑如镜。见于胃气、胃阴枯竭，主病危。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue surface is smooth and bare without coating, glossy like a mirror (bald tongue). Seen in exhaustion of stomach qi and stomach yin; indicates a critical, life-threatening condition.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.46</tcm:reference>
