    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">周身及四肢无力，或四肢不能持物，身体不能持重，或自觉周身无力。见于气虚证、气血两虚证、暑伤气阴证、心气虚证，或神劳、血劳、瘿劳、肌痿、心衰、伤暑等。与乏力相似，但症状表现程度较乏力重。又称周身无力。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body and weakness of limbs or limbs inability mass body inability or whole body weakness and weakness similar in size -like appearing weakness. Seen in qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; summerheat injury. [证候待译:暑伤气阴证/心气虚证/神劳/血劳/瘿劳/肌痿] [又称:周身无力] [未译片段:持持重自觉但症表程度较重]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>周身无力</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
