    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便中含有未消化物，状如蛋汤。见于脾胃气虚证、脾肾阳虚证、风犯胃肠证、脾气下陷证，或食滞、寒热错杂。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stools containing undigested matter, resembling egg-drop soup. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, wind invading the stomach and intestines pattern, spleen qi sinking pattern, or food stagnation and cold-heat complex.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.12</tcm:reference>
