    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体疼痛感。见于心火亢盛证、肺胃热盛证、阴虚火旺证，或舌岩等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue body pain. Seen in heart fire with hyperactivity pattern; lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:舌岩] [未译片段:感]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.57</tcm:reference>
