    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">从心下至少腹胀满，攻撑作痛，按之坚硬。见于热毒蕴结、食滞胃肠证，或腹痛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Distension and fullness from the epigastrium to the lower abdomen, with surging, stretching pain and hardness on palpation. Seen in heat toxin accumulating, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, or abdominal pain diseases.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.11</tcm:reference>
