    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳窍流脓稠浊如粘，或牵拉成丝。见于湿热内蕴证、脾肾阳虚证、风热犯耳证、肝火犯耳证，或慢性脓耳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thick, turbid, sticky pus from the ear orifice, sometimes drawn into threads. Seen in dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, wind-heat invading the ear pattern, liver fire invading the ear pattern, or chronic suppurative ear (chronic suppurative otitis media).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳脓稠浊</oboInOwl:id>
