    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉形宽大，来盛去衰，来大去长，应指浮大有力，滔滔满指，成波涛汹涌之势。见于热证，主邪热亢盛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A broad, large pulse arriving forcefully and receding weakly, flooding and overflowing under the finger like surging waves. Seen in heat patterns; indicates exuberant pathogenic heat.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.41</tcm:reference>
