    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部出现白色腐膜，严重可蔓及至鼻咽部。见于虚火上炎证、肾阴亏虚证，或白喉等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A white, putrid pseudomembrane in the throat, in severe cases spreading to the nasopharynx. Seen in deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, or diphtheria (baihou).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.72</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉白腐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A white, putrid pseudomembrane in the throat, in severe cases spreading to the nasopharynx. Seen in deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, or diphtheria (baihou).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
