    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经颜色较正常浅淡。见于胞宫血虚证、脾肾阳虚证、脾虚痰湿证、胞宫气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood paler than normal in color. Seen in uterine blood deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with phlegm-dampness pattern, or uterine qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
