    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstrual blood paler than normal in color. Seen in uterine blood deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with phlegm-dampness pattern, or uterine qi deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
