    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙龈或近龈齿上有蓝灰色或蓝色色素沉着。见于铅中毒、银汞合金损害等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gums or tooth with blue gray colored or blue colored hyperpigmentation. [证候待译:铅中毒/银汞合金损害] [未译片段:近龈上]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.73</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
