    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脐管或卵黄管未完全闭合，形成瘘管连通脏腔。见于脐尿管瘘、脐肠瘘等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Incomplete closure of the urachus or vitelline duct, forming a fistula connecting the umbilicus to an internal cavity. Seen in urachal fistula or umbilico-intestinal (omphalomesenteric) fistula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0010770</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脐部瘘管</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Incomplete closure of the urachus or vitelline duct, forming a fistula connecting the umbilicus to an internal cavity. Seen in urachal fistula or umbilico-intestinal (omphalomesenteric) fistula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
