    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在正常工作生活中，不分时间场合忽然入睡。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Suddenly falling asleep irrespective of time or occasion during normal work and daily life.</tcm:definition>
