    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉头部沉重，如蒙，如压，如裹。见于风湿泛头证、湿热内蕴证、痰湿犯头证、脾气虚证等。又称头沉、头重如裹。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective heaviness of the head, as if veiled, pressed, or wrapped. Seen in wind-dampness flooding the head pattern, dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern, phlegm-dampness invading the head pattern, or spleen qi deficiency pattern. Also known as heavy head or head heavy as if wrapped.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>头沉</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>头重如裹</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000234</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>299033004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal hands</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>13213009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal heart morphology</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>275259005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal pinnae</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头重</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective heaviness of the head, as if veiled, pressed, or wrapped. Seen in wind-dampness flooding the head pattern, dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern, phlegm-dampness invading the head pattern, or spleen qi deficiency pattern. Also known as heavy head or head heavy as if wrapped.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>头沉</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>头重如裹</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
