    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">局部或全身皮肤按之坚实发硬。见于气滞血瘀证、营卫失和证，或长期挤压、摩擦，硬皮病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Local or whole body skin pressure firmness hair hard. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; scleroderma. [证候待译:营卫失和证/长期挤压/摩擦]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.139</tcm:reference>
