    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来充盛有力，其来势盛去亦盛，应指幅幅，举按皆然。是一切有力脉的总称。见于邪气有余、食滞，或胁痛、痈疽疮疡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse arriving full and forceful, strong both on arrival and departure, palpable at all levels of pressure—the generic term for all forceful pulses. Seen in excessive pathogenic qi, food stagnation, or hypochondriac pain and abscess/carbuncle/sores.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉实</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse arriving full and forceful, strong both on arrival and departure, palpable at all levels of pressure—the generic term for all forceful pulses. Seen in excessive pathogenic qi, food stagnation, or hypochondriac pain and abscess/carbuncle/sores.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
