    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">身体某局部或某器官疼痛症状，如皮肤疼痛、头皮痛、心绞痛、肾绞痛等。见于血瘀证、气滞证、寒凝证、热盛证，或某局部、器官病变。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Body local or pain -like like skin pain scalp pain angina pectoris colicky pain. Seen in blood stasis pattern; qi stagnation pattern; cold congelation pattern; heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:某局部/器官病变] [未译片段:某某器官症肾等]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>器官）疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>（某局部</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
