    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">全身或某局部皮肤触觉、痛觉均消失，不知痛痒。见于风热疠毒证，或麻风等。见于中风、风（喑）痱、气厥、软脚瘟、肌痿、外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of both touch and pain sensation over the whole body or a local region, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in wind-heat pestilent toxin pattern, or leprosy; also seen in stroke, wind (mute) feebleness, qi syncope, soft-leg pestilence, muscle atrophy, or trauma.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033748</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030213</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>6140007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>affective insufficiency</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SK54</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Numbness disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SC62</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Numbness disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_麻木不仁</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loss of both touch and pain sensation over the whole body or a local region, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in wind-heat pestilent toxin pattern, or leprosy; also seen in stroke, wind (mute) feebleness, qi syncope, soft-leg pestilence, muscle atrophy, or trauma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0033748</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
