    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙床周围组织破溃糜烂疼痛。见于热毒壅盛证、气郁痰凝证、虚火上炎证，或口疮、牙疳、青腿牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ulceration and erosion of the tissue around the dental bed with pain. Seen in heat toxin congestion pattern, qi depression with phlegm congealing pattern, deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, or mouth sores, gum ulceration (yagan), or blue-leg gum ulceration (qingtui yagan).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.106</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000168</tcm:hpoID>
