    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">White of the eye appearance of patchy bleeding macule even and white of the eye. Seen in external contraction with wind-heat pattern. [证候待译:肺经实火证] [未译片段:浅层遍整个]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.87</tcm:reference>
