    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两手掌大小鱼际处，肤色红赤，压之退色，皮肤变薄。见于肝肾阴虚证、瘀血痹阻证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Palm large small thenar eminence skin red red colored skin thin. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:瘀血痹阻证] [未译片段:两处压退变]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.167</tcm:reference>
