    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身疲乏无力。见于气虚证、气血两虚证 、暑伤气阴证、脾肾阳虚证、心气虚证，或神劳、血劳、瘿劳、肌痿、心衰、伤暑等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body fatigue and weakness. Seen in qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; summerheat injury. [证候待译:暑伤气阴证/心气虚证/神劳/血劳/瘿劳/肌痿] [未译片段:自觉]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.25</tcm:reference>
