    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡根脚散漫。见于湿热壅滞证、热毒伤阴证、阴虚毒恋证、气郁化火证，或足背发、痈、脐痈、腹皮痈、中脘痈、臀痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Diffuse-based sore. Seen in dampness-heat with congestion and stagnation pattern; heat-toxin with damaging yin pattern; qi depression with transforming into fire pattern; buttock abscess. [证候待译:阴虚毒恋证/足背发/痈/脐痈/腹皮痈/中脘痈]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.125</tcm:reference>
