    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肠中辘辘作响，声音较响亮。见于肠道湿热证、饮停胃肠证、脾阳虚证，或暴泻、类霍乱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loud gurgling sounds in the intestines (borborygmus). Seen in intestinal dampness-heat pattern, rheum collecting in the stomach and intestines pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, or fulminant diarrhea and cholera-like disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.36</tcm:reference>
