    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">食欲差，不思食，或进食不多。见于肝气犯胃证、脾胃湿热证、脾胃气虚证、脾胃虚寒证、脾肾阳虚证，或伤食等。又称不思饮食、不欲食、默默不欲饮食。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food not food or taking food not profuse. Seen in liver qi invading the stomach pattern; spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:伤食] [又称:不思饮食/不欲食/默默不欲饮食] [未译片段:欲差思]</tcm:definition>
