    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头皮生疖，肿痛，色红，灼热。见于湿热证，或蝼蛄疖、小儿暑疖、暑热、胎毒等。又称鳝拱头、蝼疖。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scalp growing furuncle swelling pain red burning heat. Seen in dampness-heat pattern; summerheat with heat pattern. [证候待译:蝼蛄疖/小儿暑疖/胎毒] [又称:鳝拱头/蝼疖]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>蝼疖</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鳝拱头</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>1B75.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Furuncle</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF9G</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Bladder dampness-heat pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
