    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">进食后不久即吐出胃内容物，或饮食如常，或饮食不多。见于胃热炽盛证，或类霍乱、伤食、食物中毒、胃反、食管瘅、胃郁等。又称食后泛呕。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting of stomach contents shortly after eating, with normal or reduced food intake. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, or cholera-like disease, food damage, food poisoning, stomach reflux, esophageal inflammation, or stomach depression. Also known as postprandial regurgitant vomiting.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>食后泛呕</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025089</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>MD90.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vomiting</tcm:icd11Term>
  
