    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Vomiting of stomach contents shortly after eating, with normal or reduced food intake. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, or cholera-like disease, food damage, food poisoning, stomach reflux, esophageal inflammation, or stomach depression. Also known as postprandial regurgitant vomiting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>食后泛呕</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
