    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">语声重浊。见于外感风寒证、湿浊阻滞证、风寒表证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A heavy, turbid voice. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, damp-turbidity obstruction pattern, or wind-cold exterior pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.11</tcm:reference>
