    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头皮呈碎屑状，多伴头皮瘙痒。多见于血热化燥。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scalp presenting as -like profuse accompanied by scalp itching profuse. Seen in blood heat with transforming into dryness pattern. [未译片段:碎屑]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.10</tcm:reference>
