    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两侧或左、右足肌肤知觉消失，不知痛痒。见于足部疔疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both feet, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in nail-like boil (dingchuang) of the foot.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033748</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_足麻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both feet, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in nail-like boil (dingchuang) of the foot.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0033748</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
