      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痈肿质地较硬，触之无明显痛痒。见于气滞血瘀证，或寒肿、流痰、痰瘤、脱疽、冻疮、静脉曲张、委中毒、发颐、颜面疔疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The abscess is hard in texture and insensitive to touch, without obvious pain or itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or cold swelling, flowing phlegm (bone/joint tuberculosis), phlegm tumor, sloughing gangrene (tuoju), frostbite, varicose veins, popliteal toxin (weizhongdu), cheek inflammation (fayi), or facial nail-like boils.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痈肿木硬</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The abscess is hard in texture and insensitive to touch, without obvious pain or itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or cold swelling, flowing phlegm (bone/joint tuberculosis), phlegm tumor, sloughing gangrene (tuoju), frostbite, varicose veins, popliteal toxin (weizhongdu), cheek inflammation (fayi), or facial nail-like boils.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
