      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N760893055333464faae8fc26f6b148b7">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在熟睡中不由自主地起床走动，或从事日常活动，或不被人唤醒，或醒后一无所知。见于心气亏虚证、心肺阴虚证、心肾不交证、肝气郁结证、痰火扰心证、痰浊阻滞证、瘀血阻滞证等。又称梦魇。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntarily getting out of bed and walking around or performing routine activities during deep sleep, not easily roused, with complete amnesia afterward (sleepwalking/somnambulism). Seen in heart qi deficiency pattern, heart-lung yin deficiency pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, liver qi depression pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the heart pattern, phlegm-turbidity obstruction pattern, or static blood obstruction pattern. Also known as nightmare-dream wandering.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>梦魔</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>VW13</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Walking</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_梦游</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Involuntarily getting out of bed and walking around or performing routine activities during deep sleep, not easily roused, with complete amnesia afterward (sleepwalking/somnambulism). Seen in heart qi deficiency pattern, heart-lung yin deficiency pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, liver qi depression pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the heart pattern, phlegm-turbidity obstruction pattern, or static blood obstruction pattern. Also known as nightmare-dream wandering.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>梦魔</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:VW13</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#EmotionE"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
