    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">仅感觉背部（背脊）局部恶寒。见于风寒羁于太阳经脉、或内伤脾胃虚寒、或寒饮停聚等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sensation back back local aversion to cold. Seen in internal damage and spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern. [证候待译:风寒羁于太阳经脉/寒饮停聚等证] [未译片段:仅脊]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA2P90</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Back</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_背恶寒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sensation back back local aversion to cold. Seen in internal damage and spleen and stomach deficiency-cold pattern. [证候待译:风寒羁于太阳经脉/寒饮停聚等证] [未译片段:仅脊]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XA2P90</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
