      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">抽掣牵扯而痛，由一处连及它处。见于有形实邪阻闭气机证、风湿阻络证、寒凝证、气滞证、风痰阻络证等。又称引痛、彻痛、牵扯痛。临床常见的有胸痛彻背、心痛彻背、胁肋痛引少腹、腹痛牵引阴股、腰痛牵扯大腿坐骨神经、心痛牵扯左肩及左臂内侧等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pulling, dragging pain radiating from one site to another. Seen in tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic pattern, wind-dampness obstructing the collaterals pattern, cold congealing pattern, qi stagnation pattern, or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern. Also known as radiating or shooting pain. Common clinical examples include chest pain radiating to the back, heart pain radiating to the back, hypochondriac pain radiating to the lower abdomen, abdominal pain dragging to the groin and thigh, lumbar pain radiating along the sciatic nerve of the thigh, and heart pain radiating to the left shoulder and inner left arm.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>引痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>彻痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>牵扯痛临床常</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_牵扯痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pulling, dragging pain radiating from one site to another. Seen in tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic pattern, wind-dampness obstructing the collaterals pattern, cold congealing pattern, qi stagnation pattern, or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern. Also known as radiating or shooting pain. Common clinical examples include chest pain radiating to the back, heart pain radiating to the back, hypochondriac pain radiating to the lower abdomen, abdominal pain dragging to the groin and thigh, lumbar pain radiating along the sciatic nerve of the thigh, and heart pain radiating to the left shoulder and inner left arm.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>引痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>彻痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>牵扯痛临床常</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
