    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头部生疮肿脓疡。见于湿热证，或蝼蛄疖、小儿暑疖、暑热、胎毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head region growing sore swelling pus. Seen in dampness-heat pattern; summerheat with heat pattern. [证候待译:蝼蛄疖/小儿暑疖/胎毒] [未译片段:疡]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF9G</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Bladder dampness-heat pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头部生疮疡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
