    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">语声高亢洪亮有力。见于阳、实、热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The voice is high-pitched, resonant and forceful. Seen in yang, excess and heat patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
