    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urine profuse amount like clear urine like fluid. Seen in kidney qi insecurity pattern; wasting-thirst (diabetes mellitus). [证候待译:肾阳虚证/尿崩] [未译片段:崩]</tcm:definition>
