    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abscess and ulcer swelling soft at. Seen in blood heat with stagnation pattern; hemangioma; pestilential ding (cutaneous anthrax); lipoma/sarcoma. [证候待译:气滞痰凝证/痰肿/痰包/手足部胶瘤/气瘤] [未译片段:绵]</tcm:definition>
