    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小儿在生长发育过程中开始学说话较晚。见于心血亏虚证、气血两虚证，或疳病、呆小病、小儿痴呆、解颅、痫病、血劳、佝偻病、早产等。又称语迟。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A child begins learning to speak later than expected during growth and development. Seen in heart blood deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or gan-malnutrition disease, cretinism (daixiaobing), childhood dementia, cranial fissure non-closure, epilepsy, blood taxation, rickets, or premature birth. Also known as delayed speech (yuchi).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>语迟</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000750</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:5200038</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>229721007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>deficiency of speech development</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>29164008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>deficiency of speech development</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>62415009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>deficiency of speech development</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_小儿言语迟缓</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A child begins learning to speak later than expected during growth and development. Seen in heart blood deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or gan-malnutrition disease, cretinism (daixiaobing), childhood dementia, cranial fissure non-closure, epilepsy, blood taxation, rickets, or premature birth. Also known as delayed speech (yuchi).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>语迟</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
