    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现边界不清或呈弥漫性疮肿。见于郁证、气郁、血郁、痰郁、气结痰凝证，或痈、丹毒、无头疽、流注、气瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of ill-defined border or presenting as sore swelling. Seen in depression pattern; qi depression pattern; erysipelas; liuzhu (metastatic abscess); qi goiter (simple goiter). [证候待译:血郁/痰郁/气结痰凝证/痈/无头疽] [未译片段:弥漫性]</tcm:definition>
