    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛表面似有玉粒样的小泡样颗粒。见于肺经燥热证、肺阴虚证、肺火亢盛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">White of the eye surface with -like small -like granules. Seen in lung channel dryness with heat pattern; lung fire with hyperactivity pattern. [证候待译:肺阴虚证] [未译片段:似玉粒泡]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.79</tcm:reference>
