    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉发热，伴心胸烦闷，烦躁不安。见于热结胸胁、阴虚、气郁、脏燥等病证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever accompanied by chest (cardiac region) stuffiness irritability and restlessness restless. Seen in yin deficiency pattern; qi depression pattern. [证候待译:热结胸胁/脏燥等病证] [未译片段:自觉烦]</tcm:definition>
