    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">唇部上长有疮疡，红肿疼痛。见于风热夹湿证、脾胃积热证、肝郁化火证、瘀血留滞证、虚火灼口等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lip growing sores and ulcers red swelling pain. Seen in wind-heat with with with dampness pattern; spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern; liver depression with transforming into fire pattern. [证候待译:瘀血留滞证/虚火灼口] [未译片段:上]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.93</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_唇上生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
