    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脊柱过度后弯，致使前胸塌陷的症状。见于肾气亏虚、肝肾亏虚证，或发育异常、久病咳喘、脊柱病患、瘀滞筋骨证、龟背痰等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Excessive posterior curvature of the spine causing collapse of the anterior chest (kyphosis). Seen in kidney qi deficiency, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, or developmental abnormality, chronic cough-wheeze, spinal disorders, stasis stagnating in the sinews and bones pattern, or turtle-back phlegm (spinal tuberculosis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>414564002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>gibbus deformity</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>298393001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>cervical kyphosis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>53406005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>calve disease</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>FA70.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kyphosis</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>FC01.2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Post radiation kyphosis</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>FC01.3</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Postlaminectomy kyphosis</tcm:icd11Term>
  
