    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹疱腔内充满液体，饱涨。见于湿热内蕴证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The vesicles of the eruption are fully distended with fluid in their cavities. Seen in dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.41</tcm:reference>
