    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼内、目珠疼痛，或眼眶疼痛不适。见于眼疾病、风热犯目证（风热壅盛）或虚火上炎证、里实热证。又称眼痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eye inside eyeball pain or eye pain not. Seen in deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern. [证候待译:眼疾病/风热犯目证（风热壅盛）/里实热证] [又称:眼痛] [未译片段:眶适]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>眼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0200026</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>409667008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Eye pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
