    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发柔软干枯，韧性差，容易断裂。见于血热化燥证、脾气虚证、气血两虚证，或疳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The hair is soft, dry and brittle with poor resilience, breaking easily. Seen in blood heat transforming into dryness pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or gan-malnutrition disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.22</tcm:reference>
