    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胞睑内生核状硬结，逐渐长大，而又不红不肿。见于肉轮痰湿证、痰热搏结证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid inside growing -like induration long large not red not swelling. [证候待译:肉轮痰湿证/痰热搏结证] [未译片段:核逐渐又]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0010604</tcm:hpoID>
