    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">双下肢大腿和／或小腿软弱，不任步行。见于外感湿邪风毒证、湿热下注证、津血亏虚证、经络壅阻证，或痿躄、脚气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Weakness of the thighs and/or calves of both lower limbs, unable to bear walking. Seen in externally contracted dampness pathogen with wind toxin pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, fluid-blood deficiency pattern, channel obstruction pattern, or flaccidity lameness (weibi) and beriberi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腿软</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Weakness of the thighs and/or calves of both lower limbs, unable to bear walking. Seen in externally contracted dampness pathogen with wind toxin pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, fluid-blood deficiency pattern, channel obstruction pattern, or flaccidity lameness (weibi) and beriberi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
