    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">喜欢进食酸味食物，或经常饮酸味饮料，或喜食酸味零食。见于胃阴虚证、肝郁气滞证，或妊娠、个人饮食习惯。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Craving for sour foods, frequent drinking of sour beverages, or fondness for sour snacks. Seen in stomach yin deficiency pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, or pregnancy and personal dietary habits.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_嗜酸</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Craving for sour foods, frequent drinking of sour beverages, or fondness for sour snacks. Seen in stomach yin deficiency pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, or pregnancy and personal dietary habits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
