    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">食物或水饮自口腔吐出，常与恶心并见。见于寒邪犯胃证、食滞胃肠证、胃热炽盛证、寒饮停胃证、肝胃不和证、脾胃气虚证、脾胃阳虚证、胃阴虚证、湿热蕴脾证、暑湿内蕴证、虫扰胆膈证，或妊娠恶阻、胆瘅、肝瘟、胃反、食管瘅、胃郁、食物中毒、类霍乱、伤食等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food mass or fluid drink oral cavity and nausea co-occurring. Seen in food stagnation and stomach and intestines disorder pattern; liver and stomach disharmony pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach yang deficiency pattern; summerheat with dampness with internal accumulation pattern; stomach depression pattern. [证候待译:寒邪犯胃证/胃热炽盛证/寒饮停胃证/胃阴虚证/湿热蕴脾证/虫扰胆膈证] [未译片段:自吐出常]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002013</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>422400008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Vomiting</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD90</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Nausea or vomiting</tcm:icd11Term>
  
