    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">性欲低下，甚至毫无兴趣。见于痰阻中焦证、瘀血阻络证、脾胃气虚证、肾气亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Low or even absent sexual desire. Seen in phlegm obstructing the middle jiao pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, or kidney qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>性欲减退</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MB22.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Decreased libido</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_性欲淡漠</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Low or even absent sexual desire. Seen in phlegm obstructing the middle jiao pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, or kidney qi deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>性欲减退</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MB22.1</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
