    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼部分泌物粘稠胶结成块。见于肉轮血瘀证、风重于热证、血轮实热证，或胬肉攀睛、赤脉传睛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sticky eye discharge cemented into lumps. Seen in flesh-wheel (eyelid) blood stasis pattern, wind predominating over heat pattern, blood-wheel (canthus) excess heat pattern, or pterygium climbing the eye and red vessels spreading over the eye.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.61</tcm:reference>
