    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女在行经期间出现感冒症状，如鼻塞、流涕、头痛、恶风寒发热等。常兼风寒证、风热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cold symptoms such as nasal congestion, runny nose, headache, aversion to wind-cold and fever occurring during menstruation. Often combined with wind-cold pattern or wind-heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.66</tcm:reference>
