    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行感冒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cold symptoms such as nasal congestion, runny nose, headache, aversion to wind-cold and fever occurring during menstruation. Often combined with wind-cold pattern or wind-heat pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
