    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">嗜食生米、泥土、纸张、煤炭等异物。见于蛔虫证、虫积证、脾虚食积证，或疳病、虫积等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Craving and eating foreign substances such as raw rice, earth, paper or coal (pica). Seen in roundworm pattern, worm accumulation pattern, spleen deficiency with food accumulation pattern, or gan-malnutrition disease and worm accumulation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
