    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便过程中突然中断。见于热结膀胱证、下焦湿热证、下焦瘀滞证，或石淋等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urination suddenly interrupts mid-stream. Seen in heat binding the bladder pattern, lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, lower-jiao stasis stagnation pattern, or stone strangury (shilin/urolithiasis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.77</tcm:reference>
