    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇失其红润光泽，而呈现青紫、淡紫或黯紫色。见于脾阳虚证、寒犯少阴证、痰浊阻肺证、气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips red glossy presenting as appearing bluish-purple pale purple or purple colored. Seen in phlegm-turbidity with obstruction and lung disorder pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:脾阳虚证/寒犯少阴证] [未译片段:失其润黯]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.55</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
