    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿咀嚼食物时酸弱无力。见于风寒外袭证、风热侵袭证、胃火炽盛证、虚火上炎证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth chewing food mass weakness. Seen in wind-cold with external invasion pattern; wind-heat with invasion pattern; deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern. [证候待译:胃火炽盛证] [未译片段:时酸弱]</tcm:definition>
