    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">声音嘶哑，重则声哑不出，语而无声。见于外感风寒证、外感风热证、火热袭肺证、肝气犯肺证、肾虚证、脾气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hoarseness; in severe cases the voice is completely lost so that speaking produces no sound (aphonia). Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, externally contracted wind-heat pattern, fire-heat attacking the lung pattern, liver qi invading the lung pattern, kidney deficiency pattern, or spleen qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>喉喑</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>喑</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001686</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>441913003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>aphonia</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>44564008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>aphonia</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
