    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸频率快，或伴气喘。见于表寒肺热证、痰热壅肺证、痰气互结证、心气虚证、肺气虚证，或哮喘、肺炎咳嗽、肺痈、高热热病等。又称气促。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rapid respiratory rate, sometimes accompanied by wheezing. Seen in exterior cold with lung heat pattern, phlegm-heat congesting the lung pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, heart qi deficiency pattern, lung qi deficiency pattern, or asthma, pneumonia cough, lung abscess, or high-fever diseases. Also known as shortness of breath (qicu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>气促</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002789</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271823003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>increased respiratory rate or depth of breathing</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>68978004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>hyperventilation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SF80</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Lung qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呼吸急促</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Rapid respiratory rate, sometimes accompanied by wheezing. Seen in exterior cold with lung heat pattern, phlegm-heat congesting the lung pattern, phlegm-qi intermingling pattern, heart qi deficiency pattern, lung qi deficiency pattern, or asthma, pneumonia cough, lung abscess, or high-fever diseases. Also known as shortness of breath (qicu).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>气促</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0002789</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
