    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤高突肿起。见于湿热蕴结证、气滞肌表证、寒湿凝滞证、气虚血瘀证、脾肾阳虚证、阳虚水泛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin raised protrusion swollen. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; cold-dampness with congelation pattern; qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:气滞肌表证/阳虚水泛证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.80</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤肿胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin raised protrusion swollen. Seen in dampness-heat with accumulation and binding pattern; cold-dampness with congelation pattern; qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:气滞肌表证/阳虚水泛证]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
