    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡硬如石，推之不动。见于郁肿，或乳岩、失荣、肾岩、翻花疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores and ulcers hard like not movement. Seen in breast rock-cancer (breast cancer); shirong (cervical malignancy). [证候待译:郁肿/肾岩/翻花疮] [未译片段:石推]</tcm:definition>
