    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">婴儿出生后，未至1岁，囟门即闭合，甚则头小。见于肾虚髓亏证、脾虚失调证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The infant's fontanelle closes before the age of one year, sometimes with a small head. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, or spleen deficiency disorder pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
