    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉七窍不利，头脑不清爽。见于风湿上阻证、湿阻清阳证、痰湿犯头证等。可与胀并见，或与沉重、头昏并见。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective stuffiness with sluggishness of the seven orifices and an unclear, unrefreshed head. Seen in wind-dampness obstructing upward pattern, dampness obstructing clear yang pattern, or phlegm-dampness invading the head pattern. May co-occur with distension, heaviness or dizziness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
