    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SG80</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Dampness obstructing the defense yang pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头闷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective stuffiness with sluggishness of the seven orifices and an unclear, unrefreshed head. Seen in wind-dampness obstructing upward pattern, dampness obstructing clear yang pattern, or phlegm-dampness invading the head pattern. May co-occur with distension, heaviness or dizziness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SG80</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
