      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">因声音嘶哑而语言难出。见于外感风寒或风热证、痰湿壅肺证、阴虚火旺证，或暴喑、久喑、声带瘫痪、金创失音、急喉风、血溢声户证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Speech is difficult to produce due to hoarseness. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold or wind-heat pattern, phlegm-dampness congesting the lung pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or sudden aphonia (baoyin), chronic aphonia, vocal cord paralysis, metal-wound aphonia, acute throat wind (laryngeal emergency), or blood flooding the voice door pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_语声难出</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Speech is difficult to produce due to hoarseness. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold or wind-heat pattern, phlegm-dampness congesting the lung pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or sudden aphonia (baoyin), chronic aphonia, vocal cord paralysis, metal-wound aphonia, acute throat wind (laryngeal emergency), or blood flooding the voice door pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
