    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">非妊娠期却见乳房分泌乳样液体并伴有闭经，或停止哺乳（半年后）仍长期持续乳溢。见于肝胃不和、肝气郁结、阳明经气旺盛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Breast secretion of milk-like fluid accompanied by amenorrhea in a non-pregnant woman, or long-persistent galactorrhea after stopping breastfeeding (for half a year). Seen in liver-stomach disharmony, liver qi depression, or exuberant yangming channel qi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.45</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000788</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>14302001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Amenorrhea</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>GA20.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Absence of menstruation</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_闭经溢乳</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Breast secretion of milk-like fluid accompanied by amenorrhea in a non-pregnant woman, or long-persistent galactorrhea after stopping breastfeeding (for half a year). Seen in liver-stomach disharmony, liver qi depression, or exuberant yangming channel qi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
