    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽后壁充血，颜色鲜红或暗红。见于肺胃热盛证、肾阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pharynx congestion/hyperemia colored bright red or dark red. Seen in lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:肾阴虚火旺证] [未译片段:后壁颜]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.64</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽部赤丝缕缕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pharynx congestion/hyperemia colored bright red or dark red. Seen in lung stomach heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:肾阴虚火旺证] [未译片段:后壁颜]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
