    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两手心、足心发热，且伴心胸烦热，体温不升高。见于阴虚火旺证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Heat sensation in the palms and soles together with vexing heat in the heart and chest, without elevated body temperature. Seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_五心烦热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Heat sensation in the palms and soles together with vexing heat in the heart and chest, without elevated body temperature. Seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
