    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉肛门局部下坠，发胀。见于湿热下注证、气滞血瘀证、肝气郁结证、脾气下陷证、湿热内蕴证、肛门热毒证、气血两虚证、火毒内陷证，或肛周痈疽、肛裂、痔疮、锁肛痔、脏毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bearing-down sensation in the local anal region distending. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; liver qi depression and binding pattern; spleen qi sinking pattern; dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; perianal abscess; anal fissure; hemorrhoids; anorectal cancer; zangdu (perianal abscess). [证候待译:肛门热毒证/火毒内陷证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肛门坠胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Bearing-down sensation in the local anal region distending. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; liver qi depression and binding pattern; spleen qi sinking pattern; dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; perianal abscess; anal fissure; hemorrhoids; anorectal cancer; zangdu (perianal abscess). [证候待译:肛门热毒证/火毒内陷证]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
