    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉眼部干涩，欠润。见于脾气虚证、肝热脾虚证、脾肾阳虚证，或疳眼等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective dryness and lack of moisture of the eyes. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, liver heat with spleen deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, or gan-eye (xerophthalmia from malnutrition).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>眼干涩</tcm:synonym>
