    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective dryness and lack of moisture of the eyes. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, liver heat with spleen deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, or gan-eye (xerophthalmia from malnutrition).</obo:IAO_0000115>
