    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌面水液过多，扪之湿而滑利，甚则流涎欲滴。为水湿之邪内聚的征象。见于寒证、湿证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Excessive moisture on the tongue surface, feeling wet and slippery to the touch, even with drooling saliva—a sign of internal accumulation of water-dampness pathogen. Seen in cold patterns and dampness patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.102</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔滑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
