    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔黄而干涩，中有裂纹如花瓣形。见于邪热伤津，燥结腑实证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A yellow, dry and astringent tongue coating with petal-shaped cracks in the center. Seen in pathogenic heat damaging fluids, or dryness binding with bowel excess pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.65</tcm:reference>
