    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">骤然一眼或双眼视力迅速下降，以致视力丧失的症状。多见于肝气上逆证、肝火上亢证，或脉道瘀滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden rapid loss of vision in one or both eyes, up to complete blindness. Mostly seen in liver qi counterflow upward pattern, liver fire hyperactivity pattern, or vessel stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>9D90.6</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blindness</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_暴盲</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sudden rapid loss of vision in one or both eyes, up to complete blindness. Mostly seen in liver qi counterflow upward pattern, liver fire hyperactivity pattern, or vessel stasis pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:9D90.6</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
