    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉口舌腻滞不爽，甚或涩滞，影响味觉。见于脾虚湿困证、脾胃湿热证、痰热内扰证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective greasy, sticky, unpleasant sensation in the mouth and tongue, even astringent, affecting the sense of taste. Seen in spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, or phlegm-heat internal harassment pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
