    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective greasy, sticky, unpleasant sensation in the mouth and tongue, even astringent, affecting the sense of taste. Seen in spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, or phlegm-heat internal harassment pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0031249</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
