    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身及四肢肌肉酸软，或伴无力。见于外感表证、气虚证、气血两虚证、湿阻证等，或感冒、神劳、血劳、瘿劳、肌痿、心衰、痹证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body and limbs muscle soreness and weakness or accompanied by weakness. Seen in qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; dampness with obstruction pattern; common cold. [证候待译:外感表证/神劳/血劳/瘿劳/肌痿/心衰] [未译片段:自觉]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0003324</tcm:hpoID>
