      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉在筋肉之间，乍疏乍密，如解乱绳索，时快时慢，散乱无序。见于肾气亡、命门绝。为无神脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse between the sinews and flesh, now sparse now dense, like untwisting a tangled rope—fast and slow in scattered disorder. Seen in expiration of kidney qi and extinction of the life gate; a pulse devoid of spirit.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_解索脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse between the sinews and flesh, now sparse now dense, like untwisting a tangled rope—fast and slow in scattered disorder. Seen in expiration of kidney qi and extinction of the life gate; a pulse devoid of spirit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
