    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Limbs swelling colored presenting as bluish-purple or dark purple. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:外伤疾病] [未译片段:皮]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.90</tcm:reference>
