    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">长期发热不止，热势不高（体温一般小于39℃）。见于气虚、阴虚、气郁血瘀等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Prolonged, unremitting low-grade fever (temperature generally below 39°C). Seen in qi deficiency, yin deficiency, or qi depression with blood stasis patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.7</tcm:reference>
