    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">某局部皮肤发热，触之皮温较高。见于局部疮疡、疖肿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A local skin area feels hot, with elevated skin temperature on touch. Seen in local sores/ulcers or boils.</tcm:definition>
