    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睑胞虚浮肿胀。见于肉轮气虚证、脾肾阳虚证、脾气虚证、心脾气血两虚证，或更年期妇女等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Puffy swelling of the eyelids. Seen in flesh-wheel (eyelid) qi deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or in menopausal women.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
