      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸骨下部明显前突，胸廓前后径长而左右径短，肋骨侧壁凹陷，形似鸡胸。见于先天不足、肾精不足证，或佝偻病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Marked anterior protrusion of the lower sternum, with an anteroposteriorly long and laterally short thorax and depressed lateral rib walls, resembling a pigeon's breast. Seen in congenital insufficiency, kidney essence insufficiency pattern, or rickets.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>205101001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>pectus carinatum</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鸡胸</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Marked anterior protrusion of the lower sternum, with an anteroposteriorly long and laterally short thorax and depressed lateral rib walls, resembling a pigeon's breast. Seen in congenital insufficiency, kidney essence insufficiency pattern, or rickets.</obo:IAO_0000115>
