      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视物时眼前有灰色阴影，昏暗不明，模糊不清。见于水轮湿热证、水轮阴虚证、水轮气滞血瘀证、水轮水湿停聚证、水轮气虚血亏证、水轮阴亏证、水轮气虚证，或睛黄视渺、混睛障、视瞻昏渺、五风内障、圆翳内障等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A gray shadow before the eyes when looking at things, dim, obscure and blurred. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel yin deficiency pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel water-dampness retention pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency pattern, or yellow-eye dim vision, mixed-eye opacity, dim and hazy vision, five-wind internal oculopathy (glaucoma), or round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_视物昏蒙</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A gray shadow before the eyes when looking at things, dim, obscure and blurred. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel yin deficiency pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel water-dampness retention pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency pattern, or yellow-eye dim vision, mixed-eye opacity, dim and hazy vision, five-wind internal oculopathy (glaucoma), or round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#DampnessEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
