    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bowel sounds weaker than normal on abdominal auscultation with a stethoscope. Seen in drum distension, intestinal binding (obstruction), or heat toxin accumulating in the intestines, intestinal stasis stagnation, or water-rheum retention patterns.</tcm:definition>
