    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足部筋肉弛缓，无力。见于脾虚气陷证、气血两虚证、肝肾亏虚证、热毒蕴结肌肤证、湿热阻络证、瘀血阻络证，或痿躄、软脚瘟等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Foot region vessels/sinews flesh weakness. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; liver and kidney deficiency pattern. [证候待译:热毒蕴结肌肤证/湿热阻络证/瘀血阻络证/痿躄/软脚瘟] [未译片段:弛缓]</tcm:definition>
