    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood dark purple and not fresh in color. Seen in phlegm-heat internal binding pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, cold pathogen congealing pattern, blood deficiency with cold, or dry-blood consumption (ganxuelao).</tcm:definition>
