    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉势绷紧急，紧张有力，如牵绳转索。见于寒证、风寒表突征，或疼痛、惊风、宿食等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A tense, tight and forceful pulse, like pulling or twisting a rope. Seen in cold patterns, wind-cold exterior patterns, or pain, fright wind (infantile convulsion), and retained food.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉紧</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A tense, tight and forceful pulse, like pulling or twisting a rope. Seen in cold patterns, wind-cold exterior patterns, or pain, fright wind (infantile convulsion), and retained food.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
