    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇瘙痒，或伴肿胀，或伴干裂。见于胃火炽盛证、心脾积热证、燥证，或唇风。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips itching or accompanied by swelling or accompanied by. Seen in heart and spleen accumulation with heat pattern; dryness pattern; lip wind (cheilitis). [证候待译:胃火炽盛证] [未译片段:干裂]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_唇痒</oboInOwl:id>
