    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">突然发生的剧烈咳嗽，似有异物剌激。见于燥邪犯肺证、肺气阴两虚证，或百日咳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden severe cough as if irritated by a foreign body. Seen in dryness pathogen invading the lung pattern; lung qi-yin dual deficiency pattern; whooping cough (pertussis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.26</tcm:reference>
