    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉四肢关节寒冷，可伴恶风寒。见于风寒湿邪痹阻关节证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective coldness of the limb joints, possibly accompanied by aversion to wind-cold. Seen in wind-cold-dampness pathogen blocking the joints pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.10</tcm:reference>
