    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢末端皮肤紫暗，或青暗，多伴四肢厥冷。见于脾阳虚、肝气郁滞，或厥证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Limbs skin dark purple or bluish profuse accompanied by cold limbs (reversal). Seen in liver qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:脾阳虚/厥证] [未译片段:末端暗]</tcm:definition>
