    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小儿猝然惊哭或梦中啼哭，声音尖短。见于惊恐伤神证，或客忤、蛲虫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A child's sudden frightened crying or crying during sleep, with a sharp, short voice. Seen in fright damaging the spirit pattern, or guest-watching disorder (kewu/fright in infants) and oxyuriasis (pinworm disease).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.35</tcm:reference>
