    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇部干燥脱皮。见于里实热证、阴虚火旺证、血瘀证、虚寒证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips region dryness skin peeling. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; blood stasis pattern; deficiency-cold pattern. [证候待译:里实热证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.81</tcm:reference>
