    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在前臂或小腿内侧出现一条纵行红线，向肢体近端蔓延走窜。见于毒热郁滞、热毒炽盛证、毒入血分证，或疔疮走红、红丝疔、血丝疔、红线疔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A longitudinal red streak on the inner forearm or lower leg, spreading and creeping toward the proximal limb. Seen in toxin-heat stagnation, heat toxin blazing pattern, toxin entering the blood level pattern, or spreading nail-boil (dingchuang zouhong), red-thread boil, or blood-thread boil.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.64</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
