    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤丝状红缕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A longitudinal red streak on the inner forearm or lower leg, spreading and creeping toward the proximal limb. Seen in toxin-heat stagnation, heat toxin blazing pattern, toxin entering the blood level pattern, or spreading nail-boil (dingchuang zouhong), red-thread boil, or blood-thread boil.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
