    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">整个头部疼痛。见于外感疾病、邪犯头颅或瘀滞脑络等病证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the whole head. Seen in externally contracted diseases, pathogen invading the skull, or stasis stagnating in the brain collaterals.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.12</tcm:reference>
