    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胁及胁下的一侧或两侧疼痛。见于肝胆及其经脉病变，如肝胆湿热证、血瘀证、肝气郁结证、肝胆火炽证、肝阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain on one or both sides of the hypochondrium and subcostal region. Seen in disorders of the liver, gallbladder and their channels, such as liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, blood stasis pattern, liver qi depression pattern, liver-gallbladder blazing fire pattern, or liver yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.50</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>胁肋疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0006649</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>297217002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Flank pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD81</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Abdominal pain</tcm:icd11Term>
  
