    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain on one or both sides of the hypochondrium and subcostal region. Seen in disorders of the liver, gallbladder and their channels, such as liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, blood stasis pattern, liver qi depression pattern, liver-gallbladder blazing fire pattern, or liver yin deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
