    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃气上逆，喉内似有气上冲，呃呃作响，不能自我控制。见于脾胃气虚证、痰气阻膈证等。呃逆为膈肌痉挛所致，又称哕。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stomach qi ascending counterflow, with qi seeming to rush up in the throat producing hiccup sounds beyond self-control. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, or phlegm-qi obstructing the diaphragm pattern. Hiccup results from diaphragmatic spasm; also called yue.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>哕</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100247</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>65958008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>hiccup</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
