    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">因手部肌肉痿软无力致使手下垂不能抬起。见于湿热阻络证、脾虚气陷证、脾虚营亏证、气阴亏虚证、脾肾阳虚证，或肌痿、肉痿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Due to hand region muscle flaccid weakness hand sagging/ptosis inability rising. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; qi and yin deficiency pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:湿热阻络证/脾虚营亏证/肌痿/肉痿] [未译片段:致使抬]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
