    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">附睾附近出现睾丸肿胀疼痛，有硬结肿块。见于痰热内郁证、阴虚火旺证、气血两虚证，或睾丸结核、子岩等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Appearance of testicle swelling pain with induration mass. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:痰热内郁证/睾丸结核/子岩] [未译片段:附睾附近]</tcm:definition>
