      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神较正常开大，展缩失灵，甚则风轮反为窄窄一周如线者。见于水轮郁火证、水轮风火证、水轮痰火证、阳虚饮邪上泛证、肝肾阴虚证、气血瘀滞证，或绿风内障、目系炎性暴盲、青盲、五风内障、头眼部外伤、濒临死亡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pupil is abnormally dilated with loss of contraction and expansion, in severe cases leaving only a narrow thread-like rim of the iris. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) depressed fire pattern, water-wheel wind-fire pattern, water-wheel phlegm-fire pattern, yang deficiency with rheum pathogen flooding upward pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or green-wind internal oculopathy (acute angle-closure glaucoma), inflammatory sudden blindness of the optic system, blue blindness (optic atrophy), five-wind internal oculopathy, head/eye trauma, or impending death.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.94</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0011499</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>37125009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>dilated pupil</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_瞳神散大</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The pupil is abnormally dilated with loss of contraction and expansion, in severe cases leaving only a narrow thread-like rim of the iris. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) depressed fire pattern, water-wheel wind-fire pattern, water-wheel phlegm-fire pattern, yang deficiency with rheum pathogen flooding upward pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or green-wind internal oculopathy (acute angle-closure glaucoma), inflammatory sudden blindness of the optic system, blue blindness (optic atrophy), five-wind internal oculopathy, head/eye trauma, or impending death.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0011499</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011499"/>
