    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指双肩上抬。见于肺气虚证、肺肾气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Elevation of both shoulders. Seen in lung qi deficiency pattern, or lung-kidney qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
