    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视正物而发生倾斜。见于肝郁血滞证、脾失健运证、肝肾阴亏证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Straight objects appear tilted. Seen in liver depression with blood stagnation pattern, spleen failing in transport pattern, or liver-kidney yin depletion pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_视正反斜</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Straight objects appear tilted. Seen in liver depression with blood stagnation pattern, spleen failing in transport pattern, or liver-kidney yin depletion pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
