    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌质由淡紫转蓝，舌苔由淡灰转黑，或苔白如霉点、糜点。主病危重难治。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue proper turns from pale purple to blue, and the coating from pale gray to black, or a white coating like mold or thrush spots—indicates critical illness difficult to treat.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌蓝</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The tongue proper turns from pale purple to blue, and the coating from pale gray to black, or a white coating like mold or thrush spots—indicates critical illness difficult to treat.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
