    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌系带短小，舌卷不伸。多为光天性。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A short lingual frenulum with the tongue curled and unable to be extended (ankyloglossia/tongue-tie); mostly congenital.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
