    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后眩晕，或伴血压高、水肿。见于妊娠眩晕。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dizziness occurring after conception, sometimes accompanied by elevated blood pressure and edema. Seen in gestational dizziness.</tcm:definition>
