    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉咽喉梗塞不适，如有物梗，伴有灼热感。见于阴虚肝郁证，或妇女更年期等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A subjective feeling of obstruction and discomfort in the throat, as if a roasted morsel were stuck there, accompanied by a burning sensation. Seen in yin deficiency with liver depression pattern, or in menopausal women.</tcm:definition>
