    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢骨折后，出现异常被动活动。见于骨折。又称假关节形成。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abnormal passive movement of a limb after fracture. Seen in fracture. Also known as pseudoarthrosis formation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.78</tcm:reference>
