    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足月妊娠，腹痛，但产程延长，胎儿不能顺利降生。又称滞生。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Full-term pregnancy with abdominal pain but a prolonged course of labor, the fetus failing to be delivered smoothly (dystocia). Also known as stalled delivery.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>滞生</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0011413</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>2267009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Obstructed labor</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>JB06</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Obstructed labour</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_难产</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Full-term pregnancy with abdominal pain but a prolonged course of labor, the fetus failing to be delivered smoothly (dystocia). Also known as stalled delivery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>滞生</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0011413</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
