    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部胀大坚满，青筋怒张。见于热毒瘀肝证、肝脾痰结证、肝脾瘀滞证、血虚夹瘀证、湿热蕴脾证、寒湿困脾证、肝郁脾虚证、脾肾阳虚证、肝肾阴虚证，或肝积、肝痨、肝癌、脂膜痨、肥气、臌胀、蛊虫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdomen distension large hard and full blue vessels (varicose veins) engorgement. Seen in liver and spleen stagnation pattern; cold-dampness with encumbrance and spleen disorder pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; liver accumulation pattern. [证候待译:热毒瘀肝证/肝脾痰结证/血虚夹瘀证/湿热蕴脾证/肝郁脾虚证/肝痨]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>腹壁青筋暴露</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腹部青筋暴露</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Abdomen distension large hard and full blue vessels (varicose veins) engorgement. Seen in liver and spleen stagnation pattern; cold-dampness with encumbrance and spleen disorder pattern; spleen and kidney yang deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; liver accumulation pattern. [证候待译:热毒瘀肝证/肝脾痰结证/血虚夹瘀证/湿热蕴脾证/肝郁脾虚证/肝痨]</obo:IAO_0000115>
