    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">看见食物或油腻，即感恶心欲呕或呕吐，不欲进食。见于肝胆湿热证，或妊娠恶阻、胆瘅、肝热病、肝瘟等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Seen food mass or greasy food nausea vomiting or vomiting not taking food. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; liver-heat disease. [证候待译:妊娠恶阻/胆瘅/肝瘟] [未译片段:看即感欲欲]</tcm:definition>
