    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每于行经时期发生呕吐，经后自然缓解。见于脾胃气虚、胃气上逆、痰湿阻滞、肝脾不调证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting occurring during each menstrual period and resolving spontaneously afterward. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency, stomach qi ascending counterflow, phlegm-dampness obstruction, or liver-spleen disharmony pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.63</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>药物副作用</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行呕吐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Vomiting occurring during each menstrual period and resolving spontaneously afterward. Seen in spleen-stomach qi deficiency, stomach qi ascending counterflow, phlegm-dampness obstruction, or liver-spleen disharmony pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
