    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">透过舌苔能隐隐见到舌体的苔。见于平人、表邪初起。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A coating so thin that the tongue body is faintly visible through it. Seen in healthy persons, or at the onset of an exterior pathogen.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.92</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔薄</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A coating so thin that the tongue body is faintly visible through it. Seen in healthy persons, or at the onset of an exterior pathogen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
