        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胸部一侧或两侧乳房部位疼痛，或有明显周期性。见于肝郁气滞证、痰气阻闭证，或乳痈、乳癖等。又称乳痛。逢经前或月经期乳房发胀疼痛，称经期乳痛，见于肝气郁结、气滞血瘀，或乳癖等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in one or both breasts, sometimes with an obvious periodicity. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi obstruction pattern, or breast abscess (ruyong/mastitis) and breast lump (rupi/fibrocystic disease). Also known as breast pain. Distending breast pain before or during menstruation is called menstrual breast pain, seen in liver qi depression, qi stagnation with blood stasis, or breast lump.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>乳痛逢经前或月经期乳房发胀疼痛，经期乳痛，</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_乳房疼痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain in one or both breasts, sometimes with an obvious periodicity. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi obstruction pattern, or breast abscess (ruyong/mastitis) and breast lump (rupi/fibrocystic disease). Also known as breast pain. Distending breast pain before or during menstruation is called menstrual breast pain, seen in liver qi depression, qi stagnation with blood stasis, or breast lump.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>乳痛逢经前或月经期乳房发胀疼痛，经期乳痛，</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
