    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉患侧（或左侧，或右侧半身）身体发胀不适。见于中风、风湿等。又称患侧半身胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Or left-sided or right-sided hemibody body distending not. Seen in wind stroke (apoplexy); wind-dampness pattern. [又称:患侧半身胀] [未译片段:自觉患侧适]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>患侧半身胀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_患病半身发胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Or left-sided or right-sided hemibody body distending not. Seen in wind stroke (apoplexy); wind-dampness pattern. [又称:患侧半身胀] [未译片段:自觉患侧适]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>患侧半身胀</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
