    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来浮大涣散，按之消失，伴节律不齐或脉力不匀。见于气虚证、血虚证、元气离散，或心脏疾病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A floating, large, scattered pulse that disappears on pressure, with irregular rhythm or uneven force. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, blood deficiency pattern, dissipation of primal qi, or heart diseases.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉散</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A floating, large, scattered pulse that disappears on pressure, with irregular rhythm or uneven force. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, blood deficiency pattern, dissipation of primal qi, or heart diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
