    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮痈扩展快，向周围蔓延。见于风热壅盛证、肝经湿热证、湿热下注证、热毒炽盛证，或丹毒、颈痈、有头疽等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The sore/abscess expands rapidly, spreading to the surroundings. Seen in wind-heat congestion pattern, liver channel dampness-heat pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, heat toxin blazing pattern, or erysipelas (dandu), neck abscess, or headed carbuncle.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痈肿漫延</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The sore/abscess expands rapidly, spreading to the surroundings. Seen in wind-heat congestion pattern, liver channel dampness-heat pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, heat toxin blazing pattern, or erysipelas (dandu), neck abscess, or headed carbuncle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
