    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">用指按压脓部即有脓液流出。见于脓已溃。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pus flows out when the purulent area is pressed with a finger. Seen when the pus has ulcerated through.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_指按有脓流出</oboInOwl:id>
