    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊皮肤溃烂。见于风热外袭证、湿热下注证，或脱囊、绣球风、囊痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum skin ulceration and festering. Seen in wind-heat with external invasion pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene); scrotal abscess. [证候待译:绣球风]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊皮肤溃烂</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Scrotum skin ulceration and festering. Seen in wind-heat with external invasion pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; tuonang (Fournier gangrene); scrotal abscess. [证候待译:绣球风]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
