    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">吞咽发音不适。见于肝郁气滞证、痰气阻膈证、热扰胸膈证、痰瘀阻膈证、津液亏虚证、脾胃虚寒证，或食道癌、梅核气、食管瘅、食管瘅、膈疝、心痹、心衰、软脚瘟、脑瘤、肉痉、肌痿、痿痹、风痱、颌下痛、上腭痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Discomfort in swallowing and phonation. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi obstructing the diaphragm pattern, heat harassing the chest-diaphragm pattern, phlegm-stasis obstructing the diaphragm pattern, fluid depletion pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, or esophageal cancer, plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis), esophageal inflammation, diaphragmatic hernia, heart impediment, heart failure, soft-leg pestilence, brain tumor, flesh spasm, muscle atrophy, atrophy-impediment, wind feebleness, submandibular pain, or upper-palate abscess.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉不利</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Discomfort in swallowing and phonation. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi obstructing the diaphragm pattern, heat harassing the chest-diaphragm pattern, phlegm-stasis obstructing the diaphragm pattern, fluid depletion pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, or esophageal cancer, plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis), esophageal inflammation, diaphragmatic hernia, heart impediment, heart failure, soft-leg pestilence, brain tumor, flesh spasm, muscle atrophy, atrophy-impediment, wind feebleness, submandibular pain, or upper-palate abscess.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
