    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">溃疡愈合后形成的新生组织。见于较深部痈肿愈合，或烧烫伤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Newly formed tissue after an ulcer heals (scar). Seen after healing of deeper abscesses, or after burns and scalds.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.113</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XE0HG</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Residue after decontamination</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疮面愈后疤痕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Newly formed tissue after an ulcer heals (scar). Seen after healing of deeper abscesses, or after burns and scalds.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XE0HG</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#sx_眼前黑影">
