        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼前有点状、絮状黑影，可固定不动或飘动。漂浮不定，起病急骤者，见于湿热上蒸证或眼内出血；缓慢发生者见于肝肾不足证或气血亏虚证。固定不飘动者，多为早期圆翳内障，为肝肾亏虚所致。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dot-like or flocculent dark shadows before the eyes, either fixed or drifting. Drifting shadows of acute onset are seen in dampness-heat steaming upward pattern or intraocular hemorrhage; those of slow onset are seen in liver-kidney insufficiency pattern or qi-blood deficiency pattern. Fixed, non-drifting shadows mostly indicate early-stage round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract) caused by liver-kidney deficiency.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_眼前黑影</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dot-like or flocculent dark shadows before the eyes, either fixed or drifting. Drifting shadows of acute onset are seen in dampness-heat steaming upward pattern or intraocular hemorrhage; those of slow onset are seen in liver-kidney insufficiency pattern or qi-blood deficiency pattern. Fixed, non-drifting shadows mostly indicate early-stage round nebula internal oculopathy (cataract) caused by liver-kidney deficiency.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#DampnessEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
