    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒的程度较轻。可见于多种表证，如风寒初起、新感风热等证。又称微恶风寒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A mild degree of aversion to cold. Seen in various exterior patterns, such as early wind-cold invasion or newly contracted wind-heat. Also known as slight aversion to wind-cold.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>微恶风寒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_微恶寒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A mild degree of aversion to cold. Seen in various exterior patterns, such as early wind-cold invasion or newly contracted wind-heat. Also known as slight aversion to wind-cold.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>微恶风寒</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#ColdEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
