    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不甚发热（体温多未达高热，低于39℃），扪久才觉灼手，见于湿温、湿热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mild, uneffusive fever (temperature usually below 39°C) that only feels burning after prolonged palpation. Seen in damp-warmth (shi wen) or dampness-heat patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>身热，初按未觉热，久按热反甚</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0011134</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>304213008</tcm:snomedCT>
