    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mild, uneffusive fever (temperature usually below 39°C) that only feels burning after prolonged palpation. Seen in damp-warmth (shi wen) or dampness-heat patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>身热，初按未觉热，久按热反甚</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
