    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">粪便在肠道内滞留过久，干燥坚硬，排出困难，或排便次数少，通常在二、三天以上不大便。见于肠道气滞证、肠热腑实证、脾肺气虚证、脾肾阳虚证、寒滞肠道证、阴虚肠燥证、血虚肠燥证，或肠痹、脾约、肠结、肠癌、铅中毒、肠郁等。又称便秘。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Feces retained too long in the intestines, dry and hard with difficult evacuation, or infrequent defecation—usually no stool for two or three days or more. Seen in intestinal qi stagnation pattern, intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, spleen-lung qi deficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, cold stagnating in the intestines pattern, yin deficiency with intestinal dryness pattern, blood deficiency with intestinal dryness pattern, or intestinal impediment, spleen constraint (piyue), intestinal binding, intestinal cancer, lead poisoning, or intestinal depression. Also known as constipation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.55</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>便秘</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>便秘不畅</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002019</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>14760008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>constipation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>225595004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>constipation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>236069009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>chronic constipation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SA57</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Constipation disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>ME05.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Constipation</tcm:icd11Term>
  
