    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔滑腻，中有绿色，或青碧色。见于湿热疾饮，或阴伤肝绝。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A slippery, greasy coating with green or bluish-jade coloring in its midst. Seen in dampness-heat with phlegm-rheum, or yin damage with liver exhaustion.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.37</tcm:reference>
