    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一足或两足震颤动摇。见于血虚风动、风寒湿侵等。又称足颤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Trembling and shaking of one or both feet. Seen in blood deficiency with wind stirring, or wind-cold-dampness invasion. Also known as foot tremor.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.85</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>足颤</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002522</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_下肢颤抖</oboInOwl:id>
