    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胎儿娩出后，瘀血和浊液从阴道流出，颜色较淡。见于气虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid fluid discharged from the vagina is pale in color. Seen in qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
