    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red vessels starting from the inner or outer canthus and traversing the white of the eye. Seen in blood-wheel (canthus) excess heat pattern, or blood-wheel deficiency heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
