    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中出气臭秽，且带酸腐味，自觉或为他人所闻。多见于食滞胃肠证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Foul breath with a sour, putrid odor, noticed by the patient or by others. Mostly seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
