    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿上有黄色斑块。见于胃火炽盛证、肝胆湿热证，或黄疸、胃滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth with yellow colored macule. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; jaundice; stomach stagnation pattern. [证候待译:胃火炽盛证] [未译片段:上块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.97</tcm:reference>
