    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">虚里搏动明显，甚至隔着衣服也能看到。见于宗气外泄。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The xuli (apical) pulsation is so pronounced that it is visible even through clothing. Seen in outward leakage of ancestral (zong) qi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
