    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The xuli (apical) pulsation is so pronounced that it is visible even through clothing. Seen in outward leakage of ancestral (zong) qi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
