    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻部皮肤色泽正常，润泽。见于无病、病将愈。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The nasal skin has a normal, moist, lustrous complexion. Seen in the absence of disease, or when the disease is about to heal.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.1</tcm:reference>
