    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉动极为沉细，无法候及。见于久病、暴病、脉痹、外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The pulse is so extremely deep and faint that it cannot be palpated at all. Seen in chronic illness, fulminant illness, vessel impediment, or trauma.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0032554</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0031271</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_无脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The pulse is so extremely deep and faint that it cannot be palpated at all. Seen in chronic illness, fulminant illness, vessel impediment, or trauma.</obo:IAO_0000115>
