    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">产后由阴道排出的瘀浊败血，持续3周以上，仍淋漓不净。见于气虚证、血瘀证、血热证、阴虚证。又称恶露不断、恶露不绝。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Postpartum vaginal discharge of stagnant, turbid, stale blood persisting beyond three weeks, still dribbling without clearing. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, blood stasis pattern, blood heat pattern, or yin deficiency pattern. Also known as incessant or unceasing lochia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>恶露不断</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>恶露不绝</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶露不净</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Postpartum vaginal discharge of stagnant, turbid, stale blood persisting beyond three weeks, still dribbling without clearing. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, blood stasis pattern, blood heat pattern, or yin deficiency pattern. Also known as incessant or unceasing lochia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>恶露不断</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>恶露不绝</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
