      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻窍（一侧或两侧）流血。见于风寒袭鼻证、风热犯鼻证、燥伤鼻窍证、肺热熏鼻证、胃热熏鼻证、肝火犯鼻证、心火犯鼻证、郁热熏鼻证、阴虚鼻窍失濡证、脾虚肺燥证、脾不统血证、脾肾阳虚证等。又称鼻红、鼻流血。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bleeding from one or both nasal passages (epistaxis). Seen in wind-cold attacking the nose pattern, wind-heat invading the nose pattern, dryness damaging the nasal orifices pattern, lung heat fuming the nose pattern, stomach heat fuming the nose pattern, liver fire invading the nose pattern, heart fire invading the nose pattern, depressed heat fuming the nose pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened nasal orifices pattern, spleen deficiency with lung dryness pattern, spleen failing to govern blood pattern, or spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern. Also known as nosebleed.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻流血</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻红</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
