    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒与发热交替发作，先有恶寒，甚或寒战，随即发热，汗出热退，反复发作无定时。见于少阳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Alternating chills and fever—first aversion to cold or even rigor, then fever with sweating and defervescence—recurring at irregular times. Seen in shaoyang disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SD93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Alternating fever and chills disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>MG21</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Chills</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_寒热往来无定时</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Alternating chills and fever—first aversion to cold or even rigor, then fever with sweating and defervescence—recurring at irregular times. Seen in shaoyang disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SD93</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MG21</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
