    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿组织被侵蚀，仅留有部分残根。见于肾阴虚证、虚火上炎证、肾虚髓亏证、气血两虚证，或牙宣等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tooth tissue eroded away, leaving only partial residual roots. Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or tooth disclosure (periodontal atrophy, yaxuan).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.96</tcm:reference>
