    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口干或渴，喜冷饮。见于气分热炽证、胃热津伤证、温燥证、阴虚证等。实热（火）证时，多与口渴引饮或大渴并见。又称渴喜热饮。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dry mouth or fond of cold drinks excess heat profuse and thirst with desire to drink or intense thirst co-occurring. Seen in yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:气分热炽证/胃热津伤证/温燥证] [又称:渴喜热饮] [未译片段:渴火证时]</tcm:definition>
