    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">溃疡部感觉奇痒常由脓区不洁，脓液浸渍皮肤护理不当所致。若痒不甚，由痛而痒，是毒邪渐化，气血渐充助养新肉，将要收口的佳象。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Severe itching of the ulcer, usually caused by an unclean purulent area with pus soaking the skin and improper care. If the itch is mild and follows pain, it is a favorable sign that toxin is gradually transforming, qi and blood are replenishing to nourish new tissue, and the sore is about to close.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.107</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_溃疡作痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Severe itching of the ulcer, usually caused by an unclean purulent area with pus soaking the skin and improper care. If the itch is mild and follows pain, it is a favorable sign that toxin is gradually transforming, qi and blood are replenishing to nourish new tissue, and the sore is about to close.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
