    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手足肢体末端肥大，骨节增粗。见于阴阳失调，肾精不足证，或巨人症等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand foot limbs hypertrophy joints thickening. Seen in yin and yang disharmony pattern; kidney essence insufficiency pattern. [证候待译:巨人症] [未译片段:末端]</tcm:definition>
