    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患侧肢体沉重，抬举不利。见于中风偏瘫，或患肢水湿瘀滞、湿热阻滞经脉、经脉失养证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The affected limb feels heavy and is difficult to lift. Seen in post-stroke hemiplegia, or water-dampness stasis in the affected limb, dampness-heat obstructing the channels, or channels failing to be nourished pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
