    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发干枯、缺少光泽。见于血热化燥证、脾气虚证、气血两虚证，或疳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair dry and withered scanty glossy. Seen in blood heat with transforming into dryness pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan (infantile malnutrition). [证候待译:脾气虚证] [未译片段:缺]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
