      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脖颈疼痛感，或酸痛无力，或兼项痛，或兼瘰疬肿物等。见于阴精亏虚证、气虚证、湿热证、风热证，或瘰疬等。以项痛为主，称颈项痛，或一侧痛，或两侧痛，见于风寒犯表证、风湿犯表证、津液亏损证，或金疮风毒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the neck, or soreness with weakness, possibly with nape pain or scrofula masses. Seen in yin essence deficiency pattern, qi deficiency pattern, dampness-heat pattern, wind-heat pattern, or scrofula (luoli). When nape pain predominates it is called neck-nape pain, on one or both sides, seen in wind-cold invading the exterior pattern, wind-dampness invading the exterior pattern, fluid depletion pattern, or metal-wound wind toxin (tetanus).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030833</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>81680005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Neck pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>ME84.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Cervical spine pain</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain in the neck, or soreness with weakness, possibly with nape pain or scrofula masses. Seen in yin essence deficiency pattern, qi deficiency pattern, dampness-heat pattern, wind-heat pattern, or scrofula (luoli). When nape pain predominates it is called neck-nape pain, on one or both sides, seen in wind-cold invading the exterior pattern, wind-dampness invading the exterior pattern, fluid depletion pattern, or metal-wound wind toxin (tetanus).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0030833</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030833"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:81680005</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/81680005"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:ME84.0</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
