    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉络延长。见于热证、病情进展期。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vessels and collaterals long. Seen in heat pattern. [证候待译:病情进展期] [未译片段:延]</tcm:definition>
