    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳廓肿起，按之柔软。见于风邪痰湿证、脾胃气虚证、痰浊凝滞证，或耳壳痰包、断耳疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Auricle swollen soft on palpation. Seen in spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; phlegm-turbidity with congelation pattern; auricular perichondritis. [证候待译:风邪痰湿证/耳壳痰包]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.40</tcm:reference>
