    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胞睑失于卫护，黑睛长期暴露，致使白睛混赤，黑睛生翳，常伴胞睑不能覆盖黑睛。见于阴虚证、肝火上炎证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid at cornea long-term exposure mixed redness of the white of the eye corneal nebula accompanied by eyelid inability cornea. Seen in yin deficiency pattern; liver fire with upward flaring pattern. [未译片段:失卫护致使常覆盖]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.85</tcm:reference>
