      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来时有一止，止有常数，每次间歇时间较长。见于血瘀证、心气虚证或脏气衰惫等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse with a regular pause at fixed intervals, each interval relatively long. Seen in blood stasis pattern, heart qi deficiency pattern, or exhaustion of visceral qi.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0031796</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>XT5G</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Intermittent</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉代</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
