    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便紫黑如柏油样。见于火热内蕴证、肝胃瘀滞证、瘀滞胃肠证、肠道瘀滞证、肝胃热盛证，或内伤劳倦、胃疡、臌胀等。又称为上消化道出血。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stool purplish-black like -like. Seen in fire with heat with internal accumulation pattern; liver and stomach stagnation pattern; stagnation and stomach and intestines disorder pattern; liver and stomach heat with exuberance pattern; internal damage with fatigue and overstrain pattern. [证候待译:肠道瘀滞证/胃疡/臌胀] [又称:为上消化道出血] [未译片段:柏油]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002599</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>297249002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Melena</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>ME24.A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Digestive tract haemorrhage</tcm:icd11Term>
  
