    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现大片丹红色斑块，且发展迅速，焮热灼手。见于丹毒、流火等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Large bright cinnabar-red patches on the skin, developing rapidly, burning-hot to the touch. Seen in erysipelas (dandu) or flowing fire (liuhuo).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.130</tcm:reference>
