      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">言语先后颠倒，不合逻辑，不能正常表达思维，或前言不达后语，或语无伦次，不能自主。见于肝郁气结证、瘀血忧心证、痰湿内阻证等。又称胡言乱语、语言错乱、错语、语言颠倒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Speech with reversed word order and illogic, unable to express thought normally, with incoherent, uncontrolled utterances. Seen in liver depression with qi binding pattern, static blood worrying the heart pattern, or phlegm-dampness internal obstruction pattern. Also known as raving nonsense, confused speech, or reversed speech.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>胡言乱语</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>语言错乱</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>语言颠倒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>错语</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_言语错乱</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Speech with reversed word order and illogic, unable to express thought normally, with incoherent, uncontrolled utterances. Seen in liver depression with qi binding pattern, static blood worrying the heart pattern, or phlegm-dampness internal obstruction pattern. Also known as raving nonsense, confused speech, or reversed speech.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>胡言乱语</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>语言错乱</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
