    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每值经行前后或经期出现皮肤瘙痒，周身隐疹，或起疹块。见于肺经风热证、肝经风热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin itching with hidden rash or wheals over the body occurring before or during each menstrual period. Seen in lung channel wind-heat pattern, or liver channel wind-heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.52</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
