    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin itching with hidden rash or wheals over the body occurring before or during each menstrual period. Seen in lung channel wind-heat pattern, or liver channel wind-heat pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
