    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热，热势以夜间为甚。见于热入营血、血瘀、阴虚等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever heat nocturnal is marked. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:热入营血/阴虚等证] [未译片段:势以]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
