    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">突然神志不清仆倒，昏不知人。见于风痰闭阻证、痰火内盛证，或痫病、中风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden clouded consciousness unconsciousness. Seen in phlegm-fire with internal exuberance pattern; xian (epilepsy); wind stroke (apoplexy). [证候待译:风痰闭阻证] [未译片段:仆倒]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_卒然昏倒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sudden clouded consciousness unconsciousness. Seen in phlegm-fire with internal exuberance pattern; xian (epilepsy); wind stroke (apoplexy). [证候待译:风痰闭阻证] [未译片段:仆倒]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
