    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">局部皮肤感觉减退或丧失，不知痛痒。见于气滞血瘀证、痰湿阻滞证，或乌头类中毒、风眩、脱疽、疔疮、脚气、痿躄、口僻等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Local skin hypoesthesia or loss not pain itching. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; phlegm-dampness with obstruction pattern; tuoju (thromboangiitis obliterans). [证候待译:乌头类中毒/风眩/疔疮/脚气/痿躄/口僻] [未译片段:知]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>(某局部)麻木</tcm:synonym>
