    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体较正常偏大，伸舌满口或有齿痕。见于水湿痰饮证，或热毒、酒毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue body is larger than normal, filling the mouth when extended, or bearing tooth marks. Seen in water-dampness phlegm-rheum pattern, or heat toxin and alcohol toxin.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.4</tcm:reference>
