    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部肠中辘辘作响。见于外感风、寒、湿邪、肠道寒湿证、肠道湿热证、食滞胃肠证、寒湿困脾证、脾胃湿热证、饮停胃肠证、脾阳虚证、热毒蕴肠证、肠道瘀滞证、蛔结肠闭证、脾胃虚寒证，或胃饮、类霍乱、伤食、积滞、胃疡、胃癌、肝积、肥气、臌胀、胆瘅、肠结、肠郁、气腹痛、食亦、脾痿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gurgling sounds in the intestines of the abdomen. Seen in externally contracted wind, cold or dampness pathogens, intestinal cold-dampness pattern, intestinal dampness-heat pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, cold-dampness encumbering the spleen pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, rheum collecting in the stomach and intestines pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, heat toxin accumulating in the intestines pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, roundworm-caused intestinal blockage pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, or stomach fluid-retention, cholera-like disease, food damage, accumulation-stagnation, stomach ulcer, stomach cancer, liver accumulation, fat qi, drum distension, gallbladder heat, intestinal binding, intestinal depression, qi abdominal pain, food-also, or spleen atrophy.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.37</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>21522001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abdominal discomfort</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
