    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Gurgling sounds in the intestines of the abdomen. Seen in externally contracted wind, cold or dampness pathogens, intestinal cold-dampness pattern, intestinal dampness-heat pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, cold-dampness encumbering the spleen pattern, spleen-stomach dampness-heat pattern, rheum collecting in the stomach and intestines pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, heat toxin accumulating in the intestines pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, roundworm-caused intestinal blockage pattern, spleen-stomach deficiency cold pattern, or stomach fluid-retention, cholera-like disease, food damage, accumulation-stagnation, stomach ulcer, stomach cancer, liver accumulation, fat qi, drum distension, gallbladder heat, intestinal binding, intestinal depression, qi abdominal pain, food-also, or spleen atrophy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
