    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">龟头阴茎皮下肿胀。见于肝经湿热、湿热下注证，或阴头痈。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Glans penis penis subcutaneous tissue swelling. Seen in liver channel dampness-heat pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:阴头痈]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_包皮水肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Glans penis penis subcutaneous tissue swelling. Seen in liver channel dampness-heat pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:阴头痈]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
