    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃脘部感觉似饥非饥，似痛非痛的不适，莫可名状。见于胃热阴虚证、胃阴虚证、脾虚营亏证、肝胃不和证，或胃郁、食管瘅、胃疡、胃痞、胃胀、胃络痛、胆胀、胰胀、脾痿等。又称心嘈、嘈心。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Epigastrium region sensation hunger-like but not hunger pain-like but not pain not -like. Seen in stomach heat with yin deficiency pattern; liver and stomach disharmony pattern; stomach depression pattern; gallbladder distension. [证候待译:胃阴虚证/脾虚营亏证/食管瘅/胃疡/胃痞/胃胀] [又称:心嘈/嘈心] [未译片段:适莫可名]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>嘈心</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>心嘈</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>胃中嘈杂</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>饥嘈不适</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_嘈杂</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Epigastrium region sensation hunger-like but not hunger pain-like but not pain not -like. Seen in stomach heat with yin deficiency pattern; liver and stomach disharmony pattern; stomach depression pattern; gallbladder distension. [证候待译:胃阴虚证/脾虚营亏证/食管瘅/胃疡/胃痞/胃胀] [又称:心嘈/嘈心] [未译片段:适莫可名]</obo:IAO_0000115>
