    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">女子年满18周岁尚未初潮，或月经周期建立后停经3个月以上。见于肾气亏虚证、气血两虚证、气滞血瘀证、痰湿阻滞证、阴虚血燥证等。又称闭经。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A woman aged 18 or over has not yet had menarche, or menstruation has ceased for more than three months after the cycle was established. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, or yin deficiency with blood dryness pattern. Also known as amenorrhea.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>闭经</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>8913004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>primary amenorrhea</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>86030004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>previous menstrual periods stop</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>373717006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>climacterium praecox</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SB94</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Amenorrhea disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经闭不行</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A woman aged 18 or over has not yet had menarche, or menstruation has ceased for more than three months after the cycle was established. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, or yin deficiency with blood dryness pattern. Also known as amenorrhea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
