    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热与恶寒同时并作，发热的程度较恶寒重。见于风热犯肺或暑湿袭表等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever and aversion to cold occurring simultaneously, with fever more severe than the cold aversion. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung, or summerheat-dampness attacking the exterior patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>自身免疫反应</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_发热重_恶寒轻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever and aversion to cold occurring simultaneously, with fever more severe than the cold aversion. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung, or summerheat-dampness attacking the exterior patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
