    <obo:IAO_0000115>Eye region discharge white. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; dry eye syndrome. [证候待译:气轮湿热证/气轮虚热证/肺虚邪恋证/气轮阴虚证/气轮湿热证]</obo:IAO_0000115>
