    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉络色泽鲜红而浮露。见于外感表证，多属风寒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The (infantile index-finger) venule is bright red and superficially visible. Seen in externally contracted exterior patterns, mostly of wind-cold type.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.3.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
