    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The (infantile index-finger) venule is bright red and superficially visible. Seen in externally contracted exterior patterns, mostly of wind-cold type.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
