    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">唇之上下左右有肿物色紫有头，时觉木痛。见于风热夹湿证、脾胃积热证、肝郁化火证、瘀血留滞证、虚火灼口证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A purplish swelling with a head on the upper, lower or lateral lip, with intermittent numb pain. Seen in wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern, spleen-stomach accumulated heat pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, static blood retention pattern, or deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.92</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_唇部生疽</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A purplish swelling with a head on the upper, lower or lateral lip, with intermittent numb pain. Seen in wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern, spleen-stomach accumulated heat pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, static blood retention pattern, or deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
