    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足趾肿胀，发红，活动不利。见于寒湿痹阻证、湿热痹阻证、血瘀证，或水气、蛇头疔、蛇眼疔、足趾外伤、脚气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Foot toe swelling turning red impaired movement. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:寒湿痹阻证/湿热痹阻证/水气/蛇头疔/蛇眼疔/足趾外伤]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.65</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SK68</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Tear sac swelling disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_趾肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Foot toe swelling turning red impaired movement. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:寒湿痹阻证/湿热痹阻证/水气/蛇头疔/蛇眼疔/足趾外伤]</obo:IAO_0000115>
