    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">单个或多个牙齿不同程度动摇。见于肾虚髓亏证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯肺证、气血亏虚证，或牙宣、牙痈、齿槽风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">One or more teeth loose to varying degrees. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, stomach fire flaring the teeth pattern, wind-fire invading the lung pattern, qi-blood deficiency pattern, or tooth disclosure (periodontal atrophy), dental abscess, or alveolar wind (jaw osteomyelitis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.86</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000164</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>234096007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Loosening of teeth</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>DA0C.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Tooth mobility</tcm:icd11Term>
  
