    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈部臖核肿大。见于肝郁气结证、毒邪流窜证、气滞痰凝证、痰瘀互结证、阴虚火旺证、肝郁痰热证、胃热脾虚证，或颈痈、瘰疬等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Enlarged neck nodules. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; scrofula. [证候待译:肝郁气结证/毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/胃热脾虚证/颈痈]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈部臖核肿大</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Enlarged neck nodules. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; scrofula. [证候待译:肝郁气结证/毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/胃热脾虚证/颈痈]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
