      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上腹部右侧疼痛。多为肝胆病证，见于肝胆湿热证、肝郁气滞证、瘟毒蕴积证、瘀血阻络证、蛔扰胆腑证，或胆石、胆胀、胆瘅、肝痈、肝热病、肝瘟、肝著、肝积、蛔厥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the right upper abdomen; mostly pertains to liver-gallbladder disorders. Seen in liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, pestilent toxin accumulation pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, roundworm disturbing the gallbladder pattern, or gallstones, gallbladder distension, gallbladder heat, liver abscess, liver heat disease, liver pestilence, liver fixity, liver accumulation, or roundworm syncope.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_右上腹痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain in the right upper abdomen; mostly pertains to liver-gallbladder disorders. Seen in liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, pestilent toxin accumulation pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, roundworm disturbing the gallbladder pattern, or gallstones, gallbladder distension, gallbladder heat, liver abscess, liver heat disease, liver pestilence, liver fixity, liver accumulation, or roundworm syncope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
