    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足底或足底侧面皮肤溃烂。见于湿毒浸渍、火毒炽盛、湿热下注证，或足底疽或痈、消渴足等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sole or sole face skin ulceration and festering. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:湿毒浸渍/火毒炽盛/足底疽/痈/消渴足] [未译片段:侧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.68</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
