    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛周皮肤瘙痒，或顽固不愈，反复发作的症状。见于风热郁结证、风湿挟热证、血虚生风证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Perianal region skin itching or not recurrent attacks -like. Seen in wind-heat with depression and binding pattern; wind-dampness with with with heat pattern; blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern. [未译片段:顽固愈症]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肛门瘙痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Perianal region skin itching or not recurrent attacks -like. Seen in wind-heat with depression and binding pattern; wind-dampness with with with heat pattern; blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern. [未译片段:顽固愈症]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
