      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">喉咙部干涩，发声不利。见于风热袭肺证、脾胃热盛证、肝胆郁热证、阴虚咽喉失濡证、气虚咽喉失充证、热盛伤津证，或干燥病、急性咽喉病、急性外感病、高热病、慢喉痹、慢乳蛾、久喑等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dryness of the throat with impaired voice production. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern, spleen-stomach exuberant heat pattern, liver-gallbladder depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened throat pattern, qi deficiency with underfilled throat pattern, exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or dryness disease, acute throat disease, acute exogenous disease, high-fever disease, chronic throat impediment, chronic nippled moth (tonsillitis), or chronic aphonia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.41</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_喉干</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dryness of the throat with impaired voice production. Seen in wind-heat invading the lung pattern, spleen-stomach exuberant heat pattern, liver-gallbladder depressed heat pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened throat pattern, qi deficiency with underfilled throat pattern, exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or dryness disease, acute throat disease, acute exogenous disease, high-fever disease, chronic throat impediment, chronic nippled moth (tonsillitis), or chronic aphonia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
