    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">新生儿或婴儿因多种原因引起啼哭过频。见于脾经虚寒证、心经积热证、心虚禀弱证，或受惊恐惧、伤食、积滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Overly frequent crying in newborns or infants due to various causes. Seen in spleen channel deficiency cold pattern, heart channel accumulated heat pattern, heart deficiency with weak endowment pattern, or fright and fear, food damage, or accumulation-stagnation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_小儿啼哭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Overly frequent crying in newborns or infants due to various causes. Seen in spleen channel deficiency cold pattern, heart channel accumulated heat pattern, heart deficiency with weak endowment pattern, or fright and fear, food damage, or accumulation-stagnation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
