    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阵发性痉挛性咳嗽，咳声末尾有高声调回音。见于百日咳、外感疫疠等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Paroxysmal spasmodic cough with a high-pitched whooping echo at the end of the coughing bout. Seen in whooping cough (pertussis) or externally contracted epidemic pestilence.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.60</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止咳药物、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>1C12.Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Whooping cough, unspecified</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>1C12.Y</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Other specified whooping cough</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咳后有鸡鸣样回声</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Paroxysmal spasmodic cough with a high-pitched whooping echo at the end of the coughing bout. Seen in whooping cough (pertussis) or externally contracted epidemic pestilence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1C12.Z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1C12.Y</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
