    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉身热，或体温偏高（轻、中度发热），但用手触摸肌肤，无论初按或久按均不觉太热。提示无明显热邪或热邪较轻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective body heat or mildly-to-moderately elevated temperature, yet the skin does not feel very hot on either brief or prolonged palpation—suggesting no obvious heat pathogen or only mild heat.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0011134</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>304213008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>low grade fever</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>XS5W</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Mild</tcm:icd11Term>
  
