    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">蕈状乳头增大，数目增多，乳头充血水肿，大者称星，小者称点，色红。见于湿热证、瘟毒入血证、热毒乘心证、湿热蕴于血分证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">-like nipple large eye increase nipple congestion/hyperemia edema large star-like spots small dots red. Seen in dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:瘟毒入血证/热毒乘心证/湿热蕴于血分证] [未译片段:蕈增数称称]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌有红星</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>-like nipple large eye increase nipple congestion/hyperemia edema large star-like spots small dots red. Seen in dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:瘟毒入血证/热毒乘心证/湿热蕴于血分证] [未译片段:蕈增数称称]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
