    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳孔边缘完全与其后晶体发生粘连。见于先天性。又称瞳神膜闭。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Complete adhesion of the pupillary margin to the lens behind it (total posterior synechia/pupillary seclusion). Seen in congenital cases. Also known as pupillary membrane occlusion.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.98</tcm:reference>
