    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中散发臭气味，或呼出气体臭秽。见于胃热熏口证、肝热熏口证、肺热熏口证、脾胃气虚证、虚火灼口证，或口腔不洁、口腔坏死性病变（口糜，牙咬痈，牙疳，走马牙疳等）、鼻渊、异物入鼻、鼻鼽、肺痈、肺络张等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A foul odor emanating from the mouth, or foul-smelling exhaled breath. Seen in stomach heat fuming the mouth pattern, liver heat fuming the mouth pattern, lung heat fuming the mouth pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern, or poor oral hygiene, oral necrotic lesions (mouth erosion, dental abscess, gum ulceration, fulminant gum ulceration), deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), foreign body in the nose, allergic rhinitis, lung abscess, or lung collateral dilatation (bronchiectasis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.2.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100812</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>79879001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bad breath</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口气臭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A foul odor emanating from the mouth, or foul-smelling exhaled breath. Seen in stomach heat fuming the mouth pattern, liver heat fuming the mouth pattern, lung heat fuming the mouth pattern, spleen-stomach qi deficiency pattern, deficiency fire scorching the mouth pattern, or poor oral hygiene, oral necrotic lesions (mouth erosion, dental abscess, gum ulceration, fulminant gum ulceration), deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), foreign body in the nose, allergic rhinitis, lung abscess, or lung collateral dilatation (bronchiectasis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0100812</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
