    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">膝部肿大而股胫消瘦，形似鹤膝。见于寒湿内侵、经络血瘀证，或鹤膝风，尪痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Swelling of the knee with wasting of the thigh and shank, shaped like a crane's knee. Seen in cold-dampness internal invasion, channel blood stasis pattern, or crane's-knee wind (tuberculous/chronic knee arthritis) and joint-deforming impediment (wangbi/rheumatoid arthritis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.50</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鹤膝</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Swelling of the knee with wasting of the thigh and shank, shaped like a crane's knee. Seen in cold-dampness internal invasion, channel blood stasis pattern, or crane's-knee wind (tuberculous/chronic knee arthritis) and joint-deforming impediment (wangbi/rheumatoid arthritis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
