    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每于下午3到5点发热，见于阳明腑实证。又称日晡潮热、阳明潮热。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever occurring daily between 3 and 5 p.m. Seen in yangming bowel excess pattern. Also known as late-afternoon tidal fever or yangming tidal fever.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>日哺潮热</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>阳明潮热</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>1C33</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Q fever</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>1D45</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Sandfly fever</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>1C11.00</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Oroya fever</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_午后潮热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever occurring daily between 3 and 5 p.m. Seen in yangming bowel excess pattern. Also known as late-afternoon tidal fever or yangming tidal fever.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>日哺潮热</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>阳明潮热</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1C33</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1D45</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1C11.00</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
