    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核色黯红。见于气血瘀滞证、湿热下注证、阴虚火旺证，或翻花痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hemorrhoidal nodule colored dusky red. Seen in qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:翻花痔]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痔核黯红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hemorrhoidal nodule colored dusky red. Seen in qi and blood stagnation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:翻花痔]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
