    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">下肢单侧或双侧广泛性或局限性的肌肉萎缩，足难任地行走。见于湿热下注证、瘀血阻络证、精血亏虚证、阴阳两虚证、气血两虚证、气虚血瘀证，或痿躄等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Extensive or localized muscle atrophy of one or both lower limbs, with the feet unable to bear walking. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, essence-blood deficiency pattern, yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or flaccidity lameness (weibi).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.70</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_足萎</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Extensive or localized muscle atrophy of one or both lower limbs, with the feet unable to bear walking. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern, essence-blood deficiency pattern, yin-yang dual deficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or flaccidity lameness (weibi).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
