    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手上臂或前臂肌肉、筋骨疼痛。见于风湿阻络证、风寒湿痹证或外伤等。又称手臂痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand upper arm or forearm muscle vessels/sinews bone pain. Seen in external injury pattern. [证候待译:风湿阻络证/风寒湿痹证] [又称:手臂痛]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>手臂痛</tcm:synonym>
