    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头部皮肤呈红色。多见于实、热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head region skin presenting as red colored profuse. Seen in heat pattern. [证候待译:实]</tcm:definition>
