    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">重病昏迷患者，两于撒开，手臂不能活动。见于中风入脏证、阳脱证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In critically ill comatose patients, both hands lie flaccidly open and the arms cannot move. Seen in stroke entering the viscera pattern, or yang collapse pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
