    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸无力而表浅、微弱，气体交换不足。见于痰饮中阻证、气滞血瘀证、心脾两虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Weak, shallow and faint breathing with insufficient gas exchange. Seen in phlegm-rheum obstructing the middle pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.2</tcm:reference>
