    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">男性阴囊疼痛，或伴肿胀、灼热。见于寒滞肝脉证、肝郁气滞证、下焦湿热证，或疝病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotal pain or accompanied by swelling burning heat. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; lower jiao dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:寒滞肝脉证/疝病] [未译片段:男性]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
