    <obo:IAO_0000115>Scrotal pain or accompanied by swelling burning heat. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern; lower jiao dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:寒滞肝脉证/疝病] [未译片段:男性]</obo:IAO_0000115>
