    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痛处有发热感，喜凉，得凉则痛可减轻。见于实热（火）证、虚热（火）证，如火邪串络证、湿热蕴结证、热毒炽盛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The painful site feels hot and prefers cold, the pain being relieved by cold. Seen in excess heat (fire) patterns or deficiency heat (fire) patterns, such as fire pathogen scurrying through the collaterals pattern, dampness-heat accumulating pattern, or heat toxin blazing pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疼痛喜凉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The painful site feels hot and prefers cold, the pain being relieved by cold. Seen in excess heat (fire) patterns or deficiency heat (fire) patterns, such as fire pathogen scurrying through the collaterals pattern, dampness-heat accumulating pattern, or heat toxin blazing pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
