    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呕吐来势较快，或声音较大，急速吐出。见于热闭心神证、瘀阻脑络证，或霍乱、脑痨、春温、暑温、脑瘤、脑癌、颅脑痈、头部内伤、黄耳伤寒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting with rapid onset, loud sounds, and urgent forceful expulsion. Seen in heat blocking the heart-spirit pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, or cholera, brain consumption (tuberculous meningitis), spring warmth, summerheat warmth, brain tumor, brain cancer, cranial abscess, internal head injury, or yellow-ear cold damage (suppurative otitis with meningitis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.58</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MD90.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vomiting</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呕吐急迫</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Vomiting with rapid onset, loud sounds, and urgent forceful expulsion. Seen in heat blocking the heart-spirit pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, or cholera, brain consumption (tuberculous meningitis), spring warmth, summerheat warmth, brain tumor, brain cancer, cranial abscess, internal head injury, or yellow-ear cold damage (suppurative otitis with meningitis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
