    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔白如积粉，扪之不燥者。多见于外感温热病、秽浊湿邪与热毒相结合而成。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A white coating like accumulated powder, not dry to the touch. Mostly seen in externally contracted warm-heat diseases where filthy turbid dampness combines with heat toxin.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.80</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔如积粉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A white coating like accumulated powder, not dry to the touch. Mostly seen in externally contracted warm-heat diseases where filthy turbid dampness combines with heat toxin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
