      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女在经期或月经前出现大便下血，经后即愈的周期性发作。见于湿热下注、大肠湿热、肺肾阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cyclic episodes of hematochezia occurring during or just before menstruation, resolving after the period. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward, large-intestine dampness-heat, or lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行便血</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cyclic episodes of hematochezia occurring during or just before menstruation, resolving after the period. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward, large-intestine dampness-heat, or lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
