    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue is flaccid, protruding from the mouth and unable to retract normally. Seen in excess heat lodged internally, phlegm-heat harassing the heart, or qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.86</tcm:reference>
