    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢不由自主地做小幅度抽搐。见于风寒阻络证、风痰阻络证、气血两虚证、脾虚生风证、肝热生风证、阴脱证，或痫证、中毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntary small-amplitude twitching of the limbs. Seen in wind-cold obstructing the collaterals pattern, wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, spleen deficiency generating wind pattern, liver heat generating wind pattern, yin collapse pattern, or epilepsy and poisoning.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0200113</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_手足瘛纵</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
