    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">翳膜团聚密集，溶成一块，溃入黑睛深层者。见于风轮风热证、风轮热毒证、肠热腑实证、血热瘀滞证、正虚邪恋证，或凝脂翳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The nebula masses densely, melting into one piece and ulcerating into the deep layers of the cornea (congealed-fat nebula/suppurative keratitis). Seen in wind-wheel (cornea) wind-heat pattern, wind-wheel heat toxin pattern, intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, blood heat with stasis pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, or congealed-fat nebula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
