    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">尿液混浊如乳糜。见于肾阳虚证、湿热内蕴证、肾阴虚证、脾虚气陷证，或丝虫病、肾痨、脂膜痨、癌瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urine turbidity like. Seen in dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern; spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; filariasis; kidney consumption (renal TB). [证候待译:肾阳虚证/肾阴虚证/脂膜痨/癌瘤] [未译片段:乳糜]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
