    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">为皮肤表面出现的浅褐或深褐色针尖至钱币大小的斑片，散在或聚集分布。见于血热妄行、脾不统血证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Light- to dark-brown macules from pinpoint to coin size on the skin surface, scattered or clustered. Seen in blood heat moving recklessly, or spleen failing to govern blood pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.149</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤斑点</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
