    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠中气道经常不畅，发生呼吸粗鸣，时断时续。见于高热神昏、中风入脏等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent airway obstruction during sleep producing coarse snoring respiration, intermittent and continuous. Seen in high fever with impaired consciousness, or stroke entering the viscera.</tcm:definition>
