    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A tongue coating of moderate moisture, neither slippery nor dry; a moist coating during disease indicates that body fluids are undamaged.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.69</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
