    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A tongue coating of moderate moisture, neither slippery nor dry; a moist coating during disease indicates that body fluids are undamaged.</obo:IAO_0000115>
