    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dry mouth or thirst, but the patient only wants to rinse with water without swallowing it. Seen in blood stasis pattern, static blood internal stagnation pattern, or stasis-heat internal harassment pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.11</tcm:reference>
