    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">语声浑浊不清，似有痰液阻滞清窍。见于外感风寒证、湿浊阻滞证、风寒表证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A turbid, unclear voice, as if phlegm were obstructing the clear orifices. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, damp-turbidity obstruction pattern, or wind-cold exterior pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.7</tcm:reference>
