    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">仰卧时前腹壁明显低于胸骨至耻骨中点连线。见于脾胃虚弱、气血两虚证、精血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In supine position, the anterior abdominal wall lies markedly below the line connecting the sternum and the midpoint of the pubis (scaphoid abdomen). Seen in spleen-stomach weakness, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or essence-blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.16</tcm:reference>
