    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腹部凹陷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>In supine position, the anterior abdominal wall lies markedly below the line connecting the sternum and the midpoint of the pubis (scaphoid abdomen). Seen in spleen-stomach weakness, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or essence-blood deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025063</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025063"/>
  </owl:Class>
