        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠不实，睡眠中梦扰纷纭，或次日头昏神疲。见于心脾两虚证、心肾不交证、胆郁痰扰证，或神劳、脏躁、百合病等。又称多梦。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Unsound sleep with profuse, tangled dreams, or dizziness and spirit fatigue the next day. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, or spirit taxation, visceral agitation, or lily disease. Also known as frequent dreaming.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>多梦，寐艰多梦</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_梦多</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Unsound sleep with profuse, tangled dreams, or dizziness and spirit fatigue the next day. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, or spirit taxation, visceral agitation, or lily disease. Also known as frequent dreaming.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>多梦，寐艰多梦</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
