    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">为脱落的皮肤角质层，成粉状，糠秕状、鱼鳞状、云母状或大片形。见于血虚风燥证、热盛生风证、风邪袭表证、湿热证，或白屑风、剥脱性皮炎，单纯糠疹、银屑病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Shed stratum corneum of the skin, powdery, bran-like, fish-scale-like, mica-like or in large sheets. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, exuberant heat generating wind pattern, wind pathogen attacking the exterior pattern, dampness-heat pattern, or white-scaling wind (seborrheic dermatitis), exfoliative dermatitis, pityriasis simplex, or psoriasis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.127</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0040189</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0040190</tcm:hpoID>
