    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉脘腹部、四肢、肛门重坠，气向下迫。见于脾虚气陷证、中气下陷证，或胃缓等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective bearing-down heaviness of the epigastrium/abdomen, limbs or anus, with qi pressing downward. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern, middle qi sinking pattern, or stomach slack (gastroptosis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.26</tcm:reference>
