    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部破溃、腐烂。咽喉腐烂，分浅散表者见于虚火上炎；腐烂成片凹陷者，见于气血不足，肾阴亏损，邪毒内陷；溃腐日久，周围淡红或苍白者，多见于虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ulceration and putrefaction of the throat: shallow scattered erosion indicates deficiency fire flaming upward; sunken putrefaction in sheets indicates qi-blood insufficiency, kidney yin depletion and inward sinking of pathogenic toxin; long-standing erosion with pale red or pallid surroundings mostly indicates deficiency patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.76</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉腐烂</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Ulceration and putrefaction of the throat: shallow scattered erosion indicates deficiency fire flaming upward; sunken putrefaction in sheets indicates qi-blood insufficiency, kidney yin depletion and inward sinking of pathogenic toxin; long-standing erosion with pale red or pallid surroundings mostly indicates deficiency patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
