    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">心中思虑，而不得解脱，或闷闷不乐，或自感不安。见于心脾气结证，或脏躁等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mental preoccupation without release, gloominess, or subjective unease. Seen in heart-spleen qi binding pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SD82</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Depression disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苦闷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mental preoccupation without release, gloominess, or subjective unease. Seen in heart-spleen qi binding pattern, or visceral agitation (zangzao).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SD82</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
