    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Limbs puffiness distending. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern. [证候待译:气滞肌表/气虚血亏证/偏痹/中风偏瘫] [未译片段:一侧]</tcm:definition>
