    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口角战栗鼓颌，口唇振摇。见于气血虚衰证，热极生风证，肝阳化风证等。又称唇瞤、口角掣动、口唇颤动等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Trembling of the mouth corners with chattering jaws and quivering lips. Seen in qi-blood debilitation pattern, extreme heat generating wind pattern, or liver yang transforming into wind pattern. Also known as lip twitching, mouth-corner pulling, or lip trembling.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口唇颤动</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>口角掣动</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>唇瞤</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口振</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Trembling of the mouth corners with chattering jaws and quivering lips. Seen in qi-blood debilitation pattern, extreme heat generating wind pattern, or liver yang transforming into wind pattern. Also known as lip twitching, mouth-corner pulling, or lip trembling.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>口唇颤动</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>口角掣动</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>唇瞤</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
