    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瘘口部流黄稠脓水。见于湿毒内蕴证、肛门湿热证，或肛门直肠瘘新形成或急性炎症期等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fistula opening region yellow purulent fluid. Seen in dampness-toxin with internal accumulation pattern. [证候待译:肛门湿热证/肛门直肠瘘新形成/急性炎症期] [未译片段:流稠]</tcm:definition>
