    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼胞皮肤色暗红、晦暗。见于肾虚证、血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid skin colored dark red dull and dark. Seen in blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:肾虚证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.74</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
