    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳内鸣响，声音洪大如雷。见于肝风痰火证、表寒里热证、风热挟湿证，或雷头风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tinnitus with sounds as loud as thunder. Seen in liver wind with phlegm-fire pattern, exterior cold with interior heat pattern, wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern, or thunder-head wind.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
