    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿瘤表面与皮肤粘连。见于痰核流注证，或发瘤、脂瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tumor surface adhering to the skin. Seen in sebaceous cyst. [证候待译:痰核流注证/发瘤]</tcm:definition>
