    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肤色微红或仅两颧局部发红，多伴有低热。见于阴虚阳亢、虚火上炎证，或虚痨等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin colored slight red or local turning red profuse accompanied by low-grade fever. Seen in yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern; deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern. [证候待译:虚痨] [未译片段:仅两颧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肤色潮红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin colored slight red or local turning red profuse accompanied by low-grade fever. Seen in yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern; deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern. [证候待译:虚痨] [未译片段:仅两颧]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
