    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便溏泄，其气腥臭。多见于外感寒湿、寒湿中阻泄泻，或脏毒、癌瘤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loose, sloppy stools with a fishy, foul odor. Mostly seen in externally contracted cold-dampness, cold-dampness obstructing the middle with diarrhea, or visceral toxin (zangdu) and carcinoma.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.25</tcm:reference>
