    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口腔黏膜呈鲜红色。见于实证、热证、肠胃有热、风热邪毒侵袭等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Oral cavity mucosa presenting as bright red colored. Seen in excess pattern; heat pattern; wind-heat with pathogenic toxin with invasion pattern. [证候待译:肠胃有热]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.5</tcm:reference>
