    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道分泌物明显增多，色、质、气味异常。见于肾阳虚证、脾虚湿困证、胞宫虚寒证、胞宫湿热证，或阴痒、热入血室、胞宫病变、痰湿内盛、花柳毒淋等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">(in women) vaginal discharge obvious increase colored. Seen in uterus deficiency-cold pattern; uterus dampness-heat pattern; vulvar itching; phlegm-dampness with internal exuberance pattern. [证候待译:肾阳虚证/脾虚湿困证/热入血室/胞宫病变/花柳毒淋] [未译片段:质气味异常]</tcm:definition>
