    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">经血质地稀薄。见于胞宫血虚证、胞宫气虚证、寒湿凝滞证、肝肾阴亏证、脾肾阳虚证，或血劳、紫癜病、血溢病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood thin and watery in consistency. Seen in uterine blood deficiency pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, cold-dampness congealing pattern, liver-kidney yin depletion pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, or blood taxation, purpura disease, or blood flooding disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.19</tcm:reference>
