    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发完全脱落。见于血虚生风证、血热生风证，或忧虑、紧张过度、油风脱发等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Complete loss of scalp hair. Seen in blood deficiency generating wind pattern, blood heat generating wind pattern, or excessive worry and tension, or oily-wind hair loss (alopecia areata).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.38</tcm:reference>
