    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上下口唇紧聚，为邪正交争。见于肝风侮脾证，或小儿脐风等。又称口唇收缩、唇紧等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The upper and lower lips drawn tightly together—a sign of struggle between pathogenic and righteous qi. Seen in liver wind insulting the spleen pattern, or neonatal tetanus (umbilical wind). Also known as lip contraction or tight lips.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.57</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口唇收缩</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>唇紧</tcm:synonym>
