    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain present nocturnal or at night obvious pain. Seen in abdominal pain; blood stasis pattern; cold congelation pattern; yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:关节痛/癌瘤疼痛/痰凝证] [未译片段:加剧即感]</tcm:definition>
