    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤发亮有光泽。见于气滞血瘀证，营卫失和证，或长期挤压、摩擦，硬皮病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin hair with glossy. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern; scleroderma. [证候待译:营卫失和证/长期挤压/摩擦] [未译片段:亮]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.114</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF01</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood stasis pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
