    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿积有较多秽垢。见于胃火炽盛证、肝胆湿热证，或黄疸、胃滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abundant foul deposits accumulated on the teeth. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, or jaundice and stomach stagnation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
