    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">遗精频繁，不伴性梦而无所知，甚至因意念或无意中精自流出。见于肾阴虚证、肾气不固证、湿热下注证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent seminal emission without sexual dreams and without awareness, even semen flowing out upon mere thought or inadvertently. Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, or dampness-heat pouring downward pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_滑精</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Frequent seminal emission without sexual dreams and without awareness, even semen flowing out upon mere thought or inadvertently. Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, or dampness-heat pouring downward pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
