    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">哭声低小、细弱，多见于小儿。见于久病、虚证、寒证等，如脾阳虚证、脾虚肝旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A low, thin and weak crying sound, mostly in small children. Seen in chronic illness, deficiency patterns or cold patterns, such as spleen yang deficiency pattern or spleen deficiency with liver exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_哭声低弱</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A low, thin and weak crying sound, mostly in small children. Seen in chronic illness, deficiency patterns or cold patterns, such as spleen yang deficiency pattern or spleen deficiency with liver exuberance pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
