        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上、下眼脸疼痛。见于针眼、睑弦赤烂、迎风赤烂、风赤疮痍、胞肿如桃、椒疮、胞生痰核等。又称睑缘痛、上睑痛或下睑痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the upper and/or lower eyelid. Seen in sty (zhenyan), red ulcerated lid margin, wind-exposed red ulceration, wind-red sore (palpebral eczema), lid swollen like a peach, pepper sore (trachoma), or phlegm nodule of the lid (chalazion). Also known as lid-margin pain, upper-lid pain or lower-lid pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.58</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>上睑痛或下睑痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>睑缘痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0034808</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0200026</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>41652007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>eye pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_眼睑痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain of the upper and/or lower eyelid. Seen in sty (zhenyan), red ulcerated lid margin, wind-exposed red ulceration, wind-red sore (palpebral eczema), lid swollen like a peach, pepper sore (trachoma), or phlegm nodule of the lid (chalazion). Also known as lid-margin pain, upper-lid pain or lower-lid pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>上睑痛或下睑痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>睑缘痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0034808</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0034808"/>
