    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌上生糜点如饭粒，甚则蔓延至舌下或口腔周围，揩之可去，旋即复生，揩去处舌面多光剥无苔。多为胃体腐败，津液化为腐浊所致。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thrush-like specks like rice grains growing on the tongue, even spreading under the tongue or around the mouth, removable by wiping but promptly regrowing, leaving a glossy, peeled, coating-free surface. Mostly caused by putrefaction of the stomach body with fluids transforming into rot-turbidity.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.67</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔如霉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Thrush-like specks like rice grains growing on the tongue, even spreading under the tongue or around the mouth, removable by wiping but promptly regrowing, leaving a glossy, peeled, coating-free surface. Mostly caused by putrefaction of the stomach body with fluids transforming into rot-turbidity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
