    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻准部红赤。见于肺经郁热证、脾经郁热证、胃经郁热证、火热邪毒证，或酒齄鼻、鼻疔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tip of nose region red. Seen in lung channel depressed heat pattern; spleen channel depressed heat pattern; stomach channel depressed heat pattern; fire with heat with pathogenic toxin pattern; rosacea; nasal ding (vestibular furuncle).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
