    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">伴随月经周期而反复出现的口舌生疮。见于心火上炎、胃热炽盛、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Accompanied by menstruation recurrent appearance of mouth and tongue sores. Seen in heart fire with upward flaring pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:胃热炽盛] [未译片段:随周期]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.65</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行口糜</oboInOwl:id>
