    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇知觉丧失，不知痛痒，或麻木感。见于中风、风痰阻络证等。又称唇麻、唇木。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips loss not pain itching or numbness. Seen in wind stroke (apoplexy). [证候待译:风痰阻络证] [又称:唇麻/唇木] [未译片段:知觉知感]</tcm:definition>
