    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在身体一定部位或多处，同时或反复发生多个疖。见于正虚邪恋证、暑湿热郁证，或多发性疖、发际疮、坐板疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Multiple boils occurring simultaneously or recurrently at one or several body sites. Seen in righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, summerheat-damp-heat stagnation pattern, or multiple furuncles, hairline sores (fajichuang), or seat-board sores (buttock furuncles).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.101</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
