    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者两手握固成拳，手指不能伸展。见于风痰阻络证，或中风、闭证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Both hands clenched into fists with fingers unable to extend. Seen in wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, or stroke and blockage (bi) pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.82</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_握拳</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Both hands clenched into fists with fingers unable to extend. Seen in wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, or stroke and blockage (bi) pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
