    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛剧烈，难以忍受。见于血瘀证或有形实邪阻滞气机。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Severe, unbearable pain. Seen in blood stasis pattern, or tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XS2E</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Severe pain</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>XS25</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Severe</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>XS2U</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Severe pain-related interference</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_剧痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
