      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽部覆以白色伪膜，或松厚，容易拭去、或坚韧，不易剥离、或呈现灰白色，为点状，片状、或有白黄色脓点，渐连成腐膜、或白色焦膜呈现片状块状。见于白喉疫邪外犯、阴虚肺燥证、火毒炽盛证、正虚邪恋证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A white pseudomembrane covering the pharynx—loose and thick, easily wiped off; or tough and hard to strip; or gray-white, punctate or patchy; or with white-yellow pus dots gradually merging into a putrid membrane; or white scorched membrane in flakes or lumps. Seen in diphtheria epidemic pathogen attacking from outside, yin deficiency with lung dryness pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.78</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉伪膜</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A white pseudomembrane covering the pharynx—loose and thick, easily wiped off; or tough and hard to strip; or gray-white, punctate or patchy; or with white-yellow pus dots gradually merging into a putrid membrane; or white scorched membrane in flakes or lumps. Seen in diphtheria epidemic pathogen attacking from outside, yin deficiency with lung dryness pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#DrynessEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
