      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼前黑朦而看见闪烁的亮点，犹如夜空闪烁的荧星。见于水轮湿热蕴结证、水轮气滞血瘀证、水轮阴亏证、水轮气虚血亏证，或云雾移睛、血灌瞳神等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Darkened vision filled with twinkling bright spots, like fireflies flickering in the night sky. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat accumulation pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, or cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity) and hyphema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_荧星满目</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Darkened vision filled with twinkling bright spots, like fireflies flickering in the night sky. Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat accumulation pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, or cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity) and hyphema.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
