    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部两侧扁桃体（咽核）红肿，并伴有溃痛。见于阴虚肺燥证、火毒炽盛证、正虚邪恋证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tonsils (pharyngeal kernels) on both sides of the throat are red and swollen with ulcerative pain. Seen in yin deficiency with lung dryness pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.28</tcm:reference>
