    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">薄白苔上出现均匀的浅黄色。多见于风热表证、风寒化热入里。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thin white tongue coating appearance of all yellow colored profuse. Seen in wind-cold with transforming into heat with entering the interior pattern. [证候待译:风热表证] [未译片段:上匀浅]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.81</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
