    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃脘或腹部疼痛，或有空虚感，或饥饿痛甚，进食后疼痛可减轻。见于虚证、脾胃气虚证、中气虚证等。又称食后痛减。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Epigastrium or abdomen pain or with deficiency or severe hunger pain taking food pain alleviated. Seen in deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern. [证候待译:中气虚证] [又称:食后痛减] [未译片段:空感后可]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>食后痛减</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF7C</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Stomach qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_得食痛减</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Epigastrium or abdomen pain or with deficiency or severe hunger pain taking food pain alleviated. Seen in deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern. [证候待译:中气虚证] [又称:食后痛减] [未译片段:空感后可]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>食后痛减</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF7C</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
