    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿根部外露。见于肾阴虚证、虚火上炎证、肾虚髓亏证、气血两虚证等。又称牙根宣露。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Exposure of the tooth roots (gingival recession). Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern. Also known as disclosed tooth roots.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.114</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>牙根宣露</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_牙宣</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Exposure of the tooth roots (gingival recession). Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, deficiency fire flaming upward pattern, kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern. Also known as disclosed tooth roots.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>牙根宣露</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
