    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发枯黄。见于久病失养、肾气虚、精血亏虚证、脾胃气虚证、脾虚食积证、气血两虚证，或疳病。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair yellow. Seen in chronic disease with malnourishment pattern; essence and blood deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan (infantile malnutrition). [证候待译:肾气虚/脾虚食积证] [未译片段:枯]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头发色黄</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hair yellow. Seen in chronic disease with malnourishment pattern; essence and blood deficiency pattern; spleen and stomach qi deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; gan (infantile malnutrition). [证候待译:肾气虚/脾虚食积证] [未译片段:枯]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
