    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮面表皮或黏膜上皮缺损，露出红色湿润面。见于湿热侵淫等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of epidermis or mucosal epithelium on the sore surface, exposing a red, moist base. Seen in dampness-heat invasion and spread.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.59</tcm:reference>
