    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤小动脉末端扩张形成的血管痣，中央为红色小痣，有许多扩张的毛细血管自中央向四周放射，状如蜘蛛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A vascular nevus formed by dilation of the terminal ends of small cutaneous arteries: a central red dot with numerous dilated capillaries radiating outward like a spider (spider angioma).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.158</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>112641009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>spider veins</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>247479008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>spider veins</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>XE75L</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spider</tcm:icd11Term>
  
