    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A vascular nevus formed by dilation of the terminal ends of small cutaneous arteries: a central red dot with numerous dilated capillaries radiating outward like a spider (spider angioma).</obo:IAO_0000115>
