    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛血络密布，充血。见于血热瘀滞证、气轮湿热证、阴虚火炎证、脾胃湿热证，或赤丝虬脉等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">White of the eye blood vessels congestion/hyperemia. Seen in blood heat with stagnation pattern; spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:气轮湿热证/阴虚火炎证/赤丝虬脉] [未译片段:密布]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
