    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">吐势较猛，声音壮厉。见于实热证、瘀阻脑络证、热闭心神证，或春温、暑湿、脑瘤、脑癌、颅脑痈、头部内伤、黄耳伤寒、霍乱等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Forceful vomiting with loud, vigorous sounds. Seen in excess heat pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, heat blocking the heart-spirit pattern, or spring warmth, summerheat-dampness, brain tumor, brain cancer, cranial abscess, internal head injury, yellow-ear cold damage, or cholera.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>药物副作用</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MD90.1</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vomiting</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呕声壮厉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
