    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻内长有息肉。见于心肺郁热证、痰浊凝结证、气血郁结证等。又称鼻痔、鼻茸、鼻内瘪肉、鼻中肉赘、鼻中息肉、鼻生赘、鼻息肉等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Inside the nose growing polyps. Seen in heart and lung depressed heat pattern; qi and blood depression and binding pattern. [证候待译:痰浊凝结证] Also known as nasal polyp. [又称:鼻痔/鼻茸/鼻内瘪肉/鼻中肉赘/鼻中息肉/鼻生赘]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻中息肉</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻中肉赘</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻内瘪肉</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻息肉</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻生赘</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻痔</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻茸</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
