    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">病变关节的正常形态发生改变，影响功能活动。见于气滞血瘀证、痰瘀痹阻证、肝肾亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The normal shape of the affected joint is altered, impairing functional movement. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, phlegm-stasis blocking impediment pattern, or liver-kidney deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>399269003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal joint morphology</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>248401009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormality of the jaw joint</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>229844004</tcm:snomedCT>
