    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便不通，点滴均无，尿量极少（&lt;100ml/日）。见于膀胱湿热证、肺热气壅证、瘀浊阻滞精室证。或水肿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Failure to pass urine, not even a drop, with extremely low urine output (&lt;100 ml/day; anuria). Seen in bladder dampness-heat pattern, lung heat with qi congestion pattern, stasis-turbidity blocking the essence chamber pattern, or edema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.70</tcm:reference>
