    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块按之如绵软。见于痰湿流注证、寒湿阻滞证、痰瘀互结证、痰气郁结证、痰湿流注证，或良性肿瘤、囊肿、血瘤、肉瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass soft as cotton on palpation. Seen in cold-dampness with obstruction pattern; phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; hemangioma; lipoma/sarcoma. [证候待译:痰湿流注证/痰气郁结证/痰湿流注证/良性肿瘤/囊肿]</tcm:definition>
