    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经期或经前大便溏泄或水泻，经后则愈，呈周期性发作。见于脾虚、肾虚、肝旺乘脾证。又称经来腹泻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loose or watery diarrhea occurring each period or premenstrually, resolving after the period in a cyclic pattern. Seen in spleen deficiency, kidney deficiency, or liver exuberance overacting on the spleen pattern. Also known as menstrual diarrhea.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.56</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经来腹泻</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行泄泻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loose or watery diarrhea occurring each period or premenstrually, resolving after the period in a cyclic pattern. Seen in spleen deficiency, kidney deficiency, or liver exuberance overacting on the spleen pattern. Also known as menstrual diarrhea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>经来腹泻</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
