    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">尿液表面浮有一层泡沫。见于消渴、肾气不足、湿浊下注等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Urine surface with foam. Seen in wasting-thirst (diabetes mellitus); kidney qi insufficiency pattern. [证候待译:湿浊下注] [未译片段:浮一层]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.80</tcm:reference>
