    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">体表长出或大或小、或柔软或坚硬的肿瘤。见于气滞证、血瘀证、痰凝肌肤证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Body surface long or large or small or softness or hardness tumor. Seen in qi stagnation pattern; blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:痰凝肌肤证] [未译片段:出]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.47</tcm:reference>
