    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睾丸质地坚硬。见于瘀热内郁证、阴虚火旺证，或睾丸肿瘤、子痈后期、子岩等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The testis is hard in texture. Seen in stasis-heat internal stagnation pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or testicular tumor, late-stage zi-abscess (ziyong/epididymo-orchitis), or zi-rock (testicular carcinoma).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.26</tcm:reference>
