    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">双手或左、右手肌肤知觉消失，不知痛痒。见于气滞血瘀证、气血两虚证、风痰阻络证，或手部疔疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both hands, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, or nail-like boil of the hand.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033748</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_手麻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both hands, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, or nail-like boil of the hand.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0033748</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0033748"/>
  
