    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸困难，气息迫促，声高息粗。见于表寒肺热证、痰热壅肺证、痰气互结证，或肺炎咳嗽、肺痈、高热热病等。又称喘促、气喘。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Difficulty breathing with urgency loud voice and coarse breathing. Seen in phlegm-heat congesting the lung pattern; phlegm-qi mutual binding pattern; pneumonia cough; lung abscess. [证候待译:表寒肺热证/高热热病] Also known as rapid dyspnea, dyspnea.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>喘促</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>气喘</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002094</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>195967001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Dyspnea</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD11.5</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Dyspnoea</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_气喘息粗</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Difficulty breathing with urgency loud voice and coarse breathing. Seen in phlegm-heat congesting the lung pattern; phlegm-qi mutual binding pattern; pneumonia cough; lung abscess. [证候待译:表寒肺热证/高热热病] Also known as rapid dyspnea, dyspnea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>喘促</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>气喘</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
