      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳脐带血，颜色红。见于耳风毒等。又称耳脓带血。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear discharge tinged with blood, red in color. Seen in ear wind toxin. Also known as blood-streaked ear pus.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>耳脓带血</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
