    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">基底部呈均匀红色，创面新鲜。见于火热伤阴证、火毒炽盛证、火毒内陷证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Base region presenting as all red colored wound face new-onset. Seen in fire with heat with damaging yin pattern. [证候待译:火毒炽盛证/火毒内陷证] [未译片段:匀鲜]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.45</tcm:reference>
