    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上腹近心窝处胀满不适。见于肝胃不和证、肝郁脾虚证、食滞胃肠证、肝胃阴虚证、脾虚气陷证、水热互结证、寒饮停胃证、胃气虚血瘀证，或饮食伤胃、膈疝、胃胀、胃痞、胃络痛等。又称胃胀。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Distension and fullness discomfort in the upper abdomen near the heart pit. Seen in liver-stomach disharmony pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, liver-stomach yin deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern, water-heat binding pattern, cold rheum collecting in the stomach pattern, stomach qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or dietary injury of the stomach, diaphragmatic hernia, stomach distension, stomach stuffiness, or stomach collateral pain. Also known as stomach distension.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.61</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>胃胀</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>胃脘胀满</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SA52</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Epigastric distension disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脘胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Distension and fullness discomfort in the upper abdomen near the heart pit. Seen in liver-stomach disharmony pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, liver-stomach yin deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern, water-heat binding pattern, cold rheum collecting in the stomach pattern, stomach qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or dietary injury of the stomach, diaphragmatic hernia, stomach distension, stomach stuffiness, or stomach collateral pain. Also known as stomach distension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>胃胀</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>胃脘胀满</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SA52</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
