    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者自觉阴茎内缩。见于寒滞肝脉证，脾肾阳虚证，阴虚火旺证，或阴缩病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective feeling of the penis retracting inward. Seen in cold stagnating in the liver vessels pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or genital retraction disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.57</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎隐缩</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective feeling of the penis retracting inward. Seen in cold stagnating in the liver vessels pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or genital retraction disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
