    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发生在鼻尖、鼻翼及鼻前庭部位的疔疮疖肿。见于风热结聚证、热毒壅盛证、邪毒内陷证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Occurrence of present tip of nose ala nasi and nose region ding (deep-rooted boil) sore furuncle. Seen in wind-heat with binding with gathering pattern; heat-toxin with congestion and exuberance pattern. [证候待译:邪毒内陷证] [未译片段:前庭位]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻生疔</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Occurrence of present tip of nose ala nasi and nose region ding (deep-rooted boil) sore furuncle. Seen in wind-heat with binding with gathering pattern; heat-toxin with congestion and exuberance pattern. [证候待译:邪毒内陷证] [未译片段:前庭位]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
