    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在两次月经之间，出现的周期性少量子宫出血。见于阴虚阳盛证、肝郁化火证、湿热阻滞证、气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cyclic scant uterine bleeding occurring between two menstrual periods (intermenstrual bleeding). Seen in yin deficiency with yang exuberance pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, dampness-heat obstruction pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100608</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0034263</tcm:hpoID>
