    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">包括大腹，小腹，少腹等部的疼痛，或全腹疼痛。见于湿热证、寒湿证、寒凝证、血瘀证、热结证、气滞证、食积／虫积证、脾虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Upper abdomen lower abdomen lower lateral abdomen region pain or whole abdomen pain. Seen in dampness-heat pattern; cold-dampness pattern; cold congelation pattern; blood stasis pattern; heat with binding pattern; qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:食积／虫积证/脾虚证] [未译片段:包括等]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.2</tcm:reference>
