    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指人体皮肤发生局限性或广泛的干燥粗糙，触之刺手，形似鱼鳞的变化。见于血虚风燥证、血热风燥证、湿热痹阻证、津亏证、血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Localized or generalized dryness and roughness of the skin, prickly to the touch, resembling fish scales. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern, blood heat with wind-dryness pattern, dampness-heat blocking impediment pattern, fluid depletion pattern, or blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.27</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肌肤甲错</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
