    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不能透过舌苔见到舌体的苔。主病位在里。见于肠胃宿食、痰浊停滞等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A coating so thick that the tongue body cannot be seen through it—indicating an interior disease location. Seen in retained food in the stomach and intestines, or stagnant phlegm-turbidity.</tcm:definition>
