    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核嵌顿在肛门边缘。见于湿热下注证、气血瘀滞肛门证，或翻花痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Incarcerated hemorrhoidal nodule present anus marginal. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:气血瘀滞肛门证/翻花痔]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
