    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上下口唇缺乏血色而发白。见于脾气虚证、血虚证等。又称唇色无华。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Upper and lower lips lacking blood color turning white. Seen in blood deficiency pattern. [证候待译:脾气虚证] Also known as lusterless lip color.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>唇色无华</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口唇淡白</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Upper and lower lips lacking blood color turning white. Seen in blood deficiency pattern. [证候待译:脾气虚证] Also known as lusterless lip color.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>唇色无华</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
