    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔质疏松，颗粒明显者。多见于食积、浊邪，或与腐苔并见阶段。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue coating granules obvious profuse. Seen in food accumulation. [证候待译:浊邪/与腐苔并见阶段] [未译片段:质疏松]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.71</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
