    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔布于偏舌根处。见于里邪虽减，胃滞依然，或素有痰湿者。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue coating is distributed toward the tongue root. Seen when the interior pathogen has lessened but stomach stagnation persists, or in those with habitual phlegm-dampness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.60</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
