    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视物的形态发生异常。见于肝郁血滞证、脾失健运证、肝肾阴亏证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Straight objects appear curved—an abnormal perception of object shape. Seen in liver depression with blood stagnation pattern, spleen failing in transport pattern, or liver-kidney yin depletion pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.7</tcm:reference>
