    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻窍内干燥，或干涩不适。见于肺胃郁热熏鼻证、燥伤鼻窍证、阴虚鼻窍失濡证、气虚鼻窍失充证，或鼻槁、液脱、干燥病等。又称鼻干。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nasal cavity inside dryness or not. Seen in withered nose (atrophic rhinitis). [证候待译:肺胃郁热熏鼻证/燥伤鼻窍证/阴虚鼻窍失濡证/气虚鼻窍失充证/液脱/干燥病] [又称:鼻干] [未译片段:干涩适]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻干</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻内干燥</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Nasal cavity inside dryness or not. Seen in withered nose (atrophic rhinitis). [证候待译:肺胃郁热熏鼻证/燥伤鼻窍证/阴虚鼻窍失濡证/气虚鼻窍失充证/液脱/干燥病] [又称:鼻干] [未译片段:干涩适]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>鼻干</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
