    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">逢月经来潮，乳头有乳汁溢出，量或多或少。见于肝郁脾虚证，或垂体肿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Milk discharge from the nipples, in varying amounts, occurring with each menstrual period. Seen in liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, or pituitary tumor.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行溢乳</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Milk discharge from the nipples, in varying amounts, occurring with each menstrual period. Seen in liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, or pituitary tumor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
