    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">单侧阴囊增大，有平卧而复还缩者湿，有不复还而硬者。见于下焦虚寒证、气滞血瘀证、肝胆热证，或阴囊水肿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Unilateral scrotal enlargement—in the soft type it reduces when lying flat, in the hard type it does not reduce. Seen in lower-jiao deficiency cold pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, liver-gallbladder heat pattern, or scrotal edema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
