    <obo:IAO_0000115>Unilateral scrotal enlargement—in the soft type it reduces when lying flat, in the hard type it does not reduce. Seen in lower-jiao deficiency cold pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, liver-gallbladder heat pattern, or scrotal edema.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
