    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道分泌物色黄，而淋漓不断，间或有腥臭。见于热入血室、脾虚湿困证、阴虚夹湿证、阴虚内热证，或阴痒、胞宫病变等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">(in women) vaginal discharge yellow incessant dripping or with fishy odor. Seen in yin deficiency with with with dampness pattern; vulvar itching. [证候待译:热入血室/脾虚湿困证/阴虚内热证/胞宫病变] [未译片段:间]</tcm:definition>
