    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉心中烦热、闷乱不安，以胸部至心窝间尤显。见于余热扰膈证、湿热郁蒸证、阳明腑实证、实热结胸证、胃阴虚火旺证等。又称心中懊。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective vexing heat and restless turmoil in the heart, most marked from the chest to the heart pit. Seen in residual heat harassing the diaphragm pattern, dampness-heat steaming pattern, yangming bowel excess pattern, excess heat chest binding pattern, or stomach yin deficiency with fire exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>心中懊浓</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MD95</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Heartburn</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_心中懊恼</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective vexing heat and restless turmoil in the heart, most marked from the chest to the heart pit. Seen in residual heat harassing the diaphragm pattern, dampness-heat steaming pattern, yangming bowel excess pattern, excess heat chest binding pattern, or stomach yin deficiency with fire exuberance pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>心中懊浓</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:MD95</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
