    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手震颤动摇，或一手独发，或两手并发。见于肝风内动证、风痰入络证、风寒袭络证、脾虚动风证、血虚风袭证、阴虚动风证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand tremor movement or hand hair or hand and hair. Seen in liver wind with internal stirring pattern; yin deficiency with stirring wind pattern. [证候待译:风痰入络证/风寒袭络证/脾虚动风证/血虚风袭证] [未译片段:摇一独两]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.25</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002378</tcm:hpoID>
