    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核色青紫。见于湿热下注证、气血瘀滞证，或血栓外痔、翻花痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hemorrhoidal nodule bluish purple. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern. [证候待译:血栓外痔/翻花痔]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.29</tcm:reference>
