    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻孔呼吸有味，严重者可有恶臭，其臭味特殊。见于鼻渊、脑漏等。又称臭鼻。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">An odor from the nostrils during breathing, severe cases with a characteristic foul stench. Seen in deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), or brain leak (naolou/purulent sinusitis). Also known as stinking nose (ozena).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>臭鼻</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻臭</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>An odor from the nostrils during breathing, severe cases with a characteristic foul stench. Seen in deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), or brain leak (naolou/purulent sinusitis). Also known as stinking nose (ozena).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>臭鼻</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
