    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经质地稠厚。见于心肝火旺证、瘀热内结证、湿热蕴结证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood thick and viscous in consistency. Seen in heart-liver fire exuberance pattern, stasis-heat internal binding pattern, or dampness-heat accumulating pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
