    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Redness and swelling of the nail fold. Seen in fire toxin internal binding, or paronychia and snake boil (sheding).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.46</tcm:reference>
