    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉肛门部如有物赘生。见于气血瘀滞肛门证、肛门湿热证、脾虚气陷证，或混合痔、脏毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anal region like with mass growing. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; zangdu (perianal abscess). [证候待译:气血瘀滞肛门证/肛门湿热证/混合痔] [未译片段:自觉赘]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.5</tcm:reference>
