    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿或脱落，或被龋蚀，形成龋洞。见于肾虚髓亏证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯肺证、气血亏虚证，或牙宣、牙痈、齿槽风、牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth lost or eroded by caries with cavity formation. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, stomach fire flaring the teeth pattern, wind-fire invading the lung pattern, qi-blood deficiency pattern, or tooth disclosure (periodontal atrophy), dental abscess, alveolar wind (jaw osteomyelitis), or gum ulceration.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.107</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000692</tcm:hpoID>
