    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">为皮面线形裂口，深浅长短不一，深达真皮时常伴有疼痛及渗血。见于皮皴。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Linear fissures of the skin surface of varying depth and length; when reaching the dermis they are often accompanied by pain and oozing blood. Seen in chapped skin.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.126</tcm:reference>
