    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">直肠二度脱垂，为直肠全层脱出，淡红色，表面为环状而有层次的黏膜皱襞，需用手复位。见于气血瘀滞证，或直肠脱垂性脱肛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Second-degree rectal prolapse: the entire rectal wall protrudes, pale red, with ring-like layered mucosal folds on the surface, requiring manual reduction. Seen in qi-blood stasis pattern, or prolapsing rectal prolapse.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.8</tcm:reference>
