    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛同时自觉发冷，或疼痛处有冷感，且多喜温热。见于寒证、寒邪阻络证、阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain accompanied by a subjective cold sensation, or coldness at the painful site, mostly preferring warmth. Seen in cold patterns, cold pathogen obstructing the collaterals pattern, or yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.25</tcm:reference>
