    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">各种原因引起的肢体不随意抽动。见于风邪闭阻证、风痰挟瘀证、阴虚阳亢证、热极生风证、脾肾阳虚证、肝郁血虚证、血虚生风证，或中毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntary convulsive jerking of the limbs from various causes. Seen in wind pathogen blocking pattern, wind-phlegm complicated by stasis pattern, yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern, extreme heat generating wind pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, liver depression with blood deficiency pattern, blood deficiency generating wind pattern, or poisoning.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001257</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>91175000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Seizure</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>8A68.Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Convulsions</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_四肢抽搐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Involuntary convulsive jerking of the limbs from various causes. Seen in wind pathogen blocking pattern, wind-phlegm complicated by stasis pattern, yin deficiency with yang hyperactivity pattern, extreme heat generating wind pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, liver depression with blood deficiency pattern, blood deficiency generating wind pattern, or poisoning.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0001257</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001257"/>
