      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">怀孕后厌恶进食，甚或恶闻食物气味，或伴呕吐。见于食滞胃肠证、脾胃虚弱证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to food after conception, even to the smell of food, sometimes with vomiting. Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, or spleen-stomach weakness pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XT0S</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Pregnancy</tcm:icd11Term>
  
