    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to food after conception, even to the smell of food, sometimes with vomiting. Seen in food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, or spleen-stomach weakness pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XT0S</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
