    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道中排出分泌物，质地清稀。见于肾阳虚证、脾阳虚证、胞宫虚寒证、脾虚湿困证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vaginal discharge thin and watery in consistency. Seen in kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen yang deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency cold pattern, or spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
