    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部有物肿起，或小块状，或点状（颗粒）。见于喉痹。急性者见于肺经风寒证、肺经风热证、肺胃热盛证；慢性者见于肺肾阴虚证、肝肾阴虚证、脾气虚弱证、肾阴亏虚证、气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A swollen mass in the throat, either lump-like or punctate (granular). Seen in throat impediment (houbi): the acute form in lung channel wind-cold pattern, lung channel wind-heat pattern, or lung-stomach exuberant heat pattern; the chronic form in lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, spleen qi weakness pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.75</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉部有肿起物</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A swollen mass in the throat, either lump-like or punctate (granular). Seen in throat impediment (houbi): the acute form in lung channel wind-cold pattern, lung channel wind-heat pattern, or lung-stomach exuberant heat pattern; the chronic form in lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, spleen qi weakness pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF93</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
