    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">突然表情淡漠，沉默呆滞，痴语无伦，多静而少动。见于痰气郁结证、脾虚痰湿证、心脾两虚证、阴虚火旺证、脾肾阳虚证等。又称文痴。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden apathy, silent dullness, incoherent foolish talk, with quietness and little movement. Seen in phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, spleen deficiency with phlegm-dampness pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern. Also known as quiet dementia (wenchi).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>文痴</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000716</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>210610001191</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>depression</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>35489007</tcm:snomedCT>
