    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sudden apathy, silent dullness, incoherent foolish talk, with quietness and little movement. Seen in phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, spleen deficiency with phlegm-dampness pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern. Also known as quiet dementia (wenchi).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>文痴</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
