    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔色洁白光亮，形状如片片雪花。见于脾阴衰败，寒湿凝闭等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pure white, glossy coating shaped like snowflake flakes. Seen in spleen yin decadence, or cold-dampness congealing blockage.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔如雪花</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
