    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脐部创面渗水，浸渍不干。见于湿热蕴结证、肌肤湿热证，或脐痈、脐湿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The umbilical surface oozes fluid and stays soaked without drying. Seen in dampness-heat accumulating pattern, skin-flesh dampness-heat pattern, or umbilical abscess and umbilical dampness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
