    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉鼻腔内出气灼热。见于燥伤鼻窍证、阴虚鼻窍失濡证、气虚鼻窍失充证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A burning sensation of the exhaled air within the nasal cavity. Seen in dryness damaging the nasal orifices pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened nasal orifices pattern, or qi deficiency with underfilled nasal orifices pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻内灼热</oboInOwl:id>
