    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A verrucous growth bearing mica-like scales on the glans. Seen in liver depression with blood stasis pattern, or kidney-rock flower-turning (penile carcinoma, shenyan fanhua).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.22</tcm:reference>
