    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口腔黏膜淡白无血色。见于脾胃虚弱证、气血两虚证，或贫血等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Oral cavity mucosa pale white without blood color. Seen in spleen and stomach weakness pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; anemia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA6NQ7</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Oral mucosa</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口腔黏膜淡白</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Oral cavity mucosa pale white without blood color. Seen in spleen and stomach weakness pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; anemia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XA6NQ7</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
