    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">虚里搏动极速，快慢不一，强弱不等。见于心阳虚证，或痰饮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The xuli (apical) pulsation is extremely rapid, irregular in rate and uneven in strength, as if about to expire. Seen in heart yang deficiency pattern, or phlegm-rheum.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_虚里动而欲绝</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The xuli (apical) pulsation is extremely rapid, irregular in rate and uneven in strength, as if about to expire. Seen in heart yang deficiency pattern, or phlegm-rheum.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#PhlegmEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
  </owl:Class>
