    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">双眼平视前方，一眼或双眼偏斜于一侧，甚者黑睛为该侧眼眶半掩，或全部淹没，外观只显白睛。见于上胞下垂，或风痰阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">With both eyes looking straight ahead, one or both eyes deviate to one side; in severe cases the cornea is half or fully hidden by the orbit, showing only the white of the eye. Seen in drooping upper eyelid (ptosis), or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.103</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_目偏视</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>With both eyes looking straight ahead, one or both eyes deviate to one side; in severe cases the cornea is half or fully hidden by the orbit, showing only the white of the eye. Seen in drooping upper eyelid (ptosis), or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#PhlegmEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
