      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热，全身肌肤热，刚用手按时觉较热，但按久反觉热减。见于外感疾病发热。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever with generalized hot skin that feels hot on first touch but less hot on prolonged palpation. Seen in fever of exogenous diseases.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>身热，初按热甚，久按热反减轻</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_身热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever with generalized hot skin that feels hot on first touch but less hot on prolonged palpation. Seen in fever of exogenous diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>身热，初按热甚，久按热反减轻</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
