    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">龟头部出现结节。见于阴茎痰核、肾岩翻花、肝郁血瘀证、硬下疳、阴茎乳头状瘤、龟头疣状肿物等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Glans penis region appearance of nodule. Seen in liver depression with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:阴茎痰核/肾岩翻花/硬下疳/阴茎乳头状瘤/龟头疣状肿物]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
