    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳轮色黄。或由耳窍痈疖走黄，表现为恶寒发热、颈项强直。或见于火毒流串证、热毒内闭证、热盛动风证、阴竭阳脱证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Helix of auricle yellow or ear abscess (yong) furuncle yellow manifesting as aversion to cold with fever neck stiffness or. Seen in heat-toxin with internal blockage pattern; heat with exuberance with stirring wind pattern. [证候待译:火毒流串证/阴竭阳脱证] [未译片段:由窍走]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
