    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Helix of auricle yellow or ear abscess (yong) furuncle yellow manifesting as aversion to cold with fever neck stiffness or. Seen in heat-toxin with internal blockage pattern; heat with exuberance with stirring wind pattern. [证候待译:火毒流串证/阴竭阳脱证] [未译片段:由窍走]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
