    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈侧颌下有肿块如蚕豆，累累如串珠。见于肺肾阴虚证、外感风火时毒，或瘰疬等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bean-sized lumps below the jaw on the side of the neck, strung together like beads. Seen in lung-kidney yin deficiency pattern, externally contracted wind-fire seasonal toxin, or scrofula (luoli).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
