    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳窍流脓状如豆腐渣。见于阴虚火旺证、肾虚邪滞证，或邪蚀骨质、慢性脓耳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear discharge resembling bean curd dregs. Seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, kidney deficiency with pathogen stagnation pattern, or pathogen eroding bone and chronic suppurative ear (chronic suppurative otitis media).</tcm:definition>
