    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手掌面或指缝间皮肤脱落。见于血虚生燥、肝肾不足、脾虚气弱证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Palm face or finger skin falling off. Seen in liver and kidney insufficiency pattern. [证候待译:血虚生燥/脾虚气弱证] [未译片段:缝间]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.19</tcm:reference>
