    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">双手或单手的握捏力量减弱，不任握物。见于脾虚证、湿邪阻滞证，或久病、重病、中风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Reduced grip strength of one or both hands, unable to hold objects firmly. Seen in spleen deficiency pattern, dampness pathogen obstruction pattern, or chronic illness, severe illness, and stroke.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.63</tcm:reference>
