      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻堵塞，鼻不通气，呼吸之气通过鼻腔时受阻。见于外感风寒证、外感风热证、风寒表证、肝胆湿热证、肺脾气虚证、肺肾阳虚证、气滞血瘀证，或异物入鼻、慢性单纯性鼻窒、慢性肥胖性鼻窒、鼻鼽、鼻槁、鼻渊、鼻息肉、鼻窦痰包、鼻腔肿瘤、伤风感冒等。又称鼻窒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nasal blockage with obstructed airflow through the nasal cavity. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, externally contracted wind-heat pattern, wind-cold exterior pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, lung-spleen qi deficiency pattern, lung-kidney yang deficiency pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or foreign body in the nose, chronic simple nasal blockage, chronic hypertrophic nasal blockage, allergic rhinitis (biqiu), atrophic rhinitis (bigao), deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), nasal polyp, sinus phlegm cyst, nasal cavity tumor, or common cold. Also known as nasal obstruction (bizhi).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.6</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>鼻窒</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001742</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>68235000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Nasal congestion</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MD11.9</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Nasal congestion</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_鼻塞</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Nasal blockage with obstructed airflow through the nasal cavity. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, externally contracted wind-heat pattern, wind-cold exterior pattern, liver-gallbladder dampness-heat pattern, lung-spleen qi deficiency pattern, lung-kidney yang deficiency pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or foreign body in the nose, chronic simple nasal blockage, chronic hypertrophic nasal blockage, allergic rhinitis (biqiu), atrophic rhinitis (bigao), deep-source nasal congestion (sinusitis), nasal polyp, sinus phlegm cyst, nasal cavity tumor, or common cold. Also known as nasal obstruction (bizhi).</obo:IAO_0000115>
