    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上、下牙齿自觉不自觉地相互磨切，或格格有声。见于风寒束表证、心脾积热证、食滞胃肠证、蛔虫病、气血两虚证、热盛动风证、阴虚动风证等。又称齿。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntary grinding of the upper and lower teeth, sometimes with a clicking sound. Seen in wind-cold binding the exterior pattern, heart-spleen accumulated heat pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, ascariasis, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, exuberant heat stirring wind pattern, or yin deficiency stirring wind pattern. Also known as tooth-gnashing (bruxism).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>齘齿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
