    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">前胸正中至胸骨剑突下或偏左处疼痛。见于心脉痹阻证、气虚血瘀证、风湿阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain from the center of the anterior chest to below the xiphoid or slightly to the left. Seen in heart vessel impediment obstruction pattern, qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or wind-dampness obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.43</tcm:reference>
