    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌体失其柔和，卷伸不利，或板硬强直，不能转动。见于热入心包证，高热伤津证、风痰阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue body loses its suppleness, curls and extends with difficulty, or is stiff and rigid, unable to move. Seen in heat entering the pericardium pattern, high fever damaging fluids pattern, or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.18</tcm:reference>
