    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉颈项部拘急胀满。见于毒邪流窜证、气滞痰凝证、痰瘀互结证、阴虚火旺证、肝郁痰热证、胃热脾虚证，或瘿气、侠瘿瘅、颈痈、瘰疬、气瘿、瘿痈、肉瘿、石瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck and nape region cramping and tension distension and fullness. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; scrofula; qi goiter (simple goiter); goiter abscess (thyroiditis); fleshy goiter (thyroid adenoma); stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/胃热脾虚证/瘿气/侠瘿瘅/颈痈] [未译片段:自觉]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈部发胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Neck and nape region cramping and tension distension and fullness. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; scrofula; qi goiter (simple goiter); goiter abscess (thyroiditis); fleshy goiter (thyroid adenoma); stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/胃热脾虚证/瘿气/侠瘿瘅/颈痈] [未译片段:自觉]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
