    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视力完全丧失。见于肝郁气滞证、水轮湿热证、水轮气血瘀滞证、水轮实热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Complete loss of vision. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat pattern, water-wheel qi-blood stasis pattern, or water-wheel excess heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.21</tcm:reference>
