    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻窍红肿，多发生在鼻孔前。见于风热壅肺证、痰火阻肺证，或鼻窦痰包染毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nasal cavity red swelling profuse occurrence of present nose. Seen in phlegm-fire with obstruction and lung disorder pattern. [证候待译:风热壅肺证/鼻窦痰包染毒] [未译片段:孔前]</tcm:definition>
