        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">出现于龟头包皮处为乳白色点状或条纹状，随后融合成片状或网状的白色斑块。见于肝肾阴虚证、风邪侵袭。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Appearance of at glans penis prepuce is white colored dots -like or -like coalescing into patches -like or -like white colored macule. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:风邪侵袭] [未译片段:处乳条纹随后网块]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.49</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎白斑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Appearance of at glans penis prepuce is white colored dots -like or -like coalescing into patches -like or -like white colored macule. Seen in liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:风邪侵袭] [未译片段:处乳条纹随后网块]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
