    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门脱出物呈淡红色。见于脾虚气陷证，或直肠脱垂性脱肛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anus prolapse mass presenting as light red colored. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern. [证候待译:直肠脱垂性脱肛]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>DB53</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Anal prolapse</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肛门脱出物色淡红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Anus prolapse mass presenting as light red colored. Seen in spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern. [证候待译:直肠脱垂性脱肛]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:DB53</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
