    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉如麻子之纷乱，细微之至。见于气不运血、气衰血枯，为心之危脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse chaotic like scattered hemp seeds, extremely thready and faint. Seen in qi failing to move blood, or qi debilitation with blood exhaustion—a critical heart pulse.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.30</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_麻促脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse chaotic like scattered hemp seeds, extremely thready and faint. Seen in qi failing to move blood, or qi debilitation with blood exhaustion—a critical heart pulse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
