    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女在月经前几天或月经来后，恶寒与发热交替发作，先感觉恶寒，随即发热。见于肝郁气滞，经行不畅。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">In women a few days before or after the onset of menstruation, alternating chills and fever—first aversion to cold, then fever. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation and unsmooth menstrual flow.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经期寒热往来</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境过热</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SD93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Alternating fever and chills disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_妇女月经期_寒热往来</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>In women a few days before or after the onset of menstruation, alternating chills and fever—first aversion to cold, then fever. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation and unsmooth menstrual flow.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>经期寒热往来</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SD93</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
