    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tongue tongue coating distribution not right-sided profuse. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder disorder pattern. [证候待译:半表里的病证] [未译片段:匀偏较]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.62</tcm:reference>
