    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便排出带血，呈淡红、鲜红、暗红或酱油色等。见于肝肾阴虚证、气滞血瘀证、心火亢盛证、脾肾气虚证、阴虚火旺证、膀胱湿热证、血热动血证、下焦湿热证，或石淋、热淋、肾瘅、肾痨、肾及膀胱肿瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Blood in the urine, pale red, bright red, dark red, or soy-sauce colored. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, spleen-kidney qi deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, bladder dampness-heat pattern, blood heat moving the blood pattern, lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, or stone strangury, heat strangury, kidney heat (shendan/pyelonephritis), kidney consumption (renal tuberculosis), or kidney and bladder tumors.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000790</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>34436003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Hematuria</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MF50.4</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Haematuria</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_血尿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Blood in the urine, pale red, bright red, dark red, or soy-sauce colored. Seen in liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, spleen-kidney qi deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, bladder dampness-heat pattern, blood heat moving the blood pattern, lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, or stone strangury, heat strangury, kidney heat (shendan/pyelonephritis), kidney consumption (renal tuberculosis), or kidney and bladder tumors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
