    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便呈细条形。见于湿热内蕴证，或悬珠痔、锁肛痔、肠癌。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Narrow, ribbon-thin stools. Seen in dampness-heat accumulating internally pattern, or hanging-pearl hemorrhoid, anus-locking hemorrhoid (anal/rectal tumor), or intestinal cancer.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.49</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_大便变细</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Narrow, ribbon-thin stools. Seen in dampness-heat accumulating internally pattern, or hanging-pearl hemorrhoid, anus-locking hemorrhoid (anal/rectal tumor), or intestinal cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
