    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹呈红色，与正常皮肤界限清楚。见于湿热证、风热证、血热证、热毒内郁证、脾经湿热证，或风疹、湿毒疹、湿疹、痱毒、痤疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red eruptions clearly demarcated from normal skin. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, wind-heat pattern, blood heat pattern, heat toxin internal stagnation pattern, spleen channel dampness-heat pattern, or rubella (fengzhen), damp-toxin eruption, eczema, prickly-heat toxin, or acne.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.97</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000988</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271807003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Skin rash</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>EM0Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Rash</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮疹色红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Red eruptions clearly demarcated from normal skin. Seen in dampness-heat pattern, wind-heat pattern, blood heat pattern, heat toxin internal stagnation pattern, spleen channel dampness-heat pattern, or rubella (fengzhen), damp-toxin eruption, eczema, prickly-heat toxin, or acne.</obo:IAO_0000115>
