    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛伴有肌肉挛急。见于寒邪凝滞证、虚寒证、湿热证、瘀热证等。又称抽痛、拘挛痛、拘急痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain accompanied by muscle. Seen in deficiency-cold pattern; dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:寒邪凝滞证/瘀热证] [又称:抽痛/拘挛痛/拘急痛] [未译片段:挛急]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>抽痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>拘急痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>拘挛痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF9D</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Uterine deficiency cold pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_挛痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain accompanied by muscle. Seen in deficiency-cold pattern; dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:寒邪凝滞证/瘀热证] [又称:抽痛/拘挛痛/拘急痛] [未译片段:挛急]</obo:IAO_0000115>
