    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经期或月经前后出现皮肤瘙痒。见于肝血亏虚、肝肾阴虚、肺肾阴虚、血虚生风证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual or menstruation appearance of skin itching. Seen in liver blood deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; lung and kidney yin deficiency pattern; blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern. [未译片段:每逢前后]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.59</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
