    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstrual or menstruation appearance of skin itching. Seen in liver blood deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; lung and kidney yin deficiency pattern; blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern. [未译片段:每逢前后]</obo:IAO_0000115>
