    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤较正常变薄，光亮，其表面纹理消失或异于正常。见于毒邪浸淫、寒凝血瘀证、气血两虚证、肝肾阴虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The skin is thinner than normal, glossy, with surface markings lost or abnormal. Seen in toxin pathogen invasion and spread, cold congealing with blood stasis pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or liver-kidney yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.67</tcm:reference>
