    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊外皮紧张光亮。见于湿热下注证、寒湿凝滞证、水湿停聚证、外湿内蕴成毒，或水疝、子痈、肾囊痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum tense shininess. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; cold-dampness with congelation pattern; ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:水湿停聚证/外湿内蕴成毒/水疝/肾囊痈] [未译片段:外皮]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.33</tcm:reference>
