    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮疹密集，融合成片，甚则似有分泌物。见于风热表证、风寒表证、血热证、血瘀证、胃肠积热证、气血两虚证，或风疹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rash coalescing into patches marked with discharge. Seen in blood heat pattern; blood stasis pattern; stomach and intestines accumulation with heat pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:风热表证/风寒表证/风疹] [未译片段:密集则似]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.94</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF02</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood heat pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮疹浸淫成片</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Rash coalescing into patches marked with discharge. Seen in blood heat pattern; blood stasis pattern; stomach and intestines accumulation with heat pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:风热表证/风寒表证/风疹] [未译片段:密集则似]</obo:IAO_0000115>
