    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛部位游走不固定。见于气滞证、风证、风湿闭阻经脉证等。又称疼痛游走不定。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Wandering pain without a fixed location. Seen in qi stagnation pattern, wind pattern, or wind-dampness blocking the channels pattern. Also known as migratory wandering pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>疼痛游走不定</tcm:synonym>
