    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痛无定处</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Wandering pain without a fixed location. Seen in qi stagnation pattern, wind pattern, or wind-dampness blocking the channels pattern. Also known as migratory wandering pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
