    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">为大小不一而界限清楚的实质性损害，或陷没于皮下，或高出于皮面。见于痰湿凝结证、寒湿下注证，或瓜藤缠、硬红斑、皮下痰核、皮肤猪囊虫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Well-demarcated solid lesions of varying size, either sunken beneath the skin or raised above its surface. Seen in phlegm-dampness congealing pattern, cold-dampness pouring downward pattern, or melon-vine entanglement (guatengchan/nodular vasculitis), erythema induratum, subcutaneous phlegm nodule, or cutaneous cysticercosis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.135</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>95319004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>growth of abnormal tissue on or under the skin</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>95325000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>firm lump under the skin</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤结节</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
