    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口干渴而喜饮，饮水量多、次频而不解渴。见于外感热病阳明经证、风热疫毒证、胃热津伤证、津气亏虚证，或伤暑、消渴病、夏季热、烧烫伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thirst with desire to drink, taking large volumes frequently without relieving the thirst. Seen in yangming channel pattern of exogenous febrile disease, wind-heat epidemic toxin pattern, stomach heat damaging fluids pattern, fluid-qi deficiency pattern, or summerheat injury, wasting-thirst disease (xiaoke/diabetes), summer fever, or burns and scalds.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>烦渴引饮</tcm:synonym>
