    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热，热度时高时低，体温波动。见于湿热、湿温、痈疡、气郁等病证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever with the heat level rising and falling, temperature fluctuating. Seen in dampness-heat, damp-warmth, abscess/ulcer, or qi depression disorders.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.19</tcm:reference>
