    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经周期正常，但行经时间超过七天以上，甚至淋漓半月方止。见于脾肾阳虚证、湿热蕴结证、气滞血瘀证、胞宫气虚证、胞宫虚热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A normal menstrual cycle but bleeding lasting more than seven days, even dribbling on for half a month. Seen in spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, dampness-heat accumulating pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, or uterine deficiency heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0400008</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>248989004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Prolonged menstruation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>GA20.50</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Heavy menstrual bleeding</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经期延长</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A normal menstrual cycle but bleeding lasting more than seven days, even dribbling on for half a month. Seen in spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, dampness-heat accumulating pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, or uterine deficiency heat pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
