    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼珠突然偏斜，转动受限。见于血虚生风证、脾气虚证、肝肾阴虚证、肝阳上亢证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eye sudden deviation movement restricted movement. Seen in blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; liver yang hyperactivity pattern. [证候待译:脾气虚证] [未译片段:珠转]</tcm:definition>
