    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔全部或部分剥落，剥落处舌面光滑无苔。见于胃气受损、胃阴枯涸、气血两虚等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Total or partial peeling of the tongue coating, leaving a smooth, coating-free surface. Seen in damaged stomach qi, exhausted stomach yin, or dual deficiency of qi and blood.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>光剥苔</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_剥苔</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Total or partial peeling of the tongue coating, leaving a smooth, coating-free surface. Seen in damaged stomach qi, exhausted stomach yin, or dual deficiency of qi and blood.</obo:IAO_0000115>
