    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眦部皮肤红赤溃烂。见于肉轮湿热证、肉轮热毒证、心热阴虚证，或眦帷赤烂等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Canthus region skin red ulceration and festering. Seen in heart heat with yin deficiency pattern. [证候待译:肉轮湿热证/肉轮热毒证/眦帷赤烂]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.2</tcm:reference>
