    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道中排出分泌物，夹有较多泡沫。见于湿热下注证、脾虚湿困证，或滴虫性阴道炎等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vaginal discharge mixed with abundant foam. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, or trichomonas vaginitis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.50</tcm:reference>
