    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳内鸣响，声音细小而轻，如闻蝉鸣。见于肾精亏虚证、肾气虚证、痰火郁结证、肝血虚证、阴虚耳窍失濡证、阳虚耳窍失煦证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fine, soft tinnitus resembling cicadas chirping. Seen in kidney essence deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-fire stagnation pattern, liver blood deficiency pattern, yin deficiency with unmoistened ear orifices pattern, or yang deficiency with unwarmed ear orifices pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>162349004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>ringing in ears</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
