    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者自觉身困疲乏，气短，不愿言语。见于脾气虚证、热伤气阴证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective bodily tiredness, shortness of breath, and reluctance to speak. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, or heat damaging qi and yin pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.3</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>气短懒言</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF70</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_少气懒言</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective bodily tiredness, shortness of breath, and reluctance to speak. Seen in spleen qi deficiency pattern, or heat damaging qi and yin pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>气短懒言</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF70</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
