    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">饮食倍于平常，且有饥饿感，伴身体消瘦。见于胃火炽盛证、阳明蓄血证，或消渴病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Food intake double the usual with a persistent sense of hunger, accompanied by emaciation. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, yangming blood amassment pattern, or wasting-thirst disease (xiaoke/diabetes).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_消谷善饥</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Food intake double the usual with a persistent sense of hunger, accompanied by emaciation. Seen in stomach fire blazing pattern, yangming blood amassment pattern, or wasting-thirst disease (xiaoke/diabetes).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
