    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">有较明确的疼痛部位，疼痛部位固定不移。见于血瘀证、寒湿闭阻经脉证等。又称疼痛固定不移。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain at a relatively definite location that does not move. Seen in blood stasis pattern, or cold-dampness blocking the channels pattern. Also known as fixed immovable pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>疼痛固定不移</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>痛有定处</tcm:synonym>
