    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">精液混浊，良久不化。见于湿热下注证、阴虚火旺证、肾阳亏虚证、痰瘀互结证，或精凝等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Semen turbidity chronic not. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; kidney yang deficiency pattern; phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern. [证候待译:精凝] [未译片段:良化]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_精液稠粘</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Semen turbidity chronic not. Seen in dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; kidney yang deficiency pattern; phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern. [证候待译:精凝] [未译片段:良化]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
