    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">绕黑睛周围呈环状赤带。颜色紫暗，疼痛拒按者，见于肝火上炎兼有瘀滞证：抱轮淡赤，压痛轻微者，见于阴虚火旺证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cornea surrounding presenting as -like red purple pain aggravated by pressure (refusing pressure). Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肝火上炎兼有瘀滞证：抱轮淡赤/压痛轻微者] [未译片段:绕环带颜暗]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.84</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_抱轮红赤</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cornea surrounding presenting as -like red purple pain aggravated by pressure (refusing pressure). Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肝火上炎兼有瘀滞证：抱轮淡赤/压痛轻微者] [未译片段:绕环带颜暗]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
