    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胎儿娩出后，胞宫内的瘀血和浊液留滞不下，或虽下甚少，或伴有小腹疼痛。见于肝郁气滞证、血瘀证、寒湿凝滞证、气血两虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid fluid in the uterus is retained and not discharged, or discharged only scantily, sometimes with lower abdominal pain. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, blood stasis pattern, cold-dampness congealing pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_恶露不下</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>After delivery, the stasis blood and turbid fluid in the uterus is retained and not discharged, or discharged only scantily, sometimes with lower abdominal pain. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, blood stasis pattern, cold-dampness congealing pattern, or dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
