      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上腹部疼痛是指由于各种原因引起的腹腔内外脏器的病变摄入某种植物成分或吞入毛发或某些矿物质如碳酸钙、钡剂、铋剂等在胃内凝结而形成的异物。而表现为腹部的疼痛半数以上病人有上腹部疼痛胀满、恶心、呕吐。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Upper abdominal pain caused by lesions of intra- or extra-abdominal organs from various causes—classically also described for bezoars formed in the stomach by ingested plant fibers, hair, or minerals such as calcium carbonate, barium or bismuth agents; over half of such patients present with upper abdominal pain, distension, nausea and vomiting.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:snomedCT>21522001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abdominal discomfort</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_上腹部疼痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Upper abdominal pain caused by lesions of intra- or extra-abdominal organs from various causes—classically also described for bezoars formed in the stomach by ingested plant fibers, hair, or minerals such as calcium carbonate, barium or bismuth agents; over half of such patients present with upper abdominal pain, distension, nausea and vomiting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:21522001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/21522001"/>
  </owl:Class>
