    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">涎液质稀，如流水般淋漓不尽。见于脾胃湿盛证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thin saliva flowing incessantly like water from the mouth. Seen in spleen-stomach dampness exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.14</tcm:reference>
