    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anal region with nodule bulging hardness. Seen in anorectal cancer. [证候待译:气血瘀滞肛门证] [未译片段:触]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.15</tcm:reference>
