    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来位浮，形细，势软，搏动力弱，不任重按，按之则无形。见于虚证、气虚证、亡血证，或湿困脾胃等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A floating, thin and soft pulse, weak in force, unable to bear heavy pressure—formless when pressed (soft/soggy pulse). Seen in deficiency patterns, qi deficiency pattern, blood collapse pattern, or dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉濡</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A floating, thin and soft pulse, weak in force, unable to bear heavy pressure—formless when pressed (soft/soggy pulse). Seen in deficiency patterns, qi deficiency pattern, blood collapse pattern, or dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
