    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉头重或身体沉重，而足（脚）发软，或如踩海绵，行走不稳。见于肝阳上亢证，或风眩等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head heaviness or body heaviness foot hair soft or like unsteady walking. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern. [证候待译:风眩] [未译片段:自觉脚踩海绵]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.37</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头重脚轻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Head heaviness or body heaviness foot hair soft or like unsteady walking. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern. [证候待译:风眩] [未译片段:自觉脚踩海绵]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
