    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tear fluid profuse amount clear and cold. Seen in liver and kidney deficiency pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:血虚风袭证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.65</tcm:reference>
