    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便质地清稀。见于虚寒证、寒湿犯表证、寒湿困脾证，或霍乱、胃痞、胆胀、胰胀、肝著、肠瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loose, thin stools. Seen in deficiency cold pattern, cold-dampness invading the exterior pattern, cold-dampness encumbering the spleen pattern, or cholera, stomach stuffiness, gallbladder distension, pancreatic distension, liver fixity, or intestinal tumor.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.64</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>大便稀薄</tcm:synonym>
