    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手部发生肿胀。见于风热痰毒证、热毒蕴结证、脓毒蕴结证，或手背发、托盘疔、外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand region occurrence of swelling. Seen in heat-toxin with accumulation and binding pattern; external injury pattern. [证候待译:风热痰毒证/脓毒蕴结证/手背发/托盘疔]</tcm:definition>
