    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上腹部左侧疼痛。多见于胃、胰腺或肠道病证，如脾胃虚弱证、瘀热壅滞证、胃肠气滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdomen left-sided pain profuse. Seen in stomach disorder pattern; stomach and intestines qi stagnation pattern. [证候待译:胰腺/肠道病证/如脾胃虚弱证/瘀热壅滞证] [未译片段:上]</tcm:definition>
