    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">足底局部皮厚增生，根深嵌入肉里，顶起硬结，形似鸡眼。常见于手足部长期受挤压、摩擦等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Localized thickened skin on the sole with a deep root embedded in the flesh, forming a hard nodule shaped like a chicken's eye (corn/clavus). Commonly caused by prolonged pressure and friction on the hands or feet.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>128602000</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>cross eyed</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>22066006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>cross eyed</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
