    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肢体关节或胸腹部痛处游走不定。见于风湿痹阻证、行痹证或气滞证。该项多用于描述关节疼痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Wandering pain shifting among the limb joints or the chest and abdomen. Seen in wind-dampness impediment pattern, migratory impediment (xingbi), or qi stagnation pattern; mostly used to describe joint pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.17</tcm:reference>
