    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视一物为二物而不清。见于水轮湿热蕴结证、水轮气滞血瘀证、水轮阴亏证、水轮气虚血亏证，或云雾移睛、血灌瞳神等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Seeing one object as two, indistinctly (diplopia). Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat accumulation pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, or cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity) and hyphema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000651</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>24982008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>diplopia</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_视歧</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Seeing one object as two, indistinctly (diplopia). Seen in water-wheel (pupil) dampness-heat accumulation pattern, water-wheel qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, water-wheel yin depletion pattern, water-wheel qi deficiency with blood depletion pattern, or cloud-fog drifting before the eyes (vitreous opacity) and hyphema.</obo:IAO_0000115>
