    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻尖局部肿起。见于肺经火盛证、阴虚火旺证、心虚夹瘀证、邪毒炽盛证，或鼻疔、鼻疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tip of nose local swollen. Seen in lung channel fire exuberance pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; pathogenic toxin blazing pattern; nasal ding (vestibular furuncle); nasal gan. [证候待译:心虚夹瘀证]</tcm:definition>
