    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现一时性局限性团块状隆起，时起时消，不留任何瘀迹。见于风邪外袭证、营卫失和证、卫表不固证、冲任不调证、热盛生风证，或药毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Transient localized wheals rising on the skin, appearing and disappearing without leaving any trace. Seen in wind pathogen exterior invasion pattern, nutrient-defense disharmony pattern, insecure defensive exterior pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, exuberant heat generating wind pattern, or drug toxin (drug eruption).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_风团时隐时现</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Transient localized wheals rising on the skin, appearing and disappearing without leaving any trace. Seen in wind pathogen exterior invasion pattern, nutrient-defense disharmony pattern, insecure defensive exterior pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, exuberant heat generating wind pattern, or drug toxin (drug eruption).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
