    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白昼视力正常，每到黄昏则视物不清。见于水轮气虚络痹证、水轮阳虚络痹证、肝肾亏虚证，或高风内障等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Normal daytime vision but blurred vision every evening at dusk (night blindness). Seen in water-wheel qi deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, water-wheel yang deficiency with collateral impediment pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, or high-wind internal oculopathy (retinitis pigmentosa).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.28</tcm:reference>
