    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头面疼痛沿三叉神经部位分布，多呈扯痛、跳痛，或有触电感。见于三叉神经痛疾病。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the head and face distributed along the trigeminal nerve, mostly dragging or throbbing pain, or with an electric-shock sensation. Seen in trigeminal neuralgia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>31681005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>tic douloureux</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>8B82.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Trigeminal neuralgia</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>8A82</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Trigeminal autonomic cephalalgias</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>NA04.4</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Injury of trigeminal nerve</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_三叉神经痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
