    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小腿内侧出现红丝状脉缕。见于火毒窜络证、火毒入营证，或红丝疔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lower leg inside appearance of red threads -like pulse strands. Seen in red-thread ding (acute lymphangitis). [证候待译:火毒窜络证/火毒入营证] [未译片段:侧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.91</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA5U49</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Distal lower leg</tcm:icd11Term>
  
