    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼部干涩如有沙砾磨涩。见于热盛动血证、痰浊凝聚证、热毒壅滞证，或睑内结石、鱼子石榴等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dryness and grittiness of the eyes, as if sand were grinding them. Seen in exuberant heat stirring blood pattern, phlegm-turbidity congealing pattern, heat toxin congestion pattern, or palpebral concretions and fish-roe/pomegranate follicles (trachoma follicles).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>双目干涩</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_眼砂涩</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dryness and grittiness of the eyes, as if sand were grinding them. Seen in exuberant heat stirring blood pattern, phlegm-turbidity congealing pattern, heat toxin congestion pattern, or palpebral concretions and fish-roe/pomegranate follicles (trachoma follicles).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>双目干涩</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
