    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">甲板周围皮肤色红肿胀甚则指／趾通红。见于热毒内聚证，或指头痈、蛇头疔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nail plate surrounding skin red swelling marked finger toe red. [证候待译:热毒内聚证/指头痈/蛇头疔] [未译片段:则／通]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_甲旁红肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
