    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸微弱。见于虚寒证、肺气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Faint, weak breathing. Seen in deficiency cold pattern, or lung qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.39</tcm:reference>
