    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口渴感明显、急迫，欲饮水，饮水量多，症状较口渴引饮重。见于气分热盛证、胃火炽盛证、津伤证等。常与口渴引饮并见。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thirst obvious drink fluid drink fluid profuse amount -like thirst with desire to drink and thirst with desire to drink co-occurring. Seen in qi aspect heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:胃火炽盛证/津伤证] [未译片段:感急迫欲症较重常]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_大渴</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Thirst obvious drink fluid drink fluid profuse amount -like thirst with desire to drink and thirst with desire to drink co-occurring. Seen in qi aspect heat with exuberance pattern. [证候待译:胃火炽盛证/津伤证] [未译片段:感急迫欲症较重常]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
