    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核脱出肛门外，或可自行还纳，或不能自行还纳。见于中气下陷证，或内痔、翻花痔、内外痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The hemorrhoid prolapses outside the anus, either reducible by itself or not. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, or internal hemorrhoid, flower-turning hemorrhoid, or internal-external hemorrhoids.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痔核脱出肛门</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The hemorrhoid prolapses outside the anus, either reducible by itself or not. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, or internal hemorrhoid, flower-turning hemorrhoid, or internal-external hemorrhoids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
