    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉膝关节局部寒冷，可伴恶风寒。见于风寒湿邪痹阻关节证、鹤膝风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective localized coldness of the knee joint, possibly with aversion to wind-cold. Seen in wind-cold-dampness pathogen blocking the joints pattern, or crane's-knee wind (chronic knee arthritis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_膝冷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective localized coldness of the knee joint, possibly with aversion to wind-cold. Seen in wind-cold-dampness pathogen blocking the joints pattern, or crane's-knee wind (chronic knee arthritis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
