    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">平时睡眠正常，但每值经前即出现失眠，甚至通宵不寐，经后又恢复正常。见于心脾两虚、阴虚火旺、心肝火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Normal sleep at other times, but insomnia occurring before each period, even sleepless all night, returning to normal after the period. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency, yin deficiency with effulgent fire, or heart-liver fire exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>193462001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>difficulty staying or falling asleep</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经前不寐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Normal sleep at other times, but insomnia occurring before each period, even sleepless all night, returning to normal after the period. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency, yin deficiency with effulgent fire, or heart-liver fire exuberance pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:193462001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/193462001"/>
  
