    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔淡黄而润滑多津。见于阳虚寒湿证、痰饮化热证、阳虚之体感受湿热之邪等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pale-yellow, moist and slippery coating with abundant fluid. Seen in yang deficiency with cold-dampness pattern, phlegm-rheum transforming into heat pattern, or a yang-deficient constitution contracting dampness-heat pathogen.</tcm:definition>
