    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瘿肿不随吞咽上下移动。见于气郁痰凝证、痰湿瘀滞证、瘀血阻滞证，或石瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The goiter does not move up and down with swallowing. Seen in qi depression with phlegm congealing pattern, phlegm-dampness stasis pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, or stone goiter (shiying/hard thyroid tumor).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.30</tcm:reference>
