    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The mouth is moist without dryness or fluid lack, and there is no desire to drink. Seen in cold patterns, yang deficiency pattern, water-rheum internal stagnation pattern, phlegm-turbidity internal stagnation pattern, or qi deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
