    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上、下牙齿相互磨切，格格有声。见于风寒束表证、心脾积热证、食滞胃肠证、气血两虚证、热盛风动证、阴虚动风证，或蛔虫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Grinding of the upper and lower teeth with a clicking sound. Seen in wind-cold binding the exterior pattern, heart-spleen accumulated heat pattern, food stagnating in the stomach and intestines pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, exuberant heat with wind stirring pattern, yin deficiency stirring wind pattern, or ascariasis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.54</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
