    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两侧或左、右手臂部肌肤知觉消失，不知痛痒。见于气滞血瘀证、气血两虚证、风痰阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both arms, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.15</tcm:reference>
