    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部胀大，但腹中有气体积聚，空虚如鼓。见于臌胀、水肿、积聚等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The abdomen is distended and enlarged, with gas accumulation inside, hollow like a drum. Seen in drum distension (guzhang), edema, or accumulation-gathering (jiju).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>腹胀如鼓</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0003270</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>41931001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abdominal bloating</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>60728008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abdominal bloating</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>ME01</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Abdominal distension</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SM31</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Abdominal distension disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腹大如鼓</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The abdomen is distended and enlarged, with gas accumulation inside, hollow like a drum. Seen in drum distension (guzhang), edema, or accumulation-gathering (jiju).</obo:IAO_0000115>
