    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">较长时间不想进食，饮食量较少。见于肝气郁结证、脾胃虚弱证，或伤食、疳积等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Prolonged reluctance to eat, with reduced food intake. Seen in liver qi depression pattern, spleen-stomach weakness pattern, or food damage and infantile malnutrition with accumulation (ganji).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0004396</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>64379006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>decreased appetite</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>XT8W</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Chronic</tcm:icd11Term>
  
