    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Prolonged reluctance to eat, with reduced food intake. Seen in liver qi depression pattern, spleen-stomach weakness pattern, or food damage and infantile malnutrition with accumulation (ganji).</obo:IAO_0000115>
