    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呕吐，吐出黄绿胆汁，或吐出物带有胆汁苦味。见于暴怒伤肝、肝郁气滞证、肝胃不和证，或少阳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vomiting of yellow-green bile, or vomitus with a bitter biliary taste. Seen in sudden rage damaging the liver, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, liver-stomach disharmony pattern, or shaoyang disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.47</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当、感染</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002248</tcm:hpoID>
