    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口角部出现疮疡，红肿疼痛。见于脾胃湿热证、肝胆湿热证、阴虚证等。又称口吻疮，燕口，口肥疮。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Corner of mouth region appearance of sores and ulcers red swelling pain. Seen in spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; yin deficiency pattern. [又称:口吻疮/燕口/口肥疮]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口吻疮，燕口，口肥疮</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口角生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Corner of mouth region appearance of sores and ulcers red swelling pain. Seen in spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; yin deficiency pattern. [又称:口吻疮/燕口/口肥疮]</obo:IAO_0000115>
