    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一般神志清醒而喃喃自语，见人语止。见于心气虚证、痰气郁结证、气滞血瘀证，或癫病等。又称独语。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Muttering to oneself while generally clear in consciousness, stopping when others approach. Seen in heart qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or depressive psychosis (dian). Also known as soliloquy (duyu).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>独语</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SE91</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Qi stagnation pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_喃喃独语</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
