    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门边缘皮肤皱襞肥大，赘生皮瓣。见于下焦湿热证、血热瘀阻证、气血瘀滞肛门证、肛门湿热，或外痔、皮痔、气痔、脉痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hypertrophic skin folds with redundant flaps at the anal verge. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, blood heat with stasis obstruction pattern, qi-blood stasis in the anus pattern, perianal dampness-heat, or external hemorrhoid, skin hemorrhoid (sentinel pile), qi hemorrhoid, or vessel hemorrhoid (varicose hemorrhoid).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肛门边缘皮赘</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
