    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两目神光不足。提示正气不足，精气损伤，机体功能较弱。见于疾病恢复期、体质虚弱者。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Both eyes lack spirit-luster. Indicates righteous qi insufficiency, essence-qi damage, and weakened bodily function. Seen during convalescence, or in those with a weak constitution.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.102</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_目失光华</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Both eyes lack spirit-luster. Indicates righteous qi insufficiency, essence-qi damage, and weakened bodily function. Seen during convalescence, or in those with a weak constitution.</obo:IAO_0000115>
