    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">寒热交错，时而恶寒，时而发热，寒热发作无规律。见于惊风、脏燥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Chills and fever alternating erratically—now aversion to cold, now fever—without any regular pattern. Seen in fright wind (infantile convulsion), or visceral dryness (zangzao).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SD93</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Alternating fever and chills disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>MG21</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Chills</tcm:icd11Term>
  
