    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Chills and fever alternating erratically—now aversion to cold, now fever—without any regular pattern. Seen in fright wind (infantile convulsion), or visceral dryness (zangzao).</obo:IAO_0000115>
