    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">遗精频繁，而伴有性梦、欣快感。见于湿热下注证、肝郁化火证、心肾不交证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Frequent seminal emission accompanied by erotic dreams and pleasurable sensation. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.11</tcm:reference>
