    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_梦遗</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Frequent seminal emission accompanied by erotic dreams and pleasurable sensation. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
