    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">由于皮肤表皮破损而露出湿烂面。见于肌肤湿毒证、湿盛，或水疱、脉疱、大疱等破后、表皮损伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A moist, eroded surface exposed by loss of the epidermis. Seen in skin-flesh damp toxin pattern, dampness exuberance, or after rupture of vesicles, pustules or bullae, or epidermal injury.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.125</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_皮肤溃烂</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
