    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道中排出分泌物，浑浊如米泔，闻之秽臭。见于湿毒证、胞宫湿热证，或阴痒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Vaginal discharge turbid like rice-washing water with a foul smell. Seen in damp toxin pattern, uterine dampness-heat pattern, or genital itching.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.72</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0034269</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:icd11>MF3A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Vaginal discharge</tcm:icd11Term>
  
