    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳后完骨部红肿胀痛。见于胆经风火证、肝胆湿热证、风邪热毒犯耳证、热毒炽盛证，或耳根毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mastoid region behind the ear red swelling pain. Seen in liver disorder and gallbladder dampness-heat pattern; toxic heat blazing pattern; retroauricular abscess. [证候待译:胆经风火证/风邪热毒犯耳证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>43887004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>pit behind the ear</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
