    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头形呈上小下大的梯形。见于先天肾精不足、脾胃失调证，或佝偻病、胎传梅毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A head shaped like a trapezoid, small at the top and large at the bottom. Seen in congenital kidney essence insufficiency, spleen-stomach disorder pattern, or rickets and congenital syphilis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.19</tcm:reference>
