    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部胀大。见于肝气郁结证、气滞湿阻证，或臌胀、水肿、积聚、饮食不节、嗜酒过度等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdomen distension large. Seen in liver qi depression and binding pattern; qi stagnation with dampness with obstruction pattern; edema; abdominal accumulation (jiju). [证候待译:臌胀/饮食不节/嗜酒过度]</tcm:definition>
