    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头后枕部疼痛，痛及颈项部。为太阳经头痛。见于肝阳上亢证、风寒或寒湿外袭太阳经证。又称头项疼痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head occiput pain pain and neck and nape region is yang headache. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern; wind-cold pattern. [证候待译:寒湿外袭太阳经证] [又称:头项疼痛] [未译片段:后太经]</tcm:definition>
