    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉脑户寒冷，喜戴帽或以毛巾裹头，不胜风寒。多见于风寒束表证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective coldness of the head, preferring a hat or towel wrapped around it, unable to withstand wind-cold. Mostly seen in wind-cold binding the exterior pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头恶风寒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective coldness of the head, preferring a hat or towel wrapped around it, unable to withstand wind-cold. Mostly seen in wind-cold binding the exterior pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
