    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指阴茎异常勃起，经数小时，甚至数日不衰的症状。多见于阴虚火旺、湿热下注证。又称阳举不衰。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abnormal persistent erection of the penis lasting hours or even days without subsiding (priapism). Mostly seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire, or dampness-heat pouring downward pattern. Also known as persistent erection.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>阳举不衰</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XT6Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Persistent</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SB0A</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Persistent erection disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阳强</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Abnormal persistent erection of the penis lasting hours or even days without subsiding (priapism). Mostly seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire, or dampness-heat pouring downward pattern. Also known as persistent erection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>阳举不衰</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
