    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神歪斜，或似杏仁、桃仁、三角、半圆，与瞳神干缺类似。见于气血瘀滞证，或旋螺尖起等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A skewed pupil, almond-, peach-kernel-, triangular- or semicircular-shaped, similar to pupillary defect. Seen in qi-blood stasis pattern, or spiral bulge.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.92</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
