    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤较正常人白而略带青色。见于脾虚湿蕴证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin whiter than normal with a slightly bluish tint. Seen in spleen deficiency with dampness accumulation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.152</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
