    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">臖核结块与基底部粘连，推之可移。见于肝经火旺证、心肝阴虚证、心肾阴虚证、肝肾阴虚证，或恶核、石瘿、瘿气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Xinghe nodule lumping and base region adhesion mobile on palpation. Seen in liver channel fire flaring pattern; heart and liver yin deficiency pattern; heart and kidney yin deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:恶核/瘿气]</tcm:definition>
