    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现含有血液的水疱。见于热入血分、血热妄行、脾不统血证，或外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of with blister (vesicle). Seen in blood heat with reckless movement pattern; spleen failing to contain blood pattern; external injury pattern. [证候待译:热入血分] [未译片段:含血液]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.70</tcm:reference>
