    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒与发热同时并作。为外感表证的主症，或见于痈疡溃脓等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold and fever occurring simultaneously—the chief symptom of an exogenous exterior pattern, also seen in ulcerating abscesses discharging pus.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.3.10</tcm:reference>
