    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉脘腹或小腹部寒冷，多伴有喜暖喜按。见于脾胃阳虚、肾阳虚或寒滞肝脉、冲任虚寒等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Epigastrium and abdomen or lower abdomen region coldness profuse accompanied by fond of fond of pressure. Seen in spleen and stomach yang deficiency pattern. [证候待译:肾阳虚/寒滞肝脉/冲任虚寒等证] [未译片段:自觉寒暖]</tcm:definition>
