    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头形呈上大下小的倒梯形。见于先天肾精不足证、脾胃失调证，或佝偻病、胎传梅毒等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A head shaped like an inverted trapezoid, large at the top and small at the bottom. Seen in congenital kidney essence insufficiency pattern, spleen-stomach disorder pattern, or rickets and congenital syphilis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA9DH2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Trapezoid bone</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_头面呈上大下小的倒梯形</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A head shaped like an inverted trapezoid, large at the top and small at the bottom. Seen in congenital kidney essence insufficiency pattern, spleen-stomach disorder pattern, or rickets and congenital syphilis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
