    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痛处游走不定，或走窜攻痛。见于气滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Wandering pain without a fixed site, or scurrying, darting pain. Seen in qi stagnation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>走窜作痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SE91</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Qi stagnation pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_窜痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Wandering pain without a fixed site, or scurrying, darting pain. Seen in qi stagnation pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
