    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">囟门处皮肤高出头皮，呈突起之状。见于火毒上攻证、寒湿凝滞证等。又称囟填。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fontanelle skin scalp presenting as protrusion -like. Seen in cold-dampness with congelation pattern. [证候待译:火毒上攻证] [又称:囟填] [未译片段:处高出]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>囟填</tcm:synonym>
