    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌伸于口外不即回缩。见于热盛风动证、脾肾虚热证，或痫病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue protrudes out of the mouth without promptly retracting. Seen in exuberant heat with wind stirring pattern, spleen-kidney deficiency heat pattern, or epilepsy (xian).</tcm:definition>
