    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两腿或左、右腿部肌肤知觉消失，不知痛痒。见于气滞血瘀证、气血两虚证、风痰阻络证，或脚气、痿躄等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of cutaneous sensation in one or both legs, with insensibility to pain and itch. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, wind-phlegm obstructing the collaterals pattern, or beriberi and flaccidity lameness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.58</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腿麻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
