    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻窍部发红肿胀。见于肺经火盛证、阴虚火旺证、心虚夹瘀证、邪毒炽盛证，或鼻疔、鼻疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nasal cavity turning red and swollen. Seen in lung channel fire exuberance pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; pathogenic toxin blazing pattern; nasal ding (vestibular furuncle); nasal gan. [证候待译:心虚夹瘀证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.11</tcm:reference>
