    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿瘤位置较深，一般手难触摸得到。见于深部肿瘤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tumor lies deep and can hardly be felt by hand. Seen in deep-seated tumors.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XK16</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Deep</tcm:icd11Term>
  
