    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便白如胶冻，或红如瓜瓤，或红白相杂如鱼脑。见于胃肠湿热证、肠道寒湿证、暑人厥阴、下焦虚寒证、阴虚内热证、肠道瘀滞证、脾虚湿热证、肝郁脾虚证、痰瘀互结证，或痢疾、疫毒、肠瘤、奇恒痢、肠癌、锁肛痔、悬珠痔、大瘕泄等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Stools white like jelly, red like melon pulp, or red-white mixed like fish brain (purulent-bloody stool). Seen in gastrointestinal dampness-heat pattern, intestinal cold-dampness pattern, summerheat entering jueyin, lower-jiao deficiency cold pattern, yin deficiency with internal heat pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-stasis intermingling pattern, or dysentery, epidemic toxin, intestinal tumor, persistent strange dysentery, intestinal cancer, anus-locking hemorrhoid, hanging-pearl hemorrhoid, or great aggregation diarrhea.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.56</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025085</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_大便脓血</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Stools white like jelly, red like melon pulp, or red-white mixed like fish brain (purulent-bloody stool). Seen in gastrointestinal dampness-heat pattern, intestinal cold-dampness pattern, summerheat entering jueyin, lower-jiao deficiency cold pattern, yin deficiency with internal heat pattern, intestinal stasis stagnation pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness-heat pattern, liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-stasis intermingling pattern, or dysentery, epidemic toxin, intestinal tumor, persistent strange dysentery, intestinal cancer, anus-locking hemorrhoid, hanging-pearl hemorrhoid, or great aggregation diarrhea.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0025085</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025085"/>
  
