    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脐部正中疼痛。见于蛔虫证、肾气虚寒证、肠结燥屎证等。又称脐内痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain at the center of the umbilicus. Seen in roundworm pattern, kidney qi deficiency cold pattern, or intestinal binding with dry stool pattern. Also known as intra-umbilical pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>脐内痛</tcm:synonym>
