    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain at the center of the umbilicus. Seen in roundworm pattern, kidney qi deficiency cold pattern, or intestinal binding with dry stool pattern. Also known as intra-umbilical pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
