    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢月经来临之前周期性小腹疼痛难忍。见于肝郁气滞、气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cyclic unbearable lower abdominal pain occurring before each menstrual period. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.15</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痛在经前</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cyclic unbearable lower abdominal pain occurring before each menstrual period. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
