    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">关节红肿或肿大而皮色不变，屈伸不利。见于瘀血痹阻、肾阳虚证、阴阳两虚证，或风湿热痹、痰饮流注关节、虚痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Joint red swelling or enlargement colored not impaired flexion and extension. [证候待译:瘀血痹阻/肾阳虚证/阴阳两虚证/风湿热痹/痰饮流注关节/虚痹] [未译片段:皮变]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.36</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271771009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>joint swelling</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SN08</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Prostatic enlargement disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
