    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse in the skin, faint on arrival, then darting away—like a shrimp swimming and suddenly leaping. Seen in yin exhaustion and yang defeat; a rootless pulse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
