    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉背部寒冷，欲得温暖。见于心阳虚、脾胃虚寒、寒饮停聚等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective coldness of the back, desiring warmth. Seen in heart yang deficiency, spleen-stomach deficiency cold, or cold rheum collecting patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.1.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0033850</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_背冷</oboInOwl:id>
