    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">大便燥结如羊屎。见于大肠津亏证、肠热腑实证、胃热证、阴虚肠燥证、脾肺气虚证、阳虚寒凝证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dry, bound stools like goat droppings. Seen in large-intestine fluid depletion pattern, intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, stomach heat pattern, yin deficiency with intestinal dryness pattern, spleen-lung qi deficiency pattern, or yang deficiency with cold congealing pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>便如羊粪</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
