    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肛门没有排气。见于肝胆气滞证、肠道气滞证，或肠痹、肠结等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">No flatus passed from the anus. Seen in liver-gallbladder qi stagnation pattern, intestinal qi stagnation pattern, or intestinal impediment and intestinal binding (obstruction).</tcm:definition>
