    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者两肩垂下，无力耸起。见于肺气虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Both shoulders droop and cannot be raised with strength. Seen in lung qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF80</tcm:icd11>
