    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">眼部胀痛，如石硬。见于气火上逆证、气血郁闭证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eye region distending pain like stone-hard. Seen in qi and blood depression with blockage pattern. [证候待译:气火上逆证]</tcm:definition>
