    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便后仍有余沥点滴不净。见于肾虚胞寒证、中气下陷证、膀胱湿热证、阴虚火旺证，或劳淋、精癃、老年或久病体衰者。又称尿后余沥。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Dribbling urine drops persisting after urination. Seen in kidney deficiency with uterine cold pattern, middle qi sinking pattern, bladder dampness-heat pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or taxation strangury (laolin), essence retention (prostatic hyperplasia), or old age and chronic debilitation. Also known as post-void dribbling.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>尿后余沥</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_余沥不尽</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Dribbling urine drops persisting after urination. Seen in kidney deficiency with uterine cold pattern, middle qi sinking pattern, bladder dampness-heat pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or taxation strangury (laolin), essence retention (prostatic hyperplasia), or old age and chronic debilitation. Also known as post-void dribbling.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>尿后余沥</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
