    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目眶（眼眶）疼痛。见于劳损、外感病、眼病、三叉神经痛等。又称眼眶（疼）痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Orbit eye pain. Seen in strain; external contraction pattern; trigeminal neuralgia. [证候待译:眼病] [又称:眼眶（疼）痛] [未译片段:眶]</tcm:definition>
