    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>MC86</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Precordial pain</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_目眶痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Orbit eye pain. Seen in strain; external contraction pattern; trigeminal neuralgia. [证候待译:眼病] [又称:眼眶（疼）痛] [未译片段:眶]</obo:IAO_0000115>
