    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">直立两膝并拢时，两小腿斜向内弓成“X”形。见于佝偻病、先天不足等。又称“X”型腿、八字腿。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">When standing upright with both knees together, the lower legs bow inward into an "X" shape (knock-knee). Seen in rickets, or congenital insufficiency. Also known as X-legs or splayed legs.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.76</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>“X”型腿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>八字腿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>299331007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bow leggedness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>299330008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>genu valga</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_膝内翻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>When standing upright with both knees together, the lower legs bow inward into an "X" shape (knock-knee). Seen in rickets, or congenital insufficiency. Also known as X-legs or splayed legs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>“X”型腿</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>八字腿</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
