    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anus prolapse mass stalk presenting as -like distribution. Seen in wind damaging the intestinal collaterals pattern; spleen deficiency with qi sinking pattern; polyp hemorrhoid (rectal polyp). [证候待译:气血瘀滞肛门证] [未译片段:广基]</tcm:definition>
