    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">臖核结块推之可移。见于痰气郁结证、痰瘀互结证、气郁痰凝证，或早期岩性臖核、气瘿、肉瘿等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mobile xinghe lump. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; qi goiter (simple goiter); fleshy goiter (thyroid adenoma). [证候待译:痰气郁结证/气郁痰凝证/早期岩性臖核]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.48</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025759</tcm:hpoID>
  
