    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不自主地自咬舌头。病危重时见，多预后不良。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Involuntary biting of one's own tongue; seen in critical illness, mostly with a poor prognosis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.38</tcm:reference>
