    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中出气臭秽，且带腥味，自觉或为他人所闻。多见于肺痈痰热蕴肺证，或肺痨等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Foul breath with a fishy odor, noticed by the patient or by others. Mostly seen in lung abscess with phlegm-heat accumulating in the lung pattern, or lung consumption (tuberculosis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
