    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Foul breath with a fishy odor, noticed by the patient or by others. Mostly seen in lung abscess with phlegm-heat accumulating in the lung pattern, or lung consumption (tuberculosis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
