    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胞睑内面与白睛表层粘黏。见于脾胃积热证、阴虚内热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid inside face and white of the eye sticky. Seen in spleen and stomach accumulation with heat pattern. [证候待译:阴虚内热证] [未译片段:表层粘]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.107</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
