    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脓液质地稠厚。见于风火热毒证、肝郁化火证，或脓痈、臀痈、手背发等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thick, viscous pus. Seen in wind-fire heat toxin pattern, liver depression transforming into fire pattern, or purulent abscess, buttock abscess, or dorsal hand effusion.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.18</tcm:reference>
