    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">有恐惧感，或终日神志不安，如人之将捕。见于肾精不足证、气血两虚证、心虚神怯证，或风厥、气厥、缩阴病、中恶、小儿客忤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A sense of fear, or mental unease all day long, as if about to be arrested. Seen in kidney essence insufficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, or wind syncope, qi syncope, genital retraction disease, malignity attack (zhonge), or childhood guest-watching (fright) disorder.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_善恐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A sense of fear, or mental unease all day long, as if about to be arrested. Seen in kidney essence insufficiency pattern, dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern, or wind syncope, qi syncope, genital retraction disease, malignity attack (zhonge), or childhood guest-watching (fright) disorder.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
