    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮疡上有脓头，可溃破流脓。见于外感风热、外感湿热、外感火毒、气滞血瘀证，或有头疽等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores and ulcers with pus head ulceration pus discharge. Seen in external contraction with wind-heat pattern; external contraction with dampness-heat pattern; external contraction with fire-toxin pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:有头疽] [未译片段:上可]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.131</tcm:reference>
