    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sores and ulcers with pus head ulceration pus discharge. Seen in external contraction with wind-heat pattern; external contraction with dampness-heat pattern; external contraction with fire-toxin pattern; qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:有头疽] [未译片段:上可]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
