    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">周身肌肉酸痛。见于风湿侵袭证、湿热阻滞证、寒湿蕴结证、气血两虚证、肝肾阴虚证，或劳损等。又称身体酸楚。酸楚与困倦同见称身酸困，见于风湿侵袭证、湿热阻滞证、寒湿蕴结证、气血两虚证、肝肾阴虚证，或劳损等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body muscle aching pain aching discomfort and drowsiness seen. Seen in wind-dampness with invasion pattern; dampness-heat with obstruction pattern; cold-dampness with accumulation and binding pattern; qi-blood dual deficiency pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; strain. [又称:身体酸楚] [未译片段:同称身酸困]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.4</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>身体酸楚</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_周身酸楚</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
