    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">龈边缘向牙根方向的退缩，同时伴有牙槽骨退缩，牙根暴露。见于气血两虚证、肾阴虚证、肾气虚证，或老年性牙龈退缩、早老性牙龈退缩、牙宣、牙疳、青腿牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Recession of the gingival margin toward the tooth root, accompanied by alveolar bone recession and root exposure. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, or senile gingival recession, premature gingival recession, tooth disclosure, gum ulceration, or blue-leg gum ulceration.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.71</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0006308</tcm:hpoID>
  
