    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Recession of the gingival margin toward the tooth root, accompanied by alveolar bone recession and root exposure. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, kidney yin deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, or senile gingival recession, premature gingival recession, tooth disclosure, gum ulceration, or blue-leg gum ulceration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0006308</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
