    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉四肢无力量，甚或不能持物。见于脾虚湿困证、气血两虚证、暑热伤气证，或脚气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Weakness of limbs amount marked or inability mass. Seen in qi-blood dual deficiency pattern. [证候待译:脾虚湿困证/暑热伤气证/脚气] [未译片段:自觉持]</tcm:definition>
