    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肋骨或肋间疼痛。见于风湿阻络证、悬饮停聚证、饮停胸胁证，肋骨骨折等。又称肋骨痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ribs bone or intercostal space pain. [证候待译:风湿阻络证/悬饮停聚证/饮停胸胁证/肋骨骨折] [又称:肋骨痛]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>肋骨痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0006649</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>247355005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>flank pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
