    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">红色斑块较为局限，多仅分布于面部或四肢关节等。见于湿疮、多发性红斑等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Red colored macule is profuse distribution at face or limbs joint. Seen in eczema. [证候待译:多发性红斑] [未译片段:块较局限仅等]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_局部皮肤红斑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Red colored macule is profuse distribution at face or limbs joint. Seen in eczema. [证候待译:多发性红斑] [未译片段:块较局限仅等]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
