      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">周身疲乏无力，欲卧欲睡，或嗜睡，精力不济。见于气血两虚证、湿困脾胃证、痰湿内阻证、暑伤气阴证、暑湿内蕴证、脾肾阳虚证、脾虚湿困证、心脾气虚证，或神劳、血劳、瘿劳、肌痿、肝热病、肝著、心衰、伤暑、㾏夏、肥胖病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Generalized tiredness and weakness, desire to lie down and sleep, or somnolence, with failing energy. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, dampness encumbering the spleen-stomach pattern, phlegm-dampness internal obstruction pattern, summerheat damaging qi and yin pattern, summerheat-dampness internal accumulation pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, spleen deficiency with dampness encumbrance pattern, heart-spleen qi deficiency pattern, or spirit taxation, blood taxation, goiter taxation, muscle atrophy, liver heat disease, liver fixity, heart failure, summerheat injury, summer fever of children, or obesity.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.1</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>271782001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal drowsiness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>79519003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormal drowsiness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
