    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">闷闷不乐，似有所思，精神不振。见于肝郁气滞证、痰气部结证，或神郁、癫病、狂病、脏躁、百合病、痈病、痴呆等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gloominess as if preoccupied, with low spirits. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, or spirit depression, depressive psychosis (dian), manic psychosis (kuang), visceral agitation, lily disease, abscess disease, or dementia.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>郁郁寡欢</tcm:synonym>
