    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤之色如涂丹，热如火灼。见于湿热化火证，或丹毒、流火、赤游丹、湿热化火等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin colored as if painted with cinnabar, burning like fire. Seen in dampness-heat transforming into fire pattern, or erysipelas (dandu), flowing fire, red wandering erysipelas (chiyoudan), or dampness-heat transforming into fire.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肤色丹红</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Skin colored as if painted with cinnabar, burning like fire. Seen in dampness-heat transforming into fire pattern, or erysipelas (dandu), flowing fire, red wandering erysipelas (chiyoudan), or dampness-heat transforming into fire.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
