    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口中粘腻不爽，有黏液粘滞，或伴舌苔厚腻。见于湿浊停滞证、痰饮证、食积证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A sticky, unpleasant sensation in the mouth with viscid mucus, or accompanied by a thick greasy tongue coating. Seen in damp-turbidity stagnation pattern, phlegm-rheum pattern, or food accumulation pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.40</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口中粘腻</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>口中黏滞</tcm:synonym>
