    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿全部脱落。见于肾虚髓亏证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯肺证、气血亏虚证，或牙宣、牙痈、齿槽风、牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth whole region falling off. Seen in wind with fire with invading the lung pattern; qi and blood deficiency pattern; yaxuan (periodontitis); dental abscess; mouth gan (necrotizing gingivitis). [证候待译:肾虚髓亏证/胃火燔齿证/齿槽风]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.34</tcm:reference>
