    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">恶寒与发热同时并作，恶寒的程度较发热重。见于风寒表证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to cold and fever occurring simultaneously, with the cold aversion more severe than the fever. Seen in wind-cold exterior pattern.</tcm:definition>
