    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部似有异物梗塞，咯之不出，咽之不下。见于心脾两虚证、肝气郁结证、肝郁脾虚证、肝胃不和证、风寒袭咽证、风热侵咽证、胃火燔咽证、阴虚肝郁证，或乳蛾、梅核气、慢喉痹、茎突综合征、咽喉肿瘤、食管瘅、胃病、血劳、喉痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Throat with foreign objects not pharynx failure to descend. Seen in liver qi depression and binding pattern; liver and stomach disharmony pattern; yin deficiency and liver depression pattern; tonsillar moth (tonsillitis); plum-pit qi (globus pharyngis); stomach disorder pattern; throat bi (pharyngitis). [证候待译:心脾两虚证/肝郁脾虚证/风寒袭咽证/风热侵咽证/胃火燔咽证/慢喉痹] [未译片段:似梗塞咯出]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>咽部有异物感</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
