    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手足部皮肤局部发生疔疮。见于火毒炽盛、脾虚有热、风热外袭，或阳虚消渴证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand foot region skin local occurrence of ding (deep-rooted boil) sore. Seen in wind-heat with external invasion pattern. [证候待译:火毒炽盛/脾虚有热/阳虚消渴证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_手足生疔</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hand foot region skin local occurrence of ding (deep-rooted boil) sore. Seen in wind-heat with external invasion pattern. [证候待译:火毒炽盛/脾虚有热/阳虚消渴证]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
