      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发于咽部或喉部，其形似苔藓，多为肺痨病的并发症。见于肺阴虚证、阴虚火旺证。又称喉痨。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair at pharynx or throat (larynx) region tongue coating mostly is pulmonary consumption (tuberculosis) and hair. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肺阴虚证] [又称:喉痨] [未译片段:其形似藓病症]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.102</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>喉疹</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_喉生癣</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hair at pharynx or throat (larynx) region tongue coating mostly is pulmonary consumption (tuberculosis) and hair. Seen in yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:肺阴虚证] [又称:喉痨] [未译片段:其形似藓病症]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>喉疹</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
