    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌面上出现各种形状的裂纹、裂沟，深浅不一，多少不等。见于热盛伤津证、血虚不润证等。舌心裂纹多提示阴虚证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cracks and fissures of various shapes, depths and numbers on the tongue surface. Seen in exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or blood deficiency failing to moisten pattern. Cracks in the center of the tongue mostly indicate yin deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.53</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000221</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>52368004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>fissured tongue</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌有裂纹</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cracks and fissures of various shapes, depths and numbers on the tongue surface. Seen in exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, or blood deficiency failing to moisten pattern. Cracks in the center of the tongue mostly indicate yin deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
