    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤上出现椭圆形、圆形或不规则型的红色改变，平摊于皮肤表面，抚之不碍手。见于血热证、血瘀证、风热证、湿热证，或丹毒、流火、红斑狼疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Elliptical, round or irregular red patches on the skin, flat on the surface and impalpable (not felt on stroking). Seen in blood heat pattern, blood stasis pattern, wind-heat pattern, dampness-heat pattern, or erysipelas, flowing fire, or lupus erythematosus.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.116</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025475</tcm:hpoID>
