    <obo:IAO_0000115>Elliptical, round or irregular red patches on the skin, flat on the surface and impalpable (not felt on stroking). Seen in blood heat pattern, blood stasis pattern, wind-heat pattern, dampness-heat pattern, or erysipelas, flowing fire, or lupus erythematosus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
