    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发声时声音干涩或嘶或哑，或哑然失音。见于外感风寒或风热证、痰湿壅肺证、阴虚火旺证，或暴喑、久喑、声带瘫痪、金创失音、急喉风、血溢声户证。又称音哑。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A dry, husky or hoarse voice on phonation, up to complete aphonia. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold or wind-heat pattern, phlegm-dampness congesting the lung pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or sudden aphonia, chronic aphonia, vocal cord paralysis, metal-wound aphonia, acute throat wind, or blood flooding the voice door pattern. Also known as hoarseness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>音哑</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001609</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>50219008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Hoarseness</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MA82.0</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Dysphonia</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_声音嘶哑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A dry, husky or hoarse voice on phonation, up to complete aphonia. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold or wind-heat pattern, phlegm-dampness congesting the lung pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or sudden aphonia, chronic aphonia, vocal cord paralysis, metal-wound aphonia, acute throat wind, or blood flooding the voice door pattern. Also known as hoarseness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>音哑</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
