    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腰痛连及下肢甚至足跟，多呈牵扯痛或放射痛。见于风寒湿痹证、风湿证、湿热证，偏痹、腰痹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Low back pain extending to and lower limb even heel profuse presenting as referred pain or pain. Seen in wind-dampness pattern; dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:风寒湿痹证/偏痹/腰痹] [未译片段:放射]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.39</tcm:reference>
