    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核色鲜红。见于湿热证、血络受伤证，或翻花痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hemorrhoidal nodule colored bright red. Seen in dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:血络受伤证/翻花痔]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
