    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">不性交而精自遗泄。见于精气满溢、心火亢盛证、心脾两虚证、肾气不固证、湿热下注证、心肾不交证、阴虚火旺证，或阳萎、不射精、精浊等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Seminal emission without intercourse. Seen in fullness and overflow of essential qi, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or impotence (yangwei), anejaculation, or essence turbidity (prostatitis).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_遗精</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Seminal emission without intercourse. Seen in fullness and overflow of essential qi, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, heart-kidney non-interaction pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, or impotence (yangwei), anejaculation, or essence turbidity (prostatitis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
