    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴茎部尿道出现瘘管与外界相通，有尿液自瘘管外口溢出。见于脾肾亏虚、肝经湿热、湿热蕴肾、下焦瘀滞，或尿道瘘等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A fistula of the penile urethra communicating with the exterior, with urine leaking from the external fistula opening. Seen in spleen-kidney deficiency, liver channel dampness-heat, dampness-heat accumulating in the kidney, lower-jiao stasis stagnation, or urethral fistula.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.51</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎部漏尿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A fistula of the penile urethra communicating with the exterior, with urine leaking from the external fistula opening. Seen in spleen-kidney deficiency, liver channel dampness-heat, dampness-heat accumulating in the kidney, lower-jiao stasis stagnation, or urethral fistula.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
