    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胃脘或腹部疼痛，进食后即痛，或疼痛加剧。见于伤食、泄泻等病，食积胃肠证、湿热内蕴证或肝郁滞证等实证疼痛。又称食后疼痛、食后痛甚、得食痛增等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Epigastrium or abdomen pain taking food pain or pain. Seen in food accumulation and stomach and intestines disorder pattern; dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern. [证候待译:伤食/泄泻等病/肝郁滞证等实证疼痛] Also known as pain aggravated by eating. [又称:食后疼痛/食后痛甚] [未译片段:后即加剧]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>得食痛增</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>食后疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>食后痛甚</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0025286</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_得食痛增</oboInOwl:id>
