    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">欲登临高楼，或墙垣歌唱，狂妄而无所顾忌。见于火热伤阴证、痰火扰神证，或癫病、狂病等。常与弃衣而走并见。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Desiring to climb up high places or walls to sing, reckless and unbridled. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the spirit pattern, or depressive psychosis (dian) and manic psychosis (kuang). Often co-occurs with casting off clothes and running about.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_登高而歌</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Desiring to climb up high places or walls to sing, reckless and unbridled. Seen in fire-heat damaging yin pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the spirit pattern, or depressive psychosis (dian) and manic psychosis (kuang). Often co-occurs with casting off clothes and running about.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
