    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女经行前或经期发生面目及四肢浮肿，经后自行消失。见于脾虚、肾虚、气滞血瘀证等。又称经来遍身浮肿。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">(in women) during menstruation or menstrual occurrence of face eye and limbs puffiness disappearance. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. [证候待译:脾虚/肾虚] [又称:经来遍身浮肿] [未译片段:前经后自行]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.68</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经来遍身浮肿</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>386692008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>abnormally heavy bleeding during menstruation</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
