    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脘腹部痞满明显，伴有胀痛，按之如鼓。见于食滞胃肠证、胃脘实热证，或胃痛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Epigastrium and abdomen region stuffiness and fullness obvious accompanied by distending pain pressure like. Seen in food stagnation and stomach and intestines disorder pattern; stomach pain. [证候待译:胃脘实热证] [未译片段:鼓]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>脘腹痞满，脘腹痞闷，脘闷</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
