    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疹出成片，疹粒多而密集。见于风热表证、风寒表证、血热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eruptions appearing in sheets, with numerous densely packed lesions. Seen in wind-heat exterior pattern, wind-cold exterior pattern, or blood heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.104</tcm:reference>
