    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指妇女在月经期间，大多在月经周期的第一、二天，由于某种原因而致月经突然停止。见于肝郁气滞，气滞血瘀证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sudden cessation of menstruation during the period, mostly on the first or second day of the cycle, due to some cause. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.42</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经来骤止</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sudden cessation of menstruation during the period, mostly on the first or second day of the cycle, due to some cause. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
