    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">左前胸部疼痛。见于心脉痹阻证、气虚血瘀证等，胸痹病等。又称心前区疼痛、心痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain in the left anterior chest. Seen in heart vessel impediment obstruction pattern, qi deficiency with blood stasis pattern, or chest impediment disease. Also known as precordial pain or heart pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>心前区疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>心痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>29857009</tcm:snomedCT>
