    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙槽骨受损，腐坏成脓。见于阳明胃经积热、外感风火热毒，或过食膏粱膏味等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Damage to the alveolar bone, putrefying into pus. Seen in yangming stomach channel accumulated heat, externally contracted wind-fire heat toxin, or overindulgence in rich, fatty food.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.60</tcm:reference>
