      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经不按周期来潮，时或提前时或错后，在7天以上，没有一定规律。见于肝郁气滞证、肾虚证、心脾两虚证、冲任失调证、胞宫气虚证等。又称经乱。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstruation not following a regular cycle—sometimes early, sometimes late, by more than seven days, without any pattern. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, kidney deficiency pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, or uterine qi deficiency pattern. Also known as menstrual irregularity (jingluan).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>经乱</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经先后不定期</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstruation not following a regular cycle—sometimes early, sometimes late, by more than seven days, without any pattern. Seen in liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, kidney deficiency pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, or uterine qi deficiency pattern. Also known as menstrual irregularity (jingluan).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>经乱</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
