    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肤色呈棕色。局部棕色见于疮疡等皮损，广泛于暴露处多为日晒所致。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin colored presenting as colored local colored. [证候待译:疮疡等皮损/广泛于暴露处多为日晒所致] [未译片段:棕棕]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.83</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
