    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或两侧上肢肿胀，或左右交替出现，或伴瘀紫。见于气滞证、痰温阻滞证，或风水水肿、外伤、上肢淋巴损伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Swelling of one or both upper limbs, alternating sides, or accompanied by purplish stasis. Seen in qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, or wind edema, trauma, or upper-limb lymphatic injury.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.10</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_上肢肿胀</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Swelling of one or both upper limbs, alternating sides, or accompanied by purplish stasis. Seen in qi stagnation pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, or wind edema, trauma, or upper-limb lymphatic injury.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#PhlegmEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
