    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">皮肤出现大小在0.5厘米以下，高出皮肤表面的皮疹。见于肺经风热证、血热证、脾胃湿热证、肝脾湿热证、脾虚湿热证，或银屑病、扁平苔藓、黄色瘤、湿疹等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Skin appearance of large small present below raised above the skin surface rash. Seen in lung channel wind-heat pattern; blood heat pattern; spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; liver and spleen dampness-heat pattern; psoriasis. [证候待译:脾虚湿热证/扁平苔藓/黄色瘤/湿疹] [未译片段:0.5厘米以]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.141</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
