    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉周身及四肢沉重，或伴无力，或肿胀，活动不利，难以转侧或不愿活动。见于水饮内停证、湿阻证、湿蕴卫分证、风水相搏证、阳虚水泛证、风寒束表证、暑湿袭表证、气虚下陷证等，或感冒、湿阻、湿痹、肥胖病、中暑、水气病等。又称身重、身体沉重、肢体沉重、体重。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body and heaviness of limbs or accompanied by weakness or swelling impaired movement or not movement. Seen in dampness with obstruction pattern; qi deficiency with sinking pattern; common cold; dampness with obstruction pattern; heatstroke. [证候待译:水饮内停证/湿蕴卫分证/风水相搏证/阳虚水泛证/风寒束表证/暑湿袭表证] [又称:身重/身体沉重/肢体沉重/体重] [未译片段:自觉难以转侧愿]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>体重，肢体困重</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>肢体沉重</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>身体困重</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>身体沉重</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>身重</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>身重困倦</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_周身沉重</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Whole body and heaviness of limbs or accompanied by weakness or swelling impaired movement or not movement. Seen in dampness with obstruction pattern; qi deficiency with sinking pattern; common cold; dampness with obstruction pattern; heatstroke. [证候待译:水饮内停证/湿蕴卫分证/风水相搏证/阳虚水泛证/风寒束表证/暑湿袭表证] [又称:身重/身体沉重/肢体沉重/体重] [未译片段:自觉难以转侧愿]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>体重，肢体困重</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>肢体沉重</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
