    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在意识清楚或昏迷的情况下，小便失去控制而自行溺出。见于肾气虚证、脾气虚证、下焦虚寒证、湿热下注证、下焦瘀滞证，或神昏、尸厥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Loss of control of urination with involuntary voiding, whether conscious or comatose. Seen in kidney qi deficiency pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, lower-jiao deficiency cold pattern, dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, lower-jiao stasis stagnation pattern, or impaired consciousness and corpse-like syncope (shijue).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.76</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000020</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>165232002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bladder incontinence</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>22220005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>stress urinary incontinence</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>MF50.23</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Functional urinary incontinence</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>MF50.2Y</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Other specified urinary incontinence</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>MF50.2Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Urinary incontinence, unspecified</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_小便失禁</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
