    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">黑睛生翳，形状菲薄，透明光滑，如冰上之瑕。见于阴虚邪恋证、风轮阴虚证、气血瘀滞证，或冰瑕翳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A nebula on the cornea, thin, transparent and glossy, like a flaw in ice. Seen in yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or ice-flaw nebula (corneal facet).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_翳如冰瑕</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A nebula on the cornea, thin, transparent and glossy, like a flaw in ice. Seen in yin deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern, wind-wheel (cornea) yin deficiency pattern, qi-blood stasis pattern, or ice-flaw nebula (corneal facet).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
