    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">女性外生殖器疼痛。见于下焦湿热证、结石阻滞膀胱证、心移热小肠证等。又称阴器痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the female external genitalia. Seen in lower-jiao dampness-heat pattern, stone obstructing the bladder pattern, or heart transferring heat to the small intestine pattern. Also known as genital pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>阴器痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030943</tcm:hpoID>
