    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮肿根深，坚硬如钉。见于热毒蕴结肌肤证、火毒炽盛证、余毒未清证、毒入营血证，或疔疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The sore is deep-rooted, hard as a nail. Seen in heat toxin accumulating in the skin-flesh pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, residual toxin uncleared pattern, toxin entering the nutrient-blood level pattern, or nail-like boil (dingchuang).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.95</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_疮肿根深坚硬如钉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The sore is deep-rooted, hard as a nail. Seen in heat toxin accumulating in the skin-flesh pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, residual toxin uncleared pattern, toxin entering the nutrient-blood level pattern, or nail-like boil (dingchuang).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
