    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">多由白苔或黄苔转化而成。多见于热极伤阴、阳虚阴甚、肾阴亏损、痰湿久郁等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A gray-black coating, mostly transformed from a white or yellow coating. Mostly seen in extreme heat damaging yin, yang deficiency with yin exuberance, kidney yin depletion, or prolonged stagnation of phlegm-dampness.</tcm:definition>
