    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿瘤表面青筋盘曲突起成团块。见于血瘀风燥证、热蕴络瘀证、寒滞经脉证，或筋瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Bluish sinew-like vessels coiling and protruding in clusters over the tumor surface. Seen in blood stasis with wind-dryness pattern, heat accumulation with collateral stasis pattern, cold stagnating in the channels pattern, or sinew tumor (varicose tumor).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.11.31</tcm:reference>
