    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">斑色暗淡无光。见于气滞血瘀证、脾肾阳虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Patches of dull, lusterless color. Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.131</tcm:reference>
