    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠表浅，不觉踏实，或时有思虑困扰，或易受干扰，易醒难眠。见于心脾两虚证、胆郁痰扰证、肝经郁热证、中焦不和证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Shallow, unsound sleep, troubled by ruminating thoughts, easily disturbed, with easy awakening and difficulty sleeping. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, or middle-jiao disharmony pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.8</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睡眠不实</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Shallow, unsound sleep, troubled by ruminating thoughts, easily disturbed, with easy awakening and difficulty sleeping. Seen in heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, gallbladder depression with phlegm harassment pattern, liver channel depressed heat pattern, or middle-jiao disharmony pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
