    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">手足拘紧挛急，屈伸不利。见于风寒束表证、寒湿蕴结证、湿热浸淫证、热盛伤津证、亡阳证、肝血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Contracture and spasm of the hands and feet with impaired flexion and extension. Seen in wind-cold binding the exterior pattern, cold-dampness accumulating pattern, dampness-heat invasion and spread pattern, exuberant heat damaging fluids pattern, yang collapse pattern, or liver blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.73</tcm:reference>
