    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">情绪波动大，易受刺激，时喜时悲，或无故哭笑，不能自控。见于肝郁脾虚证、痰气郁结证，或癫病、酒厥等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Marked emotional lability, easily provoked, alternating between mirth and grief, or groundless crying and laughing beyond self-control. Seen in liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, or depressive psychosis (dian) and alcohol syncope.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
