    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Marked emotional lability, easily provoked, alternating between mirth and grief, or groundless crying and laughing beyond self-control. Seen in liver depression with spleen deficiency pattern, phlegm-qi stagnation pattern, or depressive psychosis (dian) and alcohol syncope.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
