    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙齿脱离掉落。见于肾虚髓亏证、胃火燔齿证、风火犯肺证、气血亏虚证，牙宣、牙痈、齿槽风、牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Teeth detaching and falling out. Seen in kidney deficiency with marrow depletion pattern, stomach fire flaring the teeth pattern, wind-fire invading the lung pattern, qi-blood deficiency pattern, or tooth disclosure, dental abscess, alveolar wind, or gum ulceration.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.87</tcm:reference>
