    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">易受惊吓，或无故惊慌，心中惕惕然不安，不能自制。见于心胆气虚证、痰火扰心证、心火亢盛证、肝郁血虚证等。又称善惊、喜惊、惊惕。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Being easily startled, or groundless panic with a fearful, apprehensive heart beyond self-control. Seen in heart-gallbladder qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the heart pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, or liver depression with blood deficiency pattern. Also known as proneness to fright or fearful apprehension.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>善惊</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>喜惊</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>惊惕</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_易惊</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Being easily startled, or groundless panic with a fearful, apprehensive heart beyond self-control. Seen in heart-gallbladder qi deficiency pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the heart pattern, heart fire hyperactivity pattern, or liver depression with blood deficiency pattern. Also known as proneness to fright or fearful apprehension.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>善惊</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>喜惊</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>惊惕</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
