    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔质颗粒较粗大而根底松浮，边中皆厚，揩之可去，或成片状脱落，舌底光滑者。见于胃气衰败、湿浊上泛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A coating of coarse, large granules with a loose, floating root, thick at the edges and center, removable by wiping or peeling off in sheets, leaving a smooth tongue base (curd-like coating). Seen in stomach qi decadence, or damp-turbidity steaming upward.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.96</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔腐</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A coating of coarse, large granules with a loose, floating root, thick at the edges and center, removable by wiping or peeling off in sheets, leaving a smooth tongue base (curd-like coating). Seen in stomach qi decadence, or damp-turbidity steaming upward.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
