    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">四肢、躯干肌肉及关节疼痛。见于外感风寒证、风温证、风湿证、水湿停聚证，或历节病、痹病等。又称四肢痛。若为左或右上（下）肢或局部关节、肌筋疼痛，应具体描述。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pain of the muscles and joints of the limbs and trunk. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, wind-warmth pattern, wind-dampness pattern, water-dampness retention pattern, or joint-running disease (lijie) and impediment disease. Also known as limb pain; pain confined to one limb or a local joint/sinew should be described specifically.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>四肢痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>90834002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>limb pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>10601006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>leg pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>102556003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>upper limb pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_肢体痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain of the muscles and joints of the limbs and trunk. Seen in externally contracted wind-cold pattern, wind-warmth pattern, wind-dampness pattern, water-dampness retention pattern, or joint-running disease (lijie) and impediment disease. Also known as limb pain; pain confined to one limb or a local joint/sinew should be described specifically.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>四肢痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
