    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部膨大隆起。见于肝积、肥气等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdomen large bulging. Seen in liver accumulation pattern. [证候待译:肥气] [未译片段:膨]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_腹部膨隆</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
