    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头面前额部疼痛。为阳明经头痛。见于外感风寒证、风热窜攻证、阳明经病证。又称前额头痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head and face forehead region pain is yang headache. Seen in external contraction with wind-cold pattern. [证候待译:风热窜攻证/阳明经病证] [又称:前额头痛] [未译片段:明经]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.11</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>前额头痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA1UW4</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Paramedian forehead</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>XA1Z38</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Lateral forehead</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>XA9SG2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Central forehead</tcm:icd11Term>
  
