    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">龟头红肿，甚则冠状沟糜烂，有脓性分泌物。见于下焦毒热证、肝经湿热证，或龟头炎、尿道炎、阴头痈、龟头破烂等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Glans penis red swelling marked -like erosion with pus discharge. Seen in lower jiao toxic heat pattern; liver channel dampness-heat pattern; balanitis; urethritis. [证候待译:阴头痈/龟头破烂] [未译片段:则冠沟性]</tcm:definition>
