    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉在筋肉之间，连连数急，三五不调，止而复作，如雀啄食之状。见于脾气绝。为无神脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse between the sinews and flesh, rapid in successive beats, irregular in threes and fives, stopping and starting again like a sparrow pecking food. Seen in expiration of spleen qi; a pulse devoid of spirit.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
