    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse between the sinews and flesh, rapid in successive beats, irregular in threes and fives, stopping and starting again like a sparrow pecking food. Seen in expiration of spleen qi; a pulse devoid of spirit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
