    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">说话时语声低弱而无力。见于肺肾气虚证、肾气虚证、热伤气阴证、脾气虚证、心气虚证、肺气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A faint, weak, powerless voice when speaking. Seen in lung-kidney qi deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, heat damaging qi and yin pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, heart qi deficiency pattern, or lung qi deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.3.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_言语无力</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A faint, weak, powerless voice when speaking. Seen in lung-kidney qi deficiency pattern, kidney qi deficiency pattern, heat damaging qi and yin pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, heart qi deficiency pattern, or lung qi deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
