    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睑弦部潮红溃烂，或眦部睑弦潮红糜烂。见于血虚风燥证、肉轮热毒证、肉轮风热证、肉轮湿热证、风热夹湿证，或风赤疮痍等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Eyelid margin region flushed red ulceration and festering or canthus region eyelid margin flushed red erosion. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; wind-heat with with with dampness pattern; wind-red sore (eczematous blepharitis). [证候待译:肉轮热毒证/肉轮风热证/肉轮湿热证]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.47</tcm:reference>
