    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">心中焦急，多虑，或惴惴不安，或思虑繁多。见于肝气郁滞证、心虚证，或脏躁、饥厥、心动悸等。又称焦虑不安。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Anxious worry and excessive concern, or uneasy apprehension, or a multitude of thoughts. Seen in liver qi stagnation pattern, heart deficiency pattern, or visceral agitation, hunger syncope, or heart palpitation disorder. Also known as anxious restlessness.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>焦虑不安</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>48694002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>anxiety</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_焦虑</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Anxious worry and excessive concern, or uneasy apprehension, or a multitude of thoughts. Seen in liver qi stagnation pattern, heart deficiency pattern, or visceral agitation, hunger syncope, or heart palpitation disorder. Also known as anxious restlessness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
