    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">较正常舌色淡，白色偏多红色偏少。见于气血两虚证、阴寒内盛证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tongue is paler than normal, with more white and less red. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, or yin cold internal exuberance pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.28</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>舌淡</tcm:synonym>
