    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">牙龈出血。见于风热犯齿证、胃火犯龈证、虚火上炎证、虚火灼龈证、脾不统血证，或牙龈炎、牙宣、牙疳、走马牙疳、牙岩、紫癜病、经行吐衄、青腿牙疳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Gum bleeding. Seen in wind-heat invading the teeth pattern; stomach-fire invading the gums pattern; deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern; deficiency-fire scorching the gums pattern; spleen failing to contain blood pattern; gingivitis; yaxuan (periodontitis); mouth gan (necrotizing gingivitis); noma (gangrenous stomatitis); dental rock (oral cancer); purpura; blue-leg gum gan (scurvy). [证候待译:经行吐衄]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000225</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>86276007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>bleeding gums</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_齿衄</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Gum bleeding. Seen in wind-heat invading the teeth pattern; stomach-fire invading the gums pattern; deficiency-fire flaring upward pattern; deficiency-fire scorching the gums pattern; spleen failing to contain blood pattern; gingivitis; yaxuan (periodontitis); mouth gan (necrotizing gingivitis); noma (gangrenous stomatitis); dental rock (oral cancer); purpura; blue-leg gum gan (scurvy). [证候待译:经行吐衄]</obo:IAO_0000115>
