    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">肿块按之如石块般坚硬。见于寒凝血瘀证，或骨瘤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mass pressure like hardness. Seen in cold congelation with blood stasis pattern; osteoma. [未译片段:石块般]</tcm:definition>
