    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头发突然成片脱落而头皮平滑光亮。见于血虚生风证、血热生风证，或忧虑、紧张过度、油风脱发等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair sudden falling off scalp shininess. Seen in blood deficiency with engendering wind pattern; blood heat with engendering wind pattern. [证候待译:忧虑/紧张过度/油风脱发] [未译片段:成片平滑]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.32</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
