    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">厌恶进食，甚或恶闻食物气味，多伴不欲饮食或纳呆。见于食滞胃肠证、脾胃虚弱证，或厌食病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Averse to taking food marked or averse to food mass profuse accompanied by poor appetite or poor appetite. Seen in food stagnation and stomach and intestines disorder pattern; spleen and stomach weakness pattern. [证候待译:厌食病] [未译片段:厌闻气味]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>79890006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>anorexia</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
