    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌苔上有龟裂，或纵或横。为舌体失养所致，见于血虚，阴津耗损等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fissures in the tongue coating, longitudinal or transverse, caused by the tongue body failing to be nourished. Seen in blood deficiency, or yin-fluid consumption.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.72</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
