      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">发热不高，一般不超过38℃，或仅自觉发热。见于外感初期、轻证，温病后期，或阴虚、气郁、血瘀、气虚等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Low-grade fever, generally not exceeding 38°C, or merely a subjective feeling of heat. Seen in the early/mild stage of external contraction, the late stage of warm disease, or yin deficiency, qi depression, blood stasis, or qi deficiency patterns.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、炎症</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_微热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Low-grade fever, generally not exceeding 38°C, or merely a subjective feeling of heat. Seen in the early/mild stage of external contraction, the late stage of warm disease, or yin deficiency, qi depression, blood stasis, or qi deficiency patterns.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
