    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉胃脘部挛急，或伴阵痛。见于脾胃虚寒、胃虚寒痛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Subjective cramping and tightness of the epigastrium, sometimes with paroxysmal pain. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold, or stomach deficiency cold pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.9.26</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA8ZL8</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Epigastrium</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_胃脘拘急</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Subjective cramping and tightness of the epigastrium, sometimes with paroxysmal pain. Seen in spleen-stomach deficiency cold, or stomach deficiency cold pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
