      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈项部连及背部筋脉肌肉强硬疼痛感。见于外感风寒证、外感风热证、风温证、风湿证、瘟毒证或金疮风毒、风中脏腑闭证等。又称头项强痛，无明显强硬感为颈项痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck and nape region extending to and back sinews and vessels muscle stiffness and rigidity pain. Seen in external contraction with wind-cold pattern; external contraction with wind-heat pattern; wind-warmth; wind-dampness pattern. [证候待译:瘟毒证/金疮风毒/风中脏腑闭证] [又称:头项强痛/无明显强硬感为颈项痛] [未译片段:感]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>头项强痛，无明显强硬感为颈项痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>寒冷刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈项强痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Neck and nape region extending to and back sinews and vessels muscle stiffness and rigidity pain. Seen in external contraction with wind-cold pattern; external contraction with wind-heat pattern; wind-warmth; wind-dampness pattern. [证候待译:瘟毒证/金疮风毒/风中脏腑闭证] [又称:头项强痛/无明显强硬感为颈项痛] [未译片段:感]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>头项强痛，无明显强硬感为颈项痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
