    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上肢或下肢颤抖或振摇不定，不能自主。见于血虚筋脉失养，或饮酒过度、动风先兆等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Trembling or unsteady shaking of the upper or lower limbs, beyond voluntary control. Seen in blood deficiency with sinew-vessel malnourishment, or excessive drinking, or a premonitory sign of wind stirring.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.79</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0001337</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>26079006</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>Tremor</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>8A01</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Tremor</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_四肢震颤</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Trembling or unsteady shaking of the upper or lower limbs, beyond voluntary control. Seen in blood deficiency with sinew-vessel malnourishment, or excessive drinking, or a premonitory sign of wind stirring.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0001337</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001337"/>
