    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="N802b2fbba47e4f0aa875172270a8d9a5">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#cat_睡眠类"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">进食后（饭后）感觉困倦，欲睡，或进餐中疲困难支，甚或停食入睡。见于气虚证、气陷证、脾气虚证、痰湿中阻证等。又称饭后困倦嗜睡。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Drowsiness and desire to sleep after eating, or fatigue hardly bearable during the meal, even stopping eating to fall asleep. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, qi sinking pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, or phlegm-dampness obstructing the middle pattern. Also known as postprandial somnolence.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.50</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>饭后困倦嗜睡</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF70</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Spleen qi deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_食后困顿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Drowsiness and desire to sleep after eating, or fatigue hardly bearable during the meal, even stopping eating to fall asleep. Seen in qi deficiency pattern, qi sinking pattern, spleen qi deficiency pattern, or phlegm-dampness obstructing the middle pattern. Also known as postprandial somnolence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>饭后困倦嗜睡</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF70</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
