    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">水疱壁厚不易破。见于脾阳亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thick-walled blisters not easily broken. Seen in spleen yang deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
