    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">苔质颗粒细腻而致密，融合成片，中间厚边尖薄，紧贴于舌面，揩之不去，刮之不易脱落。见于湿浊、痰饮、食积等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A coating of fine, dense granules fused into a sheet, thick in the middle and thin at the tip and edges, closely adherent to the tongue surface, neither removable by wiping nor easily scraped off (greasy coating). Seen in damp-turbidity, phlegm-rheum, or food accumulation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.59</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_苔腻</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A coating of fine, dense granules fused into a sheet, thick in the middle and thin at the tip and edges, closely adherent to the tongue surface, neither removable by wiping nor easily scraped off (greasy coating). Seen in damp-turbidity, phlegm-rheum, or food accumulation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
