    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经质地粘稠。见于心肝火旺证、瘀热内结证、湿热蕴结证、胞宫虚热证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood sticky and viscous in consistency. Seen in heart-liver fire exuberance pattern, stasis-heat internal binding pattern, dampness-heat accumulating pattern, or uterine deficiency heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
