    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">腹部肌肤长痈肿。见于热毒蕴结证、气郁化火证，或腹皮痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Abdomen skin and flesh long abscess swelling. Seen in heat-toxin with accumulation and binding pattern; qi depression with transforming into fire pattern. [证候待译:腹皮痈]</tcm:definition>
