    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指脉络终于第三指节横纹至手指末端之间。见于邪气深入脏腑，病情严重。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The (infantile index-finger) venule extends between the third phalangeal crease and the fingertip (the life gate). Seen when the pathogen has penetrated deeply into the viscera with severe disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.3.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_指纹现于命关</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The (infantile index-finger) venule extends between the third phalangeal crease and the fingertip (the life gate). Seen when the pathogen has penetrated deeply into the viscera with severe disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
