    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">两侧鼻孔交替性堵塞，此起彼伏。见于肺脾气虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nose alternating blocked appearing in succession. [证候待译:肺脾气虚证] [未译片段:两侧孔]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.45</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0004796</tcm:hpoID>
