    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉在皮肤，浮数之极，至数不清，如釜中沸水，浮泛无根。见于三阳热极，阴液枯竭。为无根脉。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A pulse in the skin, extremely floating and rapid with uncountable beats, like water boiling in a cauldron, floating and rootless. Seen in extreme heat of the three yang with exhaustion of yin fluid; a rootless pulse.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_釜沸脉</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A pulse in the skin, extremely floating and rapid with uncountable beats, like water boiling in a cauldron, floating and rootless. Seen in extreme heat of the three yang with exhaustion of yin fluid; a rootless pulse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
