    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">舌生疮疡，如粟米大，散在舌之各处。由心经火毒上攻而成者，疮多凸于舌面而痛。若下焦阴虚，虚火上浮而成者，疮多凹陷不起，亦不痛。又称红点舌、坐舌风。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Sores the size of millet grains scattered over the tongue: those caused by heart-channel fire toxin attacking upward are raised and painful; those caused by lower-jiao yin deficiency with deficiency fire floating upward are depressed and painless. Also known as red-dot tongue or sitting-tongue wind.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.1.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>坐舌风</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>红点舌</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_舌生疮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Sores the size of millet grains scattered over the tongue: those caused by heart-channel fire toxin attacking upward are raised and painful; those caused by lower-jiao yin deficiency with deficiency fire floating upward are depressed and painless. Also known as red-dot tongue or sitting-tongue wind.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>坐舌风</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>红点舌</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  </owl:Class>
