      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈前结喉处有肿块突起，或大或小，或单侧或双侧。见于肝郁气结证、毒邪流窜证、气滞痰凝证、痰瘀互结证、阴虚火旺证、肝郁痰热证、脾虚胃热证，或瘿气、侠瘿瘅、气瘿、瘿痈、肉瘿、石瘿等。又称瘿瘤。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck laryngeal prominence with mass protrusion or large or small or unilateral or bilateral. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; qi goiter (simple goiter); goiter abscess (thyroiditis); fleshy goiter (thyroid adenoma); stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:肝郁气结证/毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/脾虚胃热证/瘿气/侠瘿瘅] [又称:瘿瘤] [未译片段:前处]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>瘿瘤</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈前瘿肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Neck laryngeal prominence with mass protrusion or large or small or unilateral or bilateral. Seen in phlegm-stasis with mutual binding pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; liver depression with phlegm-heat pattern; qi goiter (simple goiter); goiter abscess (thyroiditis); fleshy goiter (thyroid adenoma); stony goiter (thyroid cancer). [证候待译:肝郁气结证/毒邪流窜证/气滞痰凝证/脾虚胃热证/瘿气/侠瘿瘅] [又称:瘿瘤] [未译片段:前处]</obo:IAO_0000115>
