    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳廓局部疼痛。见于耳疮、断耳疮、旋耳疮、耳廓痰包等。又称耳廓疼痛、外耳疼痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Auricle local pain. Seen in ear sore (otitis externa); auricular perichondritis; auricular eczema. [证候待译:耳廓痰包] [又称:耳廓疼痛/外耳疼痛]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.48</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>外耳疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>耳廓疼痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030021</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0008608</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0030025</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>43887004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>pit behind the ear</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>16001004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>ear pain</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>XA4WK4</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Greater auricular nerve</tcm:icd11Term>
  
