    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉全身或局部肌肤灼热感，或用手按压肌肤时感觉灼热。见于热毒炽盛等证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Whole body or local skin and flesh burning heat or hand pressure skin and flesh sensation burning heat. [证候待译:热毒炽盛等证] [未译片段:自觉感用压时]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>自身免疫反应</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>退热药物、休息</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XE7PM</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Burning oil</tcm:icd11Term>
  
