    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睑边、眦内痒，甚则痒连睛珠，痒极难忍为主症，但睛珠完好，视力也正常。见于风邪犯目证、风热犯目证、风热夹湿、血虚生风证，或椒疮、粟疮、赤丝虬脉、赤脉传睛、暴风客热、天行赤眼、睑弦赤烂、风赤疮痍等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Itching of the lid margins and canthi, in severe cases extending to the eyeball with unbearable intensity, while the eyeball is intact and vision normal. Seen in wind pathogen invading the eye pattern, wind-heat invading the eye pattern, wind-heat complicated by dampness, blood deficiency generating wind pattern, or pepper sore (trachoma), millet sore, red twisted vessels, red vessels spreading over the eye, storm-like guest heat, heaven-current red eye (epidemic conjunctivitis), red ulcerated lid margin, or wind-red sore.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.24</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_目痒</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Itching of the lid margins and canthi, in severe cases extending to the eyeball with unbearable intensity, while the eyeball is intact and vision normal. Seen in wind pathogen invading the eye pattern, wind-heat invading the eye pattern, wind-heat complicated by dampness, blood deficiency generating wind pattern, or pepper sore (trachoma), millet sore, red twisted vessels, red vessels spreading over the eye, storm-like guest heat, heaven-current red eye (epidemic conjunctivitis), red ulcerated lid margin, or wind-red sore.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
