    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">胆小、畏惧或害怕，不可自制，或伴易受惊吓。见于心脾气血两虚证、心虚神怯证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Timidity, fearfulness or dread beyond self-control, possibly with easy startling. Seen in heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
