    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_胆怯</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Timidity, fearfulness or dread beyond self-control, possibly with easy startling. Seen in heart-spleen qi-blood dual deficiency pattern, or heart deficiency with timid spirit pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
