    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口唇色黧黑，干焦无泽。见于脏腑气绝等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lips dark blackish, dry, scorched and lusterless. Seen in expiration of visceral qi.</tcm:definition>
