    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">直肠脱垂，脱出物色淡红，触之柔软，不易出血，可自行回复。见于中气下陷证，内痔、外痔、直肠黏膜脱垂性脱肛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Rectal prolapse with a pale-red, soft protrusion that bleeds rarely and reduces by itself. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, internal hemorrhoid, external hemorrhoid, or mucosal rectal prolapse.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.2.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>DB53</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Anal prolapse</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>DB31.2</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Rectal prolapse</tcm:icd11Term>
  
