    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Rectal prolapse with a pale-red, soft protrusion that bleeds rarely and reduces by itself. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, internal hemorrhoid, external hemorrhoid, or mucosal rectal prolapse.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:DB53</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:DB31.2</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
