    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">在安静状态下出现颈侧人迎脉搏动明显。见于肝阳上亢证、肺气壅滞证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Present calm -like below appearance of neck pulse pulsation obvious. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern; lung qi congestion and stagnation pattern. [未译片段:静态侧人迎]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
