    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_颈脉搏动明显</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Present calm -like below appearance of neck pulse pulsation obvious. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern; lung qi congestion and stagnation pattern. [未译片段:静态侧人迎]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
