    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">头部一侧或两侧局部头痛。为少阳经头痛。见于肝阳上亢证、瘀血犯头证、寒饮内停证、少阳经病证。又称侧头痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Head region or local headache is scanty yang headache. Seen in liver yang hyperactivity pattern. [证候待译:瘀血犯头证/寒饮内停证/少阳经病证] [又称:侧头痛] [未译片段:一侧两侧经]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.14</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>侧头痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0002076</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪紧张</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>37796009</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>intermittent migraine headaches</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>56097005</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>migraine without aura</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>4473006</tcm:snomedCT>
