    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳鸣如闻潮声，或声大如闻蛙叫。见于肝风痰火证、表寒里热证、风热挟湿证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Tinnitus like tidal sounds, or as loud as frogs croaking. Seen in liver wind with phlegm-fire pattern, exterior cold with interior heat pattern, or wind-heat complicated by dampness pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.2.35</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_耳鸣如潮</oboInOwl:id>
