    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">外耳道内流出清水样分泌物。见于风热湿邪侵袭证，或旋耳疮等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">External ear canal inside fluid -like discharge. Seen in auricular eczema. [证候待译:风热湿邪侵袭证] [未译片段:流出清]</tcm:definition>
