    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">由各种原因所致的头发脱落。见于气血两虚证、阴虚血热证、瘀血阻滞证、血瘀气滞证、脾肾阳虚证、肾精亏虚证，或七情过激、血风劳、瘿劳、发蛀脱发、油风脱发、肥疮、疳病等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hair loss from various causes. Seen in dual deficiency of qi and blood pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, blood stasis with qi stagnation pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, kidney essence deficiency pattern, or excessive seven emotions, blood-wind taxation, goiter taxation, moth-eaten hair loss (seborrheic alopecia), oily-wind hair loss (alopecia areata), fat sore (favus), or gan-malnutrition disease.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.8.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
