    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经周期提前7天以上，甚至1月两次。见于血热证、阴虚血热证、肝郁化热证、脾气虚弱证、肾气不固证、瘀血阻滞证、胞宫气虚证、胞宫虚热证、心脾两虚证、胞宫积热证等。又称月经先期。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The menstrual cycle advanced by more than seven days, even twice in one month. Seen in blood heat pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, liver depression transforming into heat pattern, spleen qi weakness pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, or uterine accumulated heat pattern. Also known as advanced menstruation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.21</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>月经先期</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0400007</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>52754008</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>polymenorrhea</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经提前</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The menstrual cycle advanced by more than seven days, even twice in one month. Seen in blood heat pattern, yin deficiency with blood heat pattern, liver depression transforming into heat pattern, spleen qi weakness pattern, kidney qi insecurity pattern, static blood obstruction pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency heat pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, or uterine accumulated heat pattern. Also known as advanced menstruation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>月经先期</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>HPO:HP:0400007</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0400007"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:52754008</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:exactMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/52754008"/>
  
