    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">唇、颌内口腔疼痛。见于肺胃火热证、阳明热盛、阴虚火旺证、口腔溃疡等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Lip inside oral cavity pain. Seen in lung disorder and stomach fire with heat pattern; yangming heat with exuberance pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:口腔溃疡] [未译片段:颌]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.1.16</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、热敷</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口腔痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Lip inside oral cavity pain. Seen in lung disorder and stomach fire with heat pattern; yangming heat with exuberance pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern. [证候待译:口腔溃疡] [未译片段:颌]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
