    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊内出现肿块。见于寒湿凝滞证、湿热下注证、水湿停聚证、气血瘀滞证、痰浊凝聚证，或囊痈、绣球风、子痰、子岩、筋疝、子痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum inside appearance of mass. Seen in cold-dampness with congelation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern; scrotal abscess; zitan (tuberculous epididymitis); ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:水湿停聚证/痰浊凝聚证/绣球风/子岩/筋疝]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.62</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊内肿物</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Scrotum inside appearance of mass. Seen in cold-dampness with congelation pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern; qi and blood stagnation pattern; scrotal abscess; zitan (tuberculous epididymitis); ziyong (epididymitis/orchitis). [证候待译:水湿停聚证/痰浊凝聚证/绣球风/子岩/筋疝]</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
