      <owl:Restriction rdf:nodeID="Nb1dd568aabaa4e33bcfbec5e2adf170a">
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/accompanies"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#ClinicalFinding"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疼痛剧烈如刀割，疼痛范围较刺痛大，有如剜、割、绞结之感，疼痛难忍。见于邪毒炽盛证、瘀热互结证、有形实邪阻滞气机等证。又称刀割痛。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Severe pain like being cut with a knife, broader than stabbing pain, with a gouging, cutting, twisting sensation, hard to bear. Seen in pathogenic toxin blazing pattern, stasis-heat intermingling pattern, or tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic. Also known as knife-cutting pain.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.2.2.12</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>刀割痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_刀割样疼痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Severe pain like being cut with a knife, broader than stabbing pain, with a gouging, cutting, twisting sensation, hard to bear. Seen in pathogenic toxin blazing pattern, stasis-heat intermingling pattern, or tangible excess pathogen blocking the qi dynamic. Also known as knife-cutting pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>刀割痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
