      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">附睾肿大，形成坚硬肿块，多数不痛。见于阳虚寒凝证、阴虚火旺证、痰湿瘀滞证、肝肾阴虚证，或附睾结核、子痰、慢性子痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Enlargement formation of hardness mass profuse not pain. Seen in yang deficiency with cold congelation pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; phlegm-dampness with stagnation pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; zitan (tuberculous epididymitis). [证候待译:附睾结核/慢性子痈] [未译片段:附睾数]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.31</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA4D25</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Epididymis</tcm:icd11Term>
    <tcm:icd11>SF5H</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_副睾硬结</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Enlargement formation of hardness mass profuse not pain. Seen in yang deficiency with cold congelation pattern; yin deficiency with fire flaring pattern; phlegm-dampness with stagnation pattern; liver and kidney yin deficiency pattern; zitan (tuberculous epididymitis). [证候待译:附睾结核/慢性子痈] [未译片段:附睾数]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XA4D25</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SF5H</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
