    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">指末节膨大如杵。见于久病心肺气虚证、血瘀痰阻证等。又称杵状指。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The terminal phalanges are enlarged like pestles. Seen in chronic heart-lung qi deficiency pattern, or blood stasis with phlegm obstruction pattern. Also known as clubbed fingers (drumstick fingers).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.61</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>杵状指</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>30760008</tcm:snomedCT>
