    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部有脓液溢出。咽喉脓液黄稠者，见于实证。脓液清稀或污秽，见于正虚。脓液易排者，见于正气充足。脓液难清者，见于体弱气虚。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Throat with pus throat pus yellow and thick pus thin and clear or filthy seen at deficiency pus easy to discharge seen in sufficient righteous qi pus difficult to clear seen in weak body with qi deficiency. Seen in excess pattern. [未译片段:溢出正]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.79</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_咽喉溢脓</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Throat with pus throat pus yellow and thick pus thin and clear or filthy seen at deficiency pus easy to discharge seen in sufficient righteous qi pus difficult to clear seen in weak body with qi deficiency. Seen in excess pattern. [未译片段:溢出正]</obo:IAO_0000115>
