    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">目珠每遇明亮温暖场所，即感眼睛涩痛，眼睑难睁。见于风寒犯目证、风热犯目证、气虚风热证、肝肾亏虚证，或倒睫拳毛、异物入目、暴风客热、天行赤眼、聚星障、凝脂翳、瞳神紧小、偏头风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Astringent eye pain and difficulty opening the eyelids whenever in bright, warm surroundings (photophobia). Seen in wind-cold invading the eye pattern, wind-heat invading the eye pattern, qi deficiency with wind-heat pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, or trichiasis with curled lashes, foreign body in the eye, storm-like guest heat, heaven-current red eye, clustered-star opacity, congealed-fat nebula, contracted small pupil (acute iritis), or hemilateral head wind (migraine).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.9</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000613</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>246622003</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>extreme sensitivity of the eyes to light</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:snomedCT>409668002</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>extreme sensitivity of the eyes to light</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_羞明</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Astringent eye pain and difficulty opening the eyelids whenever in bright, warm surroundings (photophobia). Seen in wind-cold invading the eye pattern, wind-heat invading the eye pattern, qi deficiency with wind-heat pattern, liver-kidney deficiency pattern, or trichiasis with curled lashes, foreign body in the eye, storm-like guest heat, heaven-current red eye, clustered-star opacity, congealed-fat nebula, contracted small pupil (acute iritis), or hemilateral head wind (migraine).</obo:IAO_0000115>
