    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">甲缘或甲板下红肿。见于热毒内聚证，或瘭疽、蛇疔、脱疽、疠风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Or nail plate below red swelling. Seen in tuoju (thromboangiitis obliterans). [证候待译:热毒内聚证/瘭疽/蛇疔/疠风] [未译片段:甲缘]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.45</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XA6Q52</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Nail</tcm:icd11Term>
  
