    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">鼻部肿胀，皮肤青紫，疼痛和压痛明显。见于外伤等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Nose region swelling skin bluish-purple pain and pain obvious. Seen in external injury pattern. [未译片段:压]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.3.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
