    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每同房时不能排出精液。轻者可有少量精液流出，甚者全无。见于肾阴亏虚证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Failure to ejaculate semen during intercourse; in mild cases a small amount may flow out, in severe cases none at all. Seen in kidney yin deficiency pattern, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.21</tcm:reference>
