      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">身热，发热如从骨中蒸蒸而出，或伴微汗出。见于阴虚火旺证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Fever steaming out as if from within the bones, sometimes with slight sweating (steaming-bone fever). Seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.1.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>自身免疫反应</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>物理降温</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>1C33</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Q fever</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_骨蒸发热</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Fever steaming out as if from within the bones, sometimes with slight sweating (steaming-bone fever). Seen in yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:1C33</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
