      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经期或月经前后出现头痛。见于气血亏虚、肝火上炎、气滞血瘀、痰湿阻滞，或内伤头痛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Headache occurring during or around each menstrual period. Seen in qi-blood deficiency, liver fire flaming upward, qi stagnation with blood stasis, phlegm-dampness obstruction, or internal-injury headache.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.58</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>劳累、姿势不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>止痛药物</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行头痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Headache occurring during or around each menstrual period. Seen in qi-blood deficiency, liver fire flaming upward, qi stagnation with blood stasis, phlegm-dampness obstruction, or internal-injury headache.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
