    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">自觉口中有咸味，有时或伴有咸味痰或唾液。见于肾虚证、寒水上泛等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">A subjective salty taste in the mouth, sometimes accompanied by salty phlegm or saliva. Seen in kidney deficiency pattern, or cold water flooding upward.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.39</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_口咸</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A subjective salty taste in the mouth, sometimes accompanied by salty phlegm or saliva. Seen in kidney deficiency pattern, or cold water flooding upward.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
