      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">神志躁动不安，或情绪急躁不宁，狂乱妄动。见于热入血室、火热伤阴证、瘀阻脑络证、痰火扰神证、肠热腑实证，或各种热病、狂病、癫病、酒厥、肾厥、消渴厥、肝厥、中风等。又称神舍失守、神舍难安、神乱不安、神恍易惊、神不守舍等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Restless agitation of the spirit, or irritable unease, with frantic reckless movement. Seen in heat entering the blood chamber, fire-heat damaging yin pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the spirit pattern, intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, or various febrile diseases, manic psychosis (kuang), depressive psychosis (dian), alcohol syncope, kidney syncope, wasting-thirst syncope, liver syncope, or stroke. Also known as spirit losing its abode, spirit failing to keep its residence, spirit turmoil, or spirit trance with easy fright.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.1.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>神不守舍</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>神乱不安</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>神恍易惊</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>神舍失守</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>神舍难安</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_神舍不安</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Restless agitation of the spirit, or irritable unease, with frantic reckless movement. Seen in heat entering the blood chamber, fire-heat damaging yin pattern, stasis obstructing the brain collaterals pattern, phlegm-fire harassing the spirit pattern, intestinal heat with bowel excess pattern, or various febrile diseases, manic psychosis (kuang), depressive psychosis (dian), alcohol syncope, kidney syncope, wasting-thirst syncope, liver syncope, or stroke. Also known as spirit losing its abode, spirit failing to keep its residence, spirit turmoil, or spirit trance with easy fright.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>神不守舍</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>神乱不安</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>神恍易惊</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>神舍失守</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>神舍难安</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
