    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴毛脱落稀疏。见于精血不足证、脾肾阳虚证，或普秃等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pubic hair falling out and thinning. Seen in essence-blood insufficiency pattern, spleen-kidney yang deficiency pattern, or alopecia universalis.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.4.156</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0100133</tcm:hpoID>
