    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">一侧或两侧阴囊肿硬，板滞。见于湿热下注证，外湿内蕴成毒，或阴囊痈、外肾痈、肾囊痈、阴囊紧缩等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hard, stiff swelling of the scrotum on one or both sides. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, external dampness accumulating internally into toxin, or scrotal abscess, external-kidney abscess, kidney-sac abscess, or scrotal contracture.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.43</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SK6G</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Hard swelling of eyelid disorder (TM2)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴囊硬肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Hard, stiff swelling of the scrotum on one or both sides. Seen in dampness-heat pouring downward pattern, external dampness accumulating internally into toxin, or scrotal abscess, external-kidney abscess, kidney-sac abscess, or scrotal contracture.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SK6G</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#DampnessEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
