    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">咽喉部两侧扁桃体（咽核）红肿，并出现白色腐膜。见于疫邪外犯证、阴虚肺燥证、火毒炽盛证、正虚邪恋证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The tonsils (pharyngeal kernels) on both sides of the throat are red and swollen with a white putrid membrane. Seen in epidemic pathogen attacking from outside, yin deficiency with lung dryness pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.4.20</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
