    <obo:IAO_0000115>The tonsils (pharyngeal kernels) on both sides of the throat are red and swollen with a white putrid membrane. Seen in epidemic pathogen attacking from outside, yin deficiency with lung dryness pattern, fire toxin blazing pattern, or righteous deficiency with lingering pathogen pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
