    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊皮肤许多或因皮疹流滋而潮湿。见于风湿侵袭证、湿热下注证，或肾囊风、肾虚等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum skin profuse or due to rash oozing of serous fluid dampness/moisture. Seen in wind-dampness with invasion pattern; dampness-heat with downward pouring pattern. [证候待译:肾囊风/肾虚] [未译片段:许]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.38</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
