    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">疮口周围肿硬，中间按之陷凹等。见于湿热瘀阻证、毒入营血证、正虚毒恋证，或烂疔、颈痈等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The area around the sore opening is swollen and hard, while the center is soft and dents on pressure. Seen in dampness-heat with stasis obstruction pattern, toxin entering the nutrient-blood level pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering toxin pattern, or festering nail-boil and neck abscess.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.1.34</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_痈疡中软</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The area around the sore opening is swollen and hard, while the center is soft and dents on pressure. Seen in dampness-heat with stasis obstruction pattern, toxin entering the nutrient-blood level pattern, righteous deficiency with lingering toxin pattern, or festering nail-boil and neck abscess.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
