    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">阴囊皮肤增厚。见于血虚风燥证、阴虚血燥证，或绣球风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Scrotum skin thickening. Seen in blood deficiency with wind-dryness pattern; yin deficiency with blood dryness pattern. [证候待译:绣球风]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.47</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>SF04</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Blood dryness pattern (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
