    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/f#PsychiatricFinding"/>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">小便后有浊物从尿道口滴出。见于湿热内蕴证、阴虚火旺证、气滞血瘀证，或精浊、花柳毒淋等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Turbid matter dripping from the urethral meatus after urination. Seen in dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or essence turbidity (prostatitis) and flower-willow toxin strangury (gonorrhea).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.4.1.13</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>环境刺激</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_尿后溢浊</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Turbid matter dripping from the urethral meatus after urination. Seen in dampness-heat internal accumulation pattern, yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern, qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, or essence turbidity (prostatitis) and flower-willow toxin strangury (gonorrhea).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
