    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">生产后，产妇乳汁少，或无乳汁分泌。见于脾虚证、肝郁气滞证、瘀血阻络证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">After delivery, scant breast milk or no milk secretion at all. Seen in spleen deficiency pattern, liver depression with qi stagnation pattern, or static blood obstructing the collaterals pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.25</tcm:reference>
