    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">痔核质地柔软。见于中气下陷证，或内痔、脱肛、息肉痔等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The hemorrhoid is soft in texture. Seen in middle qi sinking pattern, or internal hemorrhoid, rectal prolapse, or polyp hemorrhoid.</tcm:definition>
