    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">耳脓颜色黄。见于湿热内蕴证、脾虚证、肾虚夹湿证、肝火犯耳证、风热犯耳证、邪恋耳窍证，或慢性脓耳等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Ear pus yellow. Seen in dampness-heat with internal accumulation pattern. [证候待译:脾虚证/肾虚夹湿证/肝火犯耳证/风热犯耳证/邪恋耳窍证/慢性脓耳] [未译片段:颜]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.2.17</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
