    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">与同龄人相比，阴茎过小，但阴茎形态，尿道口位置都正常。常见于幼稚病、雄性激素分泌不足。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The penis is smaller than in peers, while its shape and the urethral meatus position are normal (micropenis). Commonly seen in infantilism or androgen insufficiency.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.63</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:0000054</tcm:hpoID>
    <tcm:snomedCT>34911001</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>hypoplasia of penis</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_阴茎短小</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The penis is smaller than in peers, while its shape and the urethral meatus position are normal (micropenis). Commonly seen in infantilism or androgen insufficiency.</obo:IAO_0000115>
