    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">睡眠质量不高，或似睡非睡，或易受干扰、易惊、易醒。见证同失眠。又称睡眠不深。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Poor-quality sleep, half-asleep, easily disturbed, easily startled and easily awakened. The associated patterns are the same as for insomnia (see that entry). Also known as shallow sleep.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.4.2.7</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>睡眠不深</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:hpoID>HP:5200304</tcm:hpoID>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睡眠表浅</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Poor-quality sleep, half-asleep, easily disturbed, easily startled and easily awakened. The associated patterns are the same as for insomnia (see that entry). Also known as shallow sleep.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>睡眠不深</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
