      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经周期后延7天以上，甚至四五十天一行。见于肝郁气结证、痰湿阻滞证、胞宫气虚证、胞宫血虚证、胞宫虚寒证、冲任失调证、寒凝胞宫证、痰凝胞宫证，或月经后期等。又称月经后期、月经推迟。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The menstrual cycle delayed by more than seven days, even occurring only every forty to fifty days. Seen in liver depression with qi binding pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine blood deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency cold pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, cold congealing in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, or delayed menstruation. Also known as delayed or postponed menstruation.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.22</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>月经后期</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:synonym>月经推迟</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:snomedCT>135810007</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>delayed myelination</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
    <tcm:icd11>SB81</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Delayed menstruation disorder (TM1)</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_月经推后</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The menstrual cycle delayed by more than seven days, even occurring only every forty to fifty days. Seen in liver depression with qi binding pattern, phlegm-dampness obstruction pattern, uterine qi deficiency pattern, uterine blood deficiency pattern, uterine deficiency cold pattern, chong-ren disharmony pattern, cold congealing in the uterus pattern, phlegm congealing in the uterus pattern, or delayed menstruation. Also known as delayed or postponed menstruation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>月经后期</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>月经推迟</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SCTID:135810007</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://snomed.info/id/135810007"/>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:SB81</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  
