    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">视物上下颠倒。见于肝郁血滞证、脾失健运证、肝肾阴亏证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Objects appear upside down. Seen in liver depression with blood stagnation pattern, spleen failing in transport pattern, or liver-kidney yin depletion pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.6.1.37</tcm:reference>
