    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">妇女阴道中排出分泌物，闻之气腥。见于肾阳虚证、胞宫湿热证，或胞宫癌等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">(in women) vagina discharge fishy odor. Seen in uterus dampness-heat pattern. [证候待译:肾阳虚证/胞宫癌] [未译片段:中排出闻]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.33</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
