    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">脉来速率迟缓，在搏动迟缓中时而有一次歇止，止后又再搏动，歇止无一定的规律性。见于气滞血凝证、元气虚证、血瘀证，或宿食、气郁、虚损等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Pulse coming at a slow rate present slow pulsation with pause beating again after the pause pauses without regular pattern. Seen in blood stasis pattern; qi depression pattern; deficiency damage pattern. [证候待译:气滞血凝证/元气虚证/宿食] [未译片段:中一次]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.2.2.46</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>饮食调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_脉结</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
