    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈项部肌肉紧张，或拘急强硬，或连及背部，不能前俯后仰及左右转动。见于风寒犯表证、风湿犯表证、津液亏损证，或金疮风毒。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Neck and nape region muscle tense or cramping and tension stiffness and rigidity or extending to and back inability and movement. Seen in fluids depletion pattern. [证候待译:风寒犯表证/风湿犯表证/金疮风毒] [未译片段:前俯后仰左右转]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.68</tcm:reference>
