    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">患者手指拘急或强直，难以屈伸。见于历节、痹证、痉病、中风等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Hand finger cramping and tension or rigidity flexion and extension. Seen in wind stroke (apoplexy). [证候待译:历节/痹证/痉病] [未译片段:患难以]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.7.20</tcm:reference>
