    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">包皮紧勒在冠状沟处不能推下。见于气滞证、血瘀证，或包皮过长、包皮口过小等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">The retracted foreskin is tightly strangulated at the coronal sulcus and cannot be pushed back down (paraphimosis). Seen in qi stagnation pattern, blood stasis pattern, or redundant prepuce and narrow preputial orifice.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.1.19</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>GB05.3</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Paraphimosis</tcm:icd11Term>
  
