    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Short neck and high shoulders, flattened supra- and infraclavicular fossae, widened intercostal spaces, with a barrel-shaped thorax. Seen in lung failing to diffuse and descend pattern, kidney failing to receive qi pattern, or chronic cough-wheeze.</tcm:definition>
