    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">上下睑胞肿胀，自觉睑胞沉重。见于肉轮风热证、肉轮热毒证、热毒内陷证、水湿内停证、脾肺气虚证、心脾两虚证，或风水、正水、石水、肾水等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Swelling of the upper and lower eyelids with a subjective heavy sensation. Seen in flesh-wheel (eyelid) wind-heat pattern, flesh-wheel heat toxin pattern, heat toxin sinking inward pattern, water-dampness internal stagnation pattern, spleen-lung qi deficiency pattern, heart-spleen dual deficiency pattern, or wind edema, ortho-edema (zhengshui), stone edema, or kidney edema.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.5</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:snomedCT>89091004</tcm:snomedCT>
    <tcm:snomedCTTerm>edema of the eyelids</tcm:snomedCTTerm>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_眼睑水肿</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
