    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">口渴不甚，或口干渴欲饮，但饮水量不多。见于营分热盛证、脾胃湿热证、风热证、湿热证、风温。又称口微渴。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Thirst not marked or dry mouth drink drink fluid amount not profuse. Seen in ying (nutritive) aspect heat with exuberance pattern; spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; wind-heat pattern; dampness-heat pattern; wind-warmth. [又称:口微渴] [未译片段:渴欲但]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.3.29</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>口微渴</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>偶尔发作</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_渴不多饮</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Thirst not marked or dry mouth drink drink fluid amount not profuse. Seen in ying (nutritive) aspect heat with exuberance pattern; spleen and stomach dampness-heat pattern; wind-heat pattern; dampness-heat pattern; wind-warmth. [又称:口微渴] [未译片段:渴欲但]</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>口微渴</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
