    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">呼吸费力，吸气困难，胸郭胀满，但肋间凹陷。见于肺失宣降证、肺气虚证，或肺胀等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Labored breathing with difficult inhalation, a full distended chest but sunken intercostal spaces. Seen in lung failing to diffuse and descend pattern, lung qi deficiency pattern, or lung distension (emphysema).</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.3.18</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_呼吸胸高肋陷</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Labored breathing with difficult inhalation, a full distended chest but sunken intercostal spaces. Seen in lung failing to diffuse and descend pattern, lung qi deficiency pattern, or lung distension (emphysema).</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
