    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">白睛上部或下部，内部或外部出现各种色素斑点。见于色素沉着，乃先天而成。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">White of the eye region or below region inside region or region appearance of colored spots. [证候待译:色素沉着/乃先天而成] [未译片段:上外各种素]</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.52</tcm:reference>
