    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">瞳神紧小症失治、误治，致使黄仁与其后晶珠发生粘连，瞳神失去正圆，边缘参差不齐，伴视力下降。见于肝胆火盛证、阴虚火旺证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Mistreated or untreated contracted-small-pupil disorder causing adhesion of the iris to the lens behind it, the pupil losing its round shape with irregular margins and decreased vision. Seen in liver-gallbladder fire exuberance pattern, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.6.10.1.70</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>数小时一次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>情绪波动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>药物治疗</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_睛珠干枯</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Mistreated or untreated contracted-small-pupil disorder causing adhesion of the iris to the lens behind it, the pupil losing its round shape with irregular margins and decreased vision. Seen in liver-gallbladder fire exuberance pattern, or yin deficiency with effulgent fire pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
      <owl:Restriction>
        <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/dueTo"/>
        <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://OntoTCM.org.cn/ontologies/tcm_v38/e#FireEvil"/>
      </owl:Restriction>
    </rdfs:subClassOf>
  </owl:Class>
