    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">颈颈连及背部肌肉经脉拘急强硬，前俯后仰及左右转动不便。见于风寒犯表证、气滞血瘀证。又称项背强。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Contracture and stiffness of the muscles and channels of the nape and back, with inconvenient forward-backward bending and lateral turning. Seen in wind-cold invading the exterior pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. Also known as stiff nape and back.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.1.5.2.67</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>项背强</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>每日多次</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>感染、过敏</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_项背拘急</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Contracture and stiffness of the muscles and channels of the nape and back, with inconvenient forward-backward bending and lateral turning. Seen in wind-cold invading the exterior pattern, or qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern. Also known as stiff nape and back.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>项背强</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
