    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">生产后，产妇怕风、怕冷。见于产后血虚、表虚等证，或产后外感等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Aversion to wind and cold after delivery. Seen in postpartum blood deficiency or exterior deficiency patterns, or postpartum external contraction.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.3.23</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>中度至重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>持续性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>饮食不当</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>休息、保暖</tcm:reliefText>
    <tcm:icd11>XT4Z</tcm:icd11>
    <tcm:icd11Term>Postpartum</tcm:icd11Term>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_产后恶风</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Aversion to wind and cold after delivery. Seen in postpartum blood deficiency or exterior deficiency patterns, or postpartum external contraction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ICD11:XT4Z</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
  </owl:Class>
