    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">每逢经期或月经前后出现周期性的小腹疼痛难忍。见于气滞血瘀证、痰瘀阻滞、肝郁气滞、瘀热互结、气血亏虚证等。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Cyclic unbearable lower abdominal pain occurring during or around each menstrual period (dysmenorrhea). Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, phlegm-stasis obstruction, liver depression with qi stagnation, stasis-heat intermingling, or qi-blood deficiency pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.67</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:synonym>女子经行腹痛</tcm:synonym>
    <tcm:severityText>轻度至中度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>运动</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>体位调整</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经行腹痛</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Cyclic unbearable lower abdominal pain occurring during or around each menstrual period (dysmenorrhea). Seen in qi stagnation with blood stasis pattern, phlegm-stasis obstruction, liver depression with qi stagnation, stasis-heat intermingling, or qi-blood deficiency pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>女子经行腹痛</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
  
    <rdfs:subClassOf>
