    <tcm:definition xml:lang="zh-cn">月经血腥味浓重。见于肝郁证、湿热证。</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:definition xml:lang="en">Menstrual blood with a strong fishy odor. Seen in liver depression pattern, or dampness-heat pattern.</tcm:definition>
    <tcm:reference>Book(中医临床常见症状术语规范)、 8.5.2.2.2</tcm:reference>
    <tcm:severityText>重度</tcm:severityText>
    <tcm:frequencyText>间歇性</tcm:frequencyText>
    <tcm:triggerText>受凉、劳累</tcm:triggerText>
    <tcm:reliefText>情绪调节</tcm:reliefText>
  
    <oboInOwl:id>TCM-SO:sx_经血气腥</oboInOwl:id>
    <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>TCM_symptom</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Menstrual blood with a strong fishy odor. Seen in liver depression pattern, or dampness-heat pattern.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  
